R {  207} {128} {<148>} {Wolves' Den} {<148>. .<088>} {  In the depths of the den, a sense of an unnatural presence fills the room.  Natural light can not reach here, so one must rely on torches and such for lighting.  Moaning and chanting can be heard, although it is very unclear where it is coming from.  The smell of fresh blood is carried by a soft breeze that comes from every direction.  The sound of wrestling pups fills the air as well as yelping, although the yelping seems to be coming from the other side of the den.   } {snuckles} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
