R {  229} {0} {<228>} {Abandoned Pet And Hurt Animal Refuge} {<228>( *<088>} {  The refuge is placed out in the forest for animal housing.  The snuckles decided to build it in the forest to give more room for animal care and extra space if needed for emergency housing of animals in larger numbers.  Several animals roam the land of this refuge.  Some were abandoned in the forest by travelers who no longer wanted to care for their pets.  Others are animals that are either from the forest, or have wandered into the forest, and were hurt.  Some of those animals were even maimed.  Also the refuge houses a few orphaned animals.  The snuckles started a donation drive to keep this refuge up and running.  As new animals come in injured, abandoned or orphaned, some of the older animals are well enough to be let go back into the wild.   } {snuckles} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
