R {  321} {0} {<228>} {Entrance to Wildwood forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Wandering through the icy plains, you stumble into this clearing. Further on, the path leads into a forest thick with very old evergreens. The light is  filtered through so much foliage that it is dim in there, even at high noon. The Centaurs believe this place to be their ancestral home and will protect  it with strength and dedication. Visitors are welcome, mostly. Humans,  however, are suspect and may find their reception a chilly one. The  collective herd memory informs even the youngest Centaur of the raids and  desecrations by humans throughout history. } {wildwood} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
