R {  322} {0} {<228>} {Wildwood forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The forest closes around you as you start to wander. Small animals scurry  through the undergrowth and birdsong fills the air. You catch occasional  glimpses of other creatures, visitors to Wildwood, as you are. To the east is a small clearing, and you hear the bubbling sound of water over rocks. } {wildwood} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
