R {  323} {0} {<228>} {Wildwood forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The air here is warmer, and fragrant with the scent of flowers. A small  spring bubbles up from a rocky outcrop, the water then tumbles over a small  bed, flowing off to the south. Larger rocks with flat surfaces create places  to sit and enjoy the sounds and smells. } {wildwood} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
