R {  324} {0} {<228>} {Wildwood forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  As you wander about the forest you catch glimpses of other visitors to the  Centaurs' home. Many appear to be lost and confused which is not at all  surprising as there seems to be no clear path leading out of this place. Off  to the east, the trees are less dense and west leads back to the bubbling  spring. } {wildwood} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
