R {  325} {0} {<228>} {Eastern edge of the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Beyond this fringe of evergreens, the icy plains stretch out to the east, although another forest is faintly visible in the distance. Some magic must be at work here as the icy cold doesn't penetrate this forest at all. Perhaps Athakra has discovered a spell that protects the home of the Centaurs. } {wildwood} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
