R {  326} {0} {<228>} {Southwest corner of Wildwood forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  There doesn't seem to be any way out of this place. Perhaps you are trapped  and doomed to wander Wildwood for the rest of your life? Ah, but if you can  wriggle through the bushes to the north, a way might be found. Good luck! } {wildwood} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
