R {  327} {0} {<228>} {Southern reaches of Wildwood forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  A small stream flows in from the north, happily bouncing over smooth stones,  leaving a wide bank where the undergrowth has crept in to enjoy the patch of  sunlight here. A riot of colorful flowers nearly covers the bank of the  stream, and butterflies flit about, doing their butterfly thing. To the east  the forest becomes more dense once again, although a faint path shows  evidence that others have wandered here frequently. } {wildwood} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
