R {  328} {0} {<228>} {Southern reaches of Wildwood forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  This edge of the forest is darker, the trees so dense that branches overhead  create a protective roof, even if the sunlight is blocked. This place would  shelter one from rain and snow, and footsteps are cushioned by the bed of  dead foliage and pine needles that has collected over the years. } {wildwood} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
