R {  329} {0} {<228>} {Southeastern corner of Wildwood forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Here in the further reaches of the forest the trees begin to thin out, and  you can see the icy plain stretching off to the east. It is colder in this  spot so you don't see many of the small creatures that abound to the west,  although there are some who burrow into their warm underground dens. } {wildwood} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
