R {  502} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mArmageddon[0;37m} {<278>. .<088>} {  Lightning streaks across the sky, breaking the suffocating darkness.  The  air suddenly becomes still and you no longer hear the screams of war or the  clanking of armor.  There is a solitary figure standing atop the fortress  where the great battle took place.  Another flash of lightning reveals the  victor, but it is neither Zhamet nor Ramos.  Dark magic creeps down your  spine as you gaze in awe at this new omnipotent being.  The sounds resume  and your blade slices through yet another enemy.  Suddenly a powerful voice  speaks to your soul telling of a new order.  There will be no more battles  of good and evil, instead, pure power will flow through the veins of  Dak'kon's followers.  You recognize the calling like a brand on your skin  and you pledge your sword to Dak'kon.  The new order has come and the Dark  Templars will protect this order gaining unparalleled strength in rituals  to Dak'kon's name. } {rhabdo} {} {city} {bank,safe,shop,healer} {1.000} {}
