R {  652} {128} {<228>} {Cougarian Defense Line} {<228>, `<088>} {  The Bengaleens try to advance, but the Cougarian Army holds strong.  This is the last line of defense.  Soldiers' bodies from both sides litter the ground around you, staining the soil with the stench of war. } {cougarian} {} {field} {pk} {1.000} {}
