R {  653} {128} {<228>} {Bengaleen Advancing Line} {<228>, `<088>} {  The battle rages on, and the armies seem deadlocked.  Neither side will give up and the realization of the stakes hits you like cold steel through your heart.  This is a battle for Cougaria.  This is a battle for her people and their way of life. } {cougarian} {} {field} {pk} {1.000} {}
