R {  660} {0} {<178>} {The Castle Kitchen} {<278>###<088>} {  This kitchen is filled with the overpowering scent of baking bread. Several  ovens line the walls with a large cutting table in the center. A couple of  pots of stew bubble as they cook. Several carts with trays loaded with food  sit near the door. The air is warm, almost uncomfortably so, from the hot  ovens. } {stormhaven} {} {castle} {} {1.000} {}
E {20659} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {  662} {0} {<238>} {Kitchen} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  The ceiling of the room is shaped such that the smoke from the fires can  easily escape. To feed the company men, large portions of food are prepared  daily. Metal pots and pans line the walls, and two large tables occupy the  room. An ice box sits in the corner. } {sagewood} {} {hut} {} {1.000} {}
