R {  663} {0} {<238>} {Blacksmith Forge} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  A fire burns brightly and hotly inside the furnace that dominates the  blacksmith's workplace. One wall is lined with tools of the trade. The other  wall is lined with finished products: a random assortment of armor and  different types of bladed weapons. You see the plans of large siege weapons  on the table. } {sagewood} {} {hut} {shop} {1.000} {}
