R {  664} {0} {<178>} {The Conservatory} {<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>} {  The jungle-like environment of the conservatory is a flourishing green canopy that inundates the nose with fresh scents from trees and flowers. The air is  humid and warm and the floor is made from hardwood, crafted in just such a  way to give the feeling of walking along a long zigzagging bridge in the  midst of a jungle. The plants here come from tropical rainforests or tropical grasslands, and are often ornate and colorful. } {nursing} {} {flowers2} {} {1.000} {}
