R {  665} {0} {<228>} {The Conservatory} {<228>* *<088>} {  Being in this conservatory is like stepping into a tropical garden that is  brimming with beautiful plants. The conservatory's structure is composed of  glass and steel, and is roughly rectangular in format. At its central point  the roof comes to a fifty foot high apex. That means the trees here sure can  grow tall! The climate is carefully controlled to be hot and excessively  humid. Vivid, picturesque, peaceful, and uplifting, this conservatory is a  welcome retreat for anyone who seeks some solace. } {nursing} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
