R {  671} {0} {<178>} {The Dining Area} {<278>###<088>} {  This end of the dining area holds the kitchen doors to the north. They are a  simple set of swinging wooden doors and often are busy with those who work at the nursing home running in and out of them. The western wall of this area  has been hung with large paintings, and the eastern wall is taken up by  generously-sized picture windows. The floor has been furnished with an  exquisite rug, and small round tables, each holding six chairs, have been  scattered strategically around the room. } {nursing} {} {castle} {} {1.000} {}
