R {  677} {0} {<228>} {A Dusty Wagon Trail} {<228>, `<088>} {  The dirt of the trail lightens here a little, shading gradually to a dark brown.  One could almost wonder if there's a drought in the region, for dust still rises and clings stubbornly to skin and shiny armor.  The scents of evergreen and fruit trees combine with each breeze that blows through the trees to either side of the road, though the occasional fresh horse droppings that can be spotted on the trail offer a less aromatic whiff.   } {childsplay} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
