R {  678} {0} {<228>} {A Dusty Intersection} {<228>, `<088>} {  The rutted road has faded to an even light brown, though the dust is heavier than ever.  There is a break in the forestry on either side of the trail, and from the east you can hear the comforting sound of happy children at play.  To the west seems to be another branch of the trail lined with shrubbery and trees.   } {childsplay} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
