R {  680} {0} {<228>} {A Muddy Wagon Trail} {<228>, `<088>} {  This part of the trail is very much softer than the portions to the south.  Squish, squish your feet sound out while walking along, as they sink into brackish mud a couple of inches deep.  The greenery to either side of the road is rather small, tending toward scrub grass and tangled vines.  Whoever settled this area must have conquered a swamp to do it.   } {childsplay} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
