R {  681} {0} {<278>} {A Lonely Outpost} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This little trading post isn't exactly at its best anymore.  The shelves are as dusty as the trail outside, and few of them hold any goods.  Most of these wares are spoiled, and a sour smell hovers in those spots.  Strong as it is, the smell does not detract from the nauseating sight of insects slowly nibbling their way through the rotten food.   } {childsplay} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {  676} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {  682} {0} {<228>} {A Deeply Rutted Trail} {<228>, `<088>} {  The dirt trail is more firmly packed here, with very little dust rising from it.  Many hoofprints have been pressed into the ground, especially between the deep wheel ruts lining it.  Still, a few blades of grass poke up here and there, though many more have been brutally trampled.  The overgrown evergreen forest on either side of the trail is beginning to creep over the trail's shoulders.   } {childsplay} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
