R {  683} {0} {<228>} {The Trail to the Mines} {<228>, `<088>} {  The hard-packed trail takes a turn here, the thick forestry blocking the view of what lies around the bend.  The woods are alive with the sounds of wildlife- the yowl of large felines, sweet birdsong, and the cheerful chirping of crickets that occasionally gets cut off by a hunting bird.  One could get tired of the almost overwhelming evergreen aroma, though.   } {childsplay} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
