R {  686} {0} {<148>} {A Mine Shaft} {<148>. .<088>} {  Dry, red stone forms the endless shafts and caverns of this jewel mine.  You can almost feel the weight of tons of stone overhead, just waiting to crack and come tumbling down to crush you and everybody else down here.  And here you thought it was bad enough just breathing all the stone dust produced by the mining.  There are indeed a few crevices in the rock, so it's probably just as well that the light down here is very poor, making it difficult to see them.   } {childsplay} {} {underground} {maze} {1.000} {}

R {  687} {0} {<148>} {Overseer's Office} {<148>. .<088>} {  More of a niche in a wall than an office, this space is rather small, and crowded by the small desk that occupies it.  Filled burlap sacks are carelessly tossed on the floor to pile up however they happen to fall.  Taller beings will need to bend over or sit to fit in here, as the ceiling is only about five feet high.   } {childsplay} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
