R {  701} {0} {<228>} {The Village Square} {<228>, `<088>} {  The foul stench of acrid and rotting blood is pungent here, leaving its taste in one's mouth long after departing it.  This village square, a hundred feet to a side, was once cleared of all greenery, but it's not kept up as well as it used to be, and grass has begun to reseed the bare earth in scraggly patches here and there.  At the center of the square is a stout wooden dais where instruments of execution are put into use by the ruling class.  To please the crowds, the one most often used is the axe.   } {childsplay} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
