R {  707} {0} {<228>} {A Broad Meadow} {<228>, `<088>} {  Surrounded by a thick, tangled forest, the meadow is huge, covering several acres.  The bright green grass grows tall here, barely kept in check by the livestock permitted to graze the lea.  Be careful!  You wouldn't want to step in the little surprises the animals leave behind.  Gentle, rolling hills rise and fall, providing an excellent place for sledding in wintertime.  Here and there a bright flower pokes its petals over the grass, relieving the monotony of the green plain and adding spice to the aroma of fresh grass that pervades the meadow.   } {childsplay} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
