R {  710} {0} {<148>} {A Babbling Brook} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The water in the deep brook that runs from east to west through the meadow is as clear as crystal, and the reddish-brown sand and rocks that form the streambed can easily be seen.  The water moves along quite rapidly, the current strong enough that swimming could very well be dangerous.  The brook seems to sing as it burbles along merrily,' providing drinking water is essential for the survival of the village.  Several homemade docks jut out over the water, for rafting and fishing are favorite local pastimes.   } {childsplay} {} {waternoswim} {} {1.000} {}
