R {  717} {0} {<228>} {An Overgrown Yard} {<228>( *<088>} {  This was once quite an elegant yard, suitable for the small mansion nestled to the east.  A path of crushed stone leads to the door of the manse, as well as circling gently through the yard itself; once fastidiously maintained, the path has been broken up in quite a few places, scattering pebbles into the wildly overgrown grass.  The fence surrounding the yard is missing several of its pointed slats, and the grand marble fountain in a quiet glade has been smashed and destroyed.   } {childsplay} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
