R {  718} {0} {<278>} {The Foyer} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The foyer is a little hall; in its heyday it was used primarily to greet visitors who came to see the Lord Mayor.  Now it's a guardpost for the gang that has taken over the village.  Trash that is dropped here gets pushed to either side of the hallway, and it's starting to stack up against the walls. As it includes discarded food, the odor here is quite sharp, and one might hear the rustle of scavenging rats.  From the east comes raucous laughter with a nasty edge to it, and loud music.   } {childsplay} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
