R {  719} {0} {<278>} {The Banquet Hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is one chamber of the mansion that has retained its original use.  Though the banners proclaiming the honor and glories of the late Lord Mayor have been ripped to shreds, the long tables for feasting still range across the banquet hall.  In some places, they've been shoved aside to allow room for wild, gyrating dancing.  The food that occupies the tables is simple, but plenty of it is provided.  The floor is covered with the remains of many meals, ranging from chicken bones to sausage casings.   } {childsplay} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
