R {  730} {0} {<148>} {At The Bottom Of The Well} {<148>. .<088>} {  After lowering yourself down the well for what seems to be an eternity, you finally reach the bottom of the well.  As you let go of the rope and land on the well floor, you can see that Sarah was right, the well is bone dry.  As you look around, you can see many small holes in the wall of the well.  Perhaps these are where the water came from.  To the east, is a small boulder, which appears to be blocking the way of a rather large hole.   } {zyian} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
