R {  886} {0} {<228>} {At a bench outside the Alehouse} {<228>( *<088>} {  You are standing off to the west of the doorway to the Wayward Alehouse. There is not a whole lot here, save for a single tall, green tree about ten  paces from the Alehouse itself, as well as a simple bench of wood and iron  directly under said tree. This environment hardly seems to be one which would support the growth of such a tree, but nevertheless, there it is, bright and  vibrant, apples damp with dew hanging from its limbs. Directly across the  little gravel path from the bench and the tree, a window is situated into the Alehouse wall. It is dirty, and a little difficult to see through, though it  would likely be possible to sneak a peek if one were to get close enough. The only exit worth bothering with is back to the east. } {alehouse} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
