R {  888} {0} {<278>} {Near the horse pasture} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The gravel path follows the Alehouse's perimeter, leading off to the north  and the west. Coming to the corner of the Alehouse, the producer of the  animal-like smells may be easily deduced...it's animals!  Off to the north is a fence, and behind the fence is a pasture, and in the pasture are horses, and  off the horses wafts a scent. For most, it would be an unpleasant one. From  here, the hustle and bustle of the innards of the Alehouse can hardly be  heard, save for those with exceptional hearing capabilities. } {alehouse} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
