R {  890} {0} {<228>} {Horse pasture} {<228>, `<088>} {  You are currently in the southwestern section of the horse pasture. Oddly  enough, there is grass here. Green, edible, delicious (for horses) grass. There is no grass outside of this pasture for as far as the eye can see. In  fact, save for the apple tree near the front door of the Alehouse, there is  no visible vegetation at all outside of this pasture. The smell here is quite strong, and horse-like. To the south lies the gate which serves as entrance  and exit of the pasture. To the north and east there is simply more pasture,  and to the west, it seems the owner of this establishment has decided to use  the Alehouse itself as a fence of sorts. There is a dusty window built into  the wall here. Off in the distance to the northeast, there is building of some sort. } {alehouse} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
