R {  896} {0} {<278>} {The Unicorn Stable} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Upon entering the stable, the most immediately noticeable feature is that  despite there being no windows, no lanterns, no lamps, and torches, the  inside of this stable is bright as day, as though there was some sort of  magical illumination to the room. The stable itself is fairly regular aside  from the magical lighting. There is a single stall which stands closed in the back of the stable. The floor is littered with hay. Inside the stall there is a trough, filled to the brink with oats and apples, as well as a separate  trough for water. Off to the side, outside of the stall, bags of oats and  large containers of water sit idly, waiting to refill the trough. A large  sign hangs above the stall. } {alehouse} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
