R {  898} {0} {<278>} {Coat (Armor) Check} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is the coat room of the Wayward Alehouse. Patrons are encouraged to  leave their unnecessary outer garments in this room for safekeeping while  they enjoy the festivities of the bar area. "Coat" room is not entirely  correct, as there are not many coats here, but rather pieces of armor. Hanging on the walls, pieces of armor range from the simplest of hide tunics  to steel breastplates, to horned battle helmets. There is a window giving a  rather drab view of the path around the Alehouse. There is also a weapons  rack, though it is oddly empty. A staircase extends northward to the second  floor, and the only other obvious exit is back to the Alehouse proper. } {alehouse} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
