R { 1109} {0} {<138>} {Darkened Ooze} {<138>%%<088>} {  Sinking deeper into the goo, the light put off by the mixing fluids above fades to near pitch black.  The rhythmic thumping you heard on the edge of your senses before grows ever-louder as you sink deeper into the abyss.  A bubble of dimly-lit, green oil snakes up your leg and away, growing lighter as it comes nearer the source of purple glow above.  Your eyes grow heavy, your senses dulled by the cadence of the beat, surrounding your mind and cushioning your thoughts.  But a thought breaks free from the cloud, stinging your wavering consciousness, reminding you that while you doze off, you're sinking ever-farther from where you came.  The realization floods in like a bucket of ice water to the face - you've lost track of time, and can't remember which way is up.   } {vale} {} {quicksand} {} {1.000} {}

