R { 1129} {0} {<178>} {Justiciar Headquarters} {<278>###<088>} {  This aged building, remarkable only in that it's slightly less run down than the structures around it, is home to His Majesty's Justiciars. From here Fellchantry's city guards work hard at the appearance of upholding justice. In reality the guards are only about two steps removed from being criminals themselves, and the sour reek of tobacco, alcohol, and sweat on the air says much about the Justiciars' efficacy. Still, the Baron's coat of arms hangs large on the wall, and that's all the legitimacy these men need.    His Majesty's Kangaroo Court is in the western wing of the courthouse. To the south wait the pickpockets and cutpurses of Fellchantry Square. } {chantry} {} {castle} {} {1.000} {}
