R { 1130} {0} {<178>} {His Majesty's Court of Justice} {<278>###<088>} {  A large dais at the westernmost end of a long walkway is the most prominent feature of His Majesty's Court of Justice. On it is a simple judge's bench, its face decorated with the Baron's coat of arms. Those wondering about the Baron's views on justice can find their questions answered by the large painting that totally dominates the wall behind the bench. Simply titled, "Justice," it depicts a woman with a radiant halo and pure white vestments holding a sword aloft with one elegantly-sandled foot atop a pile of corpses. It's not exactly the sort of court at whose mercy one throws oneself. Non-descript hardwood benches are arranged in two aisles so that the populace may observe the proceedings of the court, though few ever do.    The way back east leads to the Justiciar Headquarters, and to the bustling city square beyond. } {chantry} {} {castle} {} {1.000} {}
