R { 1131} {0} {<278>} {Fellchantry Square} {<278>. .<088>} {    The signature smell of Fellchantry (jokingly referred to as "Kettermoor Cologne") wafts in with particular potency from the west, hinting at the docks to be found in that direction. The aroma, not so much unpleasant as it is unusual, has strong fishy accents punctuated with less-identifiable effluvia. Fishmongers exhort the crowds with carny-like shouts, each extolling the freshness and superiority of their particular wares. The occasional prostitute wanders through, on their way to providing the services of Andolor's oldest profession to the dock crowd.     Fellchantry's docks lie to the west, offering an escape from the square. Farther east an unusually lively building boasts signs claiming the coldest beer in the Barony. } {chantry} {} {city} {pk} {1.000} {}
