R { 1132} {0} {<278>} {The Heart of the Mystery} {<278>. .<088>} {  Alas, some foul tragedy seems to have occurred here, for nothing else could so reliably draw such a diverse crowd of onlookers. Loud cries of "Murder most foul!" and "What villainy!" abound. At the center of the whole mess, mayhap literally as well as figuratively, stand a group of His Majesty's Justiciars observing one very dead body. The darkness of the deed and the storm of intrigue sure to follow are a fitting complement to the dark and stormy nights so common in the Barony.    Fellchantry Square stretches out in all directions, oblivious to the fact that Death has paid a visit nearby. } {chantry} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
