R { 1147} {0} {<138>} {The General Store} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  What purports to be a simple general store on the outside is somehow so much more on the inside... The shop's proprietor prides himself on having something for everyone, and to that end the shop is a mess of shelves and racks, each holding its own little universe of odds and ends. The General Store is the sort of place where one enters and seems to find the very thing they were just wishing they had. The deep shadows lining the far corners of the shop, and the way the hushed whispers of customers suddenly cease when anyone gets too close, are enough to show most just how sinister the desires of the clientele can be. In Fellchantry everything is for sale, and affording the price isn't always a matter of money.      The front door leads north back to the square, but who could leave when their heart's most cherished treasure is bound to be on the next shelf they see? Stay a while... Stay a while... } {chantry} {} {shop} {shop} {1.000} {}
