R { 1412} {0} {<238>} {A Dirty Path} {<238>. .<088>} {  This dusty path was cleared out by the amazon in order to provide a clear route to the nearby mountain.  No one has ever scaled the mountain to see what lies on the other side, but perhaps sometime a brave soul will be able to find out what treasures are found on the other side.  A warm breeze is blowing, but the road isn't nearly as sweltering as the nearby rainforest is, but small beads of sweat are still forming on your forehead.  The path continues in two directions: back to the village or towards the mountain.   } {amazon} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
