R { 1414} {0} {<228>} {End of the Path} {<228>. ^<088>} {  You are at the base of the mountain!  An inexplicable fear tears at your heart, threatening to rip your soul apart if you can not quell its force.  A dark grey cloud circles about the mountain, and bolts of midnight black lightning crackle ominously above your head.  You can almost hear demonic laughter eminating from inside the peak.  You squeeze your eyes tightly and try to temper your fear and scale the mountain, but to no avail: your willpower isn't strong enough to supercede the evil about this place.  You are almost glad that you are forced to head back west to the outskirts of the village.   } {amazon} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
