R { 1415} {0} {<228>} {Trial of Ice} {<228>( *<088>} {  After giving the Aqua Mirror to Jules, you notice the complete change of scenery.  What she warned you about is true - evil fills this place.  The trials you must pass will, indeed, test your inner strength to the max.  A frigid forest provides a bleak view everywhere you turn.  Your sense of despair is maddening ...  Nothing but cold and destruction all around.  You wander for endless miles through the forest until you at last reach a tiny clearing.  In this haven's center stands a man holding a small key.  He narrows his eyes as you enter the clearing - the first of the trials has begun.   } {amazon} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
