R { 1416} {0} {<278>} {Trial of Fire} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  After defeating the Aqua Guardian and leaving the frozen forest, you find yourself at the site of the second trial.  The ground is a sickening reddish-brown, and the orange sky is void of life ...  The sun itself is blotted out by the power contained within the mountains.  You tentatively creep forward, and you notice that in some places there are wide holes in the ground.  As you peer at the edges of a nearby crevice, a burst of flame shoots forth!  You barely manage to avoid the searing blast of heat.  After recollecting your wits, you continue onward.  The whole place smells like rust and charred wood.  Eventually you come across a living ball of flame in this forsaken land - an evil tiding to be sure, but the only way to move on is to defeat it.   } {amazon} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
