R { 1421} {0} {<278>} {Inside the Village Wall} {<278>. .<088>} {  After passing the slender stone wall, you are greeted by the sounds of more "traditional" amazons.  From the rainforest and the outer gates, you realize that things aren't always what they seem.  The leaves of the nearby trees seem to be reaching towards a large stone structure far to the north.  You can barely make out the outlines of this grand edifice.  The cobblestone path gives you a feeling of a fresh countryside, and the sun's rays spiral happily down towards the earth.  A faint scent of pine seems to wrap around the village, and in the distance this pleasant feeling is countered by the sounds of Amazon warriors training in the distance.   } {amazon} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
