R { 1719} {0} {<148>} {An Endless Mine Shaft} {<148>. .<088>} {  The spiral goes down, curling around rock fissures and crumbling dirt to descend into the core of the volcano.  The heat builds, the pressure increases - the entire environment takes on an agitated feel.  The dull clacking sounds of the dwarves' picks recede, the thick walls of rock an effective insulator against all sounds of life.  Instead, a dreadful churning noise emits from the as yet unseen exit to the tunnel.   } {hoard} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
