R { 1726} {0} {<218>} {Pools of Lava} {<118>(<178>~<118>)<088>} {  Gleaming pools of lava adorn the rocky floor.  The tiny slit leading to the as yet passable sections of the volcano seems to sew itself shut, preventing those who venture forward from regretting their decision.  The shadows continue dancing their inanimate mating dances upon the jagged walls, mocking those who come here as reckless and their derring-do as a foretelling of their joyless end.   } {hoard} {} {hellfountain} {} {1.000} {}
E { 1727} {d} {open d;d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
