R { 1960} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mInside a Morbid Gallery[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The shadows created by the torches on the walls dance like maddened demons. From these a gloomy light spreads throughout the room allowing you to see  the morbid exhibition that is on show here! Screaming faces are molded into the wall, and skins of men and elves adorn the walls from which some blood  still drips fresh! The floor is littered with the skulls of enemies slain  and bones cracked and turned into dust. A sickening smell of rot reaches  your nose as you see a corpse of a vain raider who attempted an invasion of these halls. A wind howls through the great hall, blowing the torches dim,  and in the distance you hear footsteps and an insane laughter. Panic  spreads throughout your mind and soul. When you try to run, you trip and  fall over a skeleton, and find yourself staring into the empty sockets of  a Viking-helmed skull. You hear the footsteps growing nearer, and as the  sound finally disappears, you hear a dark voice pronounce  New flesh for the clan of Retribution!  } {retri} {} {inside} {safe,trainer} {1.000} {}
