R { 2291} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mTreasure Island[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  At last! Your heart is filled with joy as your cold, wet, exhausted body is thrown by the waves upon the yellow sand.  A strangely familiar picture is before your eyes. Grey-coloured woods cover a large part of the  island. This even tint is broken up by streaks of yellow sand-break in the lower lands, and by many tall trees of the pine family, out-topping the others--some singly, some in clumps but the general colouring is  uniform and sad. The hills run up clear above the vegetation in spires of naked rock. All were strangely shaped, the largest, a good three to four hundred feet of height, bearing the most unusual configuration of all.  Running sheer up on every side, it cuts off abruptly at the top,  as if it's a pedestal on which a statue might rest.   It takes a while before the warmth of the sand begins to run through your veins, but finally you gather enough strength to sit up on the sand and look around.  The place was entirely land-locked, buried in woods, the trees coming right down to high-water mark, the shores mostly flat, and the hilltops standing round at a distance in a sort of amphitheatre, one here, one there. Two little rivers, or rather two swamps, emptied out into this lagoon. The foliage round that part of the shore has a kind of poisonous brightness.   There was not a breath of air moving, nor a sound but that of the surf booming along the beaches and against the rocks. A peculiar stagnant smell hung over the place --a smell of sodden leaves and rotting tree trunks, a smell of yellow fever. Exhausted, you decide to halt your exploration and fall asleep on the warm sand. It is not long before you are woken up by the smell of smoke and the sound of a song, faint at first, but growing louder....   "Fifteen men on the dead man's chest-- Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of rum!   Drink and the devil had done for the rest-- Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of   rum!" Your heart sinks, as the saying is, into your boots, as you realize that you have landed on an island.. .  Treasure Island. } {hook} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}
