R { 2339} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mA Light Provisions Room[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Calmness, warmth and serenity are the three first impressions you get  from the large underground dome.  Two rows of elegantly curved, white marble pillars lead all the way up to a bright white statue of Light's  deity, Radience, standing there with open arms to welcome those in need of help and the downtrodden.  The soft pure light coming from  the columns bathe the dome in a soft glow, inviting you to come closer and bask in it's warmth.  A deep soothing voice comes from your left : 'Is there anything Light can do to help you on your perilous way?' When you turn towards the voice, you immediately notice the wrinkles around the woman's bright green eyes, the graying of the once blonde hair and the still athletic posture and tread as she approaches. Upon coming closer she falls silent and only the white robes rustle softly against her, she looks at you with a surprising freshness and deep-rooted intelligence.  The stylish hand-and-a-half sword hanging on her weathered belt warns you that she's always on her toes, probably because evil can lurk everywhere, but still she smilingly invites you : 'We also sell potions and other goods, if that's what  you're looking for.' } {light} {} {inside} {safe,shop,healer,questor} {1.000} {}
