R { 3789} {0} {<228>} {Vitus} {<228>* *<088>} {  The jungle here seems much more untamed.  If it were not for a wide river flowing through it, you certainly would not know where you are.  As you head further south into the jungle, both the surrounding vegetation and the river turn darker and gloomier.  The trees are a much duller green, almost brown, and the river, once a clear red, is now rust-coloured and thick like sludge.  Almost no light penetrates the jungle.  Likewise, the air stagnates, and so it is heavy with the stench of death and decay.  The river continues to the east.   } {alagh} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
