R { 3790} {0} {<228>} {The Rope Bridge} {<228>* *<088>} {  The path continues here from the north.  You can cross a river to the south on a narrow bridge that doesn't look safe at all.  It must have been built with sturdy wood at one point, but now the wood is rotten and damp.  The river surges violently beneath, and, despite the support from vines hanging from the trees bunched at opposite ends of the river, the bridge sways dangerously.  You get the feeling that it's safer to fly over it than to risk crossing it.   } {alagh} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
