R { 4395} {0} {<278>} {The Entrance to the Tower} {<278>. .<088>} {  You stand just inside the great gates of Mistridge. Their metallic bulk rises above you into the distance. You try but fail to imagine the forge that could have cast such metal monstrosities, such metallic behemoths, and you wonder  at the strange metal that still holds its shine after so many years. Everything around you seems steeped with magic, from those gates that no man  could push aside, and which seemingly only magic could open, to the lights  that sit in gold cups set high into the walls, casting a flickering pale  light upon the polished floor beneath you. To your north an entry hall opens  up, and you can see a tradesman standing there, perhaps he can offer some  advice? } {mistridge} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
