R { 4396} {0} {<278>} {The Entryway} {<278>. .<088>} {  You stand in the foyer of the great tower, a vast room made from pillars of  solid marble and a floor of polished semi-precious stone. The light from the  magical lanterns sitting high on the wall reflects blindingly from the  polished surfaces around you, seemingly to cast a spell of light and fire  throughout the room. To your south you can see the entrance hall. Beyond are  the great gates that seal this tower from the dangers and influence of the  outside world. Those great magical gates were fashioned and fixed upon the  high stone walls by magic ancient and lost, by spells so mighty that they  took a portion of the casters life to accomplish. To your north you can see a large plaza. A tradesman is standing just north of here. Perhaps from him you can learn something of this place? } {mistridge} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
