R { 4397} {0} {<278>} {The Cellar Stairs} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hallway ends abruptly, with a blank wall to your west and a set of stairs descending into some ancient cellar beneath you. The hallway is quite dark,  filled with nauseous fumes and strange smells coming from the ancient and  rickety stairs This makes you pause and wonder if it is truly a wise thing to continue downwards. Strange how the smell seems to linger here, almost as if  it was held by some magical force. You raise your lantern to look down the  stairs, noticing that they end a short distance down at a locked door. The  only other way out is back down the hallway to your east. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
