R { 4401} {0} {<278>} {Common room} {<278>. .<088>} {  On the long low benches that littering the area, Grogs sit, talk and play  games involving dice and stones. You can see the tattered pennants and  flowers from a recent festival littering the ground and tables, and several  tables still hold stains that tell of a banquet as well. Perhaps the rumours  you had heard of the demise of Mistridge are off the mark, as all you can see here are Grogs peacefully enjoying the sunlight coming from a single large  skylight overhead. You are already a little lost, but your initial view of  the tower makes you believe that there should be no light coming from the  ceiling. Instead, there should be at least five more stories of solid stone  above. Perhaps the skylight is simply a trick of magic. To your south lies  the tower's central plaza, while to your north a great staircase looms  overhead. A stable door lies to the west as well. } {mistridge} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
