R { 4405} {0} {<278>} {The Northern Stables} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You pass through the wooden gate expecting to see your average stable; a barn with straw and stalls for horses. Instead you see an expanse of smooth tiles  and marble walls forming comfortable pens for the horses. The floors seem  kept clean by both the hard work of the Grogs, and the help of some minor  magic. The horses seem calm despite the strange surroundings. Amazingly,the  Grogs seem to have a talent for animal husbandry. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
