R { 4424} {0} {<278>} {Secret Lab} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Silvery smoke hangs heavy in this strange lab. The equipment is very good  quality and well used. Some of it clearly has been twisted by the magical  energies summoned within the room. A large lab table is bathed in that magic  smoke which streams over it in waves. A large toad sits in the middle of the  table as smoke pushes against him like a magical tide. The toad seems  unaffected and unafraid. To the east the smoke is very thick and almost forms a wall that moves with energies that appear alive and deliberate. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
