R { 4428} {0} {<278>} {Grimgroth's Library} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This room appears to be more of a study than a library, with the desk being  the most prominant piece of furniture. Bookshelves line the walls, but are  shrouded in cobwebs, dust and unused books and scrolls. Grimgroth's desk is  covered with letters, ink and candlewax. The entire room is magically  shadowed. The shadows not only darken the room, but seem to blur its details  as well. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
