R { 4429} {0} {<278>} {The Great Hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  From here the window is truly marvelous. One must wonder how such a pane  stands against the winds and even more wonderous is the thought that this  window was in some fashion hoisted to this great height. Gazing out the  window to enjoy the view, it's easy to be lost in such wonders. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
