R { 4440} {0} {<278>} {Lookout Post} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  From this hut you can survey all the lands surrounding the tower.  From the southern forests to the northern ocean all seems well in the land.  Grogs are usually posted here as lookouts.  They can ring the bell as an alarm to warn of approaching danger.  The staircase that leads down from this trapdoor is long and narrow, but seems safe enough to take one back down to the base of the tower.  Grogs are forbidden to use the other staircase except in the direst of emergencies.   } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
