R { 4441} {0} {<278>} {Vulcris' Sanctum} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This hut is relatively tidy in relation to Vulcris's other hovel.  It is here that she perform her ritual magic and experiments.  There are no books here and the sparse equipment seems neglected to the point of near worthlessness.  In the corner is Vulcris's nest, which is really nothing more than a pile of sticks, animal furs and pillows.  She seems to guard it territorially so you only get a view from a distance.   } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
