R { 4442} {0} {<278>} {Vulcris' Hut} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  In the midst of a flurry of birds and feathers there is a sort of hut. All  species of birds are welcome and it's quite obvious that far too many have  decided to roost here. The place smells and looks like an overcrowded  henhouse. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 4441} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 4443} {0} {<278>} {The Cellar} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The stink of death and decay fills your nostrils with a dank, wet and disgusting smell.  It is becoming obvious to your senses and your shaking body and soul that Felix has practiced some dark arts in this ancient cellar, foul arts that long ago should have been driven from all civilized places.  Skeletons, mummified and more recent corpses litter the floor in some grotesque caricature of order, seemingly arranged to some vile and insane plan.  Clearly this place is the creation of a madman, a figment of an evil mind made flesh by dark magic and darker deeds.     ** WARNING ** The mobs to the east are aggressive and very powerful.                     Proceed at your own risk. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 4444} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
