R { 4444} {0} {<278>} {The Cellar} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you step gingerly over the shredded corpse of a local Grog, you manage to accidently trip over part of a pentagram drawn in chalk on the filthy floor.  The magic is released by your careless action, manifesting itself as a creature of bones and magic.  It manifests itself into the form of a skeletal dragon, made from human bones and flesh into a terrifying effigy of dragonkind.  Perhaps if you are quick enough you may yet escape to your west or east, or duck past it to the south. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
