R { 4446} {0} {<278>} {The Wine Cellar} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have managed to duck into a small niche, away from the dragon's attacks. You duck behind a ruined rack and while peeking through dusty and broken  bottles watch the dragon try to squeeze its bony length through the small  doorway, fortunately to no avail. Still... As much as this place is a haven  for you, it is also a trap. The only way out is past that evil beast to the  north. If only you had more time, you could examine the rack closer. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 4444} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 4447} {0} {<278>} {The Pantry} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  All around you, like the colossal wreck of time's party, lie the debris and  shattered remnants of ancient containers. Rats breed and play amidst the  debris, revelling in the decay and death. At least one skeleton lying  underneath the shattered crockery seems to have been tied in place and left  here...as an offering for the rats. Felix seems to have a fondness for  torture. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 4445} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 4448} {0} {<278>} {The Cellar} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This seems to be the place that Felix actually uses as a lab.  Despite the rat carcasses there seems to be plenty of usable equipment here.  Glancing over the mage tools a small box catches your eye.   } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
