R { 4451} {0} {<278>} {The Great Hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  To the south is a gigantic stained glass window that depicts the scene of a  great battle. The artist chose two main subjects\; a hulking giant wielding a  great bloody axe and a haggard old mage who appears battle-weary and spent. They have met at a summit and appear to be on the verge of combat. Fallen  soldiers litter the field and the sun seems to be setting on two empires. To  the north you can see a long grand table and several important dignitaries  seem to have gathered there. } {mistridge} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
