R { 4477} {0} {<228>} {The Outer Field} {<228>, `<088>} {  The hundred yards between the bridge and the tower's main gate seem like an  eternity. With every step you feel as if you're being watched from above. You can almost hear the long dead moans of fallen soldiers who have died in  this very field while attempting to attack the mighty Mistridge. There are  rumors that this tower has lost much of its power, but even a few bowmen  perched on the tower walls could strike fear into an approaching unit if they were forced to ride over this barren field of forgotten death. From the  forest, it seemed the tower barely cleared the trees, but from this vantage  point it reaches almost into the clouds themselves. Magic is certainly at  work here. } {mistridge} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
