R { 4491} {0} {<278>} {The Bridge} {<278>. .<088>} {  A white stone bridge arcs high over the emerald waters of a magical river. It seems to defy gravity and all common sense with its slim span extending  unsupported across a great expanse of water. To your north looms the gates of the tower, great and ancient metal doors. They tower high, impervious to  magic and force and all that man can throw against them, made with mighty and old magicks in times long forgotten. The tower itself is a marvel of both  engineering and more mystical arts, held up into the sky by mighty buttresses of stone, and built by both the hand and the spells of mages long since  passed on. You shiver slightly as you realize that you are entering a place  of power and danger, and hope you will be able to pass safely within. Fortunately the guards that are generally posted here will let those of good  intent pass without challenge. Somewhere over the mountain around you can be  heard the rumble and noise of a waterfall as well, seemingly coming from the  west. } {mistridge} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
