R { 4494} {0} {<148>} {The Courtyard of Fort Terramire} {<148>. .<088>} {  Ah, here we have the friendly face of an invading army.  This courtyard has been seeded with a grass-like lichen that glows in criss-cross patterns of eerie blue and green.  The ceiling of the tunnel, however, has been lined with iron-bound heavy wooden planks to fend off an invasion from outside (rather ironically).  The firmness of the ground below indicates the same was done there as well and recovered with earth.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
