R { 4501} {0} {<148>} {An Underground Playground} {<148>. .<088>} {  This part of the compound is a playground for the kits of the fort. Much of  the construction is the handiwork of the slaves, directed each step of the  way by the military. Metal tubing has been twisted and contorted into  miniature tunnels for the kits to crawl in, on and through. Knotted ropes  hang from the ceiling for the kits to climb and use for swinging. Gleeful  shrieks fill the air - evidently, the playground is a great success. } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
