R { 4502} {0} {<278>} {A Family Burrow} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Typical of many family-sized burrows, this one spreads over quite a decent space.  A few cubbyholes in the walls provide sleeping areas for the various members of the family, and there is even a larder with hinged doors to hold all the yummy stuff to feed a family of four.  Pretty little needlepoint pictures stagger across the walls for that extra special homey touch.  It's hard to hear in here, between the noisy kids and a loud and forceful father rabbit.   } {terramire} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
