R { 4503} {0} {<278>} {A Bachelor Burrow} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  What a mess! The boys must have thrown one wild party last night. Spilled  food and empty beer containers litter the dirt floor, and over in one corner  somebody is still sleeping the whole thing off. Whistling snores rattle  through the burrow, but nobody seems to notice. The sofa will have to be  fixed again- it is sagging dangerously in the middle after having served as a  trampoline. } {terramire} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
