R { 4504} {0} {<148>} {An Underground Market} {<148>. .<088>} {  It's fairly busy in this part of the warrens, as rabbits come and go about their daily business.  Young rabbits scamper along laughing and playing tag, those a bit older swagger toward their favorite taverns, and matrons bustle as they shop for groceries.  In addition to the lichen that lights most of the fort, posts topped with torches have been added, lighting the marketplace brilliantly.  There is almost no dark shadow for thieves and pickpockets to abscond to with their ill-gotten gains.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
