R { 4505} {0} {<278>} {The Mole's Whiskers} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A rough and rowdy tavern is this little bar, but it has great atmosphere.  Even children are welcome to enter, and the patrons cut back on the swearing and fighting when they do.  The babble of conversation is underscored by the three-rabbit band playing over there on the tiny stage, and there is just enough light from strategically placed candles and torches that it's easy to avoid the unconscious drunks on the floor.   } {terramire} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
