R { 4506} {0} {<278>} {The General Store} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A tidy little family store, this burrow holds all sorts of wares for the average rabbit family.  It's run by a rather greedy rabbit who jacks up his prices beyond the outrageous, but at least the goods are of high quality.  The commander of the fort made sure of that.   } {terramire} {} {inside} {shop} {1.000} {}
