R { 4507} {0} {<148>} {A Dark and Foreboding Corridor} {<148>. .<088>} {  There is plenty of the glowing lichen lining the walls of this tunnel, yet one might almost swear that less light exists here.  The peaceful babble of the civilians to the east is starting to die out, overcome by the sounds of clashing metal and shouting rabbits to the west.  Even the air seems to be tinged with less pleasant odors- foul, metallic, acrid.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
