R { 4508} {0} {<148>} {A Guarded Gate} {<148>. .<088>} {  The tunnel widens abruptly into a large cavern, but the cave has been bisected by a wall of stone that stretches from north to south, the masonry letting not even a mouse through.  Rabbit soldiers are stationed every few yards along the grey barricade, as if a stone wall three feet thick weren't enough to delay an invading force.  There is one point of entry- a narrow wooden gate is placed right in the center of the wall, guarded by more elite soldiers.  They dip their heads to listen to everyone who wishes to pass between the military and civilian portions of the fort.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
