R { 4509} {0} {<148>} {Military Square} {<148>. .<088>} {  There isn't a speck of dust out of place here.  Wooden planks are carved to match walls, roof, and ground, and are lined with iron to reinforce both stability and strength.  Surrounded by a square of fastidiously placed rocks painted a glistening white, this is where the rabbit troops perform their drills under the watchful eyes of the commanders.  Woe betide the soldier who puts a single paw or whisker out of place, too.  These rabbits have a world to conquer, and a lack of discipline will simply not be tolerated.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
