R { 4511} {0} {<148>} {The War Room} {<148>. .<088>} {  This massive chamber holds a more brilliant light than the soft illumination in the hallway.  It's necessary to let full detail of the maps covering every inch of the wall to be read and understood.  Aylor, the Werewood, Tir na Nog...  It seems that every land of the surface world is detailed here.  Battle plans for the taking of each are appended to every map, and half of the huge conference table is inlaid with a map of the entire surface world.  Models and figurines are placed across it, showing current troop locations.  } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
