R { 4512} {0} {<148>} {Officers' Corridor} {<148>. .<088>} {  A large desk has been set up in this part of the well-lit tunnel, neatly blocking the way to the offices used by the rabbit command.  The secretary that mans it seems to be a civilian- she wears no insignia- yet she wears a sword buckled at her side.  Desperate times call for desperate measures, it seems.  Plenty of room is left for those waiting to see the commander and her staff, and a steady stream of rabbits flows between the offices in a brisk businesslike fashion.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
