R { 4516} {0} {<148>} {Recruitment Office} {<148>. .<088>} {  There is just enough of a military feel to this office to engender a bit of blood-and-glory excitement in potential recruits.  Large paintings of heroic battle scenes line three walls alongside racks of brochures proclaiming the benefits of a career in the army.  Of course, they don't mention that pesky injury and death aspect.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E { 4510} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 4517} {0} {<148>} {The Military Encampment} {<148>. .<088>} {  From here, the military encampment of the rabbits sprawls across the underground landscape.  Tunnels lead to both the officers' and enlisted living areas, as well as to the supply compound.  Though this part of the camp is perhaps not as obsessively kept up as the square to the south, it's still policed daily to get rid of litter, and those rabbits caught carelessly tossing aside debris face censure, fines, and, worst of all, kitchen patrol.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
