R { 4519} {0} {<148>} {The Training Field} {<148>. .<088>} {  The same size as the drill square to the south, this wide burrow is used for practice rather than review.  It tends to be used a lot more, and the dirt over the protective iron-banded wood underfoot has been packed into a hard surface by hundreds of drilling paws.  Between shouted orders, officers screaming at clumsy soldiers, and marching, one can barely hear oneself think.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
