R { 4520} {0} {<148>} {The Armory} {<148>. .<088>} {  One of the most secure burrows of Fort Terramire is this armory.  Rows upon rows of shiny swords and coiled whips fill wooden racks, waiting to be distributed to the newest recruits the army has suckered into its grasp.  Armor is available here as well, in every form from helmets to tail protectors.  Clangs and bangs from a back room, combined with the odor of hot metal, reveal that even now, more equipment is being produced.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
