R { 4521} {0} {<148>} {Soldiers' Barracks} {<148>. .<088>} {  This is a large burrow, divided into sections for each task for the soldiers. To the north lies the eating area and kitchen, to the south and east are  sleeping quarters. The room is very large and lighted torches line the wall  in very close intervals. The torches never go out and burn continuously day  and night, making it hard to get any sleep. } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
