R { 4522} {0} {<138>} {The Latrine Pit} {<138>%%<088>} {  This is where the soldiers come when they're looking for some relief.  To judge from the size of the pyramid of droppings that dominates the pit, the fort has been in business for a long time.  Of course, the floor is slimy, and the smell is just awful, but that helps ensure that soldiers on a bathroom break don't linger very long.   } {terramire} {} {quicksand} {} {1.000} {}
