R { 4523} {0} {<148>} {The Mess Cavern} {<148>. .<088>} {  The babble in here is surprisingly quiet; mess halls tend to be rather noisy.  But the prevalent sound here is crunching and chewing.  A buffet table covered in various choices of grain- corn, wheat, rye- provides plenty of fodder for the soldiers to choose from, and water has been hauled in from the Fort's underground stream.  The rich aroma of grain combined with the comfortable air of companionability makes for a relaxing dining spot.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
