R { 4525} {0} {<148>} {A Storage Cavern} {<148>. .<088>} {  The storage cavern is kept cool and dark, but at the first touch of light from a torch, the scrabbling of tiny retreating rodent paws is immediately detectable.  Most of the food kept here goes to waste, but the army commander feels that is a more viable alternative than not ordering enough.  Sheaves of wheat and corn line the tiers of shelves pushed against each wall, and in one corner rests a small cooler that holds the little meat required to keep the army's slaves more or less healthy.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
