R { 4526} {0} {<148>} {The Officers' Mess} {<148>. .<088>} {  Less than half the size of the enlisted mess hall, this burrow has been  fancied up for fine dining. There are actual tables here, in long rows and  covered by pristine white and red checkered tablecloths. A spray of flowers  at the center of each table is color-coordinated, providing a pleasant scent  and eye candy at the same time. Kitchen workers in pressed uniforms take  the officers' orders and silently deliver steaming, tasty dishes. } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
