R { 4529} {0} {<148>} {Cavalry Field} {<148>. .<088>} {  The ceiling on this burrow is higher than most, and this is one place where the cavern had to be shored up with wooden columns.  The rabbit cavalry works around these obstacles with a smooth synchronization that's a pleasure to watch.  An entire company of horses and their riders can drill here all at once, hooves pounding against the hard packed ground.  Grass no longer bothers trying to grow, but glowing lichens cling stubbornly to the reinforced walls.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
