R { 4530} {0} {<148>} {The Stables} {<148>. .<088>} {  These stables are huge, and actually extend through a myriad of caverns. Each gelding has a doorless stall to itself, its halter clipped to the posts on either side of the animal.  Fresh straw is piled deep to give the animals plentiful soft bedding as well as something to snack on in between meals of rich oats and gruel.  This is not the best place for somebody with hay fever.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
