R { 4531} {0} {<148>} {The Paddock} {<148>. .<088>} {  This concave cavern has more greenery than anywhere else in Fort Terramire, though the courtyards run a close second.  Special yellow grasses and lichens have been carefully cultured here to allow the cavalry horses to contentedly graze when they're turned out into the paddock.  One small section is fenced off from the rest of the burrow, to protect injured horses that are on the mend.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
