R { 4532} {0} {<278>} {Cavalry Housing} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is where the cavalry officers reside, commanders and men alike.  The regular horse soldiers are housed two to a room, and each pair shares a private latrine for their burrow.  The officers have burrows all their own, and the opportunity for a bit of luxury, but most are hardened fighters and find no need for such fripperies.  A saddle for a pillow, a rough blanket, and they're happy.   } {terramire} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
