R { 4533} {0} {<148>} {The Slave Pens} {<148>. .<088>} {  The small hallway leads west, south, and east. To the west are slave pens as  well as the south, however, to the east is the office in which you go to rent slaves by the day. Even the civilians are allowed in this part of the  military compound, however, this is the ONLY part they are allowed in. When a civilian does enter, they are escorted to the slave pens, and are escorted  out as well. With the slave pens being underground, it is rather dark and  cold here, although torches upon the stone wall light the small hallway it is definitely not bright by any means. } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
