R { 4534} {128} {<148>} {A Slave Pen} {<148>. .<088>} {  This burrow is closed off by a door of rough metal bars, and nobody has bothered providing the slaves with light.  That's probably just as well, for the sights here would turn the strongest stomach if the smell wasn't doing so already.  A few scattered stalks of dirty straw lie here and there, but the bedding provided was long ago eaten by the half-starving surface dwellers kept here.  Dung has coated the floor with a sticky, disgusting muck, but the slaves covered with open, weeping sores don't even seem to notice.   } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
