R { 4536} {0} {<148>} {Rent-A-Slave} {<148>. .<088>} {  The large office is well lit by an orb that is suspended in the center of the room about a foot below the ceiling. This room is very cold, being  underground does not help that any. There is a tariff hanging on the wall  listing the prices of renting the slaves. There are a few potted plants, but  they look as fake as the smile Barnum wears when he is trying to talk his  customers in renting more than one slave. There is a large desk that is  cluttered with papers and it seems it would be impossible to find anything on the desk. Behind the desk is a rather comfortable looking chair, one that  definitely cost a pretty gold coin. There are no pictures on the wall, just  the tariff hangs on the otherwise bare walls. Along the east wall is a filing cabinet. Let's just hope it is in better order than Barnum's desk. } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E { 4533} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 4537} {0} {<148>} {The Eatin' Place} {<148>. .<088>} {  Makeshift tables are set up into rows for the undead soldiers and their  families to eat. Although the men ALWAYS eat first, then the children, and  then the women, there is always enough food cooked for everyone to eat their  fair share. The wooden tables are made of wooden barrels and large wooden  planks sat across the top of them and the chairs are nothing more than  buckets turned upside down. The soldiers don't complain about the  accommodations, they only complain if dinner is late. } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {35627} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 4538} {0} {<238>} {Atop the Dune} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  Burnt by the sun, you stumble blindly onto shimmering salty sands, white and gleaming in the impossibly bright noon sun.  All about, long and level and lone and bare, the salt flats stretch from eye to eye.  Even the air shimmers in the heat, raising visions of lost temples and strange creatures long since lost to this world.  Clearly few things you will experience here will be entirely true to the eye....   } {salt} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
