R { 4842} {0} {<278>} {Western Corner} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Smooth and solid, the tunnel looks like it was constructed to last a long  time. There is the usual layer of dirt and grime that goes with anything made underground for the purpose of removing something from there, but the  structure itself is sound with no signs of cracks or aging. There are strings of lights heading east towards the entrance, and south towards another corner of the tunnel. } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 4839} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
