R { 4843} {0} {<278>} {SouthWestern Corner} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The layout of these tunnels has more of a smooth surface than what you would  expect from a mine. The walls have been smoothed out, and where the walls  join to make a corner has been rounded. There is a string of lights going  north to another corner, east to another room in the tunnel, and there is a  string of lights going downward to another level of the mine. } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 4845} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
