R { 4848} {0} {<278>} {At the Bottom of the Mine} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The lower floor of the mine is lacking some things that have been seen in the upper levels. The walls here are rough, and don't have the carefully crafted  smoothness that are seen on the upper levels, although some parts have been  smoothed, and some look like no effort was put into their construction. The  walls, instead of being smooth like the upper levels, still have depressions  in it that look like there has been recent mining. } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
