R { 5763} {128} {<228>} {Strange New World} {<228>, `<088>} {  You stand in a vast field, all around you, food a plenty and even soft beds  have been provided for you. There looks as if there is no way out though, but fortunately everything you will ever need to survive for the rest of your  life is here. You stepped into what you thought was the perfect place to  visit, and now, you pay the price. Upon a bit more inspection, you do find a  small crack in the cavern like wall around the area to the north, leading  into what seems to be a vast maze. If you ever want to escape, that is the  way in which you must go. } {partroxis} {} {field} {safe,shop} {1.000} {}
E { 5764} {n} {open n;n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 5764} {128} {<238>} {In the Mountains} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The mountains around you are just the beginning of the Otherworld. You find  yourself slowly edging along an extremely narrow ledge, hoping not to fall  into the rapidly flowing river below. You hear a rumbling now and then, and  suddenly notice the way back has disappeared. The only way to go now is  forward. One thing keeps popping into your mind though, the rumbling sound  getting closer. Sooner than you know it, the ground before you collapses as  the mountain itself seems to come alive. } {partroxis} {} {mountain} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5765} {128} {<228>} {Through the Woods} {<228>( *<088>} {  You now notice that you are past the mountains, traveling through a small patch of woods.  The birds are chirping, somewhat, the air is blowing through the leaves.  The sound of screeching and clawing rings in your ears. Tiger-like men have ambushed you, and you are once again fighting for your life.   } {partroxis} {} {forest} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5766} {128} {<228>} {The Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  You have escaped the tiger-men, but have only done so by retreating into the lair of their sworn enemy, the wolfen.  They snarl as they surround you, their teeth glaring in the moonlight as it suddenly becomes dark.  You look around for a way to escape, finding none, you are fighting yet again.   } {partroxis} {} {forest} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5767} {128} {<228>} {Swampy Path} {<228>( *<088>} {  You have gone from a thick forest to a bog like swamp.  Crickets are chirping at a rate that is driving you insane, frogs are leaping from rock to rock.  What is getting to you now is how there is a path leading you forward.  Is something living here that has made this?  Suddenly a spear flies by your head, missing its mark and digging into a tree behind you.  A pack of lizard like men then emerge slowly from the swamps around you and begin their assault.   } {partroxis} {} {forest} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5768} {0} {<228>} {The Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  You are back into the forest as you fight your way out of the swamps.  The trees here are disturbingly still as no wind blows through the area.  Suddenly you feet are swept out from under you as a tree grabs hold of you and starts to smack you around.   } {partroxis} {} {forest} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5769} {0} {<228>} {Along the River} {<228>, `<088>} {  You finally pass out of the forest after many long days of fighting with little rest.  You peer out into the open expanse, and take in a deep breath of fresh air.  You see a nearby river and go over to take a sip.  After a few handfuls of water have been scooped into your mouth you feel refreshed, so you go for 1 more.  You bring your hands up to suddenly find them covered in blood.  Before you now stands a pack of Fish with wings, legs, arms; what are they?  They quickly discard the man they were eating and edge towards you.   } {partroxis} {} {field} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5770} {0} {<238>} {The Desert} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  You travel for days it seems, nothing but a desert before you.  The water supply is running low and you see no sign of life at all.  You decide to sit and rest against a rock you just happen to come across.  A few minutes after sitting down you find yourself dozing off, and lay your head back against the rock, only to find it hit sand?  You are sinking into the ground.  Quick get up and away before the quicksand draws you in! } {partroxis} {} {desert} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5771} {0} {<238>} {The Desert} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  The desert still continues on.  Days and days pass, the water runs out, you feel as if you are near death.  You then see an oasis, you run to it.  You start to drink thirstily as you reach it, not noticing the ants that have begun to crawl on top of you.  They are too small to hurt you though, but those 10 foot long ones coming up on your position will sure be able to do some damage.   } {partroxis} {} {desert} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5772} {0} {<228>} {The Wheat Fields} {<228>, `<088>} {  You have finally emerged from the desert, and into what looks like a small community long abandoned.  You decide to take it upon yourself to resupply with their food as the fields seem to be still there and at full growth.  You wander over to them and start to pick out what you like, a strawberry here, an grape there.  You reach to pull out a carrot when the ground shakes, and a vine reaches up to pull you down.  You then realize why there is no longer anyone here, the area is full of vines that have a mind of their own, seeming to want to pull you into the ground and eat you.   } {partroxis} {} {field} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5773} {0} {<238>} {In the Mountains} {<238>/ \<088>} {  You have come across yet another mountain range as your journey through the  Otherworld continues. The ground here is a lot more traversable than it was  in the last set of mountains though, as there seems to be a huge path leading across here. You continue on for days, wondering why there are huge holes in  the ground all over, yet no signs of life inside them. One day though, the  land starts to violently shake and the ground beneath you starts to erupt. You now know what the holes were: Bulette holes. The holes indicate where  they must have surfaced to claim their prey. } {partroxis} {} {mountain} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5774} {0} {<238>} {In the Mountains} {<238>/ \<088>} {  You have reached the other side of the mountains finally, and see many birds flying in the distance around the edge of a huge lake.  They seem to be flying your way now though, getting bigger and bigger, maybe sitting and watching them is not such a good idea.  Then again, where is there to run, no caves are in sight and no where to take cover.  Again you must fight to get away from these awful winged beasts.   } {partroxis} {} {mountain} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5775} {0} {<148>} {A Cave} {<148>. .<088>} {  You happen upon a small cave and decide it is time to take a much needed rest.  You sleep soundly here, drinking from the small spring which has set itself in the back of the cave.  You hear the sudden sound of footsteps though, and turn suddenly to find a knife at your throat.  Could this be your demise?  Has this assassin of the Otherworld found his mark?   } {partroxis} {} {underground} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5776} {128} {<228>} {The Wheat Fields} {<228>, `<088>} {  Constant fighting and little rest have made you delirious, and you have wandered off the path you have been on in this Otherworld.  You are now at a dead end, fighting your own mind and existence as the visions flood into it. } {partroxis} {} {field} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5777} {128} {<228>} {The Wheat Fields} {<228>, `<088>} {  You have emerged from the temporary insanity the Otherworld has brought upon you.  Now you are traveling as fast as you can before the visions return.  So fast you travel that you don't see the fire flying in at you from above.  It hits, missing barely, scorching the ground nearby.  You look up at where it came from, to see a huge, red dragon soaring down towards you, ready to make the kill.   } {partroxis} {} {field} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5778} {128} {<228>} {The Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  You have come across another stretch of thick forest.  You hope that there are no wolfen here, for your last encounter with them was not a friendly one.  You remember the trees that attacked you, but know that won't happen because its too noisy.  Then you remember the clawing and screeching of the tiger men, why oh why do you have to hear that again now.   } {partroxis} {} {forest} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5779} {0} {<228>} {The Swamp} {<228>( *<088>} {  You happen into a very thick bog and find yourself up to your knees in water and weeds.  You slowly push your way through, getting more exhausted by the moment.  You keep a sharp eye out for any local wildlife here, hoping to god it is not hostile if you do see something.  Suddenly you feel something grab hold of your ankle, pulling you up and emerging from the bog, lifting you into the air.  This lizard man that has grabbed you is huge, and he has friends.   } {partroxis} {} {forest} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5780} {0} {<228>} {The Swamp} {<228>( *<088>} {  You remember what it was like when your sanity started to slip a whle back, and this man that has emerged before you seems to have lost the fight with it.  You are now forced to defend yourself as this insane Cheryb attacks.   } {partroxis} {} {forest} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5781} {0} {<278>} {River of Blood} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You come across a dark red river.  Many people must have died trying to cross this hellish creation of the Otherworld.  Nothing in it looks alive and it looks like nothing could survive.  Although you hate to admit it, you must cross in order to escape.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5782} {0} {<278>} {A small Cave} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A small cave is a welcome rest from the long journey through the Otherworld.  But this rest must be cut short, as the Otherworld gives no one a break.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5783} {0} {<278>} {A small Cave} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The cave has stopped rumbling and you decide it is time for a nice long nap.  Hours pass, no days pass, and all seems well.  Then months pass, something must be wrong, because you are still asleep.  Perhaps you have fallen victim to the dreaded dream eaters.  It is only a matter of time before they destroy your mind and then your body.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5784} {0} {<278>} {Through the Passage of Time} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Your thoughts are lost and so is all hope.  Your soul drifts aimlessly through the void.  Could this be the end or could this just be the beginning.  But there is a light at the end of this tunnel, a very bright light, and it happens to be reality.  But is reality really what you seek?  Is it the the truth or is it just another illusion in this twisted world known as the Otherworld.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5785} {0} {<278>} {The Swamp} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The path is as treacherous as ever as you wade through the swamp in yet another region of the Otherworld.  Having now made it to the last gate you are amazed, and at the same time not surprised at all at why the Cheryb hate the Warloxans so much.  This is not a prison, this is a deathtrap.  The water keeps getting deeper, and now and then you can feel something grazing by your leg.  You hope that it isn't alive, over and over again as it keeps brushing your leg.  But you know what is about to happen, as the vines surrounding you spring to life and come for you.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5786} {0} {<278>} {The Forest} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The swamp has once again settled down into a forest as the boggy setting evaporates with time.  This forest is not quiet though like some of the past ones, it is full of life.  Too much life.  You look around and eyes can be seen staring at you from all over.  You get very nervous at this and start to take extreme caution.  Thus another day in the Otherworld goes by.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5787} {0} {<278>} {The Wheat Fields} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  More like a death field.  What used to be a field of wheat, corn, and other crops is now filled with flying limbs.  Body parts from the dead farmers, and what looks like their animals, and maybe even their assailants fly throughout the area smashing into everything in site.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5788} {0} {<278>} {The Wheat Fields} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The field here are half eaten and torn to shreds, what could have done such a thing.  Perhaps those gerbils covered in blood heading your way are the answer.  } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5789} {0} {<238>} {In the Mountains} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The ground here is torn to pieces, fragments of rock thrown about, dirt hills laying here and there.  Bones scattered along the ground, no meat attached to them at all.  This worries you, for the last time you came across such a site, the ground tried to eat you.  Yes, you remembered it correctly, but it is too late to escape.   } {partroxis} {} {mountain} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5790} {0} {<278>} {The Wheat Fields} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  These fields seem to also be scavenged and destroyed, much like all others in the Otherworld.  But something is a bit different here, a small path, which looks almost like it has been disintegrated has been torn through the fields.  Could something have done this just by walking through it?   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5791} {0} {<278>} {Along the River} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have come across another small stream, and decide to take a small break to gather food and water.  You check the water first, making sure nothing may be lurking within it, it is safe.  You settle down then to a nice meal, eat a few bites, then get up to go get another cup of water.  As you get back you notice your encampment is gone, so you look around quickly to see what may have happened.  Next thing you know the ground shakes and from it emerges a huge dragon.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5792} {0} {<278>} {The Wheat Field} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  These fields are stained with blood, once again like those seen in the past.  No longer are their any signs of life here, of any kind, only the still sound of death.  It is cold, unbearable at some points, bringing you to only one conclusion, ghosts must wander this part of the Otherworld.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5793} {0} {<278>} {In the Mountains} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The area is deathly quiet.  The only thought to come to your head is hat either you are safe for the time being, or that you are in a whole world of trouble.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5794} {0} {<278>} {In the Mountains} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You feel at peace with yourself, and at last, you feel you have reached the end of this horrible hell known as the Otherworld.  You see the final gate, and reach it.  Then suddenly, right before your eyes, it disappears, crumbling into dust.  Now you are left again with nothing but despair.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5795} {0} {<238>} {The Desert} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  This desert is not made naturally, well, as naturally as can be expected by the Otherworld.  The local wildlife, which seems to be nothing but a swarm of glowing gnats, has sucked the life out of everything in the area.  So much have they sucked out that nothing has survived\; all plants and even the other  insects in the area are dead.  It is nothing but a desert of blood. } {partroxis} {} {desert} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5796} {0} {<278>} {The Swamp} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is a desolate place, with lots of wildlife.  What has caught your attention though is this "thing" that apparently is moving your way.  It is covered in foliage, smells really bad, and has a thirst for blood, and it seems to be the ruler of this swamp you now stand in.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5797} {0} {<238>} {The Desert} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  You have fallen into a deep sleep, collapsing as you walked for no reason at all.  Now, around you is a pure hellish looking place, and all around, your worst fears are coming true.   } {partroxis} {} {desert} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5798} {0} {<278>} {The Wheat Field} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A bloody wheat field, littered with the armor and clothing of those long dead lies before you.  An eerie glow also fills the atmosphere, and as if by magic, the armor itself seems to twitch and come to life.  Even long after its master is dead, the armor seems to carry on a life of its own.  These are the fields of death reborn.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5799} {0} {<278>} {A Cave} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You stand right outside the cave of one of the most fierce creatures the Otherworld has ever produced.  It is not a good idea to stay here.  The air smells of fresh blood, fresher then you may want to know about, and the sound of the beast that lives nears you more so every moment.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5800} {0} {<278>} {A Cave} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You now stand within the dragon's cave.  He had prisoners, that weren't really prisoners at all.  Some insane Cheryb are running around madly, probably kept alive due to the entertainment they provided the dragons.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5801} {0} {<278>} {In the Mountains} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The end is nearing in this long trek through the Otherworld and you can almost taste victory.  The Otherworld however does not like that thought, and from here on out, it is through playing games.  The terrain has become more treacherous, and the monsters far stronger.  The first test of your might comes in the form of a dragon, larger then the largest building you've ever seen flying your way.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5802} {0} {<278>} {In the Mountains} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You now stand at the brink of destruction. The Otherworld is more ruthless  than anyone could imagine. Dragons, Chitryns, Wolven, everything you can  think of has assaulted you on your journey through every type of terrain  possible. Now as you near the end, they get even worse, fewer in number, but  worse. In your newfound terrain in this part of the world, you notice the  increasing temperatures, as if to keep the inhabitants at a comfortable  temperature they are used to. In any case, it is time to be prepared for the  worst once again. } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5803} {128} {<278>} {A vast Expanse of Plains} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have come to the what seems to be the end.  The Otherworld has fought you well, and you have won.  Now to make it past what is in front of you and claim your prize, freedom, by passing through the final gate.   } {partroxis} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R { 5804} {128} {<278>} {Inside the Sailing Vessel} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You stand inside a sailing vessel. These ships were made to travel long  distances on the oceans of Volantis. Spacious, sturdy ships such as this  never sink. Many people spend their lives aboard these ships, never to reach  land at all. } {partroxis} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
