R { 5806} {128} {<278>} {Underground Passage} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are now underground, in passages long forgotten.  This was more than likely the home of the people in days past, before the Gyani attacked.   Now there is nothing here but old bones, and Gyani droppings. } {partroxis} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
