R { 5812} {128} {<278>} {The Opus} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You stand before the lord of the Opus, Grax. All around, Cheryb have  gathered, weapons in hand, ready to start their conquest of the mortal  worlds, having all this time waited for you to arrive. Have you brought them  what they want to hear? } {partroxis} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}

R { 5813} {0} {<278>} {The Partroxis} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have entered the Partroxis. Before you floating within your mind you see  flashing images of five different worlds. One, Arctarian, mountain peaks,  reaching into the sky, dwellings within.. A second, Pyxidis, a world of  forests, and a great Tree. A third, Octantis, with canyons of fire, and a  city of death. You see Volantis, an ocean vast and beautiful, never ending. Last, you see perfection, trees, the sun, lakes and rivers and streams. It's  idyllic and perhaps, too much so. Now one thing is for certain, you must  choose where you wish to go. Warning: Do not enter the world of perfection  unless you are prepared for the worst. It is not as it may seem. } {partroxis} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 5818} {enter ocean} {enter ocean} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 5814} {128} {<278>} {The Opus} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Welcome to the Opus. You are in the center of what has been created during  the dividing. The dividing is that which ended a great war between two  godlike races known as the Cheryb and the Warloxans. This dividing split the  one world into four. A gateway called the Partroxis was made to link the Opus with the parted worlds. In addition, other portals were created between the  worlds. The four, in which the mortals now live, another, which is the  gateway to the prison known as the Otherworld, and lastly, the Denouement,  which no one knows the location of or what lies within it. } {partroxis} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}

R { 5816} {0} {<148>} {Descending into a Canyon} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  You are descending into a great canyon. The Partroxis hovers in its center  just behind you as you travel down towards what seems to be a lake of lava up ahead. To the north of the lake you see what seems to be a huge city and a  palace. There are no signs of life on this planet at all. } {partroxis} {} {ocean} {} {1.000} {}
