R { 6049} {0} {<278>} {Light Hallway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Unlit torches line the walls of the corridor. Despite this, there is plenty  of natural light emanating from high above you. The citadel is well populated with guards whose yelling can be heard echoing through the hallways. The path south leads to the silver watchtower. The northern one takes you to the  granite watchtower. To the west you see a brighter hall and also hear the  gurgling of waters. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
