R { 6050} {0} {<278>} {Light Hallway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The corridor is lit by natural light emanating from high above you. The cold  stone walls lack any warmth that might be provided by tapestries or other  wall coverings. The voices of guards echo throughout the citadel. This would  suggest that caution is needed, as they do not sound friendly. The path south leads to the silver watchtower. The northern one takes you to the granite  watchtower. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 6058} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E { 6049} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 6051} {0} {<238>} {The Rim of a Volcano} {<238>/ \<088>} {  You stand on the rim of a smoking volcano, overlooking the desolate lands  that surround the Citadel of Rauko'ra. You can see the black walls of the  citadel and beyond them you see mountain peaks that look fresh and clean. Far away, there must be forests and rivers teaming with life, but here there  is nothing but the possibility of death and despair. } {raukora} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}

R { 6052} {0} {<238>} {Before the Iron Gates of the Citadel} {<238>/ \<088>} {   Looming before you are the very gates of the Citadel of Lost Souls, the  Fortress of Rauko'ra, made long ago. Many are the vast chambers deep in the  earth and high are the hollow peaks of the volcanoes, emitting poisonous  clouds and vapors, sent against the living. Everything is built up of ash and slag. The grey and black stones aren't a happy sight here. The gates are open, though you wouldn't call them inviting. } {raukora} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
E { 6040} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 6053} {0} {<278>} {Chamber of Loot} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This must be the place where servants of Rauko'ra bring the possessions that  are looted from the fallen. You see many sorts of weapons and armor, most of  them broken into pieces. The purses have been torn apart in the hope of  finding something of value. In the far corner you notice a small pile of  food\; guards must have discarded it as inedible. There is a tiny hole in the  wall, perhaps used by some rodent. Otherwise, this room is no different from  the others in this awful place. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 6081} {s} {open s;s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 6054} {0} {<278>} {Below the Obsidian Watchtower} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You stand below the obsidian watchtower. The "obsidian-ness" of the tower  wraps everything here in a blanket of darkness. To the south and east you can see the hallway continuing, and up is the ladder to the obsidian watchtower. You also notice a locked trapdoor leading down. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
