R { 6059} {0} {<278>} {The Barracks} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This should be the place where the guards and their monsters live and keep  fit during times when there is no war. At the moment they seem to feel very  secure because nobody can be seen practicing here. A strong and awful smell  seems to be coming from the west. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
