R { 6061} {0} {<278>} {The Outhouse} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  After seeing the hallways of the citadel, it is a surprise that there is an  outhouse here. It seems that no one is using the toilet, leaving their  droppings and fluids wherever they like. Probably this is the place to be if  one wanted to be alone. The toilet seat seems to be open. It is also covered  with cobwebs. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
