R { 6062} {128} {<278>} {Deep In} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Perfect! There is no way back. The faint light above is impossible to reach  because of the slippery walls. The moss, moisture, and a brownish substance  are not very inviting and there is nothing to support the climb. The place is dark enough to make you see "things". Something just moved behind you! } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}

R { 6063} {0} {<278>} {Armoury} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The armoury is empty of the things that usually would fill this sort of  place. The orcs feel so secure that they don't need armor now. If they have a need, the orcs go looting men and elves who have better and fancier pieces of equipment. The armorsmith here does not seem to be happy about it. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 6079} {e} {open e;e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 6064} {0} {<278>} {Weaponsmith} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  There isn't much to see in this room. The furnaces and anvils haven't been  used for a long time and the room is empty. There are rusty swords on the  floor but they look rather fragile\; no point picking them up. In one corner  there is a vassal looking somewhat goofy. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 6075} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 6065} {0} {<278>} {Ungold's Cell} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Ungold sits here upon a comfortless, iron bed. The room is dark and hazy with no windows and stale air. You can see some moss growing in the corners of the room, but that is the only other sign of benign life in the room. In one  mossy corner you notice water dripping into a small cup. What a terrible  place to be. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 6074} {e} {open e;e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E { 6080} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 6066} {0} {<278>} {Demon's Cell} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The cell seems to be a resting place to one of the citadel's many demons. The room is neither comfortable nor frightening. It is a room adrift in a sea of evil. There is a whip discarded in the corner. It does not appear to have  been used in a long while as cobwebs have formed over it. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 6073} {e} {open e;e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E { 6078} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 6067} {0} {<278>} {The Lair of the Ranah} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The air of this chamber is stifling with the odor of long dead and rotting  flesh. It is well known by all that Rauko'ra feeds the Ranah with living  flesh. The odor must be that of other creatures, dead and discarded here  rather than littering the hallways of the citadel. The floor is covered with  something that you don't want to think of: rotten, clotted blood mixed with  chunks of things that used to be parts of somebody. What a sickening place. } {raukora} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}

R { 6068} {0} {<278>} {A Very Tight Passage} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Standing in this narrow tunnel you sense a terrible presence nearby. The air  is stifling with odors of death and decay. The smell seems much worse from  the north. Listening quietly you can hear a low growl emanating close by. } {raukora} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
E { 6067} {n} {open n;n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R { 6069} {0} {<278>} {The Throne Room of Rauko'ra} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Right after entering the Nethermost Hall of the Citadel it is clear that you  shouldn't be here. The room is blacker than black and filled with all sorts  of weapons of death and torment. It is also lit by fires that have failed in  their purpose. Their light is dimmed by the horrible presence of Lord  Rauko'ra the Thirsty. In the middle of the room is the throne and on it sits  the Lord of the Citadel. His head is adorned with a crown that glows bloody  red in the darkness. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E { 6051} {surrender rauko} {surrender rauko} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

