R { 6076} {0} {<278>} {Dragon's Cell} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This room seems much more lively than any other rooms in the fortress. At  first you don't see anything other than a sleepy dragon here, but as you hear the squeaking noise from up ahead and raise your eyes to the ceiling, some  small bats can be seen. Every now and then the dragon looks yearningly to the little creatures and sighs deeply. Now that's one wuzzy dragon. Maybe that's  the reason he's not with other dragons in the slaughtering business, but  here, "on guard". Rauko'ra has no fear in this strong fortress of his. Thinking of him, you inevitably sense the empty and fearing sense under your  feet. The occasional roaring of the Ranah does seem to be louder in this  room. } {raukora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
