R { 6877} {0} {<278>} {Salin's Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The floor of this room is bare, scrubbed wood.  Immediately to the right of the doorway is what appears at first glance to be a pile of blankets, but upon closer inspection a mattress is visible underneath.  The walls are undecorated save for a small portrait of a young female elf, hung in a corner at eye level.  She seems to somehow give light to the whole room...  Some trick of magic, perhaps, but it's clear that it's a very special picture.   } {insan} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
