R { 6888} {128} {<248>} {Murky Water} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  The pond is apparently fed by this underground spring. As you get deeper, the water becomes dark and cold. What you can see of it is still very clear, but  holes and cracks in the floor make it hard to discern very much at this  depth. A little further down, you can make out some projections from the  stream bed, all thickly covered with moss and streamweed. There is very  little current here... Must be a tributary of a larger stream. } {insan} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
