R { 6889} {128} {<248>} {A Small Underground Stream} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  The stream here is a tunnel, the rock sides rugged and close.  The roof is getting lower, too, though it is dotted with air pockets and shallow, natural caves.  Kelp and streamweed grow closely together in the streambed, and bunches of eggs hide among them.  Schools of minnows practice swimming down and upstream, learning to use their tails and fins like their parents.  Apparently, continuing downstream will eventually take you to a river.   } {insan} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
