R { 6890} {128} {<248>} {A Slight Current} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  Downstream from the spring, the water runs slightly faster, and there is enough current to be noticeable.  The fronds of streamweed and kelp wave lightly, as if blown by wind.  Fewer black spots in the streambed show that it is flattening out and becoming more uniform: probably due to the current gaining strength.  The water is very clear, showing every dip and rise, highlighting some parts and shadowing others.  On one side of the tunnel, there is a small red object attached to a rock...   } {insan} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
