R { 6891} {0} {<248>} {Dimly Lit Tunnel} {<248>% %<088>} {  It looks like this part of the cave is natural.  Torches sit in carved sconces, giving enough light (barely) to see.  The floors are dry and clean, not wet and debris-filled, like in some caves.  The tunnel from which you came is to the east, and it continues to the west.   } {insan} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
