R { 6893} {0} {<248>} {An Enormous Cavern} {<248>% %<088>} {  Apart from the torches on the walls, this cave would be dark and lonely.  Even the flickering light of the torches is barely enough to see; darkness remains, cowering in hollows and corners, hiding from the light.  This immense cavern seems to be completely natural, having no signs of carving or any other irregular abrasions.  The high roof seems to close in to the north, gradually becoming more of a tunnel - though at its lowest, a nicely-grown centaur could still stand comfortably without touching...  If ever a centaur would venture down into this darkness.   } {insan} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
