R { 6897} {0} {<108>} {Sleeping Peacefully...} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  In your dreams, or what?  Fine then.  In your dreams, you see nothing but blackness...  And then your brain begins working.  You see elves and dwarves fighting in a long-ago battle, centaurs roaming the mountains and forests in company with nymphs and dryads.  Then the vision changes, and you see short, hairless bipeds with tails sitting by a stream fishing - oh yes, "Nispeung". The name still seems strange to you, even after reading all about them and seeing them here.  Your mind wanders on, in and out of reality, seemingly searching for something...  You feel a powerful urge upon you, but you cannot tell what action it prompts you to take.  You feel that staying here long would not be a good thing to do...   } {insan} {} {space4} {safe} {1.000} {}
