R { 7324} {0} {<218>} {A Burgeoning Volcano} {<218>/ \<088>} {  As you step onto the black rock just barely emerging from the roiling waters, your boots become stuck on the still cooling earth. Barely one hundred meters in diameter, this small piece of land is constantly battered by the huge  waves of the Inner Sea. Slightly off from the center of the island is a  gaping hole which sends forth gusts of acerbic smog caught by the buffeting  winds. Occasionally, you glimpse a red glow that is ushered forth by the  winds that clear the dark smoke rising from the fissure. It seems there is a  small walkway down into the nascent earth, but it surely cannot travel far. Above all, a feeling of immense power - and a sense that reality is not  completely stable - has settled over this place. } {uncharted} {} {volcano} {} {1.000} {}
