R {10308} {0} {<278>} {The End of the Pier} {<278>. .<088>} {  Here, the cargo ship Eleanor Gast prepares to set sail to the island city of  Rhodus, its hold loaded down with grain. No dockhands are in sight, so the  ship will probably be leaving port shortly. However, the captain isn't in  sight either, which is very abnormal. No other ships are docked at this end  of the pier, so the captain must have gone elsewhere. } {rebellion} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
