R {10309} {0} {<278>} {Before the Gates of Rhodus} {<278>. .<088>} {  The Eleanor Gast sits at a pier here before the southern gate of Rhodus, the only city on the Isle of Molyneux.  The gate, a white marble archway with no discernable door or portcullis, is an architectural marvel; fifty feet tall, every inch of the archway covered with sculpture.  Images of wyverns and gods of the sea dominate, with the occasional war-clad Molyneuxan or enslaved human figure.  Drug-pacified servants finish unloading the ship's cargo all around you, but the strange green tinge to the sky...   } {rebellion} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
