R {10313} {0} {<278>} {Orduna Plaza} {<278>. .<088>} {  This square honors Emperor Orduna LX, the 98th Emperor of Molyneux and  current resident of the Emerald Throne. His statue, tall and melancholy,  dominates the square. Beneath your feet, the stones of Reimers Avenue leading north and south mix with the blue-tinged marble of Loredo Avenue, turning the stones of the square itself into a dazzlingly beautiful spectacle. A  filigreed silver gate to the north blocks travel beyond the Merchants'  Quarter to visitors such as yourself. } {rebellion} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
