R {10343} {0} {<118>} {On the Flagship's Upper Deck} {<118>[ ]<088>} {  Climbing onto the upper platform, you can tell beyond any shadow of a doubt  that you are now on the flagship of the Nixie Fleet... A short ways east  towards the bow, a gigantic flagpole bearing the banner of the Nixie rebels  upon it rises upwards from a large cabin. You have never seen a ship with  multiple levels like this one. The upper level sits atop the lower like  scaffolding around a half-built castle, yet the upper deck is supported by no visible means. The planks beneath you seem to lap at your feet like gentle  waves, pushing you futilely away from the cabin and the groaning, shifting  noises within. } {rebellion} {} {bloodyroom} {} {1.000} {}
E {10344} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {10344} {0} {<118>} {Beneath the Banner of the Rebellion} {<118>[ ]<088>} {  The inside of the cabin is impossibly large, with far more open space within it than should be possible from the dimensions you saw a minute ago.  The floors and walls look like ordinary wood, but feel hard and metallic to the touch\; blobs of slick green goo coat portions of the floor, but avoiding them seems a far better plan than checking their texture.  Dozens of buttons and levers and mouthpieces and spyglasses protrude from the wall near the front of the cabin, constantly shifting their positions and directions as you look at them.  A wave of sickening dizziness passes over you as you drive yourself forwards, glad for the protection of the Nixie Shield as you enter the command center of the entire Nixie Fleet.   } {rebellion} {} {bloodyroom} {} {1.000} {}
