R {10347} {0} {<228>} {Before a Great Barrow} {<228>( *<088>} {  The stream comes to an end in a small pond in this clearing, but that is far  from the primary feature of the clearing. On the west side stands a massive  grave barrow, fenced about with giant slabs of unadorned stone. A set of  heavy brass gates complete the barrow's encircling, blocking you from  entering. The forest around the clearing permits you exit in no direction  other than back upstream and towards the gated barrow to your west. An odd  frission of deja-vu passes over your body as you fruitlessly try to peek  inside the barrow for a view of its contents. } {rebellion} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
