R {10354} {0} {<148>} {Sewer Hideaway} {<148>. .<088>} {  A cave-in to the east separates these chambers from the still-functioning sewers of the rest of Rhodus.  Nevertheless, you decide to do your best not to step in that stuff on the floor.  This hideaway is dark, rancid, and depressing, but its residents have nowhere else to go, with all the guards on the streets between here and the dock.  You suspect these refugees would long ago have been found and recaptured, were it not for the distraction of the onrushing chaos.   } {rebellion} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {10353} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {10355} {128} {<278>} {Prison} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Moans of pain and suffering surround you here; dark, painful noises emanate from the cells all around you.  Immediately looking around for an exit, the staircase leads back up to the black door above you, and on downwards.  This room is little more than a place for a guard to sit and watch over the cells.  The floor and ceiling are simple but evenly-cut basalt, and you'd guess the same for the walls, but you can only barely see through the bars that line all four sides of this dark, humid chamber.   } {rebellion} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
