R {10356} {128} {<278>} {Torture Chamber} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This room is even more vile and disturbing than the one above.  Dried blood and worse spatters the floor, and hideously painful-looking torture devices sit near the room's center.  Rusty shelves rest against the east wall, and bloody hooks line the south wall near the ceiling.  A wet bundle of something lies in forgotten in a corner, smelling foul and bloody.  Surprisingly, the torture chamber is brightly lit by some sort of magical globe set into the ceiling.   } {rebellion} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
