R {10358} {128} {<228>} {A Hill Untouched by the Battle} {<228>. ^<088>} {  The sudden transition from the mind-bending music to the quiet of this hilltop leaves you stunned momentarily, but you recover quickly in the warm clear air here.  You hear the sound of a bird singing somewhere on the lightly wooded hill, the first natural sound to reach your ears in far too long.  Looking around, the battle is nowhere in sight, as if this hill stood in some land far distant from where you were a moment before.  A narrow stone path leads up the hill, and you follow it carefully to avoid disturbing the natural beauty all around you, ascending towards the lone figure standing at the summit.   } {rebellion} {} {hills} {safe} {1.000} {}
