R {10361} {0} {<268>} {The Battlegrounds of the Nix} {<268>. .<088>} {  Mesmerizing music fills the air all around you as the Nixie rebels battle  with the Loyalists for the fate of the Nix. Colossal figures grapple in  contests involving more levels of awareness than you can imagine, their every move echoing down uncountable worlds of the planes. White noise emanates  from some of the combatants, blocking the mayhem-inducing music emitted from  the others. You seem to be walking on a layer of clouds, on an entirely  different plane from where the wyverns fight Malson Gahan's army in a  conflict echoing this one. A swirling tornado of energy descends from the  clouds in front of you towards a spot just beyond the edge of the battlefield far below. } {rebellion} {} {air} {maze} {1.000} {}

R {10364} {0} {<268>} {The Battlegrounds of the Nix} {<268>. .<088>} {  Mesmerizing music fills the air all around you as the Nixie rebels battle  with the Loyalists for the fate of the Nix. Colossal figures grapple in  contests involving more levels of awareness than you can imagine, their every move echoing down uncountable worlds of the planes. White noise emanates  from some of the combatants, blocking the mayhem-inducing music emitted from  the others. You seem to be walking on a layer of clouds, on an entirely  different plane from where the wyverns fight Malson Gahan's army in a  conflict echoing this one. A swirling tornado of energy descends from the  clouds in front of you towards a spot just beyond the edge of the battlefield far below. } {rebellion} {} {air} {maze} {1.000} {}

R {10365} {0} {<278>} {A Swirling Vortex of Energy } {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A gust of energy takes hold of you and whirls you around, slowly pulling you down the tornado-like funnel. Far down below, you see a lone figure in  glowing red armor standing at the center of the vortex, his gaze turned  skywards as he controls the vortex to toy with you like a cat would a  broken-winged bird. As you wheel ineffectually up and down the inside of the  vortex, you think of all the prophecies you have supposedly been fulfilling  in your adventures here. Do you have what it takes to carry out the will of  the Hand of Fate, or is an ignoble death all your future holds?   } {rebellion} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
