R {10366} {128} {<228>} {The Shore of a Rocky Island} {<228>, `<088>} {  As the Eleanor Gast sails off into the distance behind you, your gaze turns  to this rocky island on which you now seem to be stranded. A narrow, gravelly beach winds around the island to the east towards some odd-looking rock  formations, and to your north lies the base of the jagged mountain that  dominates the island of Tonun Taishi. Looking up towards the mountain's peak, you think you can see a castle built into the rock there, majestic and  forlorn on its viewpoint over the empty ocean. } {rebellion} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
