R {10367} {128} {<238>} {The Bottom of a Giant Staircase} {<238>/ \<088>} {  Here at the base of the mountain, you can see a gigantic staircase leading up it towards the castle on its peak. Cool wind from the ocean blows across your face as you try to count how many steps you will need to climb to reach the  top, but you lose count long before you can get a useful figure. The  staircase itself has been hewn roughly from the mountainside, each step  almost two feet tall, as if designed for a pair of legs far longer than  yours. Sighing, you prepare yourself for the arduous trek up to the  mountain's summit. } {rebellion} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
E {10366} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
