R {10368} {128} {<238>} {Climbing a Giant Staircase} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The giant staircase continues onwards up the mountain, and back down to the  island's shoreline below you. The mountain looks small in comparison to the  mainland's large ranges like the Mountains of Desolation, perhaps a quarter  mile from base to summit, but it looks and feels much taller when it's the  only feature on an island out in the middle of an empty ocean. Your legs also seem to care little about the technical smallness of this mountain, as the  task of stretching for each and every step tires you far faster than hiking  would normally. } {rebellion} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
