R {10369} {128} {<238>} {Climbing a Giant Staircase} {<238>/ \<088>} {  A cold ocean wind blows hard against you, threatening to fling you clear off  the mountainside as it buffets you with force gathered from hundreds of miles of flat, empty ocean. The giant-sized steps beneath you seem virtually  untreaded, but instead its dark basalt has been worn down by the slow  workings of millenia of wind, water, and lichen. The summit and its castle  are not far above you now, the castle's large but simple construction and  disrepair lending an air of sadness and depression to the mountaintop. Far  below you lie the shores of Tonun Taishi, but looking down the staircase's  length quickly makes you dizzy, so you return your eyes to the castle above. } {rebellion} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
