R {10370} {128} {<238>} {The Top of the Mountain} {<238>/ \<088>} {  You have finally reached the top of Tonun Taishi's mountain, and the giant  castle stands bleak and wasted to your west. The summit is wide and flat  before you, and continues so towards the north by the castle's entrance. Now  that you are close enough to inspect the castle, you can see that it looks  built by somebody who had grand ideas but really just didn't care about  implementing them. Towers rise up from the twenty-foot main building, and a  wide parapet stretches over the cliff around to the south side, but the  stones seem roughly chiseled from the island's basalt. The major features are all there, but the details are lacking; no windows, no decorations, no  quality of craftsmanship anywhere. } {rebellion} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
E {10369} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
