R {10371} {0} {<238>} {Before the Giant Castle} {<238>/ \<088>} {  To your east lies the gigantic doorway to the castle, sad and forboding in  its lichen-spotted decrepitude and uninspired construction. The dark basalt  seems to brood sullenly beneath the cloudless, windy sky. The mountain's  summit has been carved into a broad plaza here in front of the gates, and the plaza continues towards the top of the giant staircase to the south. To the  north and west the summit quickly drops off steeply, descending thousands of  feet towards the ocean below. The brisk ocean wind blows with terrifying  ferocity here at the summit, forcing you to brace yourself against it and  keep your weight low as protection against being pushed towards the cliffs. } {rebellion} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
