R {10372} {0} {<278>} {Heth's Castle} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The inside of the gigantic castle is a far sight from what you had expected. You can see all the way up to the castle's roof, the full twenty feet of the  castle's height taken up by this one large room. Interior walls are also  surprisingly absent; this one vast chamber fills the castle, the towers no  more than deep recesses in the ceiling. Light spills in through the huge  doorway behind you and another leading out onto the parapet to the south. A  few rocks litter the floor in lieu of furniture, and both those and the  insides of the walls are dotted with moss and lichen, creating an aura of  disenheartenment and despair that permeates your very soul. } {rebellion} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
