R {10373} {0} {<228>} {The Parapet of Heth's Castle} {<228>. ^<088>} {  Stepping back out into the sunlight makes a refreshing change after the  gloomy inside of Heth's castle. This parapet offers a fantastic view of the  ocean, and looking out across it you can just make out the Eleanor Gast  disappearing over the horizon. You can head back inside Heth's dwelling  through the archway to your north, and you can also see a surprisingly narrow walkway leading down this side of the mountain from the parapet's side. Looking off towards the distant east, you can discern the ghastly green tint  of the sky over Molyneux, an insistent reminder of the horrors encroaching  on that island, and soon the rest of the world as well. } {rebellion} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
