R {10374} {0} {<228>} {An Outcropping of Crystalline Boulders} {<228>, `<088>} {  As you approach the strange formations, the rocks beneath your feet give way, sliding you head over heels onto the beach and making the return climb  impossible. Looking around, you see dozens of clear, crystalline boulders  and countless pebbles thereof around the beach. They seem to be outcroppings  from some deep vein of crystal descending down into the bowels of the world. As you walk near them, a faint tingle passes over you but afterwards you feel relieved, as if the presence of these crystals nullified some magical force  surrounding the rest of this island. } {rebellion} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}

R {10375} {0} {<278>} {Guard Post at the Bottom of a Tower} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The jade walls inside the tower have a matt finish to prevent reflected  light from dazzling or blinding its occupants. This is doubly important for  the bottom floor of the tower is filled with Molyneuxan soldiers, sharpening  their blades, stringing their bows, and generally acting nervous and  impatient. Absorbed in their worries, they ignore you completely as you walk  through the tower. Other than the exit back out onto the street, you find a  spiral staircase leading upwards along the inside of the tower's gently  tapering outer walls, as well as a door made of black stone leading downwards from a shadowy corner. } {rebellion} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
