R {10376} {0} {<278>} {The Watchtower of Rhodus} {<278>. .<088>} {    The staircase terminates at a small platform atop the tower. You can make  out numerous sculptures and carvings along the walls just below where you  stand, but you cannot identify them from this angle. Looking outwards, you  can see the entirety of Rhodus, from the sea-maze to the south protecting the city from naval attack to the magnificent spiralling towers of the Emperor's  Palace to the north. Despite all this beauty, however, the sight to the west  is far more riveting. Not far beyond the city's edge, sky sea, and land are  consumed in a roiling cloud, dark despite the thousand colors bubbling  through it. The sickening green tinge to the sky becomes more and more  pronounced as you look farther west towards the storm front of Nixie devilment. } {rebellion} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
