R {10377} {0} {<278>} {A Lavish Molyneuxan Home} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The warmth of this mansion's main hall is a welcome change from the cold  weather outside\; a blazing fire burns in a fireplace in the back of the room. An odd oily smell wafts out from the fireplace, making you feel slightly  queasy\; looking around for a dirty lamp or some other possible source to the  smell, you see no other light sources in the dimly lit room, nor anything  else likely to cause the odor. Paintings cover the smooth white walls, full  of intricate patterns of colored lines suggesting some otherworldly figure. The only visible exit lies through the locked door to the south, back out  into the garden. Perhaps the occupant could help you find your way out? } {rebellion} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}
