R {10379} {0} {<278>} {The Eye of the Storm} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You find yourself standing on a small plot of relatively stable ground, a  barren, dry plain for a few dozen yards around you, encircled by Nix  devilment and lit by the vortex over your head. A dread calm fills the air as you stand face to face with the man who set in motion the events leading to  the uprising of the Nixie rebels on your plane and eventually to this crucial instant. Fate is on your side, but the look in Gahan's eyes makes you doubt  your faith in the inevitability of destiny. Whoever wins this battle, the  victory will resonate across the planes of existence, affecting events for  one side or another in the conflicts between the Loyalists and Nixie rebels  across the near-infinity of worlds. } {rebellion} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}

