R {10500} {128} {<148>} {The hole} {<148>. .<088>} {  Dropping down into this rather small hole you crouch and extend your torch  out before you. Your eyes are greeted by a huge mischief of rats and standing in the middle of the bunch is the largest damn rat you've ever seen! Standing about three feet tall at the shoulders, this rat would rival most  dogs in size. Even worse, it seems to be covered in open sores that are  festered and oozing pus. Its mouth looks even worse and it's obvious that  these rats have acquired a taste for flesh. You shudder at the thought of  what diseases those mouths might hold... } {damned} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
