R {10507} {0} {<278>} {The temple entry} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Climbing down the ladder, you are amazed to find that you are in an actual  section that has been carved out. Torches line the smooth stone walls and  give off a friendly light making you feel more at ease. That is, until the  chanting starts. Stepping up to the door, you press your ear against the cool wood and listen intently. Several voices are coming from somewhere ahead;  they are very faint. If this room were not so quiet, you really doubt you  would have noticed them at all. Taking advantage of not being discovered yet, you stop to look around. A strange symbol decorates the east wall. } {damned} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
