R {10512} {0} {<278>} {Altar of sacrifice} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Drawing closer, you see that there is no table here but in fact a bloody  altar. Several men stand around the altar chanting over the body of a young  woman who is chained down to it. Holding hands with their eyes closed they  don't seem to notice you walk up. You can see that their skin is gray and has a leathery look to it. These are not men- they are undead performing some  dark ritual! Suddenly the chanting rises in volume until it becomes almost a  yell. The man in the center, at the head of the altar, suddenly steps forward and drives his hand into the young woman's chest! The still living girl lets  out a low moan. As her last breath escapes her, the evil priest pulls her  still-beating heart out and holds it high. Suddenly seeing you, he screams in rage, "Kill this fool! No mortal will ever witness such a ceremony and escape to tell about it!" The undead priests turn on you as he flees north. } {damned} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
