R {10516} {128} {<278>} {The glass portal} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  At last the high priest stands before you. Holding the still-beating heart  defiantly in one hand he beckons you forward. "You cannot stop us, even if  you slay me. Alister will not fall before you! This heart is the key and if  you take another step I will cast it into the portal!" Glancing past him you  see a terrible sight. A sheet of what appears to be glass stands suspended in mid-air with no apparent supports. It swirls with black clouds and every few  seconds lightning streaks across the surface of it. A deep rumbling rolls  through the room and you look back to the priest to see his evil grin of  triumph. He laughs insanely, confident you are lost. } {damned} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
