R {10519} {0} {<278>} {Bob's Blacksmith Shop} {<278>. .<088>} {  You walk through a thick steel door and stare in wonder at the room before you.  Immediately, you are met by the smell smoke and sweat.  On one wall of the shop, weapons of every type hang.  On the other side of the shop, all sorts of armor lie, ready for use.  After going through a door at the back of the shop, you find yourself deafened by the roar of metal being hammered, and fires blazing as they melt steel.  Quickly, you head for the front of the shop, and bump into a tall, well-muscled blacksmith.  With a warm smile, he greets you and says, "Hi, my name's Bob.  Would you like to buy something?"   } {sanctity} {} {city} {safe,shop} {1.000} {}
