R {11039} {0} {<148>} {On the lake} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The waters here are crystal clear.  To the south, you see the far shore and the tree, which is on the other end of the bridge.  The tree is much like the one that grows on this side of the lake.  West is a thriving mass of thick vegetation, and even here the insects which fly to and from the reeds are a near constant cloud over the water.  Silver, black and brown fish leap from the water to skillfully catch the insects, and a small frog paddles by with its tongue flickering constantly as it devours more of the insects.   } {agroth} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
