R {11040} {0} {<148>} {In watery vegetation} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Here, the water is cloudy with mud and the leaves and decay of dead plants.  Reeds, cattails and bulrushes grow here in the water, and a few saplings have grown up out of the water as well.  Fish swim around here and a few birds peck at the watery vegetation.  It is quite possible that an alligator could use this for a very good hunting ground with all the camouflage provided.  The sounds of splashes and small chirps and buzzings reach your ears from the edges of the lake, and the, and the chanting floats on the light breezes, reminding you of its unusual presence in this place.   } {agroth} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
