R {11041} {0} {<148>} {In muddy water} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Here the water is muddy.  Odd since most of the lake has crystal clear water, when it is not cluttered with vegetation.  The water is a dirty brown and has a gritty feel to your skin.  Possibly this spot is becoming some animal's home, or the mud here is not as sticky and can move up to cloud the surface.   } {agroth} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
