R {11042} {0} {<148>} {Shaded cove on the lake} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Here the shade of a very large tree helps to cool the water somewhat.  There are several leaves floating on the water, as well as some petals from the red and yellow flowers found along the lakeshore.  Small insects dart over the water, and frogs croak in the rushes.  This would be a nice place to rest and cool off, if not for the danger of any marshland predators.   } {agroth} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
