R {11043} {0} {<148>} {In reeds and bulrushes} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The vegetation in this part of the lake is so dense that you can hardly move.  Reeds and rushes nearly clog the water at this point, and insects here are swarming; many make their homes in this part of the lake.  The colors are very beautiful, all greens, reds blues and yellows, but the uncomfortable feel of bites on your skin makes it difficult to stop to enjoy the view of the plant life thriving around you.   } {agroth} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
