R {11044} {0} {<248>} {Underwater} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  After diving under the surface, you notice the water does not cool off much.  In this spot, the water is still clear, but it becomes cloudy in some places.  You can see the fish swimming around here, and you can make out the birds floating on the surface of the lake.  On the bottom of the lake is a mixture of smooth, rounded rocks and a thick sticky mud.  There are some rotting logs and other decaying plants on the lake bottom, but they seem to be scattered, and do not clutter the muddy depths.   } {agroth} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
