R {11045} {0} {<248>} {Shaded rocks} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  Below the waters in the shady part of the lake you find many algae and moss covered rocks.  The stones are smooth and rounded from centuries of rubbing by the waters.  There is light glinting from the east but here the water is still cool and shaded by the large tree overhead.   } {agroth} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
