R {11046} {0} {<248>} {Diving among the plants} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  You are now swimming near the bottom of the lake.  The water here is very cloudy, and the mud is very sticky.  This is the perfect place for fish, dark and cool.  Things brush by you, their bodies wet and some a bit slimy.  } {agroth} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
