R {11048} {0} {<228>} {Along the lakeshore} {<228>( *<088>} {  Here the lakeshore is very muddy.  Frogs and birds are hidden in the rushes and trees along the water's edge, and the clinging mud steams.  Out on the lake, a large bass arcs through the air, disappearing into the water with barely a ripple.  It appears that the lake has an abundance of plant life as well, many plants grow up through the water to the north, and the trees here offer little shade, as they are spaced farther apart.   } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {11049} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
