R {11049} {0} {<228>} {Close to the marshland lake} {<228>( *<088>} {  The ground here is extremely swampy, and it is crossed by many deep tracks, both humanoid and animal.  Reeds and rushes grow thickly here, and the trees are fewer and farther between.  The sun falls full upon the sparkling lake to the west and the sounds of frogs and other aquatic life grow much stronger.  The smell of the lake is very thick, almost covering all other smells in the vicinity, though you can still catch hints of the flowery blossoms from bushes nearby.  The air steams and feels as if you could wring water directly from it.   } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
