R {11050} {0} {<138>} {Very swampy spot on the lakeshore} {<138>%%<088>} {  Here it is very difficult to follow the path around the sparkling lake.  The path is little more than a shallow part of the lake itself.  The water stands a few inches above the thick, saturated mud which serves as the path. There are a few rotting logs scattered around the area here and insects swoop over them, feeding off of the decay.  There are sucking sounds as the mud bubbles and steams in the hot air, and you realize that there are pools of quicksand dotting the path at this point as well.  To the west, the lake sparkles and shines.  The breeze is somewhat cooler to the west, as well, possibly the lake would offer at least some relief from the oppressive heat and steam of the surrounding area.  North of here is a large pool of quicksand, making travel impossible, and to the east, more quicksand and trees block your passage.   } {agroth} {} {quicksand} {} {1.000} {}
E {11049} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {11041} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {11051} {0} {<138>} {Muddy path} {<138>%%<088>} {  The path here is quite muddy, the mud clings to everything in clumps and water seeps through at every step.  To the east, you can see an enormous pool of quicksand, perhaps it is growing and this spot will soon become a part of the enormous pool.  You can see a few small skeletons trapped just at the edge of the path, where it becomes the quicksand, and as you watch, a small rodent scurries past and is suddenly caught in the sucking mud to the east.   } {agroth} {} {quicksand} {} {1.000} {}
