R {11054} {0} {<278>} {Among the roots of a large tree} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have come upon a great tree, its roots rising up over the small pools of water which dot the edge of the large lake.  It would be very easy for even a large giant to walk under the roots of this enormous tree.  Vines seem to have grown over the roots, making a small shelter for anyone to hide or rest in.  A few large rocks have been broken apart where the enormous roots have forced their way through to the rich, muddy soil beneath, and the air is cooled by the shelter provided.  The lake lies to the east and a small pool from the lake has formed right at the edge of the roots, making it possible to sit here and rest for a while.  You get the feeling that many animals here do just that, and it is easy to understand why.   } {agroth} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
