R {11056} {0} {<228>} {Along a dark path} {<228>( *<088>} {  The path here is very shady and dark.  Trees with thick trunks grow along the sides of the swampy cleared space which serves as a path.  Lush grasses and low flowery bushes dot the spaces between the enormous trees.  In the darkness, mushrooms and moss flourish and the heat lessens.  The sticky air carries a hint of mud and water, and you can hear occasional splashes to the northeast.  An errant breeze again brings with it the sound of chanting, and almost singing that touches the very center of any natural being.   } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
