R {11057} {0} {<278>} {A shady spot on the lakeshore} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  There is a very large tree here which provides shade to a bit of the surrounding area.  The trunk of the tree is very tall and as big around as a house, its ancient bark pitted and cracked.  The branches spread in all directions, and many small marshland creatures seem to use this spot at one time or another; there are many sets of different kinds of tracks here.  A large flat rock provides a place to stop and rest for a while, and the shaded water looks cool and inviting.   } {agroth} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
