R {11058} {0} {<228>} {Along a narrow and shady path} {<228>( *<088>} {  The shade here is somewhat cooling, though shafts of sunlight break through the light covering of branches.  The scent of mud and rotting vegetation fills the air and the sounds of insects, birds and some rustlings, probably of smaller animals, fill the air.  The air here is still and sound does not carry far in the close vegetation which helps to make the path you are now following.  You glance toward the opening in the vegetation, where the loggers chopped into the marshlands, and then toward the darker path leading to the north.   } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
