R {11059} {0} {<228>} {A darkening marshy path} {<228>( *<088>} {  The mud here lacks the steam of that in the open air, but still sticky, clinging to anything that touches it.  Deep prints show in the mud, from creatures that have traveled this way.  The trees along the path are tall and have thick trunks.  Their branches reach high above the path and become a maze of interconnecting branches.  Thick vegetation fills the spaces between the brown and gnarled trunks, and moss grows in streamers from the branches far above.   } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
