R {11060} {0} {<228>} {A dark and gloomy path} {<228>( *<088>} {  As you leave the sunlit clearing behind, you find yourself on a winding path filled with tall trees, their trunks thick and their bark a greenish brown and riddled with deep fissures.  High overhead, the branches of the trees weave into a canopy which serves to block out the light.  Harsh calls from some exotic birds, as well as soft whirrs and buzzings filter through the thick undergrowth.  There are sounds of scrabbling and snuffling deep in the undergrowth as well.  The ground here is muddy, but it seems drier than the ground in the stump dotted clearing.  The air is very humid, and seems to press down on you.  To the west is the clearing, while to the north, the winding path continues to snake its way into the marshlands.   } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
