R {11061} {0} {<228>} {A dark and winding path} {<228>( *<088>} {  The path continues to snake through the tall trees.  Here and there, thick tangles of roots snake across the path; a danger to any unwary traveler.  The air is close and steamy and the sounds of life surround you here.  There are soft sucking and bubbling sounds from somewhere to the north and east, and the scents of rotting vegetation and wet earth fill your nostrils.  The path continues to wind both south and east.   } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
