R {11066} {0} {<138>} {A treacherous path} {<138>%%<088>} {  The path continues to open out, the trees receding and the undergrowth seeming to shrink back from the wide expanse of mud.  As you continue along, you suddenly realize that there are sucking sounds all around you, and looking closer at the oozing mud, you can see the very tips of great branches futilely reaching toward the open sky.  It would not be good to get stuck in this quicksand.  The path appeared solid because there was nothing to see sink into the muck, it all happened long ago, and you were almost the first victim in centuries to be claimed by the wide pool of hungry mud.   } {agroth} {} {quicksand} {} {1.000} {}
