R {11067} {0} {<228>} {A solid path} {<228>( *<088>} {  Here the path rises up higher than the soaking waters of the marshlands.  For once, you seem to be out of the clinging mud, though the ground is still damp, it is considerably drier than the paths you followed to reach this spot.  The great willow is more visible from here, to the northwest, and you seem to see less and less undergrowth and large trees.  Perhaps with the monstrous willow, it is difficult for anything else to grow very close.   } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
