R {11068} {0} {<228>} {A path through a field} {<228>, `<088>} {  You have stumbled on a field, an oddity in a marsh.  Puzzling over how a field managed to just spring up next to the mud, vines and large trees, you nearly trip over a small furry humanoid working close to the path you are following.  The furry humanoid seems to be planting some sort of grain, and you see rows of small pale mushrooms under a thick bush which seems to be a source of a yellow berry.  The air is fresher here, smelling more of plant life and less of stagnant water.  You can still hear the drippings, scrabblings and shrieks of the marshlands, and the sights are all around you as well, if you look, but the field seems peaceful and removed from the surrounding wetland.   } {agroth} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
