R {11070} {0} {<228>} {On the edge of the Marshling village} {<228>( *<088>} {  You continue through the village and make your way to the edge of the village, on the way toward the enormous willow.  Just in front of you is a large house, presumably belonging to the headman of the village.  In front of the house there is a large stone circle and a cauldron bubbles over a fire in the center of the circle.  Here there are small flower and vegetable gardens, and the trees here provide a great amount of shade.  A small stream runs through the area, and a low, wooden bridge crosses the stream to the west, making it possible to continue on to the willow.  There is a small beating sound, as if someone is beating a primitive drum.  Glancing to the north, you see a small hunched figure lightly stirring something in another cauldron, and keeping time with the chanting on a small skin and wood drum.  } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
