R {11071} {0} {<228>} {Near the great willow} {<228>. ^<088>} {  After passing through the Marshling village, you can clearly see the willow.  It is easily the largest tree you have ever seen, its branches spanning nearly a mile in circumference, and the topmost branches nearly lost from sight.  The chanting is very loud here, and your primal instincts begin to tug harder at your conscious mind.  You begin to climb a hill toward the enormous tree and a few pools of stagnant water and deep quicksand seem to force you to keep to this path.  Whirring insects cloud the side of the path.  A shrill call echoes across the marshlands from some bird of prey as it spots a meal, and you grip your weapons tighter as you slowly make your way along the path.   } {agroth} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
