R {11072} {0} {<228>} {On the fringes of the enormous willow} {<228>( *<088>} {  You have finally reached the enormous tree.  Here the outer branches begin to create a shaded path, and you can tell that it will become much darker the farther under the branches you go.  The marshland noises seem to become more distant here, and the chanting begins to pull at the core of your being.   } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {11071} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
