R {11076} {0} {<228>} {In a hidden clearing} {<228>( *<088>} {  A warm tingle runs through you and a slight gasp escapes your body as you emerge from the crack in the trunk of the enormous willow.  Blinking, you stare around in wonder as the sun beams down onto a bright clearing filled with flowers and a small babbling brook.  You can again hear all the sounds of the marshlands, and looking out across the clearing, you realize you can see the entire marsh spread out before you.  In the center of the clearing is a large, misty portal, a reflection of the marshlands, and standing around it are three figures, all chanting.  Their voices blend together so well you could hardly separate them at first notice.  A sense of finality comes over you as their individual songs and dances merge into a powerful tribal chant.   } {agroth} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
