R {11086} {0} {<278>} {Castle Dining Hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Standing before a vast table of wonderful food your stomach begins to growl in hunger.  Stuffed pheasant, quail, venison, piles of vegetables dripping in butter, cakes, pies.  And every pudding imaginable.  Young girls scurry about with serving trays and huge pitchers of ale.   } {nottingham} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
