R {11420} {0} {<278>} {Side Street} {<278>. .<088>} {  Citizens of the Stone City walk hurriedly passed you.  Everyone seems busy, even in this side street which you expected to be quiet.  The smells of sweat and rubbish surround you and you try to cover your nose in your jacket.  From time to time even more disturbing smells waft by, and you decide that this is definately not part of the city that you like.  To the north the street continues, and to the south you see a guardhouse.   } {stone} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
