R {11421} {0} {<278>} {A Small Clearing} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The noises of the battle in the distance become harder to hear as you walk around the clearing.  The wind is strong and it makes your hair and clothes blow about you.  The animals in the clearing eye you warily and scuffle out of your way.   } {stone} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {11402} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {11422} {0} {<278>} {Castle Gates} {<278>. .<088>} {  You get the perfect opportunity to admire the beauty of the Citadel as you stand at the gates.  The walls are built of many different stones and gems, creating a glorious pattern across the surface.  The citadel seems to glow as the sun shines and glints on the polished surface.  You cannot even imagine how much time it must have taken to build such an amazing building.  Before coming to the Stone City you had heard many stories of the Citadel's beauty, but still you did not expect to find a building as magical and enchanting as this.   } {stone} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
