R {11423} {0} {<278>} {Castle Courtyard} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Warm rays of sunlight stream through the tall trees surrounding the stone coutyard.  In the centre there is a majestic fountain, intricately carved out of stone with details of amethyst, garnet and diamond.  Ferns and flowering shrubs brighten up the courtyard and create homes for buzzing insects and small birds.  The atmosphere is so peaceful here, you feel as if you could forget all about your mission and spend the rest of your life in this tranquil place.   } {stone} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
