R {11425} {0} {<278>} {Guard Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The guard room is small and crowded.  The walls and low ceiling are covered with a texture of small pebbles of many different colours, stuck tightly together.  You feel uncomfortable in the hot room and damp air.  Echoing sounds that seem to come from below catch your attention for a moment.  Your mind returns to the tall guards standing in the room, and you decide to leave as soon as possible, it is not safe to be here.   } {stone} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
