R {11428} {0} {<278>} {Royal Corridor} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The interior of the citadel is decorated with beautiful furnishings.  The stone walls are covered with fine tapestries and sculptures, depicting scenes of legendary Stone City champions from the past.  The corridor is very quiet, a sullen mood surrounds you as you watch the dreary faces of the occasional servants walking by.  You decide to continue through the citadel in hope of meeting a member of the royal family.   } {stone} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
