R {11429} {0} {<278>} {Royal Corridor} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Your footsteps echo loudly throughout the wide corridor as you continue walking down it.  You think you hear the sound of a muffled scream close by..  But you must be hearing things, the battlefield is too far away for you to hear the fighting.  You turn your attention back to the corridor.  The marble floor looks freshly polished and reflects the ferns and pillars that surround the hall.  Patterned light streams in from an oddly shaped window that stretches across the high ceiling and down slightly into the stone walls.  Statues stand either side of the hall amidst large paintings and tapestries.   } {stone} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
