R {11430} {128} {<278>} {The Nyx's Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The stench of mold surrounds you in the dark cave.  It is quiet, the only sounds to be heard are the dripping of water from the ceiling, and a faint scuffling sound.  Wondering what the sound is you explore the cave further.  The walls are smooth and slimy, your feet squelch with every step you take.  Looking down you notice the floor is covered with worms and beetles..  Yuck! Your disgust is overshadowed by fear when you notice a hunched over figure in the corner of the room.   } {stone} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {11389} {u} {u} {16} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {11431} {0} {<278>} {Throne Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The throne room is large and round.  Steps lead up to a circular platform in the middle of the room, which is decorated with unfamiliar symbols.  Long shadows extend from the throne which sits on the platform.  Sharp coloured light is let in through a stained glass dome that looms high above your head.  On the edge of the platform statues made of stone and silver stand amidst small lucious ferns.   } {stone} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {11429} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {11432} {0} {<278>} {Stairwell} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The steep, wooden stairwell creaks with each footstep as you climb it.  Heading towards the royal bedchamber, you notice the door at the top of the stairway.  It is elaborate and beautiful, made mainly from grey stone, it is framed with a line of different coloured gems.  Softly formed stone walls extend from the door to surround the stairwell.  Small plants hang from the ceiling in silver pots, swaying silently in the stillness.  A small opening in the western wall catches your attention.   } {stone} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
