R {11433} {0} {<278>} {Before the Royal Bedchamber} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Small painted portraits of the royal family hang outside the bedchamber.  You think you can see the king and queen with their daughter Isara as a small child.  Taking a closer look at the painting, you notice a small outline of white around the Princess's head, and then as if by magic it is gone.  You look around to see if anyone else could see it, but you are alone.  Another painting catches your attention.  Three majestic women with dark round eyes are standing in a stone building, staring out of the painting into your eyes.  Each clutches a strange symbol; one purple, one red and one white.  A shiver runs up your spine and you decide to move on, there is something very odd about those paintings.   } {stone} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
