R {11434} {0} {<278>} {Royal Bedchamber} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A feeling of awe overcomes you as you look at the lustrous furnishings in  this huge room. A huge mahogony bed is in the centre, covered with bedspreads of intricate patterns. Fine chains of gold and silver dangle from a  chandelier above, tinkling quietly as a breeze wafts through the window. Stone shelves line the right wall filled with old books and manuscripts.  On the left wall you see a huge tapestry, delicately woven to depict a forest  scene. Looking closer you notice that the tapestry hangs oddly, as though the wall behind it was not quite even. } {stone} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
