R {11598} {0} {<228>} {At the Foot of the Ice Mist Peaks} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grasslands begin to give way to the Ice Mist peaks; a large mountain range dominating the north east of Mesolar.  The ground is covered in a perpetual mist, and several large boulders dot the landscape.  There is a force in the air here, as if elemental forces are gathering; a power so basic yet strong that even the least of magical creatures can feel it.  Very few creatures wander into this field, because of the sense of raw elemental power.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
