R {11602} {0} {<238>} {Traveling through the Ice Mist Peaks} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The slopes of the mountains are covered with large boulders and ancient pines and spruce trees.  The swirling mist covers everything with a thin sheen of ice, causing the shadows to shimmer softly with colors.  North from here a small cove sparkles coldly, and the scent of salt is heavy in the air.  South of here a small valley relieves the craggy peaks.   } {mesolar} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
