R {11613} {0} {<228>} {The Horn of the Dragon} {<228>, `<088>} {  This is the smaller of the two islands which make up the Horn of the Dragon, so named because the original surveyors of the continent of Mesolar were in such awe of the dragons that they named many features of the land and waters after the mighty creatures.  This island seems to be made up of mostly rock.  Seaweed dots the wet shores of the island, and a few palm trees are scattered around, but otherwise it seems to be mostly black, volcanic rock.  Far in the distance, there is another island, one which seems to be smoking, perhaps it still has an active volcano?  The seas to the north seem a logical way to reach it, if one wanted to do such a thing.  } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
