R {11659} {0} {<238>} {Travelling Through the Ice Mist Peaks} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The Ice Mist Peaks are situated on the north east coast of Mesolar.  The ground is rugged, boulders and craggy peaks make for tough climbing.  Spruce and pine trees cover the slopes of the mountains and their interlacing branches block out most of the light.  There is a definite chill in the air, and icy mist swirls around the peaks.  While there are sounds of life all around, very few can catch even the faintest glimpse of anything living.  Moisture drips from the branches of the trees, and the rough ground is covered in a mixture of damp pine needles and slush.  A winding path lies to the east, and there seems to be a sense of peace coming from that direction. Perhaps it has something to do with the temple, just noticeable in the distance.   } {mesolar} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
