R {11662} {0} {<228>} {A Misty Valley in the Ice Mist Peaks} {<228>, `<088>} {  Climbing down from the heights of the Ice Mist Peaks, you find yourself in a bowl shaped valley.  The grass grows thick here, and there are a few shrubs dotting the area.  The boughs of the great trees extend out over the valley, covering all but the center with their shade, and keeping the valley nearly as cold as the mountains.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
