R {11666} {0} {<228>} {Rugged Mesolarian Grassland} {<228>, `<088>} {  Not far from shore, a fish jumps out of the water, as if trying to escape something.  With a cry of delight, a hovering sea bird makes a dive for it, but at the last moment a large shark, seconds ago just an underwater shadow, leaps out and swallows both of them.  Silence reigns over the waters as the shark's fin slowly disappears under the ocean's surface, but eventually the threat of being eaten is forgotten and life returns to normal.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
