R {11705} {0} {<278>} {Coastfollow Road} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This road follows the northern coast of Mesolar hence the name. From here you can hear the sounds of waves crashing against the shore to the north, and the sound of a tavern adds to the overall effect of being so close to the sea. Gulls and other seabirds wheel in the skies, calling out to each other in the cool air on the northern part of this continent. To the east you can see a  path heading into a dark forest, be wary as bandits seem to favour paths such as these. To the west Coastfollow Road continues. South from here the Blessed Aylorian Highway stretches off into the distance. } {mesolar} {} {road} {} {1.000} {}
