R {11710} {0} {<228>} {A Field of Grain} {<228>, `<088>} {  Wheat, barley and oats grow thickly in this section of the open plain.  One of many fields of grain on the Mesolarian grassland, this is a good place to find food and is probably a favorite place for the gatherers among the nomadic tribes which live on the wide expanse of grass.  Some of the stalks look as if they have been nibbled, a good sign of large herbivores living on the grassland.  The Mesolarian grassland stretches out in all directions from here.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
