R {11718} {0} {<228>} {At the Foot of the Ice Mist Peaks} {<228>, `<088>} {  The Mesolarian grassland becomes somewhat rocky here.  To the north the Ice Mist Peaks rise into the air like fingers of some great beast, reaching for the clouds, as if to rend them for sustenance.  The ground is strewn with boulders, and the great boughs of pine and spruce stretch out over the grasses, shading this part of the grassland.  This far north the air has become a bit colder, and the shade from the mountains and the mighty trees on their slopes does nothing to ward off the chill.  South from here Meso Hor Nee stretches from west to east, toward the mountain city of Kerofk.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
