R {11721} {0} {<238>} {A tough climb} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The slopes here are covered in large boulders and fallen trees.  While not completely impassable, this section of mountains provides many challenges for those wishing to continue without using the road to the south.  Thick mist swirls around the trunks of the trees still standing, and the sounds of clattering hooves and chitterings of small rodents come from every direction.  The chill air would seem still if it weren't for the swirling mists, which seem to freeze anything they touch.   } {mesolar} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
