R {11723} {0} {<238>} {Mountains Overlooking a Bay} {<238>/ \<088>} {  Tall, thick trunked trees march in ranks over the slopes of the Ice Mist Peaks.  A soaking, freezing mist settles around the trees, and the sounds of crashing waves come distantly from the east.  Just to the north, a small bay reaches right to the roots of the Ice Mist Peaks, though climbing down the mountains into the freezing waters of the bay would be dangerous.  All around the sounds of wildlife can be heard.  Though it is difficult to see anything through the deep shadows caused by the large trees and the thick, swirling mist, you do manage to catch a brief glance of a herd of mountain goats picking their way through the forest and foraging on any small plant life that manages to sprout in this harsh environment.   } {mesolar} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
