R {11724} {0} {<148>} {The Bay of Mists} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Looming to the west, the Ice Mist Peaks make an almost impenetrable barrier.  This small bay offers a little protection from the ocean, but howling winds come roaring down from the mountains regularly, chilling anyone who shelters in the bay to the bone.  The winds are not the only thing that come down from the mountains though, a thick mist enshrouds this bay almost every day making it impossible to see very far at all.   } {mesolar} {} {ocean} {} {1.000} {}
