R {11731} {0} {<148>} {Siirima Ocean} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  A vast expanse of water lies to the north, east and west.  There could be others out here, but it is hard to tell with all the rolling waves.  Flocks of seabirds dive and glide over the waves, and the occasional fish can be spotted out on the ocean, leaping into the air and splashing back into the cold waters.  This far north, the sea becomes much cooler, and there is a definite chill in the air; at least it is not uncomfortable-not yet.   } {mesolar} {} {ocean} {} {1.000} {}
