R {11734} {0} {<148>} {Aphasia} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The ocean is full of life; fish can be seen below the surface, darting around trying to find food or avoid bigger predators.  A dark, menacing shadow glides through the water-suddenly everything around you hushes and life stops, as if waiting for the shadow to make its move.  Slowly the shadow glides by, and life continues, exhaling after holding a collective breath.   } {mesolar} {} {ocean} {} {1.000} {}
