R {11783} {0} {<238>} {Climbing into the Ice Mist Peaks} {<238>/ \<088>} {  Great cliffs of rock rise up to meet the swirling mists which obscure most of the sky.  While this part of the mountains is not as heavily covered with trees, there are still a few, their trunks sparkling with ice crystals. The ground is hard and there is little to mark out a path through the rugged terrain.  To the west there does seem to be a pass, possibly leading into the mountain city of Kerofk, though it is difficult to say for sure.  It would be very easy to become lost in this forbidding range of jagged peaks.  East and south of here the mountains slope down to meet the flat plains of the continent.  To the west the mountains continue, and the trees close in in that direction, making thick shadows which dance when the air shifts the branches of the trees.   } {mesolar} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
