R {11826} {0} {<278>} {Meso Hor Nee} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  It is uncertain how this small dirt track gained its name.  Perhaps it means something in an old, lost language of the continent?  It is left up to those who travel its route to come up with their own explanations; most of these come from the dim smokey rooms of taverns where men have drunk perhaps more than is necessary and turn to baudy stories for entertainment.  No matter what one chooses to believe, this road does exist for a purpose.  It connects the Blessed Aylorian Highway to the distant mountain city of Kerofk.  Perhaps the reason it is made of hard, compact dirt has to do with the ease of maintaining it when the road reaches the mountain passes.  Deep ruts show where wagons have, over the centuries, carved out their space for travel along this track.   } {mesolar} {} {road} {} {1.000} {}
