R {11841} {0} {<238>} {Lower in the Ice Mist Peaks} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The rugged terrain is much lower here than in the rest of the mountains.  Far above, the high passes of the Ice Mist Peaks are nearly hidden by swirling mist.  The trees here are as thick as anywhere else in these craggy heights, but the air isn't quite so chill.  Meso Hor Nee lies to the north, its cleared path a welcome sight from the treacherous paths through the peaks.  To the west the mountains grow higher, and the trees in that direction seem to shimmer with ice crystals.  South of here the Mesolarian grassland stretches out like a vast sea of green, and to the east the Tothmeer trail winds away from the mountains.   } {mesolar} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
