R {11843} {0} {<228>} {At the Foot of the Ice Mist Peaks} {<228>, `<088>} {  The ground begins to rise toward the north, gradually becoming the mountain range known as the Ice Mist Peaks.  The air is cool here, but not as chill as it will become in the mountains.  The Tothmeer trail lies to the west, winding its way away from the mountains and into the more temperate sections of the continent.  A few evergreen trees grow here, their inviting beauty a pretense to what will await any who decide to travel through the mountains.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
