R {11851} {0} {<228>} {On the Banks of the Dragon River} {<228>, `<088>} {  The vegetation along the banks of Mesolar's most famous river consists mostly of cat tails, reeds and rushes.  Here and there, other unidentifiable greenery makes its presence known.  The smell of mud and fish permeates the air, and the gurgling of the river is a soothing, pleasant sound.  From here, the waters of the Dragon River look clean and clear, but the ground underfoot is damp; thick greenery covers the saturated earth.  To the north the Mesolarian grassland offers a feast for those who know where to look, and in the distance a herd of deer make their way over the open expanse.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
