R {12020} {0} {<228>} {Trampled Ground} {<228>, `<088>} {  The Mesolarian grassland is home to many living things.  Wild animals roam the open spaces, and several nomadic tribes hunt and gather out here.  This particular stretch of the plain seems to have been trampled recently hoof prints and torn grass cover the ground.  It does not appear that there was a struggle, so perhaps this was a gathering spot for some herd, or group of hunters.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
