R {12022} {0} {<238>} {The Tothmeer Trail} {<238>. .<088>} {  This small trail is an alternate route from the mountain city of Kerofk to the capital city of Aylor.  While not very wide, and made up of hard packed dirt, the trail is used quite often by adventurers, and by merchants who are too poor to pay the tolls on the main highways and roads.  The trail has one oddity, however, which travelers should be ware of when traveling; the trail ends on Kerofk's side in the graveyard.  This hints that long ago, perhaps the trail was used more as a funeral trek for people, in some long forgotten ritual of the continent.  At this point, the Tothmeer trail fords the Dragon River, though the waters seem to be too swift to allow for a straight crossing.   } {mesolar} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
