R {12027} {0} {<148>} {The Dragon River} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Full of life, the Dragon River provides sustenance to the surrounding lands; fresh water to both animals and people, as all forms of life need water to drink, and fish for predators and the people who use this river as a source for food.  A cluster of cattails dots the lush river banks nearby, while large fish swim lazily in the shallows.  To the southeast lies some sort of jungle, cutting off any view to the surrounding plains in that direction.   } {mesolar} {} {river} {} {1.000} {}
