R {12029} {0} {<148>} {The Dragon River} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Insects of all kinds skim the surface and buzz through the cattails on the banks of the Dragon River.  Both large and small animals dot the banks drinking from the cool and clear waters.  People have come to realize that it is best not to spoil these waters, as they provide essential resources for survival.  Southwest from here a large jungle looms in the distance, vibrant green trees breaking the monotony of the surrounding plains.   } {mesolar} {} {river} {} {1.000} {}
