R {12077} {0} {<228>} {Entering a Range of Low Hills} {<228>. ^<088>} {  The change in landscape is a welcome sight from the seemingly endless stretches of flat land that is the primary makeup of Mesolar.  Perhaps the nomads of the plains would feel differently, but surely even they would come into these low hills to hunt.  The soft green grass is shorter here than on the grassland, and there are tracks stamped into the soft vegetation.  Rabbits, foxes, and even a few wild goats can be seen in the distance, though none come very close to the sentient life that wanders out here.   } {mesolar} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
