R {12088} {0} {<228>} {On the Edge of a Rainforest} {<228>* *<088>} {  Large, green ferns mix with the reeds and cattails which grow along the river bank.  A chorus of sounds fills the air; the high pitched whirr of mosquitoes, the croaking of frogs, and the cries of the many birds which call the rainforest home, all mix with the gentle sounds of the slowly moving river.  The ground is very muddy, and would be hard to traverse, if not for the thick root systems of the vegetation that makes up the rainforest.   } {mesolar} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
