R {12136} {0} {<228>} {A Hill Covered with Black Rock} {<228>. ^<088>} {  Shiny black rock dots the land here.  The few trees which dot the hillside are stunted and spindly-looking.  The grass is torn and splotches of bear earth show in many places.  To the west the shiny rock seems to take over more of the hills.  There is definitely much less vegetation in that direction, although there is a herd of mountain goats who seem to be frolicking among the black slopes.   } {mesolar} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
