R {12139} {0} {<228>} {Mesolarian Grassland} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grassland stretches out, like a vast plain of green.  Many wild animals call the grasslands home, and several nomadic peoples live on this expanse of flat plain.  From here, however, the flatness is interrupted.  A range of low hills rises higher than any point nearby.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
