R {12148} {0} {<228>} {Walking through thick vegetation} {<228>* *<088>} {  The air is heavy with moisture, making it seem thick and hot.  Several large ferns grow thickly here, and you find that it is necessary to push your way through the vegetation.  The ground sucks at boots and bare feet both, but luckily the roots of the willows and ferns keep this marshy ground from becoming quicksand.  High overhead the sounds of bird calls echo across the grasslands which surround this small rainforest.   } {mesolar} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
