R {12149} {0} {<228>} {A field dotted with trees} {<228>, `<088>} {  This field seems to be a dividing point between two types of land.  Tall palm trees have mixed with a few willows and ferns here, and the ground is as much wet sand as it is mud.  Short crabgrass grows where the trees allow, and a few low bushes spring up to the north.  The sounds of the ocean to the east mix oddly with the shrill cries of parrots and other birds to the west. } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
