R {12151} {0} {<148>} {Ninyth Bay} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Crystal clear waters wash up against a shore of pure white, thick grained sand.  Tiny fish swim in the shallows of this pristine bay.  Sea birds can be seen high above waiting for the opportunity to catch something to eat.  Small jellyfish float past in the water without any real direction except the ebb and flow of the tides.  To the south a squeaky, white beach marks the southern end of the bay and in the distance to the west a small patch of jungle rises out of the plains.   } {mesolar} {} {ocean} {} {1.000} {}
