R {12152} {0} {<148>} {Ninyth Bay} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Further out in the Ninyth Bay the water changes from a crystal clear color to a sky blue.  Small patches of kelp dot the sea bed and fish dart between the slowly stirring seaweed.  The occasional rock can be barely made out through the clear, but deeper waters.  To the south, a large beach meets the pure waters, and although the waters are shallow close to the sand it drops off suddenly into deeper waters only feet from shore which makes it dangerous for an unwary swimmer.   } {mesolar} {} {ocean} {} {1.000} {}
