R {12206} {0} {<228>} {Damp Field near a Rainforest} {<228>, `<088>} {  This area of the grasslands is quite muddy.  It appears that one time this was part of the rainforest to the east; rotting stumps dot the area, mud running off of them, taking bits of rotted wood with it.  There is still a good amount of grass here, though it grows much taller, and a few reed-like plants grow higher than the height of a man.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
