R {12207} {0} {<228>} {In a Damp Rainforest} {<228>* *<088>} {  Moisture drips from the upper branches of the willow trees which grow in this humid forest.  The green ferns glisten with water, and the ground is very muddy underfoot.  Rocks poke out of the mud in places, their surfaces covered in moss and fungi.  The roots of the larger plantlife are spread out over the forest floor, and it would be easy to trip over them.  Small animals make their homes in the earth near the base of the trees, and from the noise, birds make their homes high up in nests.   } {mesolar} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
