R {12210} {0} {<138>} {Arcian Beach} {<138>, `<088>} {  Joining the two bays, Imperial Bay and Ninyth Bay, the white, pristine sand of Arcian Beach squeaks under the feet of almost anyone who crosses it. Little puffs of sand and bits of sea weed are stirred by a vagrant breeze.  Over the centuries shells of all sizes have washed up on the shores, ranging in size, shape and color.  Some more smooth than could be imagined, while others have tiny little ridges over them, and yet more that are covered in spikes.  High over head, sea birds cry and dive towards the waters looking for food.   } {mesolar} {} {beach} {} {1.000} {}
