R {12240} {0} {<148>} {A Quiet Inlet on Big Tree Lake} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  This inlet is small and fairly calm, the water clear enough in some spots to see the sandy floor of the lake.  The smell of growing things is stronger here than further out on the lake, where the wind picks it up and carries it away.  The inlet joins the rest of the lake to the west, and to the north, east, and south, water meets shore with a soothing coat of white foam.   } {mesolar} {} {river} {} {1.000} {}
