R {12311} {0} {<228>} {A Shady Spot on the Banks of the Dragon River} {<228>( *<088>} {  The tall, slender trees provide a bit of shade here, their branches reaching out over the clear waters of the Dragon River.  Moss grows heavily on the trunks of the trees and on the few rocks.  Here and there mushrooms and small, tender shoots grow up through the rich soil which is washed onto the bank during the rainy season.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
