R {12319} {0} {<148>} {The Dragon River} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Cutting a long, winding path through the lands, the Dragon River continues its northeasterly flow towards the eventual meeting with the sea.  Who knows how many centuries have past and how long it took to create such a vast river.  The occasional fish darts beneath the cool and clean surface of the water, and now and then a fish can be seen jumping out of the water to catch an unsuspecting insect.   } {mesolar} {} {river} {} {1.000} {}
