R {12330} {0} {<228>} {Close to Arcian Beach} {<228>, `<088>} {  Tuffs of dry, brown grass, sand and gravel are slowly taking over the lush grassland.  Small sand dunes cover parts of the plains the occasional small shrub or plan is engulfed in sand with only the tops of it uncovered.  How could anything survive like that?  Surely it does as it looks quite unharmed from being covered in sand well at least the parts of the tree you see look healthy.  Little creatures barely seen dart between clumps of dried grass and the dunes looking for food and cover from the driving wind.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
