R {12331} {0} {<138>} {Arcian Beach} {<138>, `<088>} {  Massive sand dunes shift and form all over the Arcian beach, depending on the winds.  Palm trees jut out of both small and large dunes and still others are completely free of sand.  In the distance waves crash and roar where sand meets ocean, a light, almost imperceptible rattle can be heard as a breeze stirs the large grains of sand and various pieces of seaweed from the ocean. } {mesolar} {} {beach} {} {1.000} {}
