R {12365} {0} {<278>} {The Blessed Aylorian Highway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Constructed of large, rectangular stones, this wide highway stretches far to the north and south.  Many wagon trains and caravans travel along the Blessed Aylorian Highway, carrying trade to the many settlements which have grown up along its route over the years.  The highway also serves as the main route for pilgrims, on their way to the great city of Aylor, to worship in the magnificent temple there.   } {mesolar} {} {road} {} {1.000} {}
