R {12366} {0} {<228>} {Mesolarian Grassland} {<228>, `<088>} {  Open and flat, the fields of Mesolar cover a good portion of the continent.  An abundance of life lives on the open grassland; mice rabbits badgers and foxes are just some of the animals one can expect to see out here.  The grasslands offer much in the way of wild grains and edible vegetation to both the animals and people who choose to live out here, and many adventurers will not find it hard to forage for food.  To the north a stretch of cobblestones can be seen, though in several spots, grass seems to be reclaiming the land.  The Blessed Aylorian Highway lies to the west, and many pilgrims and merchant trains can be seen traveling along its route to and from the great city of Aylor.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
