R {12373} {0} {<228>} {A cluster of tall trees} {<228>( *<088>} {  The famous Dragon River flows past to the west, its clear waters alive with fish, frogs and plantlife.  Above the surface of the water, clouds of gnats and mosquitoes seem to dance in the slight breezes.  The serenity of this peaceful forest encompasses you; the occasional singing or chirp of birds breaks the silence.  Decades of dead and rotting leaves carpet the forest floor making all sounds muted.  North of here there seems to be a path.  It seems unnaturally quiet in that direction, and a faint glint of metal is just visible on one of the trees in that direction.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
