R {12426} {0} {<228>} {Mesolarian Grassland} {<228>, `<088>} {  Open and flat, the fields of Mesolar cover a great portion of the continent.  An abundance of life lives on the open grasslands: mice, rabbits, badgers and foxes are just some of the wild animals one can expect to see out here.  The grasslands offer much in the way of wild grains and edible vegetation to the animals and people who choose to live outside the cities and villages, and those who live an adventurer's life will find it easy to forage.  To the south the sounds of axes can be heard from the small stretch of woodland.  The Blessed Aylorian Highway lies to the west, and many pilgrims and merchant trains can be seen traveling along its route to and from the great city of Aylor.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
