R {12452} {0} {<268>} {Imperial Bay} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  Shallow and quite warm waters gently roll upon the shore.  Imperial Bay stretches to the south and its namesake, the Imperial City of Reme looms in the distance.  Small fish dart and dive in the warm waters, looking for food and somewhere to hide from the bigger fish lurking in the deeper waters.  Tiny and hopefully harmless jelly fish float by while, seaweed rolls past in little bits and chunks drifting on the subtle changes to current.   } {mesolar} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
