R {12453} {0} {<148>} {Imperial Bay} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Unlike other bays around the coast the waters here are much deeper even though it is close to land.  Large boats make use of this and use the waters to easily gain access to both the sea and the port of Reme.  Small fishing vessels dart between the wakes of the larger boats, seeking fish to feed their families.  A flock of sea birds fly over heard diving for left over fish tossed overboard by the fisherman.   } {mesolar} {} {ocean} {} {1.000} {}
