R {12487} {0} {<228>} {Lush grassland near a farm} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grass here is thick and soft. Here and there, small clusters of flowers  nod gently in the occasional breezes, and insects work industriously,  pollinating the plantlife. South of here is a large farm, but there does not  appear to be anyone working in the fields. The grass stretches out to the  north, while to the east the famous Dragon River meanders its way through the continent of Mesolar. To the west a small stretch of woodland offers shade  and lumber for the citizens of Aylor. } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
