R {12500} {0} {<228>} {A Cluster of Tall Trees} {<228>( *<088>} {  The serenity of this peaceful forest encompasses you; the occasional singing or chirp of birds breaks the silence.  Decades of dead and rotting leaves carpet the forest floor making all sounds muted.  This small trail is an alternate route from the mountain city of Kerofk to the capital city of Aylor.  While not very wide, and made up of hard packed dirt, the trail is used quite often by adventurers, and by merchants who are too poor to pay the tolls on the main highways and roads.  The trail has one oddity, however, which travelers should be ware of when traveling; the trail ends on Kerofk's side in the graveyard.  This hints that long ago, perhaps the trail was used more as a funeral trek for people, in some long forgotten ritual of the continent.  Several trees have grown up right in the middle of the trail here.  The ground is broken and cluttered with roots and clods of earth.  It would be very confusing if the trail did not continue north and south from this point.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
