R {12502} {0} {<228>} {Fields near the Flames of Godhood} {<228>, `<088>} {  The Mesolarian grassland stretches out to the north, west and south, but to the east the Flames of Godhood rise up; monoliths which seem to climb into the very heavens.  Here, the grasses are brown and in places, the earth is bare, except for the fine coating of ash over black rock.  The western peak glows with a dull red, and a pall of smoke hangs over the peaks themselves.  The air is hot and an occasional tremor rumbles through the ground.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
