R {12551} {0} {<228>} {A Comfortable Field} {<228>, `<088>} {  This field would be an ideal spot for a picnic.  To the north, east and west, the banks of the Dragon River provide ideal spots for fishing.  This spot is dry and open.  Perhaps it is still attractive because it is not quite so close to the animal park to the south east.  Directly south of here is a trampled and littered field.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
