R {12571} {0} {<228>} {Rugged Mesolarian Grassland} {<228>, `<088>} {  Not far from shore fish jump out of the water, almost like they are trying to escape something.  The almost constantly hovering sea birds cry in delight and make a dive for the leaping fish.  Just at the last moment, a large shark leaps from the water and swallows both fish and bird whole.  Silence reigns over the waters for a minute or two, as the shark's fin disappears below the surface.  Quietly, at first, birds cry and circle above the waves, not wanting to go near the surface.  But even the threat of being eaten is forgotten and life returns to normal.  To the south a twisted and cracked ancient road leads towards the Imperial City of Reme.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
