R {12604} {0} {<228>} {In the Fields Surrounding Aylor} {<228>, `<088>} {  Just outside the well-known city of Aylor are farms that sell their produce to their urban cousins.  To your side, a young milkmaid struggles with a heavy pail of milk.  A strapping farmer pauses in his unloading of the cart and moves to help her.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
