R {12605} {0} {<278>} {The Blessed Aylorian Highway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Constructed of large, rectangular paving stones, this wide highway stretches far to the north.  Many wagon trains and caravans travel the Blessed Aylorian Highway, carrying trade goods to the many settlements which have grown up along its route over the years.  Continuing south will take you into the magnificent city of Aylor, its many shops and homes, splendid as they are, seeming to fade into the background when viewed along with the large temple.  The highway narrows into a road just inside the city proper, and many people seem to be going to and from the temple, which is the main destination of the road.   } {mesolar} {} {road} {} {1.000} {}
