R {12606} {0} {<228>} {Fields near Aylor} {<228>, `<088>} {  The fields just outside Aylor are dotted with small farming villages.  The people living outside the city provide the necessary food and materials, other than metal, to keep the city's population fed and able to practice their crafts.  To the west The Blessed Aylorian Highway stretches out from the northern edge of Aylor, while to the south, the Eastern High Road connects with the east Main Street of the city.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
