R {12607} {0} {<238>} {Plains near a Farm} {<238>, `<088>} {  The land here is mostly flat. Small bushes and clumps of wild flowers dot the landscape. This is a favorite hunting ground for the nobility of Aylor, and  when they become tired of their sport, there is farmland to the north,  offering shade and perhaps a piece of fruit. To the south the Eastern High  Road leads back to Aylor, or farther into the wilderness. } {mesolar} {} {plain} {} {1.000} {}
