R {12610} {0} {<238>} {Plains near the Dragon River} {<238>, `<088>} {  The rolling plains show signs of a recent encampment.  Small scorched areas in the waving grasses show where fires burned to cook food or keep away the creatures of the night, which roam the grasslands.  The Eastern High Road lies to the south of here, stretching from east to west.  Directly to the west, the Dragon River eddies and swirls as it comes to the stone bridge, which is part of the roadway.  To the north the river bank continues, and farther to the east there seems to be some sort of park.   } {mesolar} {} {plain} {} {1.000} {}
