R {12611} {0} {<228>} {A Wide Stretch of Crushed Grass} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grass here is completely crushed.  It seems as if this is one of the places where people gather to wait for the park to the east to open.  There are signs of litter here and there among the devastated blades of vegetation; here a dropped handkerchief flutters in the breeze; some ways away, a child's toy lies broken and forgotten in a mud puddle, and several bits of discarded food and wrapping are scattered over the area.  North from here the Mesolarian grassland seems to reclaim itself from humanity.  A lush field of grass and flowers lies between the banks of the pristine Dragon River.  South from here the Eastern High Road stretches off into the distance, carrying merchants to and from the great city of Aylor, which lies far to the west.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
