R {12613} {0} {<228>} {Fields Near the Animal Park} {<228>, `<088>} {  Children play in the short grass which stretches off toward the dragon river.  South of here, the eastern High Road stretches to the east and west, and directly west of here, is the entrance to some kind of park filled with animals.  The people gathering here seem to be talking and gesturing with excitement, and the shouts of the frolicking children echo back from the walls of the park.  To the east a stand of trees offers some shade during the afternoon hours.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
