R {12614} {0} {<228>} {Small, Dark Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Ancient trees dominate this forest, but occasionally there is a small shoot trying to reach towards the muted sunlight.  Moss covers the occasional rock that peeks through the rotting leaves on the forest floor, and some mushrooms or maybe toadstools grow on the sides of some of the trees.  If it weren't for the nearly continuous stream of people to the west, this would make an ideal spot for bandits, wishing to waylay lone merchants on the road. } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
