R {12743} {0} {<228>} {Gently Rolling Plains} {<228>, `<088>} {  The ground is made up of small rises and dips.  It looks more like some great hand has wrinkled the land.  While not exactly covered with hills, the ground definitely is uneven, and with the thick, tall grass, it would be an easy thing for the unweary traveller to injure themselves in one of the many dips and small holes which dot the landscape.  Just to the east, a small village seems to have sprouted near a larger town.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
