R {12745} {0} {<228>} {South of a small town} {<228>( *<088>} {  The small town is now to the north and seems to be a logging community.  A small village to the west houses more people who appear to be a part of the community within the town.  The sounds of saws and axes are very distinct, and you can make out many animals among the trees which surround the small town.  There is a large forest to the south and east, as well, but nobody seems to be raising an axe anywhere near that forest, perhaps it has something to do with the shimmer which seems to come from the trees themselves.  Farther to the south, legends say, is a battlefield from the great war which nearly destroyed Mesolar.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
