R {12746} {0} {<228>} {A small field} {<228>, `<088>} {  This field is shaded by the many silvery trees which make up the Silverwind Forest.  There are no humans in this part of the area, and the lush, soft grass seems virtually untouched.  It has grown to an incredible height, as if nature has been allowed to have her way here.  Small shrubs peek out among the blades of tall grass, and brightly colored berries are on display among the leaves of the bushes.  This seems a very peaceful place, nearly surrounded by the splendor of the softly shimmering forest.  Even the breezes which gently blow through the grasses and among the branches high over head seem to whisper of peace and tranquility.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
