R {12808} {0} {<228>} {An odd field} {<228>, `<088>} {  This field seems to have once been populated by large trees.  Tracks, like those a tree might make if its roots could be pulled loose to allow it to walk are everywhere here.  To the north and west, the Silverwind Forest stretches out, its soft, silver sheen seeming to cloak the area in a sense of peace.  In this field, however there is no tree to be found, not even a stump.  Farther east, a line of trees mixed with low, thorny bushes border a barely visible trail.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
