R {12851} {0} {<228>} {A healthy looking stretch of grassland} {<228>, `<088>} {  Thanks to the nearby waters of the Dragon River, the grass here is vibrant and soft.  It seems odd that this lush greenery should sit so close to the parched ground to the east, but perhaps the slight slope in the ground accounts for the lack of moisture reaching the plains.  To the west, the banks of the famous river offer even more vegetation, as well as a place to sit and try one's luck at fishing.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
