R {12859} {0} {<228>} {The Beastwar fields} {<228>, `<088>} {  During the great war, fought centuries ago, nearly every race on Andolor became involved.  Elven clerics, mages and rangers fought on foot and mounted on griffons, who themselves, were armed with bows and magics.  The humans from Solace and New Ofcol rode to battle on Centaur archers, alongside the holy paladins.  Dwarven Berserkers and Giant irregulars held the center line for the forces of light, while Wolfen and Sprite skirmishers scouted out the enemy forces.  They met the forces of darkness on these fields, and the horde which met the forces of light were horrible to behold. Troll, Minotaur and Giant berserkers held the dark center, while Dark Elf sorcerers and Dark Dwarf night raiders caused havoc behind the lines of the light forces.  Lizardmen shaman and Ratling foragers scouted ahead of the dark forces, and in many places, managed to outflank the forces of light.  Shadow clerics of the dark and Vampire necromancers brought destruction on the light army, turning many corpses to their cause, while the human brigands and antipaladins rounded out the forces.  A select few Wolfen, it is said, fought for the dark, as well, acting as scouts, and savaging the scouts of the light.  These fields show the ferocity of the fighting.  While no actual corpses remain, there are many pieces of bone and broken armor and weapons scattered over the ground, though most is half buried under new earth.  Only the treasure seekers who have come to the fields in recent years have managed to uncover at least part of the past, and from the look of this battleground, the past was grim indeed.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
