R {12860} {0} {<228>} {The Beastwar fields} {<228>, `<088>} {  It is almost possible to hear the sounds of the long ago battle fought on these plains.  The signs of devastation have not faded much with the passage of time; small bits of rusted armor and broken weapons, half buried in the earth, still glint dully in the light.  The armies of light and dark met on this plain and fought one of the largest battles of the great war.  Small mounds give evidence to the multitude of graves which are occupied with the fallen warriors on both sides, and as if in mockery of the savage contest so long ago, the grass which now grows here is exceptionally green and healthy looking.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
