R {12863} {0} {<228>} {Silverwind Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The tall oaks of the forest shroud this forest in shadows.  Long ago, before the great war which ravaged most of Mesolar, this was part of the Elven homelands.  Legends say that while Wolfen fought on both sides of the conflict, the majority fought alongside the Elves, and in fact, were the primary protectors of these woodlands.  The stands where Elven archers used to sit as sentries are still set high up in the branches of the ancient trees.  The ground shows little signs of the great war, possibly because the armies of darkness were unable to put together a decent attack force to penetrate these lands, thanks to the tactics of the Wolfen and Elven forces. } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
