R {12864} {0} {<228>} {Silverwind Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Small animals dart behind trees and hop over branches, collecting food, leaves, and even parts of the trees themselves.  Life, although a little silent flourishes here.  Small little mushrooms, lichen and moss cover parts of the vast forest floor.  A ring of mushrooms circle a large ancient tree while a patch of silvery green moss covers part of a decomposing tree.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
