R {12865} {0} {<228>} {Devastated land} {<228>, `<088>} {  Though the armies of darkness were unable to mount a large attack on the Elven homelands during the great war, they were able to cause some destruction to these lands.  The local people speak of dark magic users working in union with clerics to enter the lands, and just before the homelands of the Elves, a magical battle was fought.  The land here is shattered.  The earth is blackened, and no living thing grows here.  NOt even the greatest of the Elven rangers, druids and clerics has ever been able to rejuvenate the land, and even the stench of smoke and decay still lingers here.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
