R {12917} {0} {<228>} {The Beastwar fields} {<228>, `<088>} {  For those who think war lasts only as long as the generation who fights it, these fields give direct and stark evidence to the opposite.  The ground here is torn and in many places scorched from the battle fought long ago.  The armies of dark and light met in many places across Mesolar, but the local peoples still speak of the ferocity of the Trollish and Minotaur armies which fought to gain entrance to the Elven lands to the east.  In the torn earth, there are still bits of broken metal, and what look to be bits of bone showing.  No matter how hard the people of the continent try, they can never forget the war with evidence such as this as a reminder.  There are some among the sages of the land who say that the war still rages, and small skirmishes are still fought over the continent.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
