R {12922} {0} {<228>} {Zhurk's last stand} {<228>, `<088>} {  This portion of the battlefield is where the awesome and terrible Zhurkishkaliviigharg made his last stand.  Evidence of how fierce the fighting was is still noticeable.  The dull glint of rusted metal pokes through the thick layer of grass which has grown to cover the carnage which took place here.  What looks to be a bleached rock, upon closer inspection, turns out to be the thick skull of a troll, and even with the greenery, there is still evidence of the magics used here; the earth still shows signs of scorched ground, and a few withered tree stumps.  Among the trolls of Mesolar, names are rarely given, so the importance of this figure is evident.  (Either that or it's just difficult to translate Troll into English).   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
