R {12923} {0} {<228>} {Silverwind Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Underneath the tall eaves of the forest, there seems to be hardly any light coming from above.  The boughs of these ancient trees reach towards the sky in a crisscross pattern.  Patches of sunlight filter through the silvery canopy in places making it possible to see, but there are only brief patches of blue breaking the lush silvery-green of the leaves.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
