R {12926} {0} {<228>} {Silverwind Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Ancient trees with their bark an unusual silver sheen to it, dominate this forest, but occasionally there is a small shoot trying to reach towards the muted sunlight.  Moss covers the occasional rock that peeks through the rotting leaves on the forest floor, and some mushrooms or maybe toadstools grow on the sides of some of the trees.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
