R {12927} {0} {<228>} {Border of the Elven woods} {<228>( *<088>} {  While most of this forest is Elven homeland, the Elves have retreated farther into their forest homes after the great war, fought centuries ago.  The surrounding forest is still tended by the Elven druids and clerics, and patrolled by their skilled rangers, but more and more, other races seem to be allowed to pass through unharmed, though perhaps this has something to do with the Diva who now also patrol the ancient woodland.  At this point, however, it becomes evident that the Elven homeland of today is still jealously guarded.  Only the keenest of eyes can just make out the slender beings dressed in forest greens and browns, even with hints of silver to compliment their ancient forest.  The Elven sentries sit high in the trees, long bows drawn, silver pointed arrows aimed.  The sound of finches and larks fill the air, and several silver mailed Elven warriors seem to appear from nowhere with drawn swords, their suspicious eyes watching your every move.  In stern silence, they stand, guarding the path into their homeland to the north.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
