R {12970} {0} {<228>} {Fields near the Dragon River} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grass grows tall here, and closer to the river itself reeds and cat tails rustle gently as the waters rush past.  The sounds of frogs and buzzing insects seem to come from everywhere, and the smells of mud and fish are strong on the air.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
