R {12975} {0} {<238>} {West of a black-watered river} {<238>, `<088>} {  The ground here seems almost cocvered in a shadow.  It is a shadow of the spirit, rather than anything physical, however.  Perhaps the river to the east has something to do with it?  The people of Andolor often attach significance to the names of places, and to the things which seem to happen to those who venture too far into the odd lands across the world.   } {mesolar} {} {plain} {} {1.000} {}
