R {12977} {0} {<228>} {East of a foreboding river} {<228>, `<088>} {  The river to the east has been a source of interest, and hopelessness alike for many Mesolarians.  People from all over Andolor have been seen coming to the river to try their luck at fishing, or at exploring, and some come back with a sense of utter loss.  The ground here is stony and small water plants struggle to grow through the unyielding earth.  At least the rocks look like good skipping stones, though.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
