R {12979} {0} {<228>} {The Beastwar fields} {<228>, `<088>} {  The great war, fought centuries ago on the continent of Mesolar, has left its marks on the land.  Here, the ground has slowly returned to flat grassland, but low mounds show evidence of graves of the fallen, and the occasional scorch mark is still visible; a wound in the land caused by the terrible magics loosed from either side.  It is said that treasure hunters occasionally dig in this battlefield, turning up rusted armor and weapons, but occasionally a fine piece of Dwarven or Elven work which has not decayed over the centuries.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
