R {12980} {0} {<228>} {The blasted area of the Beastwar Fields} {<228>, `<088>} {  The ground here is completely shattered.  Even to this day, no living thing will grow here.  There seems to be a permanent stain of ash and blasted rock over this part of the field, and the unevenness of the ground is not from the digging of treasure hunters, but of broken and shattered land.  It seems that this place, at least seems to be one the treasure hunters avoid.  There is a feel in the air of magics still dissipating, and unless there are things buried in the devastation, there seems to be nothing left of the forces who fought here.  One very large, prominent section of wall stands proudly amongst all the destruction and chaos surrounding it, with an ancient story still legible upon its face. } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
