R {12983} {0} {<228>} {Fringe of the dreaded Murkmire} {<228>( *<088>} {  This forest is dark, and seems almost to encroach on the Silverwind Forest.  While not exactly a part of the Murkmire Forest, it bares much resemblance to the forest, and very few travel through this stretch of woodland.  Ravens and crows peer at you from their perches high in the elms, their black eyes seeming to glint with an evil light.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
