R {12987} {0} {<228>} {Silverwind Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Throughout the centuries the trees have given shelter to the elves that deep within its forest.  From what can be seen, any signs of life besides the great majestic trees remain hidden.  Perhaps the elves made a pact to protect the forest from any sort of invader and in return the trees would offer protection to them.  It is said that trees walked and took vengeance on the last lot of intruders into their forest who dared to attack a tree.  If it was truly so, both the elves and the trees are not or will not talk about it.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
