R {13032} {0} {<228>} {A small camp ground} {<228>, `<088>} {  This appears to be a camp ground for the many nomadic tribes which wander the open plains of Mesolar.  A small pit for a fire is situated in the center of bear earth, and a few pieces of animal hide, probably from a destroyed tent, flutter around the area.  The ground shows tracks of many horses and humans, and the ashes in the pit are fairly fresh.  It is probably a good thing you didn't stumble on the nomads while they were here. They can be unpredictable.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
