R {13044} {0} {<228>} {A small patch of dead field} {<228>, `<088>} {  Despite the best efforts of the Elves, they cannot always border friendly or pure peoples.  Here, the Silverwind Forest meets the Forest Murkmire, home to a coven of dark witches.  In the past, the witches used to come out of their forest to practice their rites.  This field was their chosen meeting place.  The grass lies dead, and wilted and broken flowers are strewn over the field like discarded refuse.  Many times, since the great war which has sealed the Murkmire border, the elves have tried to bring life back to this small field, but to no avail.  The trees surrounding this area almost seem to weep with sadness, though their silver sheen seems to also offer comfort to the dead plantlife.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
