R {13049} {0} {<238>} {On a Dull Forest Trail} {<238>. .<088>} {  Long ago this trail was cut out of the forest.  The marks of axes and mattocks still show in the trees and on the ground.  High over head, the thick branches of trees block out most of the light, and the chirping and shrill calls of birds seem to surround you.  The occasional thick root from one of the larger trees snakes its way across the trail, and here and there, low, thorny bushes have crept partially onto the trail, snagging loose clothing or the skin of an unweary traveller who doesn't stick to the center of the trail.  This track is not wide enough for a wagon, but small carts, and horses in a single line could pass safely along its winding route.   } {mesolar} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
