R {13052} {0} {<228>} {Rugged Mesolarian Grassland} {<228>, `<088>} {  Dotting the coastline something different has appeared, stunted trees are not the only type of tree growing here, palm trees line the coast.  Some of the trees have been covered by sand, while others grow in clusters, almost like a mini forest.  The tops of the trees look like they are used for nests of the local sea birds.  Even though it is warmer here, it does not seem that much more hospitable.  Small clumps of dried grass and gravel strewn ground still make it more than a little impossible to grow anything worthwhile.  To the south, woods as dark as night loom, a silent reminder of the last bastion of the Minotaurs, the Keep of Mahn-Tor.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
