R {13089} {0} {<148>} {The Dragon River} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Known as the largest river in the lands, the Dragon River is also the widest.  Making its way through the continent of Mesolar in a northeasterly direction, the river, for the most part, looks smooth and far from turbulent.  Large rocks, perhaps sharp and jagged at first, have been worn smooth by the constant flow of the river over the years.  To the south the mighty Dragon River merges with the Greyhare Stream.   } {mesolar} {} {river} {} {1.000} {}
