R {13217} {0} {<228>} {An odd field} {<228>, `<088>} {  This field is shaded by the forest to the south.  Many mushrooms grow here, and they seem to favor growing in rings.  The air seems filled with an almost inaudible tinkling sound, like that of perhaps very small instruments, or tiny voices raised in song.  The soft grass seems inviting, and the soft chirp of crickets is very soothing.  Perhaps this is a good time for a nap?  Then again, if legends are correct, sleeping here would just mean you would wake up without your gold.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
