R {13219} {0} {<228>} {The Faerie Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Tall, thick trunks reach toward the sky.  The brown bark of the trees is fissured and rough with age.  High above, the patchwork of limbs and leaves lets through very little sunlight, and the shadows amidst the trunks are deep and quiet, shimmering mist engulfs almost all that could be possibly seen.  Patches of moss and various types of fungi thrive in the dim light, and the occasional chirp of a cricket breaks the peacefulness of the forest. To the north and east the passing of the Greyhare Stream breaks the almost engulfing silence.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
