R {13228} {0} {<228>} {Silverwind Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Silverwind Forest was named so by the unusual silver sheen that any tree that grows in the forest has.  Tall majestic trees look almost unearthly, their bark glints silver in any light that filters through the canopy high above.  Even the leaves on the trees have a light silver sheen mixed in with the dark green of their leaves.  Interestingly, even the decomposing leaves rotting on the forest floor have a small silver remaining on them.  Directly to the south the Greenwart Swamp abruptly takes over from the serene beauty of the forest.  Perhaps the mire of the swamp is what stopped the dark armies from penetrating the forest at least from the southern edge of the forest.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
