R {13288} {0} {<228>} {Greenwart Swamp} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The soft, silvery sheen of Silverwind Forest is muted in this swamp.  The trees here are almost defiantly dark in color.  Rather than green or brown, they are nearly black.  Thick streamers of moss hang from the trees, and thick roots snake across the muddy swamp bottom.  Several small pools of water dot the muddy ground and thick green vines look almost like snakes at first glance.  The ominous Greenwart plant seems to flourish in this wet and hot environment, its green, spiney berries seeming to glow with an inner light under the shade of the large trees.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
