R {13289} {0} {<228>} {Greenwart Swamp} {<228>; ;<088>} {  Dark and murky, this swamp seems forboding even under the best of skies.  Thick, tangled roots cross the muddy floor of the swamp, and tall, nearly black trees dot the quagmire.  Thick streamers of moss hang fromt he branches of the large trees, and long, green vines snake their way around and through the undergrowth, which includes the deadly Greenwart plant.  The greenwart was cultivated by the Trolls long ago as a spice for some of their more exotic dishes, and during the great war, the Trolls figured out that it held properties which made it poisonous to many other races, and from that time on, Trolls used Greenwart on their weapons, especially the Trollish assassins.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
