R {13290} {0} {<238>} {On a Dull Forest Trail} {<238>. .<088>} {  The trail becomes somewhat swampy here, and the trees seem to have thinned out a bit.  The low, scrubby bushes, on the other hand, have increased, not only in number, but in type.  Now a low plant with green, spined berries also grows in the vegetation lining the trail.  The plant is know as the Greenwart, and is the namesake of the swamp.  It was cultivated by the Trolls and is used as much for a spice in their foods, as for a poison on the weapons of the Trollish assassins.   } {mesolar} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
