R {13298} {0} {<228>} {Mesolarian Heartland} {<228>, `<088>} {  It's somewhat odd to call fields near the shore "The Heartlands".  However, so much food is produced out of these fields that they truly do support much of the Mesolarian continent, and produce from these fields is shipped across the entire world.  The fields stretch all around you, waving golden grain in the breeze.  The ground underfoot is dark and rich with loam.  The air is filled with the scent of growing things.  The entrance to a huge, underground city lies in the mountains to the southeast, and a large whirlwind blows to the north.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
