R {13337} {0} {<228>} {An unusual fortress, crackling with magic} {<228>( *<088>} {  Underneath the tall eaves of the forest, there seems to be hardly any light coming from above.  The boughs of these ancient trees reach towards the sky in a crisscross pattern.  Patches of sunlight filter through the canopy in places making it possible to see, but there are only brief patches of blue breaking the lush green of the leaves.  To the south, barely visible through the trees a wide, hard packed dirt road runs through the grasslands, its general direction seeming to be east to west, though it seems to wander a bit.  Just to the north and east a large fortress can be seen, the air here is thick with magic.  Any magic user passing through this forest would look towards the Snuckles Forest and wonder what holds such power.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
