R {13396} {0} {<238>} {On a dull forest trail} {<238>. .<088>} {  For some reason, the builders of Dragon Road just stopped at this point.  Perhaps this trail used to be a part of the road, and has fallen into disrepair?  The trail is much more narrow than the road, and though there are small bits of stone on the trail, nothing that seems to be paving stones can be seen here.  The forest to the south offers shade to the travellers on this trail, and it becomes noticeably darker to the east.  North of here a small field looks a bit out of place, when seen through the thin line of trees which mark the northern boundary of the trail.   } {mesolar} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
