R {13397} {0} {<238>} {On a dull forest trail} {<238>. .<088>} {  The trees close in on both sides of the trail, and very patchy sunlight streams in from above.  The branches of the two distinctly different forests mingle above you on the trail, and the sounds of squirrels and birds seem loud.  The trail is carpeted with old leaves and pine needles, and the occasional stone lies unearthed on the trail.  Deep ruts show where heavy carts have passed along this track, but it is only wide enough for traffic to move one way.  This seems a dangerous way to travel, considering pulling off into either forest would be near murder on the wheels of any cart.   } {mesolar} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
