R {13401} {0} {<238>} {A small camp ground} {<238>. .<088>} {  This area is crossed by many trails from horses and small carts.  There are small circles of stone where camp fires could be made, and the area is kept relatively clear of fallen branches and leaves, probably they are used in the campfires.  This seems an ideal spot to rest before entering the swamp to the east and south, or after coming from the swamp, for the trek through that dangerous land is difficult at the best of times.  The trail which serves as a dubious road through the wilds lies to the south.   } {mesolar} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
