R {13405} {0} {<228>} {Silverwind Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Underneath the tall eaves of the forest, there seems to be hardly any light coming from above.  The boughs of these ancient trees reach towards the sky in a crisscross pattern.  Patches of sunlight filter through the silvery canopy in places making it possible to see, but there are only brief patches of blue breaking the lush silvery-green of the leaves.  On the edges of the forest large clumps of half submerged grass and large bubbling mud holes detract from any thoughts about leaving the peacefulness of the forest.  Unless you like being submerged to your knees in mud, water and who knows what else.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
