R {13406} {0} {<228>} {The Greenwart Swamp} {<228>; ;<088>} {  Thick, choking vines spread across the sludge which serves as "solid" ground, their snake-like appearance making this swamp more ominous than it already is.  Clusters of tall reeds bend and sway in the breezes, which smell of mud and decay, and small, thorny bushes with bright flowers seem to invite disaster.  Among the rest of the vegetation is the Greenwart plant, whose bright green berries, studded with small spines, are known to have poisonous qualities for many races.  These plants were cultivated long ago by the Trolls who live in the swamps, though this close to the marshes of Agroth, it is more likely that one will run into Lizardmen tribesmen than organized Trolls.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
