R {13407} {0} {<228>} {Near the Marshlands of Agroth} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The greenwart comes to an abrupt end here.  Something around the marshland to the east has put a complete halt to the growth of the poisonous plant, though the small, brightly flowering bushes with the needle-like thorns still seem to be everywhere.  Tall, nearly black trees cluster close around the marshland, but then, they seem to cluster whever given reign to do so in this murky landscape.  The calls of ravens and kingfishers are all around, and mixed with them, the sounds of mosquitoes and the small frogs who hunt them.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
