R {13457} {0} {<228>} {The Forest of Everwood} {<228>( *<088>} {  The sounds of life infuse this forest, birds sing high above in the lush green canopy, insects can be heard from nearly every direction.  Animals both small like rabbits and large like the majestic deer wander unconcerned by the approach of people.  Strangely there are no dead leaves on the ground, it appears that this forest is full of evergreen trees.  Although the forest lives in legend of being able to heal people, the occasional dead and decaying tree can be seen.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
