R {13460} {0} {<238>} {On a dull forest trail} {<238>===<088>} {  This bridge is very old and creaks under the weight of heavy horses or loaded carts.  If there were rails to guard against falling into the stream, they have long since rotted away, and now the sides of the bridge are unprotected.  The timbers are thick and have browned with age, and the dirty stream below quietly gurgles away to the south.  East of here is a campground, and west will continue the trek into the forested lands.   } {mesolar} {} {bridge} {} {1.000} {}
