R {13463} {0} {<238>} {On a dull forest trail} {<238>. .<088>} {  The narrow trail runs straight for several miles in either direction.  The fields to the south appear to have been part of a forest, but are now cleared of all but the large stumps which used to be trees.  Farther south is the edge of Greenwart Swamp, and perhaps the forest was cleared to give travellers at least a fighting chance to run, should Trolls come out of the swamps in a raid.  North of here the Silverwind Forest shimmers softly.  To the west a set of campgrounds sits to either side of the trail.   } {mesolar} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
