R {13468} {0} {<228>} {At the edge of Agroth's marsh} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The trees in this part of the swamp have been cut back quite a bit.  Several stumps rot in the humid air, and there are axe cuts on a few trees which still stand.  The ground here is somewhat firmer, and there is little sign of undergrowth.  To the north is the steamy Marshland of Agroth.  Rumor has it that the marshland is as dangerous, in its own way, as the swamp.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
