R {13469} {0} {<228>} {Greenwart Swamp} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The dense undergrowth makes traveling through this part of the swamp nearly impossible.  Luckily, there seems to be no Greenwart here, even the small thorny flower bushes seem to be fewer in this part of the swamp.  Tall reeds and sawgrass among the thick trunked trees offer plenty of resistance, though, and hiding places for the small, posionous creatures which call Greenwart Swamp home.  Deep pools of thick mud are also a hazard to the unwary traveller.  Nearby a large pool of quicksand bubbles hungrily, and you can just make out the antlers of an unfortunate deer disappearing below the solid looking surface of the pool.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
