R {13508} {0} {<228>} {East of an eerie hilltop} {<228>, `<088>} {  Looming to the east two large and ancient oaks have been twisted together to form some sort of gate.  Unlike the surrounding grasslands dead leaves litter the ground.  There is a still silence that can be felt, even from here, as if someone or something is watching whoever enters those gates.  In almost every other direction, the peace of the surrounding grasslands offer refuge for the waiting silence.  Though to the south, a grim reminder to the ferocity of the great war.  Bones, both bleached and broken litter the ground.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
