R {13525} {0} {<228>} {The edge of Greenwart Swamp} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The edges of Greenwart Swamp are covered with tall reeds and cat tails.  The thick, sticky mud which seems to be the trademark of the solid land in the swamp is nearly black, and has a peculiar odor about it.  Several tall, dark trees grow in stands around the glistening wetland, and a few rotting logs litter the landscape.  As you watch, one of the logs opens up and a small frog disappears.  Perhaps not all these logs are logs afterall.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
