R {13561} {0} {<228>} {Fruit Orchards} {<228>, `<088>} {  Sparse fruit trees straggle from the ground.  Many are dead or dying, and the ones that remain bear small and sour fruit.  Several trees are blown over, leaving rotting logs which fill the air with the sour stench of fungus.  Small hills dot the landscape to the west, and the sound of the ocean can be heard far to the south.  A small track leads southwards, towards a distant city.  } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
