R {13562} {0} {<278>} {Thalos Road} {<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>} {  The road here is heavily traveled by a wide variety of people.  Merchant caravans, mercenaries, and adventurers travel to New Thalos in search of fame and fortune, while ragged and tired pilgrims travel to the shrines of Old Thalos.  Those destined for New Thalos seek to advance themselves in their current lives, while those destined for Old Thalos seek to improve their lot in the next.   } {mesolar} {} {smallroad} {} {1.000} {}
