R {13563} {0} {<228>} {By the Thalos Road} {<228>, `<088>} {  A large field of swaying grass starts at the Thalos Road and trails off in the distance, far to the east.  A huge statue of the great Thalosian hero, Marikus Corvwin, catches your eye.  The bronze statue shines brightly in the reflected sun and stands well over 100 feet tall.  Several travelers have left the main road, just to visit the tourist center and museum at the base.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
