R {13565} {0} {<228>} {Rolling Hills} {<228>. ^<088>} {  These "hills" are actually mass graves for the tremendous casualties of the beast war.  Thalosian heros that died were given a special burial within the city, while the beasts were stacked up and covered with earth.  Corvwin had considered burning the bodies, but decided to leave a reminder to the armies of darkness: "Further aggressive action will only meet in your descruction", "u r sux", or something similar.   } {mesolar} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
