R {13568} {0} {<228>} {A bone-riddled plain} {<228>, `<088>} {  Thick clouds of black winged birds cluster overhead.  Their croaking and hissing seems directed at you, the intruder on their feast.  The ground here is littered with shards of bleached white bone and there are several unearthed graves.  This must've been part of a battlefield from long ago.  There are newer corpses, here, as well.  The grizzly sight before you is probably some unfortunate merchant and his or her guards and servants, unlucky enough to fall victim to bandits.  Now they are food for the vultures and flies.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
