R {13574} {0} {<148>} {Everwood Springs} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  This small, clear and very pristine lake looks breathtaking.  The reflection of the trees of the forest Everwood.  Lush grass waves softly in the vagrant breezes.  The air smells crisp and clean, this place does live up to legend in at least making anyone who visits feel better.  Birds sing and insects dance over the lake.  It is a perfect place to relax and rest.   } {mesolar} {} {ocean} {} {1.000} {}
