R {13577} {0} {<228>} {The Forest of Everwood} {<228>( *<088>} {  The Forest of Everwood is remembered not for wars like a lot of this part of the continent but for the legend that visiting the forest itself has healing properties.  Ancient trees reach towards the sky, the boughs are lost in the shadows of the canopy high above.  A large number of the trees here are not only tall but are massive in width as well.  It is a wonder that such an ancient and vibrant forest remained untouched.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
