R {13580} {0} {<148>} {The Greyhare Stream} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The murky water of the Greyhare picks up speed here as it cascades around a series of rocks that bar the middle of the river.  Further to the north a bridge is visible, spanning the waters.   } {mesolar} {} {river} {} {1.000} {}
