R {13586} {0} {<228>} {Greenwart Swamp} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The land here is covered in thick, thorny vines mixed with the ominous Greenwart plant.  To the east a stand of trees, green in color, is a nice change from the tall, nearly black trees which grow all around.  A black bear can be seen roaming the swampy ground, and nearby, black flies buzz over the carcass of some unidentifiable creature who was probably unlucky enough to try one of the berries from the Greenwart plant.  The shrill cries of birds echo across the swamp, and the hissing and hoarse croaking of buzzards lend support to the dark and ominous atmosphere of the wetlands.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
