R {13591} {0} {<228>} {Greenwart Swamp} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The Greenwart plant which seems to flourish so well in these swamps grows very thick near the city of Anthrox.  East of here the ocean roars, its furious motion carrying it into the swamp in a violent spray of muddy foam.  The oozing, black mud seems to suck at the feet of those who travel through this area.  To the west the Troll city of Anthrox lies, and it would be wise not to stick around too long, as there may be a harvesting party along at any time to harvest the Greenwart.  South of here the ground rises and there seems to be a hummock of solid ground.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
