R {13628} {0} {<228>} {Rugged Mesolarian Grassland} {<228>, `<088>} {  Tuffs of dry, brown grass dot the sand and gravel strewn ground.  Sand dunes hide some of the coastline from view, and even the occasional tree is engulfed in sand with only the tops of its branches uncovered.  How could a tree survive like that?  Surely it does as it looks quite unharmed from being covered in sand; well at least the parts of the tree you see look healthy.  Little creatures, barely seen, dart between clumps of dried grass and the dunes looking for food and cover from the driving wind.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
