R {13634} {0} {<228>} {The Forest of Everwood} {<228>( *<088>} {  Large and lush green leaves rustle in the soft vagrant breezes.  The creak of large limbs moving gently in the winds high above do not seem to make their way down this far, perhaps it is just because the canopy is so thick.  Although the forest is larger than most, you may not see another soul on your travels through here you may not feel alone.  The forest feels alive, more so than others, it feels soothing and a great calm encompasses all both animal and people alike.  To the north Everwood Springs can be seen through the trees.   } {mesolar} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
