R {13646} {0} {<228>} {Greenwart Swamp} {<228>; ;<088>} {  Tall, dark trees and the dangerous and often deadly Greenwart plant grow thickly in this portion of the swamp.  The muddy ground sinks underfoot, nearly hip high on the average human.  Long, snaky, green vines twist and climb through the vegetation, a few of them seem to have small thorns.  What is it with thorny plants in this accursed mire anyways?  A low bush with thorny flowers of many bright colors rings the bases of the trees, and a few toadstools and mushrooms also dot the surface of anything they can cling to. } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
