R {13649} {0} {<228>} {An especially hot part of the swamp} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The smells coming from the east are horrid, to say the least.  It seems that perhaps the dark, oily liquid being fountained into the air might be heated from an underground source.  The heat radiating out to this area certainly seems to be more than just sunshine.  This is especially true since this portion of the swamp is covered in a permanent cloud of foul smelling mist.  The ground begins to rise to the west, but at this point, it is still a quagmire of mud and rotting vegetation.  A large quicksand pool lies nearby, its bubbling seeming to be a song for the oily geysers to spray to.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
