R {13699} {0} {<138>} {A narrow strip of beach} {<138>, `<088>} {  Large clumps of dried grass are scattered through the sand and trees on the beach.  Pieces of sea weed and other unrecognizable items have been caught between the tightly grown grass.  Strange little ridges in erratic patterns mark small stretches of sand, it could be just the wind causing these patterns, but it could be some sort of animal too.  The bright, white sand marks a vast contrast to the ocean's deep blue further out to sea.   } {mesolar} {} {beach} {} {1.000} {}
