R {13701} {0} {<148>} {The Greyhare Stream} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Although the Greyhare is one of the longer streams, it is certainly not that wide.  The river flows swiftly through the continent of Mesolar and although it runs along a good stretch of the continent, not many would stop to drink from it.  The silty color of the river makes it less than inviting to anyone who might consider stopping for a drink.   } {mesolar} {} {river} {} {1.000} {}
