R {13703} {0} {<228>} {Rim of the Greenwart Swamp} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The Greenwart Swamp extends a bit farther south here, and its muddy surface is mixed with the white sands of Haytlan Beach.  South of here, the wetlands meet the ocean, and at that point, a mangrove forest has sprouted up.  This portion of the swamp seems devoid of trees, but the Greenwart plant and a small, flowery bush with long, sharp thorns grow in abundance.  Mosquitoes swarm in droves through the Greenwart Swamp, and alligators and several varieties of poisonous snakes make travel through the swamp extremely dangerous.  Let's not forget the Trolls who call the swamp home.  They may not have the army they once could field, but meeting a Troll in these swamps would be almost a fate worse than death.   } {mesolar} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
