R {13707} {0} {<138>} {Haytlan Beach} {<138>, `<088>} {  Massive sand dunes shift and form all over Haytlan Beach, depending on the winds.  Stunted trees jut out of both small and large dunes and still others are completely free of sand.  In the distance waves crash and roar where sand meets ocean.  A light, almost imperceptible rattle can be heard as a breeze stirs the large grains of sand and various pieces of seaweed from the ocean.  Long ago this beach was used as a landing point for the Minotaurs so they could link up with the trolls.  Discarded pieces of rope, armor and weapons can still be found scattered throughout the beach.   } {mesolar} {} {beach} {} {1.000} {}
