R {13729} {0} {<228>} {A City.  Or is it?} {<228>, `<088>} {  A small city, or perhaps just a mockup of one, sits here.  You try to catch a glimpse of the buildings or the inhabitants, but no matter what you do, they seem to glance off the edge of your vision and flow sneakily away.  You're left with the very unfulfilled conviction that there must be SOMETHING interesting here.  You're just not sure what.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
