R {13730} {0} {<228>} {Elven Fruit Orchards} {<228>, `<088>} {  This field is overflowing with orchards of fruit trees.  Apples, oranges, peaches, nectarines, and all sorts of other fruits grow together.  No regard is given for straight lines, either.  The people who planted these orchards have more regard for the beauty of a project than for the organization.  The ocean lies to the south, and mountains stain the horizon to the north.   } {mesolar} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
