R {13931} {0} {<228>} {The Branches of the Forest Heart} {<228>( *<088>} {  Standing on the western edge of the branches, you look at the forest floor below, and see a beautiful ring of flowers.  A deep crimson against the forest green, it looks like a deliberate planting, a marker of some sort.  Though the branches are sturdy, and incredibly thick, they bend ever so slightly as you reach the edge.  A slight breeze catches your exposed skin, and brings relief against the summer heat.  You could head back east, or perhaps even jump down. } {autumn} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
