R {13936} {0} {<278>} {In the Tunnel Between the Inner and Outer Gatehouses} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The tunnel between the two gates is filled with wagons, carts and people  travelling on foot. The sounds of clattering hooves, babbling voices, and  rumble of wheels all but drown out the sounds of the guards' shouts and  commands as they check everyone who would enter Empyrean. Every few feet  there is an alcove where a few guards stand with weapons at parade rest. They ensure that the crowd stays on the path leading between the gates, and  keep their space open in order to bring their weapons to bear, should the  need arise. Arrow loops are visible between the alcoves, and overhead you can see murder holes. Smoke from the torches lining the tunnel walls drifts up  and pools on the ceiling, invisible in the murk. } {empyrean} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
