R {13946} {0} {<278>} {An Intersection Past the Wall} {<278>-+-<088>} {  Guards can be seen patrolling the shadowed grounds before the citadel looming monstrous to the west, and another guard stands to the north being very  meticulous about checking identities before letting people past. To the south of here, the pavement changes from cobble stones to something that looks like a fine, blue-veined black marble. While the guards are troubling, the inner  city is kept remarkably clean. No speck of litter can be seen on the ground,  and the street seems to have been swept clean of dirt and mud. } {empyrean} {} {road_crossroads} {} {1.000} {}
