R {13947} {0} {<268>} {Out of the Market, into the Southern Slums} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  The dusty, open, noise-filled air of the marketplace changes into something  else as you head south from the eastern gate. You follow the wall as it  extends, the houses pushing closer and closer until there is barely room for  two to walk abreast between the increasingly shoddier buildings and the  mighty barrier. Each building's roof encroaches on that of the next, so that  almost no light reaches the aged cobble road and a stillness hangs  oppressive. } {empyrean} {} {hallway} {} {1.000} {}
