R {13962} {0} {<278>} {The Plaza of Living Stone} {<278>---<088>} {  The grounds before the Empyrean palace have none of the typical fancy gardens with sculpted hedges and well-arranged flowers. Instead, the shadows which  stretch out long over the massive open space are those of ogres, dwarves,  humans, elves, and so many others. At first glance, it seems that there is an enormous gathering, but, moving closer, you realize are petrified people. Once living and breathing, now nothing more than statues made from real  beings. Wicked testaments to Sarcoph's power and cruelty\; a garden of the  entombed. } {empyrean} {} {smallroad_ew} {} {1.000} {}
