R {14041} {0} {<238>} {Into the Stony Foothills} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  The desert road ends, but, pressing onward, you find the path is not much  worse than the road. Here and there boulders dot the landscape, providing  shade and landmarks as you make your way north. Empyrean rises out of the  horizon to the west, a black blister on the skyline, and to the north are the Stony Foothills in the Demon's Halo range. In a ravine, lost in the shadow of the gorge, rests a massive portal. Forgotten by all but time and the ravaging of the desert weather, it doesn't seem to be working. The top of the arch  lies where it fell, several feet from the rest of the portal, sheared off and sand-worn. } {empyrean} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
E {13959} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {14042} {0} {<278>} {A Long and Treacherous Road} {<278>---<088>} {  Stretching out to an almost imperceptible point to the west, this hazardous  road is barely passable. Mostly hot and dry, with brief respites along the  way, all but the most determined adventurer would be discouraged and hie back to more hospitable climes. Travelers would be well advised to stick together  for mutual support on a journey such as this. } {empyrean} {} {smallroad_ew} {} {1.000} {}
E {37000} {e} {e} {2} {1} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {14040} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {14072} {0} {<108>} {A Cell in Empyrean's Prison} {<108>~ ~<088>} {  Although initial appearances point to all the statues in the plaza being  still, eventually you notice some moving slowly and stiffly. They are  animated with a grotesque form of life, bewitched to wander the palace  grounds. This is a mockery of their former lives, even worse than just  holding living beings in perpetual petrification. } {empyrean} {} {cloud2} {} {1.000} {}

R {14086} {0} {<248>} {On the Stairway} {<248># #<088>} {  You stand on a narrow winding stair leading down into the rock under the  Yurgach Fortress. A small flow of water covers the steps making them very  slippery, and you have to take great care as you progress, so as not to fall  down into the darkness below. } {yurgach} {} {dungeon} {} {1.000} {}
