R {14087} {0} {<248>} {Falling Down the Stairs} {<248># #<088>} {  Whoops! Your armor overbalances you and you slip on some slime, suddenly you  find yourself falling down the steep stone stairway into the darkness below. Looking around you realise that you have fallen into a deep pit. A sturdy  iron door is set into the east wall, you hope it's not locked, as there seems to be no other way out, the ceiling has closed up, and you assume that it  must be some kind of a trap-door, and you fell right into the trap! } {yurgach} {} {dungeon} {} {1.000} {}
