R {14097} {0} {<248>} {Torture Chamber} {<248># #<088>} {  You enter a dark room, lit only by a small brazier containing burning coals  sitting in one corner. On the far side of the room you see a collection of  horrific and sadistic looking implements of torture. Iron maidens and racks  are in lined up along one wall, and a table covered with thumb-screws,  needles, pincers, tongs, branding-irons and other items, sits in the middle  of the room. This room is obviously where the Yurgach torture their  prisoners, or just come to have some fun, after a hard day beating the slaves and killing people.  After a closer inspection, it appears you might be able to squeeze inside the brazier, if you're willing to risk getting stuck.  } {yurgach} {} {dungeon} {} {1.000} {}
