R {14323} {0} {<278>} {Cougarian Way} {<278>. .<088>} {  The street opens up before you with lots of activity.  Your first look at this grand city is somewhat disappointing.  Worried looks are worn on the citizens, but it looks like businesses are buzzing as normal.  On the buildings you see war propaganda posted 'By order of Her Majesty'.  What battle are these people fighting?  Who is their enemy?  What is your position on the matter?  From the assorted glares and occasional hopeful look of a child, you know that a choice must be made.   } {cougarian} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
