R {14329} {128} {<278>} {Come and Join the C.A.T.S.! (Cougarian Army: Tactical Squad)} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  They want you!  The C.A.T.S. Recruiting Office opens before you, with a hardwood floor and scattered pieces of new furniture, including a large oaken desk which takes up the majority of the room.  Around the walls, you see sheets of parchment printed with anti-Bengaleen slogans, urging the Cougarians to help the war effort vs. the 'Unnatural' Bengaleen Empire.  Have you come to join the military of this Feline Civilization?  You suddenly feel patriotic and long for your home country and the people you remember there.   } {cougarian} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
