R {14330} {128} {<278>} {Through a Rusty Gate} {<278>. .<088>} {  The feeling of the city is suddenly changed into ruins as you step through this crack in time.  You see the occasional straggler walking by and step on pieces of broken vials from long forgotten magical potions.  You remember your walk through town and it didn't hit you until just now- there were no magicians, clerics, any magic users whatsoever, in the main part of town.  You realize why when your gaze fixes on notices posted on the doors in this run down part of town.   MAGIC IS HEREBY FORBIDDEN! } {cougarian} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
