R {14331} {128} {<278>} {An Unused Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  The road here is dark and dreary, with fugitive magic users roaming in the shadows.  These are the outcasts of Cougaria, those whose livelihood has been taken from them for the good of the people.  To banish magic, meant to banish these citizens, who now teach their ways through word of mouth only.  To write off their practices would be to forsake what little the Cougarian queen still provides them... the peace to finish their lives in solitude.   } {cougarian} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
