R {14333} {128} {<278>} {Cougarian Magi Guild} {<278>. .<088>} {  You enter what used to be the training hall for the magic users of Cougaria.  The east wall is completely gone, and you see the stone wall of the neighboring building.  It seems the former guildmaster has now taken up gambling, as your gaze turns to a large wheel supported against the wall.  Different colored wedges make up the wooden disk, with a dagger used to mark the 'winning' wedge.   } {cougarian} {Key on familiar, 2n, 14335} {city} {} {1.000} {}
