R {14334} {0} {<278>} {A Hidden Den} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have discovered the true guild of both mages and psions of this land. Here, the guildmaster is busy writing the secrets of the magicians of Cougaria.  Her skillful grace fills the parchment with line after line of beautiful text.  The shelves behind her are filled with completed scrolls.  What wonders wait for the person who should happen upon these deep secrets of this magical underground?  Will you be able to find out?  Be sure to use the utmost courtesy if you choose to ask a favor of her, and you will be rewarded grandly.   } {cougarian} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
