R {14335} {128} {<278>} {An Ancient Den} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You enter the den with caution, and find the room filled with the sweet smell of vanilla incense.  Sage bundles burn over an open flame and you find an ancient figure before you.  Perhaps she holds the key.   } {cougarian} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
