R {15062} {0} {<228>} {Deep in the Woods} {<228>( *<088>} {  You have pushed yet deeper into this foreboding wood. Your clothes are soaked from the ever-present mist, and you think that you are coming down with a  cold. Wonderful. You barely notice the absence of the eyes that had been  watching you. Only the feel of gravel on your feet brings you out of your  self-brooding. The smell of overgrown moss is thick in the air, and yet there is something more... It smells like smoke. You glance around looking for a  fire, but you only catch the ghostly form of woodsmoke to your west. If not  for the smoke, you probably never would have noticed this thin trail. You can go down it if you wish, although the path widens to the north. } {darkside} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
