R {15066} {0} {<248>} {The Castle Doors} {<248>[ ]<088>} {  You are standing in front of a pair of huge doors, forming the entrance to the castle. They appear to be made from hard-wrought steel and could stand up to an even greater assualt than the gates. You put your hand on the doors tentatively. There is a sharp pain and you pull your hand back quickly. It's as cold as ice! You look closer at the place where you had put your hand.  There appears to be a small hole there now. You shake your hand a little to get the feeling back. In the distance, thunder rumbles. The mist  seems to roll in to hide your eyes from your surroundings. You once again have the  feeling that you are being watched. } {darkside} {} {chessblack} {} {1.000} {}
