R {15067} {0} {<248>} {Inside Castle Liavango} {<248>[ ]<088>} {  This is the main room of Castle Liavango. You are actually quite shocked at  how warm it is inside. In contrast with its exterior ugliness, it's actually  quite beautiful inside. Large tapestries depicting some of The Fractured  Land's greatest heroes line the walls. Their art work and representations are exquisite. Another few paintings also line the walls. One however, catches  your attention. It is a fine, oil painting of a VERY old woman. She has many  deep wrinkles in her face. There is a plaque beneath it which reads, "Our  Great- Grandmother Liavango. May she always be remembered." You look around  and also notice the several exits from this room. There is a stairway in the  far right corner leading up. Two hallways extend north and west,  respectively. } {darkside} {} {chessblack} {} {1.000} {}
