R {15071} {0} {<248>} {The Baron's Lab} {<248>[ ]<088>} {  This room contrasts sharply with the niceties of the other rooms in the  castle. A look around makes your face pale, and a fit of nausea comes over  you. You fall to your knees and retch for several minutes, until your stomach is empty. Weakly, you regain your footing. A wave of dizziness comes, but it  soon passes. You take a deep breath and look about you better. The first  thing you had noticed was a large metal contraption in the middle of the  room. Some lifeless body is strapped hand and foot to it. You cannot tell if  the subject was male or female as the body has been completely drained. Near  the foot of the torture device, there is a large wooden bucket. It seems that the blood was drained from the victim drop by drop. It ran down a channel cut into the device's wooden base, and into the bucket. It must have been a very  cold and slow death. It appears that special tools were used to keep the  wounds cut into the body from closing. You feel yourself begin to retch  again, and decide it's about time to get some fresh air. There is a door to  the east, seeming to lead out onto a balcony. } {darkside} {} {chessblack} {} {1.000} {}
