R {15197} {0} {<278>} {Robert's Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Directly across from the door to Robert's room is a throne. Yes, seriously,  he's got a throne in here. A red carpet has been rolled out that leads to the throne. The carpet is a bit creased in places and buckles as well, but it's  obvious that it's meant to lead straight to the throne. Chintzy looking  paintings with overly-extravagant gilded gold frames have been hung at  intervals from one end of the room to the other. A chandelier is hanging  crookedly from the ceiling and it looks to be terribly tarnished. Every  resident gets a basic room that comes with a bed supplied by the nursing  home. They are encouraged to furnish the room further in order to add their  own personal touch. Each resident room has tongue and groove boards an inch  thick, installed vertically for the walls, and thicker boards for the floor  and roof. } {nursing} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
