R {15308} {0} {<248>} {Cavernous Deep} {<248>% %<088>} {  The northern corner of the cave shows the same features as the rest of the  rough, damp wall, and is lined with the same pale blue crystals that shine  brilliantly throughout the rest of the depths. Tapping one of the crystals  seems to provide an interesting reaction\; a flickering resonates throughout  the cave, then nothing, as the light fades. However, this isn't always the  case, as a few crystals seem to suddenly explode, sending a small burst of  shrapnel and energy outwards. } {sanctum} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
