R {15317} {0} {<218>} {Past the Hall of Flame} {<218>[ ]<088>} {  Relief floods over you like a waterfall. Though still panting from the heat,  you can feel it slowly leaving your gear, but the pounding in your head just  increases. Warmth still blazes from the south, but thankfully it is nothing  compared to being within the Hall itself. The northern wall is also smooth  and dark red like the rest of the area, but the very same tapestry that was  seen after coming down the grate hangs before you as well. } {sanctum} {} {hellinside} {} {1.000} {}
