R {15318} {0} {<268>} {Hall of Frost} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  Cold, freezing, like nothing you have ever felt before. A tundra wasteland  would feel like a sunny vacation compared to this. The walls appear to be  growing smaller with the cold, and your teeth chattering. Your breath mists  heavily from the cold, as if they could form droplets and fall to the ground  upon leaving you. The walls all around are a pale blue, only emphasizing the  extremely low temperature. } {sanctum} {} {hallway} {pk} {1.000} {}
