R {15319} {0} {<268>} {Hall of Frost} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  This deep freeze of a place seems to be pouring buckets of liquid ice on you  as your joints creak with every movement, making walking agonizing. Even if  thrown into hell, this place might be cold as ever. Pushing you down, the  cold could probably shatter your weapon if swung one more time. The blue from the walls mock you, as if they were people, nodding to themselves, pleased at the result of you possibly dying here. } {sanctum} {} {hallway} {pk} {1.000} {}
