R {15329} {0} {<218>} {Chamber of Salvation} {<218>[ ]<088>} {  The floor here is still covered in mosaic tiles, all jutting out from the  ground. When listening to the humming and looking at the tapestries, a  strange sense of a story enters your mind. The details are hazy, but it is  filled with struggle, trickery, and slavery. One familiar thing is the fact  that there was death, then life, then power beyond means. } {sanctum} {} {hellinside} {} {1.000} {}
