R {15381} {0} {<238>} {The Laundry Room} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  This is a very simple laundry room. The soiled linens and clothes go into one basket, and there are several other baskets for the neatly folded, clean  items. A large sink is available in the far corner of the room, just in case  anything needs to be quickly hand-washed there. Generally, soiled items wait  for the laundry sorcerer to come and clean them with his spells, unless they  smell especially pungent. There is only one laundry sorcerer for all of the  different buildings that hire one in the area, so he usually only swings by  once a week. This is why anyone would want to do a quick, cursory clean of a  ridiculously stinky item. } {nursing} {} {office} {} {1.000} {}
