R {15578} {0} {<268>} {Entrance to the Fortress Aethelburh} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  The air is warm and moist at the Fortress Aethelburh. The ancient pile of  stone, birthplace of the witch Aethelgyth, bears the cool-sweat of the ocean  spray that has pounded it since its construction, eons ago. You look out over the ocean and see the strange purple haze of the horizon and the never ending waves as they relentlessly crash against the cliffs. As you move closer to  the entrance a ball of flame alights and hovers over you and moves to your  every step. } {omentor} {} {hallway} {} {1.000} {}
