R {15590} {0} {<278>} {Barracks} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  These are the barracks of the soldiers and various mercenaries of the  Fortress Aethelburh. It's a large open room with many doors leading to  private rooms. At the far end you see a cafeteria of sorts and a few people  eating odd types of seafood which could only be found in Omen Tor. As you  pass the few soldiers stationed to stand guard at the entrance you wonder why they give you those odd stares. Possibly because you are an outlander from  another place. The soldiers are wearing the typical uniform of the Burh. A  few you notice have many badges of honour and valour on their uniforms. Perhaps one day you will join their ranks and be like these loyal young men. } {omentor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
