R {15651} {0} {<268>} {The Tower of the Citadel} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  The base of the tower is a plain room. The floor is a solid, flat rock, and  the walls are made of stone and mortar. A large wooden table and several  chairs are set at the center of the room. It might be a mess hall in times of peace, but at the moment, no one is eating here. } {omentor} {} {hallway} {} {1.000} {}
