R {15652} {0} {<278>} {Within the Tower} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Two rooms branch off the stairwell, midway up the tower. To the west is the  private chamber that Cuthwulf uses for rest and respite during times of war. To the east is his war room, where he can plan the next strategy against  invading troops. } {omentor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
