R {15653} {0} {<278>} {Cuthwulf's Quarters} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  During times of war, Cuthwulf uses these quarters as his bedchamber. In this  way, he is able to rise quickly and be in battle in minutes. He is able to  leave Aethelswyth safely in the Citadel, as she is well able to take care of  herself, and scorns over-protectiveness by her mate. } {omentor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
