R {15654} {0} {<278>} {Cuthwulf's War Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The war room is nothing special, except for the very accurate model of the  citadel, the courtyard, tower and surrounding lands situated on the floor of  the room. Long staves are used to push troops around the battlements, and  these are laid aside, by the wall. } {omentor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
