R {15669} {0} {<138>} {Aethelswyth's Chamber of Stars} {<138>[ ]<088>} {  The Chamber of Stars is Aethelswyth's favorite place in the Citadel. The  chamber has a domed ceiling and painted upon it, the night sky, as seen from  Omen Tor at Midsummer. But these are merely decorative. On the table at the  center of the room is a functional star chart, and underneath the table,  numerous charts, one for each month of the year. Aethelswyth selects her  spells based upon the fluctuations of power emanating from the heavens and  thusly ensures the strongest, longest lasting magic. } {omentor} {} {palace_room} {} {1.000} {}
