R {15978} {0} {<278>} {Stone Stairway Leading Upwards} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A stairway is here, leading up, out of this forbidding place.  The black walls around you seem to close in, consuming, and for a second, you yearn for an escape to the clear air up above.  Within this place, there is nothing more than the promise of complete desolation.   } {vlad} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R {15979} {0} {<278>} {Stone Stairway Leading Upwards} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The black flagged stairway continues here, striking up towards the faintest crack of light far above, and downwards, into the ever present darkness.  Faint red mist swirls in the air, the smell of vitae and blood within it, as if the very air in this place were to sap the will to carry on...   } {vlad} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R {15980} {0} {<278>} {Stone Stairway Leading Upwards} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You pull your cloak closer around yourself, as the cold air finds a way to worm its way in, and caress with icicles, your tender flesh..  Shadows around you flee at the arrival of the light that you bear, but as you pass, again they return, fleetingly, to dance from the dark corners, into the shadows of the mind..   } {vlad} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

