R {15984} {0} {<278>} {Valkur's Treasure Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As soon as you enter this chamber, you realise why this 'Valkur' must wield so much power, for if power can be bought, he has much to wield.  Countless works of art lay scattered, carelessly around the room.  Work by artists and craftsmen that you grew up learning the names of, adorn the walls.  Much of what is here is simply too heavy to carry, although its price would be beyond compare.  But, just as you are looking, your eyes are drawn to a HUGE stone chest.  Perhaps it contains something?   } {vlad} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
