R {15990} {128} {<278>} {Dungeon Cell} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Filth and straw litter the floor here, rats scurrying among the waste and bones.  A cold breeze blows through the room, rattling past the tiny bed, and chains that are set into the wall.  An anguished cry comes from the prisoner, who doesn't look like they've been fed in months.  You wonder who it was they angered so, to have been punished like this..   } {vlad} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
