R {15994} {0} {<278>} {Passing Under Some Iron Gates} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Crude, wrought iron gates spread above you as you pass beneath them.  Weathered with the rust of countless years, they screech in the wind, the sound like a scream from beyond the pale.  The metal itself has cracked, split and corroded, weathering the cold wind of Vlad Shamir for countless aeons.  The whistling of the wind, through the close built iron, sends a howling wave of noise down the corridor.   } {vlad} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
