R {15996} {0} {<278>} {Inside Valkur's Secret Laboratory} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Upon entering this domed room, you are immediately filled with a most profound sense of dread and horror.  The first thing that strikes you is the very odd smell on the air, that you cannot quite place.  Then, when you look again, your stomach turns over..  Laying on one of the benches, staked out, is something that must have once been humanoid.  The skin has been stripped from it, and every manner of strange instrument, probe and equipment seems to be inserted in it somewhere.  As you look, there is a brief flash of lightning from the sky outside, and with the smell of electricity on the air, the monstrosity slowly turns, and stares at you.  Before you know it, you are screaming...   } {vlad} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
