R {15997} {0} {<278>} {Inside a Large Metal Cage} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Thick metal bars, barely more than a handswidth apart form the walls and ceiling of this cage.  Bones lay scattered about on the floor.  Doubtless, this is where the evil chirugeons that must work here keep the victims upon which they perform their heinous experiments.  You can almost feel their terror and dread, suffusing the very rock upon which you stand...   } {vlad} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
