R {15998} {0} {<278>} {A Spawning Pit} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Upon rounding the corner, a terrifying sight confronts you.  It is as if the very ground itself had been gouged into an open wound, thick, seeping liquid oozing from the edges of the rock.  Within the morass of ungodly liquid and flesh at the centre of this suppurating mass, you can see forms sliding and slithering about.  The smell is one of something long decayed, and as you look into the pit, you can see what must have once been human, turned into a meal, upon which to feed....   } {vlad} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
