R {16015} {0} {<228>} {Standing in the Bone Yard} {<228>. ^<088>} {  The floor here is that of pock marked, finger-scratched earth.  Standing, like macabre sentinels within the dark soil, bones have been bound together into some kind of demonic icon.  The air is fetid with the smell of death, your skin crawls at being here.  As you look one way, the rictus grin of a skull greets your gaze, towards another direction, creepers and other growth twines around a rib cage...  Perhaps you should leave, before you are consumed by the bone-yard?   } {vlad} {} {hills} {maze} {1.000} {}

R {16016} {0} {<228>} {Standing in the Bone Yard} {<228>. ^<088>} {  Corruption abounds.  All around you, strange, alien plant life grows from the bones that litter this place, as if feeding on them.  Weird monuments have been constructed and shaped from the pecked-clean limbs of the fallen.. Cracked and ancient tombstones, weathered by the years, cap open graves, perhaps inviting you to enter?   } {vlad} {} {hills} {maze} {1.000} {}

