R {16031} {0} {<278>} {On the Ramparts around the Courtyard} {<278>. .<088>} {  The black stone crenelations of the castle wall jut out like fangs from a toothy jaw, half obscured and made more demonic by the dark mist that floats all around the castle sounding into the darkening mists, half obscuring the rustles, screams, and weak groans that come from the fortress around you.  Clearly you tread where mortal ones were never meant to walk, for fear of losing far more than their lives.  The ramparts continue to your west and north.   } {vlad} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
