R {16094} {0} {<278>} {The Honeymoon Suite} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Climbing up the spiral staircase, the room opens into a large honeymoon  suite. There is a large, double stuffed mattress, wrapped in yards and layers of pure white silk here. Several silk pillows adorn the bed, bringing in a bit of brightness to the room. Fresh water dotted with rose petals lies in a ceramic container on the small table to the far right. A fire is roaring in the hearth  to the far west of the room, and a rug of the softest fur lies in front of it.  This room will bring you many delights and dreams, and is a hidden treasure at the Ferka's. } {caravan} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
