R {16096} {0} {<278>} {An En Suite Bathroom} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A bathtub, easily large enough to hold two people sits in the corner of this  room, filled with steaming hot water and bubbles. The room is lit by  candlelight that throws dancing, flickering shadows onto the walls, the  light mixing with the rising steam. An elegant, marble washbasin also sits in one corner, the room itself just warm enough to permit the freedom of being  completely naked... } {caravan} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {16094} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {16097} {0} {<228>} {The Hanging Gardens} {<228>( *<088>} {  A heady smell reaches you as you stand in this garden.  All around, nature is blooming into fullness, as exotic flowers from the corners of the earth are brought together into a spectacular display of scent and colour.  The most delicate of fragrances mixes with the boldest of colours, tall, elegant, leafy green trees provide a respite from the bright sunshine.  Overhead, a cobalt blue sky frames small, fluffy clouds, birds dancing in the cooling breeze.  All around, animals dart hither and yon through the undergrowth.  Pride of place, in the middle of the Gardens, is a large fountain.  Greek in style, the inscription around the base tells of the founding of the world, as water streams, mirror-like cascading down.  There is both an air of peace and celebration about this place, and as you look north, through a number of rose arches, you can see an inviting room. } {caravan} {} {forest} {pk} {1.000} {}
