R {16098} {0} {<278>} {The Banqueting Hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A number of huge tables dominate this room, covered in the bounty of the lands of Aardwolf.  Food and Drink for everyone's taste is laden high here, the fare giving off tantalising aroma that makes your mouth water.  On a raised stage to one side, a band plays away, the music making you tap your feet, as in front, acrobats and jesters entertain.  Upon the dancefloor, people cavort and move together, in time to the music.  The air of Celebration is most powerful here, for this is a joyous occasion!   } {caravan} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {16097} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {16099} {0} {<278>} {The Hand-Fasting} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Above you, the moon casts silver light down into this glade, illuminating a sight that takes your breath away.  The trees part before you to reveal mighty standing stones, the bones of the earth, thrust from their marble embrace to stand magnificently, silhouetted against the evening sky.  Dolmens and Monoliths are arranged before you in ancient rhyme, and the mood of this place pervades your very Soul.  The touch of enchantment lies thick upon the air, the faint sound of a wolf-call echoes on the breeze...  In the centre of the circle an Altar stands, ready to receive those who make their Vows.  For so it is, that in times gone by, whatever was uttered in this place was blessed by the Gods.  And so now, do two people come together in Union to exchange their eternal promises... } {caravan} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {16097} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {16100} {0} {<228>} {Midnight Ways} {<228>( *<088>} {  And so it is that in the Beauty of Union do two come together as one.  Watching from On High, the Lady weaves her spell of enchantment upon those who dance within her light.  And as the world turns, so is Passion unbridled, realised, taken from the heart and fashioned into form.  Through these Midnight Ways, you find yourself, enwrapped in the Love of another, for here is the end to pain, the end of guilt, here is the joy of Love realised, held in wonderment, and cast gently away, forever to return...   } {caravan} {} {forest} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {16078} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {16101} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {16101} {0} {<228>} {The Sacred Grove} {<228>( *<088>} {  The coming to be and passing away is held here, within the heart.  For even as time claims that which is Mortal, so do some precious things transcend the temporal touch.  Within this Holy Grove, the smell of the damp earth, the sight of emerald green leaves, transluscent against the star-field sky, here, now, is Nature Realized.  For even as the cycle goes ever on, so do we hold against the Storm, and Peace can come to those who understand.  And so it is with us, that in this Sacred place, the whys and wherefors of the world can be left behind.  And perhaps we can find, in each other and in this bountiful day that which will endure, nourish and sustain us, always...   } {caravan} {} {forest} {safe,healer} {1.000} {}
E {16100} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {16105} {0} {<278>} {Jack} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You would now seem to be inside a book.  Truly, Qong's magical capacities are uncanny.  Well, at least now you can read the title of the book, but what interests you more is the title of one of the stories inside.  It shall remain etched in your memory for some time.   } {qong} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}

R {16106} {0} {<278>} {Inside the Bookshelf} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have entered an extraordinarily deep bookshelf.  Shelves many books deep extend from floor to ceiling.  Was Qong a scholar in the distant past?  Most of the books seem to be on the subject of magic and spellcasting, but there is some fiction and poetry as well.  One book catches your eye.  The title is covered with purple crayon strokes.  You wish you could see what it was.  The author's name reminds you of a legendary metropolis.   } {qong} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
