R {16295} {128} {<278>} {Dress-up Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This must be heaven for females of all ages.  There are at least one hundred shelves, each with ten to twenty choices of clothing.  You can find designs from the ancient times to the most modern ones; sizes range from those suitable for giants to those even ratlings can wear.  Accoutrement, array, attire, costume, covering, drapery, dress, duds, fit-out, garb, garment, gear, getup, glad rags, habiliment, outfit, raiment, rig, robe, suit, threads, trapping, vestment....  Oh my, these contestants are really spoilt for choices!   } {sirens} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
