R {16296} {0} {<278>} {Grand Hall Entrance} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This magnificent building is so gigantic that, from a mile away, one cannot see the whole of it without rotating his eyeballs.  It is actually a huge, glittering scaffold of metallic construction, with glass panels forming a latticework of windows.  Panels at different parts of the building have graded transparencies.  Some are tinted, some opaque, while others function as mirrors.  Arriving at the foot of the building, you see a gate opened wide, welcoming your arrival.   } {sirens} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
