R {16301} {128} {<278>} {Golden Sands} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Beauty contestants of all races often appear here in dazzling bikinis to impress judges with their breathtaking bodies.  Also, games of various sorts are included and points can be scored to contribute to the selection of finalists.  Since the first beauty pageant held at this resort, this beach has been overcrowded with tourists.  Many, unfortunately, resort to violence at times to protect their sunbathing territory.  The blinding sun on the sand makes it impossible to see anyone around you until you're right on top of them.   } {sirens} {} {inside} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

