R {16364} {0} {<228>} {The Swaying Branch} {<228>( *<088>} {  The branch sways in the wind, sweeping slowly across the sky and cutting right through some of the low clouds.  As it settles, a cat suddenly lunges for a small bird, but as usual the bird easily escapes.  This scene plays over and over, all up and down the tree.  It seems almost like a game, not a real hunt for food.   } {tol} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
