R {16365} {0} {<228>} {Western Branch End} {<228>( *<088>} {  The end of this branch seems a little odd at first.  Examining it closely, being careful not to fall, you finally see why.  Some of the twigs and leaves have been formed, whether naturally or not you aren't sure, into what looks like a chair.  It's a bit too close to the edge for comfort though, and you wonder who, if anyone, would sit that near to danger.   } {tol} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
