R {16560} {0} {<238>} {A Swampy Path} {<238>( *<088>} {  When will you ever find your way out of here?  You have walked the same paths so many times you can't tell which way your tracks have come or gone anymore.  Sitting down to take a break, you get out some iron rations and begin to eat lunch.  Unfortunately you can not make a fire here- the ground is much too wet and you pretty much guess the wood around here is too.  As you sit quietly, a low croaking sound starts to grow from the south.  You quickly but quietly wrap up what is left of your rations and prepare to investigate.   } {fens} {} {dead_forest} {} {1.000} {}
