R {16561} {0} {<148>} {The Frog Pond} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Rushing toward the pond, you are greeted by dozens of strange frogs who immediately go silent at your entry.  Oddly they do not try to jump away and hide or dive into the nearby pond.  Instead they just freeze and watch you warily.   } {fens} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
