R {16562} {0} {<228>} {A Flowery Path} {<228>( *<088>} {  Stepping on to the southern path, you find yourself standing on hard ground!  Thank goodness- no sloshing around through standing water, muck, and mud for at least a little while.  Looking around you see there are a good amount of flowers growing here.  Red, blue, yellow, even violet flowers.  Noticing the buzzing sound again, you glance over just in time to see a huge, bright blue bee emerging from the inside of a nearby flower.  It is heavily covered in pollen and barely makes it into the air.  You watch it warily as it flies off to the south.   } {fens} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
