R {16566} {0} {<138>} {Muck and Mire} {<138>%%<088>} {  The path seems to end here and the fens all around you have become deathly silent.  Nothing moves here, not even the wind.  The ground seems to give off a stink of decay and a strange greenish mold covers the surface.  Bending down to take a closer look at the mold, you stumble and lose your balance.  Thrusting out your arms to catch yourself, you are shocked when you do not feel the hard impact of the ground.  Instead you now find yourself floundering up to your shoulders in quicksand!   } {fens} {} {quicksand} {} {1.000} {}
