R {16568} {0} {<238>} {The Black Bog} {<238>( *<088>} {  As you slog your way through this dark liquid, it clings to your feet almost like a glue and wears you down.  Within a few minutes your feet have turned into huge clumps of goo and you struggle to walk.  Looking around for something to scrape it off with, you realize that there are no reeds here.  There are trees but no vegetation on the ground itself.  No wayward sticks lying about, not even a rock or moss.  Odd, it is as though everything on the ground has been swallowed up....   } {fens} {} {dead_forest} {} {1.000} {}
