R {16570} {0} {<238>} {The Dead Grove} {<238>( *<088>} {  The ground is much drier here\; perhaps you can set up a small campsite and make a fire to warm your aching bones.  Walking over to a nearby tree you commence to hack off some low-hanging branches with which to make your fire.  As soon as you cut off the nearest branch, a loud groaning rises from the tree and a strange black liquid sprays you from the cut branch.  Blood, black blood.  Looking up, you see slits of bark peel back to reveal deep brown eyes filled with anger.  This land is truly cursed and these are not your typical trees!   } {fens} {} {dead_forest} {} {1.000} {}
