R {16575} {0} {<238>} {The Black Bog} {<238>( *<088>} {  You find yourself standing in a far corner of this black bog.  As soon as you arrive you realize that was in fact some type of vine growing here.  In fact, there are lots and lots of vines.  They are covered in some sort of dark thorns and seem to writhe about at your presence.  Suddenly a dark tendril shoots out and wraps around your ankle!  It pulls on your leg, and you feel yourself being dragged towards the plant!  Another vine suddenly shoots out and latches on to your arm!  You had better act fast as it suddenly dawns on you just what is going on here.  These vines are trying to capture you, and as you try to pull away those thorns begin to dig into your flesh, causing you to yell out in pain.  The more you struggle, the more they dig in.  You're in real trouble here!   } {fens} {} {dead_forest} {} {1.000} {}
