R {16676} {0} {<238>} {Razor Spine Ridge} {<238>/ \<088>} {  Blinking in the bright sunlight, you find yourself high upon the slopes of a vast mountain range and it seems that you are on the rim of the known  worlds. The wind is chilling at this height and you have a wide view over the lands below. Behind and to either side, the mountains disappear into the far  horizon, while at your feet an endless vista of forest stretches on below you. The mountains are impassable, but there is a trail of sorts leading down from the jagged peaks and to the south, where the forest awaits. } {dhalgora} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
