R {16682} {0} {<228>} {A dark and dangerous thicket} {<228>* *<088>} {  The trees gather in close around you, making it difficult to progress much further in this direction. The air becomes thicker and the humidity rises as  you find yourself in a dead end. The branches of the trees hang low to the  ground and the undergrowth is quite dense, creating a natural, rough wall.   Entwined around the trunks of some of the trees is a long and ropey vine.  Along the length of the vine are bright orange flowers with large yellow  centres. On a closer inspection there are short and very sharp spines  covering the entire length of the vine. } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {pk} {1.000} {}
