R {16684} {0} {<228>} {A gathering of vines} {<228>* *<088>} {  The thick ropey jungle vines seem to be taking over the trees and are  strangling the life out of them. The uppermost branches are still bearing an  abundance of green foliage, but the lower branches are slowly bearing down  under the weight. It is a little darker here, amongst the vines, and the  grove has a spooky feel to it. You could swear you saw a pair of eyes  blinking slowly at you from within a cluster of nearby vines. Unfortunately  the sheer number of vines block your path here and your only choice is to go  back the way you came, if you can find the scant path you took. } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {pk} {1.000} {}
