R {16685} {0} {<248>} {A fetid, subterranean chamber} {<248>% %<088>} {  Having entered the hidden opening in the rock face, you find yourself in a rocky underground chamber. This chamber is quite large and has many openings  leading deeper into the mountains. A deep rumbling shakes the very stones  around you and loose stones fall from the cavern roof in response. A loud  bellowing roar erupts from one of the tunnels and echoes around you, leaving you slightly stunned. Larger stones are knocked loose as, with terrifying  speed, a giant worm leaps out of a tunnel, shaking the foundations of the  chamber, challenging your presence in its home. } {dhalgora} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
