R {16686} {0} {<228>} {A small gully} {<228>* *<088>} {  The forest floor takes a downward turn into a small gully. There is a small  and stagnant lake at the bottom and it would appear that this gully becomes a  natural dam in the heavy rains. The ground is damp and uneven, but solid enough  to ensure firm footing. On the western side of the gully there is a rock face  and perhaps an opening, but there are too many trees around to be sure. Trees rise up on all sides of the small gully, but there seems to be a path to the  south. } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
