R {16687} {0} {<228>} {The Forest of Teeth} {<228>* *<088>} {  There is a faint trail here that can be seen between tree roots that sprawl  over the surface of the ground. In the open and softer parts of the path can  be seen animal tracks of various types. One of the tracks appears to be  deeper, and fresher, than the others, giant paw prints with taloned claws. The sounds of the forest around you seem to have muted and in the hush you  can hear fast running water to the south, but the trees still block your  view. } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
