R {16688} {0} {<148>} {A tumultuous river} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  In the distance a waterfall delivers a deluge of turbulent waters to the  river that divides the forest. The water rushes by the grassy river banks at  an alarming rate before slowing down to a gentle meander further along the  rivers length. A small section of the bank has been carved out by the waters to create lagoon of sorts, some still waters that are perfect for animals to drink from and to catch the occasional fish. Looking for a way to cross the  tumultuous river, you spy a fallen tree that spans the width of the river. } {dhalgora} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
