R {16689} {0} {<228>} {Thick and luscious foliage} {<228>* *<088>} {  The air smells fresh and clean, the trees are tall and strong, the leaves glisten with rain drops and twigs crunch under your feet as,  you walk amongst the thick and luscious foliage. You can hear the  flapping of wings as large birds take flight against your intrusion  into their territories. There is scurrying in the nearby brush as  small animals skitter away to the perceived safety of their burrows.  There are signs that something larger than you has passed by this way  quite often, as there are a number of broken tree limbs and partially  squished shrubbery. } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
