R {16690} {0} {<228>} {A path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  A wide trail winds its way through the dark and dangerous Forest of Teeth. Screeches and roars can be heard in the distance, echoing around the trees  until you have no idea of the actual direction it was coming from. Dried  leaves and small twigs litter the path and crunch under your footsteps. A  slight breeze sends some leaves up into the air briefly, only to settle once  more. This path is the safest way through the forest and as such seems to be  protected by magic, leave it at your peril. To the west is the relative  safety of the plains, while the path continues to the east, heading deeper  and deeper into the forest. } {dhalgora} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
