R {16691} {0} {<228>} {Pushing through the trees} {<228>* *<088>} {  There are trees everywhere, nothing but trees upon trees, til death do you -  well, never mind, that is not the kind of thought to be had in this  forest. This section of the forest seems to be untamed, as there is no clear  path to follow. The lower branches are at the perfect height to slap you in  the face as you walk by, an annoyance to be sure, but no lasting damage.  Large green moths, looking much like the leaves on the trees, flutter around  in erratic motions as they search the nearby trees for sap to nourish their  hunger. As a group of them flutter in the air around you, they give the  impression of leaves swirling endlessly on a gentle breeze. } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
