R {16692} {0} {<228>} {The Forest of Teeth} {<228>* *<088>} {  A sibilant hissing coming from the tree tops catches your attention.  Looking skywards you see a large snake hanging down from one of the large  branches. Very well camouflaged with stripes of brown and vibrant green, they drop onto their prey from above and wrap them in strong scaly coils till the  life is squeezed out of them. This is not to be your fate today. Large red  hibiscus-like flowers decorate some of the fallen trees, bringing life once again to the gentle giants of the forest. } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
