R {16693} {0} {<228>} {A secluded grove} {<228>* *<088>} {  Quite suddenly and most unexpectedly the trees disappear as you step into a secluded grove. There is almost a holy quality to the grove, as if the  presence of an ancient and powerful magic was once used here. Perhaps this  was a druids grove, which is still ringed by oak trees and free of the  undergrowth and bracken that claims the forest floor. This area appears to  be free from the dangers that possess the rest of the forest, perhaps a good place to set up a camp and rest? } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {safe} {1.000} {}
