R {16695} {0} {<228>} {Heading deeper into the forest} {<228>* *<088>} {  The trees crowd close around you, dipping their branches towards the ground  under the weight of a mass of vines. The vines curl lovingly up the trunks of  some of the trees, slithering along the lower branches before drooping to the earth like a curtain, creating lots of places for creatures to hide from the  predators of the forest. Skittering along the forest floor are weird bugs,  like a cockroach crossed with a spider. They seem to be climbing over  everything, so it wouldn't be a good idea to stay still for too long! } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
