R {16696} {0} {<228>} {A sea of bracken} {<228>* *<088>} {  The trees begin to thin and light shines through the treetops in large  patches. Ferns and bracken cover the ground in a tall sea of green fronds, so completely, that the ground is hidden from view. A loud buzzing is heard just off to the side followed by a rattling sound, but there is nothing to be seen. A slight breeze ruffles the fronds and they sway gently, like a  small shiver of excitement running through them. } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
