R {16702} {0} {<228>} {The Forest of Teeth} {<228>* *<088>} {  A gentle layer of mist curls along the ground, brushing against you as you walk through. Reluctantly parting for your passage, it clings to you for a  brief moment, before settling into place once more. Young saplings grow tall  with their umbrella shaped canopies rising above the top layer of the mist.  Small flying creatures, that seem to glow from within, buzz and flit about  the tops of the small trees, chittering to each other and looking at you with  curiosity. } {dhalgora} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
