R {16703} {0} {<228>} {A trail through the plains} {<228>, .<088>} {  There is a faint trail through the plains that leads into the large and  daunting forest to the west. To the east the trail disappears into the vast  plains of Dhal'Gora. From this vantage point the plains look barren and  uninteresting, however, as rumours have it, the dangers lie hidden. In  the distance there is a hawk circling in the air above. } {dhalgora} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
