R {16704} {0} {<228>} {The plains of Dhal'Gora} {<228>, .<088>} {  The trail from the forest has ended and the vast plains disappear into  the horizon. The plains aren't as flat and lifeless as they first appeared.  There are lots of jackalopes bounding around the place and some sitting  so still that their antlers blend in with the tall grasses. To the south  it looks like there is a herd of animals wandering around the plains.  There are the occasional clump of trees, which offer shelter from the  hot midday sun. } {dhalgora} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
