R {16705} {0} {<228>} {The vast plains of Dhal'Gora} {<228>, .<088>} {  Long grasses wave gently in the breeze and large dragonflies hover in the  air. There are some crude huts gathered together, made from the grasses and  stretched animal hide.  A large fire pit in the centre contains the hot,  burning coals of a dying fire, and a largish animal is skewered across the  top, slowly roasting in its own juices. } {dhalgora} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
