R {16706} {0} {<228>} {The plains of Dhal'Gora} {<228>, .<088>} {  The plains stretch on before you to the horizons and back again, with very  little in between. On your trek across the plains you come across a large gash in the earth, where a riverbed has run dry. There are stones and debris in the bottom and it is easy enough to scramble across to the other side. Some trees  are scattered along the old river banks, but they are half dead and stand  skeletal against the blue sky. } {dhalgora} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
