R {16707} {0} {<228>} {The plains of Dhal'Gora} {<228>, .<088>} {  The uneven ground is pitted with burrows, which are hidden in the long  grasses. A sibilant hissing noise quietly touches your ears and the grasses  sway in the still air, before settling down again. The deep and throaty  coughing roar of a predator echoes in the near silence of the plains and birds take flight in a flurry of wings, feathers drifting to the ground behind them.  } {dhalgora} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
