R {16709} {0} {<228>} {Outside the gates of Eyllisneldth} {<228>` ^<088>} {  The gates of the High Elven city stand to the east, while the plains of  Dhal'Gora patiently wait to the west. The high elven city is ringed with a  high wall of stone that has seen some battle damage. Flying high above  the walls are bright and colourful flags and banners, which flap noisily  in the breeze. There are a couple of gate guards checking all who pass,  their duty is to stop only those declared unwelcome by their laws. } {dhalgora} {} {field4} {} {1.000} {}
