R {16710} {0} {<278>} {Eyllisneldth, the High-Elven Capital} {<278>. .<088>} {  Standing inside the city gates, the splendour of the high elves greet you.  The city is clean and orderly, as the elves take great pride in what is  theirs. The streets are wide and clean and the citizens are well dressed.  There is no poverty here, as the elves look after their own. In the distance  are tall, regal towers, that have an air of magic about them. Trees grow along side the roadways and are carefully tended to and flower beds decorate the  side of the buildings. } {dhalgora} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
