R {16711} {0} {<278>} {A guest house} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Pretty lavender and lilac wisteria drape over the outer walls, framing  the windows and filling the air with a heady fragrance. This delightful and  magical house caters for the guests of the elves. It is large and comfortable  and has many rooms. Food is magically delivered every meal time and the housekeeping just gets done, the elves certainly know how to look after  their visitors. } {dhalgora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
