R {16712} {0} {<138>} {Apothecary} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  There are two rows of simple beds lining the side walls, some of which  are occupied. The room is clinically clean but decorated with plants and  flowers, creating a more natural setting to help heal the spirit as well  as the body. The apothecary itself is through the door at the rear of the  room, where private quarters have also been set up. } {dhalgora} {} {shop} {shop} {1.000} {}
