R {16713} {0} {<278>} {Magician's Quarters} {<278>. .<088>} {  This is the main part of the city, as most of the elves train in the arcane.  There are tall towers, with dimensional pockets, that house the more prominent families. The stone work of all the buildings and fences is exquisite in its  delicate beauty, with lots of arches and scrollwork.  Climbing plants flow  over some of the buildings and walls, decorating them with green leaves and  small white flowers. } {dhalgora} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
