R {16714} {0} {<278>} {The library} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  All the information of the elves is gathered together in this wondrous  collection that spans the centuries. Rows upon rows of leather bound books line the shelves of all the rooms, all magically kept dust free and in  perfect condition. There is a quite murmur and rustling of pages as  people search through the books and drink of their knowledge. } {dhalgora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {16713} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {16715} {0} {<278>} {Residential area} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The less notable families make their homes here, though the buildings are  not less magnificent than the rest of the city. The streets are wide and well  paved, and the houses have delightful gardens on their window ledges.  Elven  children run through the streets playing with each other, the sounds of their  laughter tinkling merrily in the air. } {dhalgora} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
