R {16716} {0} {<138>} {Open air market} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  The busy market place has a festive quality to it, as the citizens delight  in trading with each other for goods that they need. Artisans sell their hand  made wares, and unique items can be made to order.  The market is near the  eastern edge of the city and the walls are very close by. There is an archway  that leads into one of the towers that will take you to the top of the walls.  To the north is a large park. } {dhalgora} {} {shop} {shop} {1.000} {}
