R {16724} {0} {<228>} {Tree covered hills} {<228>. ^<088>} {  Sparse trees dot the low hills that mark the boundary between the Forest  of Teeth and the southern slopes of Razor Spine Ridge. The forest blankets the lands to the west and north, while the mountains rise up like a wall to  the south. A tiny creek flows down from the hills and into the forest, making  an ideal pathway for the unwary. The trees sway gently in the breeze, their  leaves shimmering in the clear air. Open burrows are scattered around the terrain and if you look closely you can see the eyes of the occupants  watching your passage. } {dhalgora} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
