R {16725} {0} {<228>} {The base of the mountain range} {<228>. ^<088>} {  Gentle rolling hills make an idyllic setting against the harsh mountains  to the east and the dangerous forest to the west. A large, lake has formed  in one of the gullies, its crystal clear waters mirroring the trees and  hills on the shoreline. A soft mist is dancing on the surface of the lake, slowly dissipating in the gentle breeze. Beautiful wildflowers are scattered  about the edge of the lake and copses of fruit bearing trees grow nearby. A small stream flows from the lake towards the forest below, the waters meandering along slowly. } {dhalgora} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
