R {16726} {0} {<238>} {The southern slopes of Razor Spine Ridge} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  As you traverse the rocky mountain pass, you come across some blackened  rocks and the remains of burnt trees. The smell of rotting meat assaults  your senses as you approach, causing you to gag slightly. Large, cumbersome  birds slowly rise into the air as you get closer, their stomachs gorged on  the rotten feast below, their black wings beating loudly in the air, fanning  the unholy stench towards you. A branch snaps under the weight of one of the birds as it seeks a perch, sending it tumbling to the ground. } {dhalgora} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
