R {16727} {0} {<238>} {The slopes of Razor Spine Ridge} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  Small stones skitter down the mountainside, clacking against the larger  rocks and bouncing off the trees. A hawk flies high in the air, searching  the slopes for the unwary rodent, its solitary cry echoing off the steep  rocky slopes. To the east, some boulders are scattered at the base of a  cliff face, behind which there is a large dark opening. Further down the mountainside there is the sound of bubbling water, and at the base of the mountains there is the beginnings of a large swamp that stretches as far  as the eye can see to the north. } {dhalgora} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
