R {16872} {0} {<278>} {The Room of Elders} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This large, dimly lit room is a gathering place.  A place where the powerful, the strong, meet.  A place where magic is not only common and accepted, but necessary.  The chamber's depths are mostly confusing to those not of the magical sort, with etchings lining the walls, small bookcases wherein lie books of the strangest titles, and rat skulls placed at seemingly random intervals along the floor.  A low, almost inaudible, thrumming hum fills the void of silence in the room.  The reverberation is so low and deep-pitched, it almost seems that the ground itself is vibrating madly.  Against the back wall is painted a most curious symbol, one of twisting snakes and implied horror and insanity.  This is definitely a place where evil works.   } {deadlights} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
