R {16874} {0} {<268>} {The Lake of Storms} {<268>. .<088>} {  There is not much visible directly above the Lake of Storms.  Broad sheets of purple, green, and utter blackness sweep across the lake in dreadful, absolute chaos.  Rays of crimson, emerald, and orange dart through the spray, diverting colors into dazzling rainbows, arcing across the lake like lightning strikes and bouncing off the steep rock walls.  Although the hypnotic bands of color don't seem to be entirely physical, when they pass through living flesh, a taint of complete hopelessness, despair, and terror cascade throughout the being, leading the mind to madness and the flesh into black decay.  The lake itself seems to be entirely formed of these strange bands of light, and an estimation of its depth seems impossible.  To fall in would quickly follow into something worse than death.  These colors are slowly drifting upwards, into the dark stormclouds above the castle.  A large, glowing portal of some kind filled with brilliant blue light is suspended in the air here.  To enter the portal is to willingly invite insanity.   } {deadlights} {} {air} {} {1.000} {}
