R {16875} {128} {<148>} {The Room of Transcendental Passage} {<148>. .<088>} {  This chamber looks just like any underground chamber - lots of dirt and rock.  Closer inspection shows discrepancies, like the delicately carved pillars that were formed directly from the rock walls.  A mangled skeleton lies against the north wall, its grinning skull looking out on this ancient room forever.  What looks like a large doorway is set in the middle of the room.  It resembles a portal much more than a doorway, since this one leads (apparently) nowhere.  Strong magic is evidently at work here, as the doorway of the portal is flowing with a strong blue liquid.  To step through is to escape this strange reality and return to a somewhat sane universe.  To go further is to ask for death, or even worse, madness.   } {deadlights} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
