R {16876} {128} {<148>} {The Burial Grounds} {<148>. .<088>} {  This long, wide hallway is a memorium for the dead.  Faded, ancient hieroglyphics are indecipherable to anyone not from this universe, and they cover the walls and floor.  Niches are cut perpendicular into the walls on either side every few feet, each a final resting place for the beings who made this place.  The aging skeletons are in no way human.  Their skeletal bones show no arms, but long, thin bones that look like they were some sort of tails replacing human appendages.  Their teeth (no, call them what they are: fangs) look as sharp as steel blades, and are so long it's a wonder they could truly eat in life.  Their civilization may be extinct, and hopefully they are, because this was not a docile race.   } {deadlights} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
