R {16877} {128} {<148>} {Ascension to the Surface} {<148>. .<088>} {  This large room has no ceiling, or it is very high above.  The stifling darkness does not help in the least, yet a few rays of dim light have managed to penetrate down into this stark crypt.  Stairs are cut in the wall, spiralling further up and up.  The steps themselves are uncomfortably spaced for human design - they are much wider apart, and very steep.  The only sign of (previous) life is an old skeleton that was viciously torn asunder by rusting steel blades extending from the wall on the steps.  The skeleton is of human origin.  From what was seen down here, the world above must be very strange, indeed.   } {deadlights} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
