R {16878} {128} {<148>} {The Burial Grounds} {<148>. .<088>} {  The hallway continues on in both directions, and either side is filled with the remains of the deceased.  Many of the skeletons show signs of a violent death.  More symbols are carved everywhere, even on the ceiling.  Whether they are warnings about disturbing the dead, magical runes, or simply telling the history of their race is not to be decided, since they are unintelligable.  Why there are magical portals residing in such a place can only be imagined - perhaps they used the life force of the dead resting in these walls to power them.  Something else has definitely opened the portals now.  Maybe the mages in the castle were responsible for that.  Intelligent races have not travelled these halls in a long time, but the door has been unsealed.  Secrets aren't meant to last forever.   } {deadlights} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
