R {16914} {128} {<278>} {A Room of Crystals} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The uncountable, magnificent forest of crystals continues into this opening, which leads into a rather small orifice.  The light continues to emanate here also, sending remarkable patterns of lights dancing and tumbling in dizzying paths around everything.  Set in the back of the chamber is a heavyset iron portal, and it is the source of an overpowering bluish glow that reflects havoc from the clear formations that surround it.  } {deadlights} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {16913} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {16876} {enter iron} {enter iron} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {16915} {128} {<278>} {Concentrated Shafts of Pure Whiteness} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The magnificent, radiant cavern of glittering crystals that preceded this chamber is like a drunk playing a violin compared to a symphony.  Continuous waves of blinding white light roll forth neverending as beams of brilliance refract from the millions of giant crystal formations that exist in all directions.  The arcing beams become more and more concentrated, forming shattering shafts of pure whiteness, gleaming everywhere as if one were looking directly at the sun.  Within the center of the chamber lies the awe-inspiring source of ultimate brightness that threatens sanity.  Glowing like a miniature sun in itself, a gigantic crystal stone lies on a dais of complex patterns of fantastic beauty and sadness.  This place has been consigned to the realms of Forever and Eternity.  Whoever built these creations has long been condemned there, as well.   } {deadlights} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {16913} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {16916} {128} {<228>} {On the Battlefield of Armageddon} {<228>, `<088>} {  Absolute chaos churns and swims as far as any eye can see across a vast battlefield marred with the blood and ichor of uncountable opponents.  This is the Day of Wrath, the Last Reckoning, when the skies grow dark and the sun is extinguished from all skies.  The blood of the masses pours like a crimson sea that creatures of all types swarm through, barbarians hacking at dragons, wizards soaring with lightning velocity across the legions while charring ettins with fireballs.  Giant horrifying bubble-like protrusions float serenely in the air, reaching out with slimy tentacles and devouring living things whole one after another.  Countless enemies hack and slice while they wade and stumble over the infinite numbers of the dead and dying. } {deadlights} {} {field} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {16917} {128} {<228>} {The War That Ends All Wars} {<228>, `<088>} {  Skies as black as the deepest chasm look on with dead eyes as explosions rock off, one after the other in deep *THUDS* that follow with an unbearably loud *KAWHAAP*.  The reign of anarchy is a solid line in all directions across the dark plain, all of them ignoring in their bloodthirst while a gigantic unspeakable that blanks the mind and wrings the sanity away suddenly explodes with deafening repurcussions.  The entity disintegrates in large pieces, falling onto the mobs below.  A huge armada of silvery dragons roars their screams in triumph as the demon falls, even as they turn into combat with a rising tide of uncountable other dark beings.  Sharp lines of pencil-thin wires leap across the battlefield, glowing like plasma and tearing apart anything they touch.  The wails of the injured and dying are lost in the screams and roars of anger, victory, and betrayal.   } {deadlights} {} {field} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {16918} {0} {<228>} {The Final Conflict} {<228>, `<088>} {  To see bloodshed of this magnitude is staggering to the mind and soul.  With unconscious abandon the vast armies fight for forgotten causes, lost deeply within abandoned orders and confused intentions.  A swarm of large bee-like insects descends on a group of humanoid creatures, taking only a moment to devour and moving on to others.  Crackling energy explodes from a far source, shredding through a pack of manticores.  Suddenly there is a shattering roar as the ground explodes, something large, black, and scaly driving its tremendous bulk out of the earth and into the open.  Breathing large gusts of energy and swirling the air with hurricane force, the being drives forth all before its presence.  An army of knights are destroyed hopelessly while sorcerors blast the creature to no harm.  A sheet of blinding force descends like a wall down onto the battlefield, cutting the greater daemon in half and destroying an endless amount of other beings.   } {deadlights} {} {field} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {16919} {128} {<228>} {Reign of Anarchy} {<228>, `<088>} {  Smoke lies like a dense fog across the battle-torn plain, concealing the bloodshed.  Occasionally swarms of energy will flicker through the smoke like distant flashes of lightning.  Dragons and other flying creatures soar above the fray, fighting with each other and joining other conflicts below.  Fireballs and explosions roar in blinding succession across the battlefield. Over it all in the background lies the steady thrum of energy that streams above the fighting, like a giant forcefield high up in the sky, above the grasp of most mortal creatures.  Within the vast realm of slaughter, this is the only place where a small concentrated shaft of sunlight streams down from above.   } {deadlights} {} {field} {pk} {1.000} {}
