R {16920} {0} {<228>} {Within the Conflict} {<228>, `<088>} {  Cannons are periodically fired from the multitude of ships that float with surprising ease and swiftness through the parting mists.  The sharp reek of fiery gunpowder and the metallic taste of fear hangs over the bloody battlefield.  A slaughter in all directions, there appears to be no victors for long.  A rain of ash has begun drifting over the combatants, dusting everything with powderish film.  The ground beneath is a massive, grisly carpet of trampled and battered corpses, lying in the blood of the damned.   } {deadlights} {} {field} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {16921} {128} {<228>} {Above the Battleground} {<228>, `<088>} {  As the dense clouds of warfare fall away below, the blazing jewels of the firmament erupt in all of their glory, far above.  In the distance, the teeny and unimportant sound of thousands fighting for their lives echoes away into one continuous feedback of death.  The moon looks as if it has been filled with blood.  The stench of the dying has faded, leaving the air relatively clean and free of corruption.  Unimaginable as it may be, the calmness in the surrounding atmosphere compared to the chaos below leaves a feeling of well-being and serenity.   } {deadlights} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
