R {16922} {0} {<228>} {The Plane of Judgement} {<228>, `<088>} {  Hanging several hundreds of feet above the massive battlefield, there is no visible surface upon which to stand, yet flying is unnecessary.  Some sort of force field applies an invisible walking area, while simultaneously preventing those below from noticing the spectators high above them.  This gives a bird's eye view of the life and death circumstances that are being played out.  Far, far above, a much more dramatic scene is unfolding.  The stars - those eternal beings that all looked upon since the beginning of Time - are slowly, but surely, disappearing.  Flickering out like an aged candle, one by one those passive watchers of the universe are dying.   } {deadlights} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
