R {16925} {0} {<278>} {The Torrent} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The deepest pits in hell are the closest resemblance to draw bearing from within this miasma of conflicting elements.  Countless bands of liquid metal permeate the cosmic mix of rock, plasma, and gaseous streams that percolate like a celestial melting pot.  Incredible pressures fight for balance within the chaotic jumble, along with a terrifying, confusing array of magnetic and gravity effects, with others that are less identifiable.  There is nothing remotely relative in this type of situation.   } {deadlights} {} {inside} {maze} {1.000} {}

R {16926} {0} {<248>} {Swept in the Currents} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  Far below, like a distant memory, lies the horrible, raging torrent.  All about the aquatic surroundings possess a plain, grayish appearance, looking nearly uniform in all directions, except towards the east, where a great wall floats in the middle of this drab world like a long-forgotten dream.  A tiny speck in the dark confines of the giant wall deceive the senses, a tiny passageway a great distance away.  The wall is very large, indeed, and stretches upwards and down as far as can be perceived.  Tremendous, powerful currents of almost unimaginable magnitude battle like giants across the emptiness.   } {deadlights} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
E {16929} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

