R {16936} {128} {<148>} {A Secret Exit} {<148>. .<088>} {  An air pocket, more of a niche, rises up out of the raging waters of the Styx. This small alcove makes a nice resting place, and the glowing portal set in the back wall offers some delightful possibilities.  To return to the Styx or enter the portal?  An interesting question.   Okay, you've found one of the several hidden exits out of the Deadlights. If you need to leave, use it. Otherwise, keep it in mind for later. } {deadlights} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
