R {16939} {128} {<148>} {In the Hold} {<148>. .<088>} {  The black, rocky walls of the cavern to the east have been abruptly changed into a mixture of ruddy, dark ores that have been carved from the rock, a grab bag of iron, copper, silver, and others too mutilated or obscure to identify.  The lining of the chamber is harsh and chaotic, as if it were natural, or someone carved the room by thought, not caring how it was cut, just getting the job done.  Within the center, a depression curves the floor into a descending whirlpool of metal like a funnel.  At the bottom lies a silverish pool that glitters magically.  The bottom of the pool isn't visible.   } {deadlights} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
