R {16940} {128} {<248>} {The Sea of Eternal Torment} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  The raging waters boil and percolate with mixtures of organic cocktails, the currents stretching wide and swirling forcefully in all visible directions.  This seems to be the building place for the Dark One's creations, the workplace for his plans of building a giant army to regulate and uphold his rule after the completion of his ambitions.  Strange creatures float and travel through the currents, embodiments of a very dark and twisted imagination.  This environment seems almost peaceful after some of the earlier trials.   } {deadlights} {} {underwater} {maze} {1.000} {}

