R {16950} {128} {<278>} {The Cavern of Shadows} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The cavernous outreaches of this tremendous chamber stretch upwards on both sides, out of sight above in the distance.  The darkened shadows drift downward in hard contrast to reality, smothering everything in a black fog-like translucency.  The wrenching cries and howls of the tortured damned no longer resound against these walls, although a thin string of spirits and a smattering of colors drift northwards to the Dark One.  His power finally fully unleashed, the foulest and most evil of his creations dominate these halls, awaiting to defy the forces of the White.   } {deadlights} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {16951} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
