R {16951} {0} {<278>} {The Guardians of the Shadows} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  All of the colors in everything within these caverns seem to have been drained away, leeched just like the spirits by Yog-Sothoth, the Dark One.  His fiends and constructs guard him like armor, intently watching and waiting for any forces, and instantly aware of any threats.  Slapping and sucking sounds, yells and cackles emanate from the darkness, the shadows that fall over it all.  A terrifying, numbing cold and a powerful, unearthly sense of dread and doom radiate in waves from the northern reaches.   } {deadlights} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {16952} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {16952} {0} {<278>} {The Trials of Suffering} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The dark shades and insane creations come forth in waves, defending their master.  The deepening shadows of blackness press down harder as the end grows closer, permeating and joining with all of the living, and unliving, forms that dwell within these damned and harrowing chambers.  The terrifying power of evil that comes from the north is becoming nearly unbearable, rising and rising into a climax that never comes.  With every inch further, the repulsion coming from the master of darkness grows stronger and stronger.  He seems to be everywhere, simply waiting.   } {deadlights} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {16953} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {16953} {0} {<278>} {Into the Deadlights} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Finally... The end of it all, the final apocalyptic showdown between the  forces of darkness and the coming of the White. Yog-Sothoth sits here among  his dark creatures surrounded in an aura of oppressive evil on a throne of  twisted bones, all like a scene from a nightmare drawn into epic proportions. An exhilirating, awe-inspiring haze fills the air, strange feelings from a  dream, feelings of great events hanging in the balance, the universe holding  its breath in one fatalistic moment. Darkness pervades all, and only  Yog-Sothoth is lit in a web of strange shadows. His face, still from the  first, draws up into a ghoulish, demonic grin that sends horror and terror  hurtling down into the bones. } {deadlights} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {16949} {enter pool} {enter pool} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

