R {18329} {0} {<178>} {Ynnas Mon Icebridge} {<178>^ ~<088>} {  One of the most spectacular features in all Gelidus is the famous icebridge of Ynnas Mon.  It stretches from the shore, arcing out over the ocean, eventually landing on the frozen shores of the island of Ynnas.  At its highest point, it reaches well over 600 feet above the surface of the ocean.  Without the support of some unknown, arcane magic, this structure would have collapsed instantly - yet no traces of enchantments can be detected.  The bridge itself is very slippery, and the possibility of a long drop into the cold ocean below, compels you to walk carefully.   } {gelidus} {} {icehills} {} {1.000} {}
