R {19271} {0} {<268>} {Kuolema River} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  Through Kuolema, Lake Pirullisuus empties its water into the ocean.  The river consists of rapids and falls, making it impossible to raft.  The banks of the river are lined with birch and alder.  Once every year, salmon brave the rapids to travel to Pirullisuus.  This event attracts many of the bears inhabiting the forests of Peikkoniemimaa, who come to eat the tasty fish.   } {gelidus} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
