R {19531} {0} {<238>} {The Desolate Valley} {<238>/ \<088>} {  This is a dark and desolate valley, the rock walls rising sharply on both sides, attempting to grasp the heavens.  Dark, ominous thunderheads threaten the skies, rumbling their presence through the rocky terrain.  White streaks of lightning arc down across the visible landscape and dance among the clouds.  A steady, powerful gust of wind blows strongly between the canyon walls.  The way grows rockier and more dangerous as the path continues north, discouraging progress.   } {desolation} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
