R {19541} {0} {<238>} {On a Narrow Ledge} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The rocky ground flattens about twenty feet above the handholds, and leads into a small enclosed area where a hut has been built, in the middle of nowhere.  The dwelling seems quite safe here for living, and in fact looks lived in.  The walls surrounding the building rise for some time before breaking against the purple sky.  There is no exit but down.   } {desolation} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
