R {19542} {0} {<278>} {Inside The Hut} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you step into the hut, you immediately smell the fresh skins that lie around the hut in various stages of curing.  Bone, rock, and leather ornaments decorate the walls.  Masks, necklaces, various tools and weapons, and a large handwoven picture give the walls an air of home.  Leather skins lie over the floor, and wooden bowls and cups rest on the crude wooden table that rests in the center of the small room.   } {desolation} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {19541} {s} {open s;s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {19544} {0} {<238>} {The Suspension Bridge} {<238>===<088>} {  The ground falls sharply into a wide gorge perhaps a hundred feet across. A rickety wooden and rope bridge lies suspended over the deep chasm, crossing to the other side.  Many of the wooden planks are missing, and it looks dangerous.  Across the gorge, and further into the mountains, the trail continues.  The entire scene is tainted with a purplish color from the broiling clouds overhead, and rain appears imminent.   } {desolation} {} {bridge} {} {1.000} {}
E {19539} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
