R {19545} {0} {<238>} {Below the Bridge} {<238>/ \<088>} {  You are dangling against the wall just below the suspension bridge, which lies inches above you.  The wall here is rough, and there are ample handholds.  This does not appear to be a safe position to be in for long.  The pit below leads into blackness.   } {desolation} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
