R {19546} {0} {<238>} {Clinging to the Cliff} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The suspension bridge lies a good distance above now, as loose rocks crumble from the wall and fall into nothingness.  Below, there appears to be a narrow ledge jutting from the wall.  The wind is blowing dangerously, and only one minor mistake could send you plummeting to your death below.   } {desolation} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
