R {19549} {0} {<238>} {Crossing the Bridge} {<238>/ \<088>} {  This long, wooden bridge does not appear to be very sound anymore.  It sways and twists alarmingly in the stiff wind flowing through this open area.  The ropes are frayed and aged, giving you a very uncomfortable feeling.  The darkness lies below, stretched into infinity.   } {desolation} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
