R {19550} {0} {<238>} {West of the Gorge} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The mountains once again lay a path beyond the western side of the suspension bridge.  The narrow, rocky trail curves sharply upwards and to the right, twisting its way through the rock like a snake.  The climbing looks precarious here, and you watch your step carefully.   } {desolation} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
