R {19551} {0} {<238>} {The Upward Spiral} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The path continues sharply upwards, and slowly curves to the right.  After ascending around forty feet, it rises so sharply it is nearly perpendicular.  The path is narrow, and the walls surrounding it rise above the clouds.  The air is colder here, and frost covers the ground.   } {desolation} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
