R {19555} {0} {<238>} {A Faint, Icy Trail} {<238>/ \<088>} {  This little-used path curves between the mountain walls, slowly ascending.  Snow lies in drifts along the walls, and the brisk wind scatters it in all directions.  Snow is falling in pretty heavy amounts, and to travel in this weather is dangerous.  The ground ascends at a fairly steep angle upwards and to the west, where it levels off above.   } {desolation} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
