R {19676} {128} {<278>} {The Palace of the Sky} {<278>. .<088>} {  You stand on a white floor of marble covered with star dust.  Pillars of marble support the glowing orb above you.  Your breath is taken away by the sight of the sun rising in the north.  And you can see below you the world, glowing in the new dawn.  Before you, an altar holds the body of Georfarm.  In death he looks at peace, his evil washed away in the final burst of power from the dawn.   } {darklight} {} {city} {safe} {1.000} {}

R {19678} {0} {<238>} {A Crack in the Mountain} {<238>/ \<088>} {  A massive mountain looms out of the sea. It is magnificent, and certainly  worthy of a tavern tale. It is composed of some sort of brilliant white  material, which seems crystalline in nature. The crystal is extremely hard,  and sharp at the edges. It has some smoky translucence, but it's difficult to see through it for more than a couple of meters. There is a huge crack here  which leads downwards into the mountain. Something glints deep in its dark  depths, which makes it seem as though the mountain is composed of the same  crystalline material throughout. Light doesn't carry far into the crack; the  bottom cannot be seen. } {terra} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
