R {19680} {128} {<238>} {Further into the mountain} {<238>/ \<088>} {  Deeper into the mountain, light from the outside has begun to fade. The paths are beginning to look confusing in the dim light, especially with all the  reflections off the walls. Strange creatures roam these corridors; rare  creatures of legend. Many look dangerous, yet they seem unable to pass the  magical barriers into the main crack. The crack continues downwards, where  light seems to disappear completely. It may be wise to turn back while one  still can, and live to tell the tale. } {terra} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
