R {19681} {128} {<238>} {In the Depths of a mountain} {<238>/ \<088>} {  This deep in the mountain, the light from above barely brightens the  darkness. The crystal walls here are darker, with a black, ashen hue. Light  no longer reflects well from them; some might even consider the darkness a  welcome respite from the blinding reflections above. The sound of creatures  is diminished too, unlike the noise of footsteps heard above. But it seems  one is not alone here in the eerie silence. Shadows pass along the corridors, and there is a sense of malevolence in the branching paths. The crack extends further downward yet. From the pattern of cracks however, something has  become apparent; they run outward towards the top of the mountain. Whatever  split this mountain did so from within... Whatever it is probably resides  below... } {terra} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
