R {19682} {0} {<238>} {Lost in a mountain} {<238>/ \<088>} {  Inky blackness pervades the area here. The crystal walls have become  extremely smooth, taking on an inky black hue. Some strange magic dominates  the area too, for compasses have gone crazy; spinning wildly, and navigation  has become extremely confusing. The barriers here are the strongest, burning  at a touch. Movement can be heard from behind them in the corridors. A  pounding, chanting noise. Something moves deep within the mountain here. In  the darkness, it can be vaguely seen that the crack leads still further down,  and there seems to be a little light shining there. Dare you approach? } {terra} {} {mountain} {maze} {1.000} {}
