R {19686} {0} {<238>} {A bend in the corridor} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  Rounding the corner, a wild demon appears! It looks huge, has red skin, and  is staring straight at you, one clawed hand extended. It does not move  however, for the demon seems to be trapped within the clear crystal walls. There is no life in its eyes, and it looks long dead, frozen in that stance  for eternity. Its origins are a mystery, and there is nothing here that  explains what might have transpired. } {terra} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
