R {19687} {0} {<238>} {A sharp turn} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  The path makes a sharp bend here, almost unnoticeable due to the clarity of  the glass-like walls. Judging by some smudges on the crystal wall, it looks  like someone probably walked straight into the wall without realising it. The clear, glass-like crystal walls are really hard though, so that must have hurt! Following the path, it appears to be turning back towards the crack in  the middle of the mountain. This might be a good thing; who knows what might  lie deeper in the recesses of the mountain? } {terra} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
