R {19689} {0} {<238>} {A vast cavern} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  You have entered a vast cavern. Within it, you see several of your regular  mountain-inhabiting creatures mill about; orcs, gremlins, kobolds... As you  watch, you see a chunk of crystal break off from the wall suddenly! As it  falls to the ground, it starts to dissolve, and an orc rises from the ground. You realise that somehow, some strange magic is forming these creatures from  the crystal. As you touch the crystal wall nearest to you, you realise that  the crystalline substance might be crystallized mana! But a few grams of that takes massive amounts of magical power and energy to form... Could anything  possibly exist that could form a mountain out of the substance? } {terra} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
E {19688} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
