R {19691} {0} {<238>} {A tight squeeze} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  The corridor here has narrowed suddenly, and there is only a tight passageway onwards. The walls are covered with jagged crystalline protrusions, and care  is necessary to avoid cutting oneself on them. A cool draft rolls down the  corridor, carrying the scent of earth, like freshly cut grass. The source of  it is unknown however. } {terra} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
