R {20016} {0} {<278>} {An Ancient Tomb} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The water that floods in after you passes out of the room through a drain in the center.  Directly in front of you is a tiny circular hole in the wall at about eye-level.  Concentric circles cut into the stone radiate from that spot, each brought to attention by the eerie bright green light that each casts across the room to fall on you.  You hear a groan, and the section of wall outlined by the circles begins to project from the wall.  Within moments, a section the length of a coffin is protruding, and the upper half of the stone cylinder divides in two as it opens out, allowing a decaying human form to rise from its grave.   } {cataclysm} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
