R {20028} {0} {<278>} {[1;35mRestroom[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is possibly the cleanest restroom you've ever been in, lit brilliantly by a series of hallowed lights, cunningly embedded in glass panels in the ceiling.  Opulence and finery surrounds you, from the crystalline brickwork surrounding the entrance, to the highly polished marble floor, and the dark mahogany partitions of the bathroom stalls.  Potted ferns and tropical plants are placed discretely here and there, and small oriental pictographs are hung in aesthetically pleasing intervals along the walls.  A faint aroma of jasmine fills the room, leaving you feeling relaxed and invigorated.   } {gaardian} {} {inside} {safe,healer} {1.000} {}
