R {20155} {128} {<278>} {Dian Cecht's Apothecary} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  AAAACHHHOOOOOOOO!!!!!  The pungent aroma of herbs tickles your nose and causes your eyes to water a little.  The room is dim and cool to preserve the potency of these medicines.  Along one side you see many shelves and below them a counter.  The shelves are filled with various bags, bottles, and containers.  On the counter sits a mortar, a set of scales, and some -very- sharp knives.  A small cauldron is bubbling over the fire in one corner.  In the middle of the room is a plain oak table, scrubbed spotlessly clean.  A pair of stools sits to one side.  On another wall, below the single window, several shelves of books can be seen.  Even though you strain, you can't read their titles.  Maybe you can get that willowbark tea here?   } {tirna} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
