R {20156} {0} {<278>} {Inside the Castle of Tuatha de Danaan} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are in a small entrance hall.  The walls are made of silver veined, white marble, with the blocks so carefully fitted that not a seam is visible.  In front of you is an arch.  Through it you can hear the hum of voices and merrymaking.  To your left is a staircase leading to the next floor.  On the wall to your right hangs a silk tapestry.  Out of the corner of your eye, it seems that the stitched figures move, but when you look closer, you think you may have been mistaken.  But were you?  An engraved plaque is set into the floor.   } {tirna} {Key on Airemed} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
