R {20328} {0} {<138>} {A Sandy Beach} {<138>, `<088>} {  There is a rocky cove to the north, but here, a sandy beach leads up to drier land. The water is a gorgeous turquoise color, and as it is protected from  the open ocean by a wide reef, the waves merely lap at your feet. } {sendhian} {} {beach} {} {1.000} {}
