R {20329} {0} {<228>} {A Narrow Trail} {<228>* *<088>} {  A narrow, sandy trail leads from the beach towards a dense forest. Tall but  sparsely leafed palm trees line the path, casting welcome shade. Parrots and  macaws caw at one another, deafening in their competition to rule the  airwaves. As the forest approaches, you see something slithering in the  undergrowth. } {sendhian} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
