R {20330} {0} {<228>} {A Jungle Trail} {<228>* *<088>} {  The trail leads through a verdant tangle of leaves, vines and ferns. As you  wind your way, slicing at the foliage blocking your way, you hear the calls  of jungle birds, vying for attention, or calling out in warning. A moth, the  color of mustard and chocolate flits and lands on a wide frond, slowly  batting its wings, then takes off. } {sendhian} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
