R {20472} {0} {<268>} {Calm waters} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  The waters of Aphasia flow right past the southernmost tip of Minos here. White capped waves crash against the bleached sand, and the light misty sea spray adds to the chill in the air.  An oppressive gloom hangs over the area, and though the sun shines, it gives no warmth.  Yet the waters here are calm and subdued, as though they have had a long voyage and finally returned home.  The light breeze upon your cheek contains a slight wiff of burnt wood.  The smell appears to come from the far east where Melchos, the ruined keep, stands.  North from here, the ground turns from white sand to blackened, rocky soil.   } {minos} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
