R {20473} {0} {<268>} {A foul beach} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  The sea breeze on this shore feels like a clinging putrid wind.  You smell fear, death and hatred all rolled into one.  It assails your very senses and weaves its way into your armor, seeking to tear you apart, limb from limb.  The waves crash against the rocks and boulders with a vengeance and fury, setting up sea sprays a few meters high.  The water feels stinging and warm, akin to that of a hot spring.  Yet, you feel a foulness that makes your skin crawl.  It would not be wise to drink from these waters.  Northwards, the shore opens out into a field, while the entrance to Minos lies to the west.   } {minos} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
