R {20474} {0} {<268>} {Remains of a ruined garrison} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  A wrecked naval base stands forlornly by the shore.  It used to serve Minos as a garrison to deter invasion from the southwest.  The combined strength of the forces of good trampled over it, leaving nothing alive behind.  You see ghostly figures coming out from the collapsed entrance.  Their insubstantial uniforms marking them as former officers.  They stand silently gazing at you with their hollow eyes.  Northwards and westwards, the lands open into fields and you hear the distant cries of a raging battle.   } {minos} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
