R {20475} {0} {<268>} {A ghostly pier} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  You see majestic ghost warships docked at this pier.  Their sails endorsed with the symbol of Minos and their flags bear the mark of Asterion. It would be a fabulous sight were it not for the fact that the crew were fighting everywhere.  From the shores to the decks, warriors of all sorts are engaged in close quarter combat.  Suddenly, a sail from one of the ships catches an ephemeral fire and in moments, the entire ship is ablaze.  Riggings snap and the prevailing wind forces the ship to crash into others around it.  Havoc and pandemonium ensues.  Friend and foes alike flee the scene, some jump overboard, while others scramble to shore.  One by one, the pride of the Minotaur naval fleet falls again like dominoes, their hulls breached and sails torn.   } {minos} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
