R {20476} {0} {<268>} {A bloody shore} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  The sands on this shore have been tainted by the bloodbath fought aeons ago.  You see a row of ghostly elven archers firing their arrows in unison at the ethereal forms of Minotaur villagers fleeing out to sea.  Many fell by the water's edge, their vital organs pierced.  Unearthly screams filled the air.  A lone survivor is in the sea paddling furiously.  As if on cue, a sea breeze picks up and the wispy forms fade away.  You wonder if the survivor ever made it.  There are no signs of life around you now.  Skeletons of all forms litter the beach, washed white by the perpetual tide. The red tint of the sands stand as testimony to the massacre that happened.  A sense of foreboding is thick in the air and the smell of rot and decay grows more pungent.  Northwards, the shore opens out into a huge field.  You see more coastline and a great towering keep to the east.   } {minos} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
