R {20477} {0} {<268>} {Shores of Minos} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  The shore around you is packed with eerie forms of a fierce battle.  A small group of phantom minotaur warriors are fighting right at the water's edge.  A formation of ghostly Reman legionnaires bear down upon them slowly and surely, their spears flashing out and striking flesh.  With no more room for retreat, the minotaurs bellow in unison and charge the legionnaires.  The impact breaks up both parties and ragtag fighting ensues.  Low moans and hollow screams fill the air as the spirits battle each other back and forth. The sounds recede and the images gradually fade as you recover your senses and find the shore barren of life.  It is almost as if the fierce battle was just a nightmare.  Only a smell of death lingers in the air now.  Off to the north, you see a well-trodden path.  The Mountains of Mists, Lithaeglar lies to the east with Asterion's fortress, Melchos, beyond.   } {minos} {} {shore} {pk} {1.000} {}
