R {20478} {0} {<268>} {The scattered dead and dying} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  This shore is covered with the forms of the disembodied dead.  Their incorporeal forms casts a heavy weight on the living soul.  Over here, the intangible form of a legionnaire crawls toward his missing arm.  With each breath he takes, the gaping hole in his chest spurts out fresh blood.  Beyond the legionnaire, you see a legless Aylorian knight pinned under the corpse of a headless Minotaur warrior, their spectral forms forever locked.  Everywhere, grisly wraithlike bodies twitch and wail in despair.  Northwards, you see a path leading to the keep.  A straight shoreline spans westwards while a broken coastline leads off to the east.   } {minos} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
