R {20479} {0} {<268>} {Rocky shores of Minos} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  Huge rocks and boulders are strewn about the shore here, making for treacherous footing.  You see no ghostly combatants or any skeletons around.  It feels as if this shore has been spared from witnessing the massacre of the land.  A few paces off, you spot the remains of a shipwreck.  A hull lies among the rocks, several gaping holes in the port side stand as stark testimony to the cause of its demise.  Perhaps it was a pirate ship laden with gold, or a merchant's cargo ship.  Further east, you spot the last mountain of Lithaeglar and the keep Melchos.  The path to Melchos lies north.   } {minos} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
