R {20482} {0} {<228>} {The edge of an ancient battlefield} {<228>. ^<088>} {  The ground is still torn and broken from a battle long ago.  Twisted stumps rear up from the rocky soil and small, twisted trees reach skeletal branches toward the sky.  A sense of oppression fills the area and even in brightest sunlight a gloom hangs over the field.  Bits of broken and battered armor litter the area, most showing signs of rust.  The stench of decay is all around, and blackened bones are scattered around the broken stumps that dot this section of the battlefield.  The sounds of hollow moans and screams can be heard from every direction, and flickers of ghostly movement tease the edges of your vision; here a Reman Legionnaire thrusting his sword into a small Minotaur child, there a large bestial Minotaur hacking into the body of an Elven archer.  This is truly not a place of happiness.   } {minos} {} {field2} {} {1.000} {}
