R {20483} {0} {<228>} {Shattered ground} {<228>, .<088>} {  Deep wounds seem to have been made in the earth in this area.  It looks as if some mighty giant has taken an axe and chopped into the ground in several places.  The mountains cast a shadow over the lands to the north, and large boulders dot the landscape.  The smell of salt is in the air, but this soothing scent of the sea is offset by the acrid smell of smoke and the stench of death.  The ground seems to be in a continuous state of decay.  Rocks and soil slip and slide with no encouragement at all.  A long, forelorn cry echoes off the nearby mountains as a misty minotaur female cradles the broken and bloody body of a child, whose horns were just starting to sprout.  A man on horseback materializes from nowhere and charges the Minotaur.  He runs her through with his lance just before a bloodied form charges across the broken ground, ripping the horse's stomach open with a blood stained horn.  The misty images flicker and change constantly.  Faint screams of pain and triumph follow them.  A chill enters the air and it seems that even the sun's light is forbidden to warm the land.   } {minos} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
