R {20484} {0} {<228>} {Amongst the spirits} {<228>` ^<088>} {  Tufts of grass grow sparsely in this area, fed by moisture from the sea.  The ground is littered with fragments of bone and metal, and the remains of a shattered building are near the coastline.  The stench of decay mixed with the salty smell of the sea creates an unpleasant mixture that goes well with the howls and shrieks surrounding you.  An oppressive gloom that is sensed more than heard seems to have a weight, holding you in this area.  Ghostly figures are everywhere.  Some have bodies torn and broken, while others scream with bloodlust and hatred.  They beckon to you to join their fight.  It is impossible not to brush against the thickly clustered spirits as they relive the struggle fought so long ago.   } {minos} {} {field4} {} {1.000} {}
