R {20485} {0} {<228>} {On an ancient battle field} {<228>, `<088>} {  The battle seems to have drifted from this area.  The destruction is still complete.  Ancient trees lie where they were brought down, their branches tangled and charred.  It seems impossible to know for sure what happened, but the ground is blackened and covered with shallow pits.  An inky darkness seems to permeate this section of the battlefield.  Perhaps it is the result of some long ago spell or curse.  Spirits drift around the area.  Most appear to be wearing torn and bloodied robes of white, though the haze of the figures turns the color to a grey.  Flashes of light occasionally burst, and show shadows of what once was.  One flash shows beautiful trees towering toward the open sky, while another shows a few small parks in the distance.  The next flash shows a minotaur harvesting fruit from one of the trees.  In another flash, you catch a startling glimpse of the now ghostly figures as they were in life.  This flash seems to tug at you, the ghostly figures themselves seeming to cry out for attention, and a tingling runs over your skin.  The visions fade, showing once again the reality of a broken, shattered land, populated only by the dead.   } {minos} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
