R {20486} {0} {<228>} {A burned field} {<228>. ^<088>} {  The area here is completely burned.  The plantlife shows no signs of returning, and there are very few spirits here.  The ones you do see are engulfed by flames.  Ethereal skeletons wander here wearing tatters of blackened flesh and scorched armor.  Some of the spirits carry weapons.  Others glow an eerie red, as if still lit by the fire which ended their living existence.  South of here is an inky darkness, which acts as a visual representation of the gloom hanging over this entire land.  Hollow cries of the undead fill your ears as you continue to move through the land, and the horrors of the slaughter are visible wherever you look.   } {minos} {} {field2} {} {1.000} {}
