R {20487} {0} {<228>} {In the middle of a battle} {<228>, .<088>} {  The surrounding area is nearly blocked from view by the sheer number of spirits struggling in their endless fight.  All around are the hollow sounds of screaming and a distant clashing of arms.  As you gaze around, you see a large minotaur go down under a rain of Elven arrows; Oddly enough, the minotaur has no weapon, but instead is carrying a small minotaur child.  A Reman in blood-spattered armor materializes before you, and screams about vengeance.  He slides his spear through the ribs of a red-furred minotaur youth who is whirling a woodaxe in his hands.  The ground seems to still be stained by the blood spilled here.  Glints of metal can be seen, half covered by the centuries of dust and grime.  It is no wonder why people would seek treasure here.   } {minos} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
