R {20489} {0} {<228>} {A jumble of boulders} {<228>, `<088>} {  The spirits in this part of the battlefield seem to have been bludgeoned more often than stabbed or cut.  Several Remans look almost flat in their gleaming armor.  An Aylorian on horseback lies struggling as his insubstantial form drifts around a large boulder which now rests on the ground.  Broken weapons and shattered armor litter the area, though it looks as if there has been some scavenging here.  Small prints dot the landscape and bits of cloth hang from some of the sharper edges of the boulders.  Whoever did the scavenging must have been in a hurry to leave.  The twisted and broken remains of war machines lie among the boulders, and you can guess how many of the large rocks came to be here.  A few of the largest boulders look as if they were torn away from the earth itself, however, and they are evidence that more than physical means were used to rain destruction down on the struggling combatants.   } {minos} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
