R {20490} {0} {<268>} {A failed escape route} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  White capped waves crash against the bleached white sand here, and the light misty sea spray adds to the chill in the air.  An oppressive gloom hangs over the area, and though the sun shines, it gives no warmth.  The contrast of the fresh sea breeze and the stench of smoke and decay drifts over the beach.  Spirits flit from here to there and all are covered with gashes or burns.  Several spirits seem to flow out into the sea only to return to the land, and relive the horror of their untimely deaths.  East from here, the ground turns from white sand to a blackened and rocky soil. The spirits are much thicker in that direction.  The sounds of screaming and moaning are loud, yet oddly hollow and distant.  This place truly is a cursed land.   } {minos} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
