R {20491} {0} {<268>} {The coastline} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  This shore has black sand as though all the evils of the world have been absorbed into it.  The sand is pulling you into it - to consume or to keep you here.  The water has taken on a black tinge and has a tarlike texture.  Ghostly shapes move within the water, crying out and reaching for help that you cannot see.  You wade out into the ocean.  Progress is hard and as you wade further out the resistance increases.  Finally you push past, and the pressure decreases as though a rubber band has broken.  You find yourself back on the shore.   } {minos} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
