R {20492} {0} {<228>} {Fields of slaughter} {<228>` ^<088>} {  The screams and shrieks of the undead are mixed with the sounds of clashing weapons.  The sounds are distant and hollow, yet are all around you.  Tattered and misty forms struggle with each other in an endless battle of vengeance, bloodlust, and madness.  You see elves slaughtering women and children.  Aylorian Knights seem to be determined to wipe out an entire race.  The Reman legions continue to march in their ordered ranks, and anything in their path goes down under spear or gladius.  On the otherside, the compassion and self-sacrifice of the minotaurs seem completely out of character.  Minotaurs are said to revere the strongest, and the thrill of battle is said to run in their veins.  However, the minotaurs visible from this vantage point seem to be trying to save those who have been wounded, and many children are being carried to safety.  Several misty spirits surround a group of minotaur children and begin a methodical slaughter.  A ghostly smoke drifts over the field, making already hazy shapes even more indistinct.  Though you see no flames to cause it, you smell the scent of charred flesh and smoke.   } {minos} {} {field4} {pk} {1.000} {}
