R {20493} {0} {<228>} {On a muddy battle field} {<228>, `<088>} {  The ground here is muddy, and attempts to suck you down into its quagmire.  The reddish muck is hard to see through the spirits.  The spirits are surrounded by a ghostly fire.  They seem to be throwing themselves at the ground or what might have been a source of water so long ago.  Perhaps this area was a pond or lake in the past.  As you look around, you notice several odd flashes coming from the surrounding area, and more and more spirits pour into the immediate vicinity crowding toward the thick mud.   } {minos} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
