R {20494} {0} {<228>} {Among the combatants} {<228>. ^<088>} {  The clash of swords, the ring of spears, and the twang of bowstrings surround you as you move through this cursed land.  The cries and groans of the wounded and dying come from everywhere.  All the sounds are deafening, yet hollow and distant.  The contrast would be confusing, if it weren't for the presence of the slashed and torn spirits moving all around you.  The ghosts are covered with gaping wounds and burned faces, but their weapons shine with a very real gleam.  The chill in the air has a constant bite as the spirits brush against or flow through you.  The eyes of the undead seek you out, and seem to encourage you to join their fight.  Ghostly mages fire spells which could be contributing to the chill, or creating the blazing fire that burned skin and metal alike, or anything in between.   } {minos} {} {field2} {} {1.000} {}
