R {20495} {0} {<228>} {A stump dotted field} {<228>, .<088>} {  The ground is dotted with the charred remains of trees.  Old, broken stumps rise from the discolored ground and several ghostly apparitions drift around the area.  There are flashes of some fighting, and one of the Reman legions has taken time out to gather prisoners.  This seems odd as this war seems to have been a mindless slaughter.  As you gaze at the stump-dotted field, a flash shows a ghostly tree with branches intact, and hanging from the branches are the grizzly remains of Minotaur villagers.  Men, women, and even children dangle and swing from the branches.  Then the tree burns to the ground in a ghostly image of flames.  The bones and bone fragments of those who were hung lie scattered over the ground, slivers of what was once part of living beings.  The ash on the ground shows signs of small footprints, and you realize that something or someone has been here since the battle's end.   } {minos} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
