R {20496} {0} {<228>} {A trampled field} {<228>` ^<088>} {  The ground is torn and broken here.  Several skeletons and twisted pieces of armor lie in the open.  It is odd that they would not have decayed from exposure to the elements by now.  It seems as if someone or something has been digging here, as the soil appears piled orderly beside the hole.  The spirits, though still struggling and shrieking their hatred and death cries seem very agitated as well.  Several brush against you as you gaze around the area, and the chill deepens.  There are even a few who seem to consider attacking you.  The spirits here are definitely displeased with the disturbance to the bones buried here so long ago.   } {minos} {} {field4} {} {1.000} {}
