R {20497} {0} {<228>} {Walking through some thorns} {<228>` ^<088>} {  The ground is covered in short, thorny plant life.  It struggles out of the ashen soil and seems to claw its way across the ground.  Fragments of bone and bits of shattered weapons and armor are scattered over the area.  Larger pieces stick out of the ground; their jagged edges just waiting for the unwary foot.  The sounds of screaming and moaning are all around you, and the stench of charred land and flesh hangs in the air.  The distant sounds of the waves crashing against the shore is an odd counterpoint to the howling of the dead.  The eyes of the spirits seem to bore into you as you continue on your way. } {minos} {} {field4} {} {1.000} {}
