R {20498} {0} {<228>} {In ghostly fire} {<228>, `<088>} {  The ground here is scorched and blackened, but there are signs of a few blades of weak looking grass struggling back to the surface of the earth.  The sparse greenery is an odd contrast to the scorched earth and flames.  In the middle of all the blackened earth appears to be a very large bonfire pit.  There are several ghostly legionnaires who seem to be piling wood around a large cluster of Minotaur villagers who were caught.  The smoke, though not real, is thick with the stench of burning flesh, overpowering all else.  Screams and cries for vengeance echo all around.  There are a few ghostly shapes of Minotaur warriors who seem to be trying to break the ring of legionnaires, but are easily repelled.  The ghostly flames are steady, neither rising nor falling, yet there is no heat.   } {minos} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
