R {20499} {0} {<228>} {A ruined field} {<228>. ^<088>} {  Upon first glance, this field seems quite normal compared with the rest of the land.  Then you notice that all the crops are flickering in and out of existence.  A thick layer of ash covers the ground, and there are rusty splotches in several spots on the ground.  Flickering, indistinct shapes move among the ghostly plant life.  A minotaur with a hoe is running toward the village to the east.  Behind him, an elf takes aim with a long bow.  Several groups of spirit combatants charge through the field, brandishing torches and setting the insubstantial crops ablaze.  There is a chill in the air an the stench of burning wood and flesh are strong on the slight breezes created by the drifting and dancing spirits.  East of here there is a large building, or at least the remains of what was once a large building.   } {minos} {} {field2} {} {1.000} {}
