R {20500} {0} {<228>} {A rubble strewn field} {<228>, .<088>} {  The cursed spirits are making travel difficult as seeing the ground through them takes quite a bit of concentration.  This is a particular hindrance here, since there is rubble from a building scattered all over the ground.  Large chunks of building stone and charred timbers lie in tangles, and the bones of the dead are poking out of gaps here and there.  There are glints among the rubble as well.  It would be very unwise to fall here as you never know what is waiting out of sight to find warm flesh once more.   } {minos} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
