R {20501} {0} {<228>} {A barricaded field} {<228>` ^<088>} {  A large wall of stakes is set into the ground, though the wood is rotting and decayed.  The barricade surrounds the field, although it has fallen in several places, giving easy exit to all four directions.  As you gaze at the flattened ground, there is another oddity.  Grass, not just small struggling patches, but the entire field is full of it.  The field is green, lush, and even a few gardens planted.  The contrast with the rest of the battle field ends there however, as there is plenty of ghostly presence here. Mad-eyed elvish archers appear and rise to fire long bows over the barricade and into the village to the east.  These archers show signs of their deaths as their skin is blistered and hangs in tatters.  East of here, a ruined home rises from the rubble that was once a minotaur village.   } {minos} {} {field4} {} {1.000} {}
