R {20502} {0} {<228>} {Gardens of the dead} {<228>, `<088>} {  The scene before your eyes is ghastly.  Several Aylorian knights have dismounted and stuck their lances in the ground.  Minotaurs of all ages have been impaled on the lances, and several Remans have taken part in this new form of death and destruction.  Several Elven warriors are using enchanted swords and starting blazes with the grass in the field, burning those who survive the initial impaling alive.  The stench of smoke and death is very strong here.  East of here is where the Minotaur conducted trade, or at least some sort of commerce.  A battered and scorched sign glints in the light.  You cannot make out what it is from this distance, especially not with all the spirits drifting around and the pall of ghostly smoke hanging over the area.   } {minos} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
