R {20503} {0} {<118>} {The Fishing Post} {<118>[ ]<088>} {  A small shack rests on this pier, and the pier extends out to the shore.  This appears to be the old harbor of the village.  It looks like it hasn't been used in centuries.  The shack is leaning, and it does not appear that it will keep out the elements.  The pier is missing large sections.  The supernatural conflict from the cursed fields has spilled over to the waters here.  Gangplanks for offloading goods and fishermen catches are now a battleground for the damned.  Several fishing boats are adrift and afire with an eerie spectral flame, their owners nowhere to be seen.  You watch a group of ghostly elven warriors corner a huge troll, their blades darting back and forth across its body, rending insubstantial flesh apart.  Unable to bear the pesky cuts and stings from the magical blades anymore, the troll roars in fury and smashes the splintered planks at its feet.  The wooden pier disintegrates under the entire band of troll and warriors, and they disappear into the sea.   } {minos} {} {bloodyroom} {} {1.000} {}
