R {23413} {0} {<278>} {The Offices of the DIS} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Now here is the ultimately efficient room.  It's very tidy, perhaps even to the point of compulsive cleaning.  Two desks face each other, leaving a narrow corridor from the entrance to the barred door opposite.  Polished cabinets bear heavy locks on their doors, concealing who-knows-what from non-DIS eyes.  Oh, what's the DIS, you ask?  Well, nobody really knows except the members of that department.  Most money is laid on 'Draconic Intelligence Service'.  The DIS agents smirk when they hear this.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
