R {23420} {0} {<278>} {The Kitchen} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The kitchen is fairly large- it has to be, for the cooking personnel create three meals a day for dozens of people, not to mention keeping snacks on hand at all times.  The wood-burning stove is large enough to hold half a dozen of the huge cauldrons used to prepare mass quantities of food.  Countertops lining three walls provide plenty of space for preparing vegetables and bearing canisters of herbs and spices, and cabinets beneath hide away gleaming cooking utensils.  Opposite the entrance are the massive sinks used to wash hundreds of dishes, pots, and silverware.  The only time they're not in use is the middle of the night.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
