R {23421} {0} {<278>} {Male Personnel Dormitory} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This long chamber provides a lot more privacy than most dormitories do.  It doesn't take all that many support personnel to keep the Guild running, so although the dorm could easily hold a hundred beds, the actual number present is less than half that.  Dark grey curtains hang from the ceiling to the floor on circular tracks so that each can be drawn around a bed, and every bunk comes complete with nightstand, lantern, and a trunk to hold belongings.  Chairs are scattered here and there, though they tend to get moved around a lot.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
