R {23422} {0} {<278>} {Bathing Chamber} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The steamy bathing chamber is dominated by the large sunken pool of hot water in its center.  Circular, it deepens gradually so that even children can be bathed safely at its edges.  At its greatest depth, the water is perhaps three feet deep.  The water is constantly refreshed, bubbles floating steadily toward a drain to the south.  Slabs of soap rest in depressions around the end of the pool, and a rack against one wall holds folded, fluffy white towels for those who don't have any of their own.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23421} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23423} {0} {<278>} {Female Personnel Dormitory} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This long chamber provides a lot more privacy than most dormitories do.  It doesn't take all that many support personnel to keep the Guild running, so although the dorm could easily hold a hundred beds, the actual number present is less than half that.  Dark grey curtains hang from the ceiling to the floor on circular tracks so that each can be drawn around a bed, and every bunk comes complete with nightstand, lantern, and a trunk to hold belongings.  Chairs are scattered here and there, though they tend to get moved around a lot.  The women living here have made an effort to pretty up the place, and vases of fresh flowers are usually color-coordinated with the light pink walls.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23417} {n} {open n;n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {23424} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

