R {23425} {0} {<228>} {The Training Field} {<228>, `<088>} {  The training field is huge, covering several acres.  This was, perhaps, optimism on the part of the first Guildmembers who built the base.  The air is filled with pegasi, dragons, and their human counterparts, perfecting the skills they're going to need in the upcoming war.  The ground has long since been packed hard from centuries of traffic by hooves and feet, and the only grass that grows is at the very edges of the field.  A sheer cliff forms the western and southern borders, though forest can be glimpsed to the southeast, and wooden buildings have been built into tunnels in the semi-surrounding mountain.   } {bonds} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
