R {23426} {0} {<228>} {The Pavilion} {<228>, `<088>} {  Surrounded by the training field is a large pavilion used for outdoor relaxation, reached by three small stone steps on each side.  A peaked wooden roof provides shelter from the elements.  A smattering of furniture is provided for resting, from tables to gather around for picnicking or gossip sessions, to lounge chairs generally used by those interested in doing some light outdoor reading.  Several long tables serve as a buffet area for celebrations, and a dais on the north side provides space for musicians to jam or entertain.  Somebody planted a bed of flowers around the square, but the blossoms keep having fatal run-ins with hungry pegasi.   } {bonds} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
