R {23434} {0} {<238>} {A Sandy Path} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  Ancient scrub pines line either side of this wide path, which gradually gives way from sparse grass to lightly golden sand.  Aside from one S-curve halfway to the beach, it's fairly straight and an easy stroll.  A pair of boulders stand guard at the entrance to the beach itself, the trees thinning out and gracefully yielding to the lakeshore.   } {bonds} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
