R {23435} {0} {<238>} {The Beach} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  A long, narrow strip of beach provides access to the blue waters of Lake Kirnas.  This is one of the most beloved parts of the Guild base, and few can resist spending some off-duty hours here.  At night, Guildmembers often build a bonfire and party hard, and while the sun is shining competition is fierce but friendly for a good sunbathing spot.  Everybody works to keep the beach clean, and fallen branches are piled in one small spot, free for anybody who wants to build a fire or whittle.   } {bonds} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
