R {23438} {0} {<148>} {Lake Kirnas} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The lake deepens quickly, though not so abruptly that one cannot wade safely into it.  It's large enough that dozens of dragons can go swimming without running into each other.  The water is a deep, clear blue, and the rainbow fish that inhabit it can easily be seen as they dart here and there to avoid capture.  There is no shore other than to the south, for the cliffs in which the Guild dragons reside start here, curling around the lake before continuing westward.   } {bonds} {} {ocean} {} {1.000} {}
