R {23443} {0} {<228>} {A Grassy Path} {<228>, `<088>} {  Old trees tower high overhead on either side of this wide path, leaning in to form a leafy canopy overhead.  Sunlight filtering through dapples the grass, and warms the air just enough to be comfortable without causing sweat.  It's a rather pleasant environment marred only by the panicked screams of animals coming from beyond the wooden fence to the north.   } {bonds} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
