R {23448} {0} {<228>} {A Path of Packed Dirt} {<228>, `<088>} {  Despite the fact that the ground is so firmly packed, hundreds of recent hoofprints can be detected in the dirt of the path as it heads south.  The neighs that can be heard from the direction pretty much confirm the presence of equine creatures.  The trees seem more random here, a few allowed to remain as they were found when the Guild built this base.  The local children love this for the great climbing spots that policy provides.   } {bonds} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
