R {23457} {0} {<278>} {A Stout Wooden Shelter} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Despite being constructed of mere wood, this shelter is sturdy indeed, built by the loving hands of pegasi partners rather than hired workers.  Straw covers the floor to cushion hooves and muffle steps, and there's plenty of room for lounging.  Special treats for human and pegasus alike are stored here as well, and the fruit supply is constantly being replenished.  Pegs on the back wall are used for neatly storing tack after it's been cleaned and polished, as well as shelves for curry combs and hoof picks.  Everything is here that might be needed in the care of pegasi.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
