R {23460} {0} {<278>} {The Birthing Chamber} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Now it's obvious where those odd sounds were coming from.  This utterly clean and sterile chamber has a window, but it's covered in oilskin to protect the privacy of the mares using it.  Plenty of fresh straw makes for a thick, soft bed, though it's doubtful the current user of the room is all that concerned about that right now.  Her human partner is off boiling water and gathering towels, and the mare alternates between screaming for him and making some rather uncomplimentary comments about the stallion that got her into this condition.  The stallion in question has (un?)wisely chosen this time to volunteer for distant scout duty.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23459} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23461} {0} {<278>} {A Long Hallway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is a rather cheerful hallway- the wooden walls are painted in sunny yellow with purple doors.  Every inch of the floor is covered by a bright, electric green carpet.  Don't blame the senior members of the Guild- the students vote on the color scheme every year.  Bulletin boards in between the doors are tacked with schedules and artwork and notices, and every afternoon after classes, the pupils police the corridor so that it's fresh for the next day's studies.  The schedule is fairly easy- three hours of classes in the morning, two in the afternoon.  Of course, plenty of the other hours are taken up by the hated drills in the training field.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
