R {23465} {0} {<278>} {The Instructors' Office} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  It's this room that misbehaving students are summoned to for a lecture from Jarik or Julani.  There's merely a single desk and chair, and the aforementioned student needs must stand and fidget while getting a gentle dressing down.  Jarik never raises his voice, and Julani tries to follow his example, but she has a bit of temper in her.  It doesn't quite always work out that way.  It's probably just as well, as that makes it easy for the pair to play good cop, bad cop.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23461} {e} {open e;e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23466} {0} {<278>} {A Classroom} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Compared to the hallway outside, this classroom is fairly boring.  The wood of the walls is painted off-white, and the floor is bare stone, roughly flaked into shape.  Of course, this is all done on purpose- when the room is boring, those being taught inevitably concentrate on their teacher.  The instructor utilizes a large easel with huge sheets of paper for demonstrations, and the students often have to lean forward in their uncomfortable chairs to get every detail.  On the other hand, there's only a handful of pupils here, and each gets intense individual attention from the teacher, resulting in superior performance and results.  It's a tried and true method that's been working just fine for centuries, and nobody sees a reason to change it any time soon.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23462} {e} {open e;e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

