R {23469} {0} {<278>} {A Storage Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Basic supplies are kept here, each assigned to its own spot.  The more dangerous materials are stored in a locked cabinet to which only the instructors and the Guildmistress have a key (as far as anybody knows *cough*).  Cleaning supplies, paper and writing utensils, the porous sand used whenever anybody gets sick in class- all are readily available on wooden racks.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
