R {23472} {0} {<278>} {The Library} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is one of the most cherished rooms in the entire Guildbase.  Hundreds of years' worth of documentation, literature, and treatises are stored here, as well as the theses compiled by the senior students to guarantee graduation.  Literally thousands of books have found a home here, and each is treasured and treated with the utmost care.  The first time a student is careless with something borrowed from the library will be the last- being assigned to the cleanup crew that occasionally tries to clear the streets of the Underground will guarantee that.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23464} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23473} {0} {<238>} {Entrance to the Crag} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The Crag.  That's how the Guildmembers refer to the section of the base where the dragons and their partners live.  Here, just inside the mountain west of the training field, it's rather noisy, though nobody is in sight.  After a moment's listening, it can be realized that the burble of conversation comes from the north and south.  The stone walls of this natural tunnel have been lined with wood here, both for support in case of sudden weakening and because the young people newly Bonded to dragons seem to cope better when inside an actual structure.  The floor is still rock, though, but plenty of torches in their steel sconces light the way so that a rough patch doesn't make anybody paying attention stumble.   } {bonds} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
