R {23474} {0} {<278>} {The Junior Dragonbonded Dormitory} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The dormitory is a noisy, lively place.  At all hours of the day, and plenty at night, there are young dragons and their partners eating, getting clean, studying, or if they're not too tired, simply socializing.  It's a wonder that anybody can sleep in here, but the students' days are so filled that usually it's all they can do to keep from collapsing every night.  There are plenty of beds available, round and large enough for both dragon and partner to curl up in.   } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
