R {23478} {0} {<278>} {The Nesting Chamber} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is a comparatively small chamber, but probably the most comfortable in the Crag.  The wooden walls are a nice, soothing, soft blue, and some wit painted fluffy white clouds on the ceiling.  Pillows have been stacked several feet deep, a fact for which nesting mother dragons are rather grateful.  Currently in the center of the plush nest is a strange oval swirled with a crazy maelstrom of painfully bright colors...  Oh wait, it's an egg.  And Callyen beams with pride.  Oh, to have a mother's biased eyes.  } {bonds} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
