R {23489} {0} {<148>} {Aidan and Xamiku's Lair} {<148>. .<088>} {  Aidan has always preferred comfortable surroundings, and he sees no reason to lead an austere life here in the Crag.  While he's still left plenty of room for Xamiku to move around, the lair is filled with comfortable furniture, and even a fireplace has been installed.  Aidan does all of his own cooking as well, and is rather proud of his gourmet abilities.  (Taryl cooked for him once.  They have agreed that this is not in the best interests of anybody's health.)   } {bonds} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
