R {23490} {0} {<148>} {Ivrel and Zaniku's Lair} {<148>. .<088>} {  About the only reason Ivrel bothers to keep a lair is to have a place to sleep and keep his few clothes.  There's a bed shoved against one wall and a trunk at its foot, and that's about it.  Zaniku certainly doesn't mind- it gives him more room to stretch out than most dragons can claim.  He has been thinking about spiffing up the place with a few pretty trappings though.  Pity that dragons generally don't have a decent grasp of interior decoration.   } {bonds} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
