R {23493} {0} {<148>} {Ros and Luthe's Lair} {<148>. .<088>} {  This lair is very much larger than most, and the many beds probably explain why Ros and Luthe live here.  They're infamous for producing children at a phenomenal rate.  Perhaps surprisingly, though, all the family's belongings are neatly in their respective places, toys put away, and all the beds made.  The family is out on one of their weekly outings, though, and it might be surmised that the cleanliness is a parental condition for taking the kids out for some fun.   } {bonds} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
