R {23494} {0} {<148>} {The Underground} {<148>. .<088>} {  An entire community exists within the mountain, but this is not a pleasant place to visit.  Darkness reigns here, with only a few feeble torches casting just enough light to keep a person from stumbling but not enough to prevent stepping into muck.  What that muck is... well, you probably don't want to know, judging from the stench.  Shadowy figures slink through the narrow alley- some peer at you appraisingly, some shrink away.  It might be best to keep a weapon ready.   } {bonds} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
