R {23495} {0} {<148>} {The Flying Weasel} {<148>. .<088>} {  This is probably one of the cleanest places in the Underground, but that's not saying much.  The cavern walls were painted white at one point, but that color has long since gone to a dingy brown-grey.  Most of the tables, chairs, and stools don't match, but that doesn't seem to concern the patrons of the Flying Weasel.  There are only a few drinks available here, and that suits them just fine.  The bartender keeps a sharp eye on the crowd, rarely letting his customers get out of hand.  And waaay in the back, at the darkest corner, is the proprietor of the tavern.  Everybody seems to be having a pretty good time, laughter often rolling through the bar.   } {bonds} {} {underground} {shop} {1.000} {}
