R {23498} {0} {<148>} {Madam Callahan's} {<148>. .<088>} {  That a place like this can be found in the Underground is at worst a pleasant surprise.  The cavern is large, well-lit, and finely furnished, and if there's a speck of dust to be found, it must be hiding very well.  Warm smiles greet all who enter, though those who obviously can't pay the somewhat high prices of the courtesans are merely offered a drink and the way out by Madam Callahan.  The people accepted as customers are discreetly escorted through a tunnel hidden by swathes of sheer scarlet silk.   } {bonds} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
