R {23499} {0} {<148>} {A Pawnshop} {<148>. .<088>} {  Business really hasn't been good lately, and the shelves in the pawnshop are almost bare of anything but dirt.  This is easy to see, as the torches are bright here, in painful contrast to the tunnel outside.  This of course gives the pawnbroker an advantage in sizing up anybody who enters his little store.  A tunnel behind the sales counter disappears deeper into the mountain, but the cobwebby gloom there indicates that exploring it would be a bad idea.   } {bonds} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {23497} {s} {open s;s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23500} {0} {<148>} {The Underground} {<148>. .<088>} {  It's actually brighter here, though still dim, light streaming from the caves to the north and south.  This allows those passing through to see the garbage and rotting food piled and pushed out of the way on the main thoroughfare.  It also lets them get a better look at the filth underfoot... eeewww.  Now aren't you just deliriously happy to suddenly be able to see better down here?   } {bonds} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
