R {23503} {0} {<148>} {The Underground} {<148>. .<088>} {  Oh, gods, the stench!  It appears that this is the spot where everybody in the Underground discards their trash and garbage.  The air is thick with the sickening cloud of foul odor.  People have fainted in reaction to it before.  It's not really a recommended strategy, though, considering the stuff into which the fainter would drop.  The caves to the north and south suddenly seem like welcome shelter from the odiferous atmostphere.   } {bonds} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
