R {23510} {0} {<278>} {A Dusty Road} {<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>} {  You step out from the light forest behind you and onto a dusty road. All  before you the growth has stopped abruptly. Not only does it appear someone  has clear-cut any sign of flora, but there is also a massive pit in the  ground. It looks as if the pit has been cut straight down with only a narrow  zigzagging path leading to its depths. Before the pit, however, is a small  camp made up of roughshod tents and white stone buildings. It looks as if a  decent wind would carry this camp away, over the cliff, and into the pit. Every sound seems to echo off of the walls of the pit, making it impossible  to determine their origin. Barking voices can be heard above the din of metal on stone in the distance. } {quarry} {} {smallroad} {} {1.000} {}
