R {23511} {0} {<278>} {A Dusty Road} {<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>} {  The gravel crunches under your feet as you continue down the dirt road. The  crushed rock is all of a consistent size, suggesting the rubble was created  for this specific purpose. Farther up the road, the side of a white stone  house can be seen to the west, sidled by three tattered tents. The tent  farthest to the east is the largest, with a strange sign hanging outside of  it. The remnants of a fence are the only thing separating the path north and  the crossroads to the south. The barks from the south are starting to compete with the clash of metal on stone within the pit. } {quarry} {} {smallroad} {} {1.000} {}
