R {23514} {0} {<278>} {Overseer's Home} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This was the last standing building from whatever happened before the gnolls. Based off of rubble piled up in the corner of this two-room building, it was  once nicely furnished and lavishly decorated. All the remains are the shards  of painted ceramics and shredded strips of fabric, presumably paintings. All  that remains is the hearth in the middle of the room, a table near the north  wall, and a ruined doorway to the west. Despite the rubble, the building is  well maintained; any damage once sustained has been repaired using the bounty from the quarry. There is a faint smell of bread baking, but none can be  found. } {quarry} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23513} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
