R {23515} {0} {<278>} {Overseer's Office} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Of the three tents, this is the most impressive. It is not the largest, but  it is the most sturdy. Support beams have been sewn into the corners and top  of the tent, to increase its stability. As if by some magical force, the  noise from outside is completely absent here. The tan dye of the tent has  faded, except in squares along each of the walls. Samples of stone, papers,  and various implements of torture can be found atop a large wooden desk in  the center of the tent. In spite of convention, there are no chairs in this  tent. } {quarry} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23513} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23516} {0} {<278>} {Infirmary} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you enter the tent, the first thing you notice is the noise. The din of  quarry life seems to have been left outside, while a new symphony of  unpleasant sounds greets you within. The sheer number of cots suggests this  camp once housed many more than are presently stationed. Cots are lined along the east and west walls, with injured gnolls on the west being tended and  dwarves on the east. The severity and amount of dwarves suggests they have  been receiving less than adequate care from their slavers. Herbs, tinctures, and labeled potions are strewn about a table on the south end of the tent. } {quarry} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23512} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23517} {0} {<278>} {Dormitory} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This large tent continues, full of bunk beds and small tables. The tables do  not offer any chairs, but tall stools instead. Lewd pictures of gnolls in  compromising positions and interesting poses line the walls of the tent. The gnolls must have thought no one other than themselves would have made it this far into their tents. Playing cards, plates, and goblets litter every corner  of this section of the tent. Gnolls are just as prevalent as the litter that  clutters this area. } {quarry} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23518} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23518} {0} {<278>} {Dormitory} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This tent is the largest tent out of all of them. This north section of the  gnolls dormitory hasn't housed any soldiers in a long time. Empty cots and  bunk beds are scattered about by the dozens. There is no telling how many gnolls this camp once held. The tent continues to the south, where it appears the remaining soldiers turned slavers have been spending their time when  they're not on duty. Angry slaver guards greet you as you enter their tent, ready to impede your progress deeper into their tent. } {quarry} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
