R {23533} {0} {<238>} {A Steep Slope} {<238>. .<088>} {  Unlike the other two steep slopes along the wall of the cavern, there are no  pebbles here. In place of the pebbles are giant rounded stones that could not be loaded onto the carts and sleds that frequent the beginning of the path  upward. Whip cracking seems to be more prevalent down here, while the other  noises of the quarry are all drowned out by the forced labor below. The  ground shakes every once in a while, signaling the opening of a new vein. } {quarry} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
