R {23545} {0} {<238>} {A Hidden Cave} {<238>] [<088>} {  After discovering the existence of a hidden cave, the minute amount of light  down here seems as bright as the noonday sun. After adjusting to the  illumination, the source of the light can be seen coming from above. The  floor and walls of this hidden cavern are covered in arcane symbols, some of  which softly glowing, all of which ineptly drawn. The scrawl seems to have  been made with a dull knife or claw, rather than an exacting implement. Without the incessant sound of grinding rocks, this place is a beautiful  respite from the camp, the quarry, and the caves outside. The rest this cave  has afforded has been exchanged for the knowledge of the source of the light. } {quarry} {} {tunnel} {} {1.000} {}
E {23543} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23546} {0} {<238>} {Blast Shelter} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  This shack smells dangerous. Jars of blasting powder line the walls, atop  slipshod shelves. The shelter itself was built with rotting and subpar wooden planks, the signs of a structure that was quickly erected out of necessity. The small building has little furniture, made up solely of shelves and a  small table. The table is much more well-made than the rest of the shack,  suggesting it was taken from the camp above. Neither dwarves nor gnolls make  unnecessary visits here, for fear of their own physical wellbeing. } {quarry} {} {hut} {pk} {1.000} {}
