R {23560} {0} {<228>} {The Woods' Boundary} {<228>( *<088>} {  The woods here are bound on two sides by sheer cliff faces. Here and there  enough dirt has gathered within a rocky crevasse for some scrub grass or a  patch of wildflowers to grow, their roots clinging tenaciously in the shallow soil. It is quite clear that nothing can climb out this way. You will either  have to go back the way you came or head farther into the woods. A rabbit  darts across the path, perhaps being pursued by a fox. Its passage brings you out of your revery. From the depths of the trees come the sounds of a brief  struggle, followed by silence. Despite the apparent peacefulness of the area, you realize this would be an excellent place to stage an ambush and decide  rather hastily to move on. } {nynewoods} {} {forest} {pk} {1.000} {}
