R {23561} {0} {<228>} {Meandering Along The Path} {<228>( *<088>} {  You decide to stick to the outskirts of the woods for now, not wishing to  lose your way amongst the myriad paths. Keeping the high rock wall in view  you move along, marveling at the size and variety of the trees and the  vibrant colours of the wildflowers which grow beside the path. Berry bushes  grow in abundance here and you reflect that if you never left this place, you would not suffer for lack of food. In the distance you hear a noise, much  like the sound a horse's hooves make when running at full gallop. A squirrel  watches from a tree, chattering angrily as you pass by. The path splits here, one branch continuing straight ahead, while the other cuts farther into the  woods. From deeper within you can hear the sound of splashing water. } {nynewoods} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
