R {23562} {0} {<228>} {Peril Or Paradise?} {<228>( *<088>} {  Many years of searching and travel have finally brought you to this place. During your travels you've faced many obstacles and grown immeasurably  stronger. When you first reached the desolate island you thought your sources had once again led you astray as it appeared to be covered with nothing but  sheer cliffs and rocky outcroppings. Then you discovered a narrow pass  between two cliffs leading to the center of the island. Traversing the pass  was a struggle; more than once your way was blocked by ancient rock slides  which you painstakingly climbed over. Now though you can hardly believe your  eyes as you've emerged suddenly into a vast woods hidden within the island's  interior. Huge trees tower above you, their leaves forming a canopy, shutting out some of the glaring sunlight. Brush and wildflowers cover the ground,  though you notice several well-worn paths leading farther into the woods and  wonder who or what travels along them to keep them clear. Birds chirp and  small woodland creatures scurry through the undergrowth. From somewhere in  amongst the trees you hear a louder noise, as though something far larger  moves there, but when you turn to look you can see nothing in the gloom. Feeling as though you are being watched, your eyes dart from left to right,  coming to rest on a signpost hammered into the side of the path. Eagerly you  go to read it, wondering if at long last you have found the mythical Nyne  Woods. } {nynewoods} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
