R {23564} {0} {<228>} {Making Progress} {<228>( *<088>} {  The path is wider here and you walk along quite jauntily, finally feeling as  though you are getting somewhere. Brightly coloured butterflies flit about in the sunlight. High up in the trees a bird calls and a moment later another  answers. From the north you hear what sounds like a low moan but you decide  it must just be the wind in the trees. Sure that you are on the verge of a  momentous discovery you plunge on through the woods. A light breeze blows a  scrap of paper across the path where it comes to rest against some bushes. Curious you pick it up and attempt to read what it says: "Come vis... For a  go... See Pan... You won'..." You look around hoping to find the other part  of the paper but sadly you are unsuccessful. Shrugging, you continue on into  the woods. } {nynewoods} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
