R {23565} {0} {<228>} {Thwarted!} {<228>( *<088>} {  You decide to plunge straight ahead, hoping to get to the heart of the woods  quickly and discover all its secrets. The seemingly impenetrable wall of  trees and undergrowth that faces you does not dissuade you in the least. You  spend the next few hours attempting to force your way through, hacking and  slashing at the foliage in your way, tripping over half hidden tree roots and cursing as your clothes gets caught on brambles. Now you sit on a rock by the side of the path, all your efforts a dismal failure. Nursing your various  scratches and bruises and regarding your torn clothes with chagrin, you  ruefully admit to yourself that you have no choice but to follow one of the  paths that head to the east and west. To your east you can hear the  plish-plash of water. To the west you think you hear a snicker, quickly  stifled, but you cannot be sure. } {nynewoods} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
