R {23574} {0} {<238>} {Fountain of Knowledge} {<238>] [<088>} {  This part of the temple is dominated by a large ornate fountain. Water  splashes down into a shallow marble lined pool. Priests and clerics gather  here, lining up around the fountain and lowly chanting prayers before  kneeling to drink. You seem to have stumbled on a sort of ritual and the  participants ignore you although the heavily armed guards pace around giving  you more than your fair share of attention. The participants leaving the pool stumble slightly on unsteady hooves, their eyes distant and blank as though  seeing something you cannot. None of this makes you eager to drink from the  pool yourself, even if the Nyne would allow it, which you suspect they would  not. To the south is a long statue lined gallery. To the north are a set of  wide wooden double doors, adorned with gold inlay and precious jewels. Armed  guards stand at attention on either side of the door and a cleric stands to  the side bearing a banner with the symbol of the Nyne Matron on it. } {nynewoods} {} {tunnel} {} {1.000} {}
