R {23577} {0} {<278>} {Where There's A Will...} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are standing in the entryway of what is perhaps the most unique bar  you've ever seen... And seasoned adventurer that you are, you've seen quite a few. The bar itself has been fashioned out of the walls of the cliff and it  melds nature with construction perfectly. The top part of the walls are the  stone face of the cliff, somewhat smoothed and shaped. The bottom part of the walls and the ceiling are wood panelled. The floor is hard packed dirt which  has been covered in sweet smelling rushes from the forest, which rustle as  you walk upon them. Candles in glass jars adorn each table and a large fire  place built into the back wall of the cliff gives off both heat and light,  casting a cheerful glow over the room although the corners remain shadowy. The clink of glasses and murmur of voices assures you that you won't be alone and you welcome the idea of sharing a drink with some fellow hardy  adventurers. } {nynewoods} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
