R {23578} {0} {<278>} {An (Un)Fortunate Meeting} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You walk into the room and look around, planning on taking a table and having a few well earned drinks or maybe pulling up a stool at the bar and sharing  tales of valor with other adventurers. You are pleased to see there's quite  the crowd. A number of people line the long bar at one side of the room and  the heavy wooden tables are filling rapidly with patrons. You'd best be  getting your drink and settling soon or you'll be forced to stand. At the  table just ahead of you some other newcomers are taking seats, a pitcher of  ale newly placed in the center of the table. One of them glances towards you  as he sits down. He looks awfully familiar... Oh-oh, maybe you should come  back later when it's not so crow... Too late, he's seen you. May as well get  this over with now. } {nynewoods} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
