R {23579} {0} {<278>} {An Encounter with Elves} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This part of the bar is located near the fireplace, a huge stone affair  containing brightly burning logs. The cheerful glow has made it a popular  section and there are no free tables. Looking around your gaze alights on a  table of female elves, unusual to see in these parts. They are attracting  more than their fair share of attention as a result. The youngest of the  three gives you an encouraging smile, even pushing out the spare chair a  little with the toe of her boot. You take a step forward but a murderous  glare from one of the other elves causes you to rethink your decision to sit  down. You'd prefer to stand anyways. } {nynewoods} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23580} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
