R {23580} {0} {<278>} {A Possible Avenue of Escape} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The back corner of the bar is wreathed in shadows, the light of the candles  and fireplace only partially penetrating the corner. Leaning against the end  of the bar and surveying your surroundings you become aware of a dark wood  door built into the side wall a few feet beyond the bar. It's a slim chance,  but it might just lead to an alternative exit out of the Nyne Woods valley. You glance surreptitiously around and see that no one is paying you any mind. Moving slowly, you stand with your back to the wall, your fingers resting  lightly on the door handle. It would only take a moment to crack open the  door and slip inside to see what lies behind. It's true that the bar offers  comparative safety, but you have been fortified with a few drinks and are  prepared to face the unknown. } {nynewoods} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
