R {23581} {0} {<278>} {Suit Yourself} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You manage to slip unnoticed into the room only to turn around and find  yourself staring into the faces of four men who are staring back at you. After watching you for a moment they appear to decide that you aren't worth  their notice and go back to what they were doing before your arrival, which  is playing poker. A large oak table covered in green velvet is the main  feature of this room. The men recline in four comfortable looking armchairs. Oil lamps flicker on the table, causing the pile of coins in the center to  gleam. Several decks of well worn cards have been discarded on the table. One wall has a bookcase built in though only a few books stand on one shelf. The rest have been stuffed with various strange looking contraptions, all of  them covered in a thick layer of dust. Bits and pieces of junk lie on the  floor along with several expensive looking empty bottles of liquor. } {nynewoods} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23580} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23582} {0} {<278>} {Standing at the Bar} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You walk over and stand by the bar where a number of patrons stand or sway,  their gaze intent on the woman acting as both bartender and waitress. One  good look at her gives you the reason why. You debate the merits of dusting  off your collection of "A cleric, a paladin and a ranger walk into a bar..."  jokes, but it's likely she's heard them all. Instead you choose to play it  cool, calm and collected. Resting your arm on the well-used but highly  polished surface of the long wooden bar you casually order a drink, shooting  a well-timed dirty look at the drunk who stumbles into you, though he doesn't seem to notice. The bar owner gives you a bright smile, hands you the drink  and wipes an invisible spot from the bar. You hand over the necessary coins  and prepare to relax a little. } {nynewoods} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23580} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
