R {23583} {0} {<238>} {Entering the Festival of Mayhem} {<238>, `<088>} {  The flier you are clutching in your hand spoke of a festival of epic  proportions and perhaps that is true. What it failed to mention is that you  are now entering the Festival of Mayhem, a name that seems appropriate, for  you have certainly found yourself surrounded by chaos. People surge around  you and you hear screams of fright in the distance. They must have some  really good rides here. Carnies, painted clowns and other festival workers  grab at your hands, urging you to enter past the sign, pulling you forward  eagerly until you stumble past it and into the festival itself. Off to the  side a lost child cries for his mother. The festival workers ignore him,  seeming more intent on getting you to partake in one of the rides, or perhaps a game, or maybe you'd like to have a delicious snack. They are all yanking  you in different directions at the same time and finally you manage to pull  away. Before they can lay claim to you once more you head off into the  festival yourself. You don't need some seedy festival workers telling you how to have fun, you're always the life of the party at the Aylor Adventurer's  Association Meetings. } {nynewoods} {} {dead_field} {} {1.000} {}
