R {23594} {0} {<248>} {A Trampled Section of Seating} {<248>[ ]<088>} {  If there were any circus goers sitting here when the elephants stampeded  through you can't imagine that they survived. The stands have been knocked  down and then splintered beneath angry elephant feet. Even now one of the  elephants is standing here, tearing apart some larger sections of stands with his trunk. It seems highly unlikely that anything is going to calm these  elephants down, especially since you think you can see the brightly clad body of the elephant trainer lying lifeless in the remains of the ring. There is  nothing more to see here and you skirt carefully around the elephants,  leaving them bent on further destruction of the stands. } {nynewoods} {} {chessblack} {} {1.000} {}
E {23593} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
