R {23603} {0} {<278>} {Amazing...ly Stupid} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Your feet stick to the ground outside this building and you look down to see  that you are standing in some disgusting looking green lumpy stuff. You stare at it more closely, trying to identify it but after a minute or so you give  up. You look over at the placard and after reading it for the second time you decide the printer must have made a mistake. Putting a ticket in the box you  push through the obligatory black curtain. Five men stand around the room all looking into mirrors which have been nailed to the walls. Each of them has a  small comb which he is desperately using to groom some very sparse chin hair. There's an odd smell in the room. It takes you a minute to place it, but you  are almost sure it's welk oil. One of the men takes a bottle from his pocket, squeezing drops of something onto his chin. The smell gets stronger. This is  one strange freakshow. } {nynewoods} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
