R {23604} {0} {<278>} {Wondrous Things} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You've reached the last of the sheds in this direction. It is quite large and from inside come sounds of animals and a strange, high-pitched giggle. You  read the placard, put your ticket in the box and sweep through the curtain,  prepared for just about anything. This shed has been set up differently than  the others. One wall has cases with pictures and exhibits, each marked with a small sign. The other wall is separated into small cubicles, each containing  a live wonder. The back wall has a large sign announcing you are in the "Hall of Wondrous Things". You head down the wall containing the cases. There's a  picture of the Rare Helegear Sea Shark, a Preserved Nomad Zombie Hand and The Dagger Belonging to Hot Hands Magee amongst other things. You turn to the  live exhibits side of the room. Among other strange things you find the  Fearsome Creature from Nine Hells, the Endangered Dot Frog and the Rare and  Prized Female Adventurer. An odd-looking man stands talking animatedly to the "female" in that exhibit. } {nynewoods} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
