R {23605} {0} {<278>} {Really Big or Really Small} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The placard outside this building is rather cryptic. Intrigued and eager to  escape the pushy popcorn vendors you hastily shove a ticket in the box and  push aside the curtain, entering the dimly lit space beyond. It's a lot  darker in here and your eyes are still adjusting but you can hear quite a bit of angry muttering coming from within the room. Whoever makes up this  exhibit, they don't sound happy that you've come to look at them. Just as you start to see clearly and come to the conclusion that a number of human-sized  figures are moving menacingly towards you one of them shouts "What do you  think you're looking at? This isn't some kind of freakshow you know!". Hmm,  maybe you should have skipped this exhibit. } {nynewoods} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
