R {23606} {0} {<278>} {The Snake Charmers} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You walk along a boardwalk looking at the various wooden sheds housing the  exhibits. One shed that is taller and wider than most catches your eye. Curious, you approach the black curtain hiding the exhibit. You can hear  low-pitched talking from within though you cannot make out what is being  said. Taking a look at the placard beside the curtain, you slip one of your  tickets into the ticket box and go inside. A large, mesh covered glass tank  takes up a good deal of the space in this room. A number of men are standing  around it, leaning over the sides and speaking into it. As you approach you  can see that the tank contains a number of garden variety garter snakes. They are doing snakey-type things, slithering around and basking on rocks. The men are speaking to the snakes and you listen in. "Hey baby, I love how  your tail moves when you slither." "What say you and I swallow a mouse  sometime?" "I have a heated rock back at my place. Want to come home with me  and check it out?" "I get lost in your glittering black eyes." Shaking your  head in disbelief you are about to leave when a shoving match breaks out  between two of the men. "Back off, that snake was with me!" "You're full of  it, she's been flicking her tongue in my direction all day buddy!" The  ensuing melee causes part of the cloth backdrop to come loose from the back  wall, revealing a ladder leading up to a shadowy trapdoor in the ceiling. } {nynewoods} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23605} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
