R {23611} {0} {<118>} {Foiled Again!} {<118>. .<088>} {  Your plan of escape through the lamp's bottom is not going well and you're  now moving aimlessly down the tight quarters without much hope. The now  familiar bronze walls and tattered velvet seem to mock you as you search  fruitlessly for a way out. You start to wonder if perhaps this is nothing but an illusion, if maybe your mind is just playing tricks on you and soon you  will wake up safe and sound and not trapped in a lamp. You certainly hope so. After all, you couldn't really be trapped in a lamp could you be? } {nynewoods} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
E {23613} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {23612} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23612} {0} {<118>} {Sudden Opulence} {<118>. .<088>} {  Much to your surprise you find yourself in a part of the lamp which seems to  have escaped the fate of the rest. Deep, rich velvet lines the bronze walls,  all of it trimmed in fine expensive lace. A three sided red and black tent  which also seems to be made of velvet dominates the area. To the side is an  easel with an ornately carved plaque, partially covered in a tasseled  curtain. You manage to read "The Great M..." on it. Large bronze incense  burners release a sweetly intoxicating scent into the air. It feels warmer  here and as though the very air around you is charged with power. Brightly  polished sheets of silver placed about catch your attention. They seem to  distort your reflection, causing movement where there should be none,  changing your appearance in subtle ways that you don't quite understand. You  feel drawn to the tent and your feet move forward of their own accord,  carrying you inside an area littered with plush carpets and large plump  pillows of red, black and deep purple. In the midst of all this finery is a  low mahogany table dominated by a large crystal ball. A figure sits cross  legged behind it, peering into its depths. } {nynewoods} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
E {23611} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23613} {0} {<118>} {The Bottom of the Lamp} {<118>. .<088>} {  You've travelled down inside the lamp in the hopes that perhaps you can get  out through the bottom. Your surroundings are much the same as the rest of  the lamp, though there are other smells down here, perhaps scented oil,  perhaps something else. In any case, you'd like to get out quickly. You no  longer care what is going on here and you make your way quickly through the  confined space looking for any way out. } {nynewoods} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
