R {23615} {0} {<118>} {Venturing Farther} {<118>. .<088>} {  Your shoulders brush against decaying velvet as you make your way along a  narrow corridor. Pieces of it break off, fluttering to the floor as you pass. The bronze walls and floor gleam with a light all their own, not bright  enough for you to see clearly, but enough that you can see shadows moving  just beyond your line of sight. You reach a smooth expanse of blank curved  wall. You can no longer continue the way you were going and must now decide  to go back the way you came or go deeper into the lamp. Silently wishing that the strange things that inhabit this place pass you by, you begin to weigh  your options. } {nynewoods} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
