R {23617} {0} {<118>} {Higher in the Lamp} {<118>. .<088>} {  You've managed to crawl higher up into the lamp. Perhaps you can find the  spout and get out that way, although you feel crazy even thinking of such a  thing. But then this whole place is crazy, being stuck in a lamp that should  have been impossible to get into and yet is proving to be quite large. You  wonder how many times you will manage to get yourself into situations like  this as you prepare to explore your options. } {nynewoods} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
