R {23618} {0} {<118>} {Yet Another Dead End} {<118>. .<088>} {  Once again you've run up against the smooth bronze of the lamp. In addition  to all the other strange things and dangers you've come to expect in this  strange place the air here is clouded with cigarette smoke. You crush a  number of cigarette butts underneath your feet as you turn in a circle,  trying to peer through the smokey atmosphere. You've begun to think you might be trapped inside this lamp forever. } {nynewoods} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
