R {23619} {0} {<138>} {Crazy Consignments: Dying to Serve You} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  Haven't you ever heard of any myths where opening chests was dangerous? You're in the entryway of a strange looking shop. Even here in the entrance  merchandise is piled up with no rhyme or reason to it. Customers jostle each  other looking for deals. Farther into the shop a man screams and clutches his ankle, hopping about on one foot. It looks from here as though his pants have been shredded. Another customer picks up an antique bottle but some liquid  spills from it making a hissing noise as it burns into the wooden shelf and  he quickly puts it back. From somewhere in the back of the store there's a  shout of "Another lucky customer just bought an item! Who will be next?" Two  people are shoving each other, each clutching onto one side of what seems  like an ordinary used shoe. A sign with elaborate script announces that you  are now entering the Crazy Consignments Shop. So long as you are here, you  might as well see if you can find any good deals. } {nynewoods} {} {shop} {} {1.000} {}
