R {23620} {0} {<138>} {Deals You Can't Pass Up!} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  A huge sign saying "Deals You Can't Pass Up!" is hanging over a display of  antique dishes and other assorted glass items. Apparently you can't pass them up because the staff at Crazy Consignments have been trained to strategically bump into the customers causing them to jostle precariously placed glass  items until they fall and break. Then another staff member appears  immediately at their shoulder, scooping the broken shards into a bag and  leading the bewildered customer off to a cash register to pay for their  "purchase". Most customers are walking around with at least one bag  containing tinkling shards of glass and some have several. You vow to be  careful as you move farther into the shop, but just when you think you've  outsmarted the staff a plate comes sailing off a shelf of its own accord and  smashes you in the nose before falling to the ground. That really hurt, but  not as much as your coin purse will because a helpful cashier is already  headed your way, bag in hand. Although you are blocked by the display in  front of you, maybe you can still disappear into the crowds on either side. } {nynewoods} {} {shop} {} {1.000} {}
