R {23621} {0} {<138>} {Curious About Curios?} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  This section of the store has several curio cabinets filled with unusual and  somewhat disgusting items. There are shrunken gnome heads, mummified fingers, stuffed rats and assorted fine torture devices. One shelf is devoted to  jewelry made entirely from orc teeth. Another shelf advertises genuine bits  of Vidblain space rock, though when you look closer you can see the chisel  marks and there are suspicious looking gouges in the stone floor beneath your feet. Fancy cut crystal bottles have labels which read "Aylor in a Bottle". Small signs warn you not to touch anything as it is fragile, rare and no  doubt exceedingly expensive. You are just about to leave when a man who was  staring into one of the cabinets turns towards you and you find yourself  looking into a silver skull mask with intently staring eyes. } {nynewoods} {} {shop} {} {1.000} {}
