R {23631} {0} {<178>} {A Straight Road} {<178>~ ~<088>} {  There is a straight evenly paved road running down the center of a vast  sunlit area of vegetation. To either side flowery meadows abound, edible  plants and fruit trees grow in abundance and people walk by laughing or sit  in small groups talking. Tame, playful animals roll in the grass by the  roadside and walk up to people with no fear. In the sky above the sun shines, bathing the area in light and warmth. White puffy clouds skim through the air on an unseen breeze. The air itself smells of flowers and fruit and a  pleasant perfume-like odor. Simple yet comfortable looking houses dot the  horizon and people move to and fro between them, their joyous shouts carrying through the still air. There is a sense of great calm and peace here. } {nynewoods} {} {cloud1} {} {1.000} {}
E {23630} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {23661} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23632} {0} {<178>} {Never-ending Splendor} {<178>~ ~<088>} {  Beautifully ornate buildings made of white marble stand tall beside neatly  cobbled roads. Glimpses of large colored pillows, comfortable sitting chairs  and even pools for swimming are visible from the doorways. Several people  lounge in each house pleasantly passing the time. The air seems scented with  a fragrant perfume. Friendly animals roam the streets, getting a pet here and a belly rub there. Clear, pure water cascades down from elaborate fountains  and pools in the basins below. Long banquet tables covered in velvet  tablecloths are laden down with dishes upon dish of delicious looking food. The moment a person takes something from one and eats it a replacement  appears. Happy shouts, cheerful singing and bubbling laughter fill the air. } {nynewoods} {} {cloud1} {} {1.000} {}
E {23662} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {23630} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {23633} {0} {<218>} {Descending a Shadowy Staircase} {<218>[ ]<088>} {  Although it is solid, this staircase is made of pure black shadow. It goes  steeply downward with no end in sight. Above and below you shades stumble  down, their steps heavy and slow. The shades undergo a transformation the  lower they get on the staircase. From being wisps of shadow they solidify  into individuals, looking much as they must have at the time of their deaths. There are not so many young ones here, but other than that people of all  ages, types and wealth are well represented. As they travel lower more  changes occur. Their bodies become bent and twisted, their faces etched with  expressions of cruelty and misery, their cheeks hollow with hunger. Some  cough, spasms wracking their bodies while others scratch at rashes that  appear on their skin. Finally their clothing changes into itchy, filthy,  tattered black garments which barely cover their flesh. Looking down you  watch as clawed hands appear at the bottom, grabbing at those coming off the  last stair. } {nynewoods} {} {hellinside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23634} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
