R {23634} {0} {<218>} {Entering the Unholy Depths} {<218>[ ]<088>} {  The bottom of this staircase empties out into a cramped, dark area dominated  by jagged black rocks and jetting flames. The air is heavy and still, with a  cloying smell of sulphur and decay. Screams of anguish and the sound of  sobbing fill the air and newcomers are dragged away, blows raining down upon  their heads. Cruel looking demons watch over all, prodding at those who seek  to turn back, snapping at them with razor sharp teeth. An oppressive  atmosphere of suffering and sadness weighs down the souls, making them  fearful and unhappy. All who enter here must think of nothing but escape  though that is impossible. } {nynewoods} {} {hellinside} {} {1.000} {}
E {23636} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {23633} {u} {u} {16} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
