R {23666} {0} {<228>} {Still In The Woods} {<228>( *<088>} {  You are still in the woods, but better yet, there's a still in the woods! All this admiring of trees and wildflowers has made you mighty thirsty and  you head on over and help yourself to a cup of grade A moonshine. Sipping it  down, your head swims a little and you look around through watering eyes to  assess your surroundings. Not surprisingly, your surroundings consist of a  lot of trees, brush and wildflowers. Looking along the path you see a rabbit. It stands on its hind legs and you could swear it shakes its head at you  before continuing on its way. You decide against helping yourself to a second cup and prepare to continue your exploration. The way to the north is blocked by bramble bushes. The path through the woods continues running east to west  while a smaller path veers off to the south. You are debating which direction to take when you hear sounds of laughter and a snatch of song from the south. Since you've yet to hear any of the Nyne either laugh or sing you strongly  hope you are about to meet someone who's a little more friendly. } {nynewoods} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {23667} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {23671} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
