R {23667} {0} {<228>} {If A Tree Falls In The Forest...} {<228>( *<088>} {  As you continue through the woods, you reflect on the age-old question of a  tree falling in the forest. Unfortunately, if one were to fall now, you would most assuredly be here to hear it. You never realized before today just how,  well, woody woods were. The trees no longer seem so impressive nor the  wildflowers so colourful as you trudge along hoping to find something,  anything. The fact is, people don't buy rounds of drinks for adventurers  whose adventure stories consist of nothing but elaborate descriptions of  trees and flowers and the occasional encounter with a bad tempered bunny  rabbit. Again you are faced with a number of paths and must choose which way  to venture. Peering down each one you can only hope that whichever you pick  it will end in something other than more trees. } {nynewoods} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {23668} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {23670} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
