R {23670} {0} {<228>} {Southern Comfort} {<228>( *<088>} {  You have reached the southernmost boundary of the woods. Rocky outcroppings  tower high above your head, blocking further exploration to the south. From  the east you hear an odd cry, perhaps the call of a bird of some sort. To the west you think you hear the sound of rapidly retreating footsteps, followed  by silence. You take some small comfort in the fact that despite some  perilous encounters you have thusfar made it with your life intact. Your  newly amassed knowledge of flora and fauna will probably be utterly useless  in the bars of Aylor, but you can't have everything. } {nynewoods} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {23669} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
