R {23750} {0} {<278>} {Murray's mulberry farm} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is Murray's farm, where the famous mulberry extract is grown and  processed. The extract is known throughout the valley to quench the thirst of even the thirstiest traveler, though it is rumored to have other effects. The house is fairly neat, although it lacks decoration. The door north leads  to the road. The south door leads out to Murray's land. You notice a few  mulberry stains on the door handles. } {solan} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
