R {23754} {0} {<138>} {Brad's brewery} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  Brad grew up in a desert community where beverages were scarce. So to solve  this problem he moved to Solan and started his own brewery. "You can never  have too many beverage options" is Brad's logo. The brewery offers plenty of  non-alcoholic beverages. Brad looks up from his brewing with a cheerful hello whenever someone steps into his shop. He chats with his customers as they  stop by. } {solan} {} {shop} {shop} {1.000} {}
