R {24186} {0} {<228>} {At the base of the World Tree} {<228>( *<088>} {  You stand at the base of the gigantic tree Yggdrasil. Standing high into the  heavens, this magnificent plant bridges the gap between the Nine Worlds. Its  large roots extend from the base to the many different planes of existence. Awe-struck as you are, you forge on with a new determination. A small green  portal stands as a hollow against the tree, offering you passage to the  secrets hidden high above. You speculate that it would be good to drink your  fill from this well. Wouldn't it be something to find the near mythical Well  of Wisdom, Mmisbrunnr? Legend says that Odin gave an eye to Mmisbrunnr in  return for wisdom. } {ygg} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
