R {24187} {0} {<268>} {Bifrost's Eternal Junction} {<268>. .<088>} {  Standing at the intersection of the great rainbow bridge, Bifrost, you feel  so insignificant. The huge expanses span to distant lands and connect the  entire world together. If you strain your eyes northwards you can see  desolate wastelands and a pale gray shoreline. The eastern bridge connects to a rugged mountainous region. A bitterly cold breeze can be felt drifting from the eastern lands. Unquenchable fires burn to the south. Looking westwards a  huge Viking longboat is anchored at the shoreline. Gazing above you a small  forest with golden gates holds a small elven village. Below you...complete  darkness. } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
