R {24188} {0} {<268>} {On the Rainbow Bridge} {<268>. .<088>} {  Walking lightly upon the almost intangible bridge, you come to a vista above  a wasteland. Staring down at this wretched sight, all that is visible is  miles of snow-blanketed plains and frozen mountains. Sleet and ice pepper  from the skies, as if making sure that this dismal place stays eternally  within its desolate grasp. Shifting about slowly, large figures slink in and  about the mountains, making you wonder just what sort of creature would and  does live here. Against your better judgment, you begin your descent. } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
