R {24189} {0} {<268>} {On the Rainbow Bridge} {<268>. .<088>} {  Walking slowly southward, you begin to notice an increase in the temperature. The cold air has disappeared and is replaced with a gust of heat. Removing  some of your layers of clothing, you move onward. The heat becomes greater as you come upon a mesa. Further below lies miles of fire scorched lands burning brightly. Fear falls across your heart, as the pyre burns brighter,  swallowing more land. Large figures move across the mountainscape, revealing  what must be residents of this forsaken land. Leaving quickly would probably  be the best course of action... } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
