R {24190} {0} {<268>} {On the Rainbow Bridge} {<268>. .<088>} {  You reach the edge of this portion of the Rainbow Bridge, only to come upon a long twisting river. Miles into the distance, you happen to see a Viking  longboat fighting upstream on this magnificent river. Its long body piercing  the waves as its large sails drag it forward. The large emblem of Odin is  emblazoned onto the sail and again on the side of the ship. A few men move  about on the deck and the captain can be seen resting on the port side  against the railing. Their journey lies upon this body of water, as now so  does yours... } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
