R {24191} {128} {<268>} {On the Rainbow Bridge} {<268>. .<088>} {  Traversing westward on the shimmering bridge, you come to an abrupt stop. The walkway seems to become completely intangible here, fading in and out. It is almost painful upon your eyes to concentrate on its sporadic movement. Averting your eyes up towards the horizon, you fall back gasping. Light is so bright that it nearly blinds you as it shines off the frozen ground below. The chilled winds whip your face as tiny ice crystals swirl and spin in a  whirlwind of frozen confusion. Freezing temperatures bite at your exposed  skin and nature's fury pushes you away. You try to turn and leave, but  something draws you towards the frigid wastelands. Something painfully  alluring... } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
