R {24192} {0} {<268>} {On the Rainbow Bridge} {<268>. .<088>} {  You begin to walk up a steady incline. Pondering what could be happening, you speed up and head towards the end of the bridge, where you find an  astonishing view. Looking down over an endless greenscape, you stare in awe. Large plush forests cover parts of this beautiful land, while glistening  ponds and rivers snake about the land. Here and there, a small village rests  in a clearing or near the base of a body of water. Wildflowers grow up to the bridge's end, filling each of your breaths with an intoxicating aroma. Your  feet begin to move with your awareness, eager to approach this magnificent  place. } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
