R {24193} {0} {<268>} {On the Rainbow Bridge} {<268>. .<088>} {  Walking now slightly downhill, you begin to see where the bridge is leading. A large mountain rests at the walkway's end. Arcing toward the heavens, this  gigantic entity drops a shadow covering this end of the Rainbow Bridge. Slopes vacant of life, the mountain seems somewhat forgotten, excluding small holes that penetrate it across its surface. Small, almost unnoticeable  figures scurry across the mountain's edge. Curiosity has you in its iron  grasp as you tread closer to the colossus ahead of you. Glancing at the base  of the bridge, you notice something doesn't look quite right, but you aren't  in charge of maintenance. } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
