R {24194} {0} {<238>} {Overlooking the Mists} {<238>/ \<088>} {  You step off the bridge onto a small mesa, and you meet with a cold gust of  air. The wind blows fiercely as you overlook this desolate place. Lifelessness blankets the mountains, along with a few feet of snow. No sun  burns above this frozen nightmare, only layers of pitch black clouds cover  the sky masking all that lies beyond. Fear begins to set in, as you turn  around to realize that the bridge you came from isn't there. You are trapped, held within these icy confines and bound with glacial shackles. Pulling your  cloak tighter, you begin to descend. You move only steps before a loud growl  sounds behind you. Panic grasps your heart as you reach for your weapon. } {ygg} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
