R {24195} {0} {<238>} {Upon the path of glacial eternity} {<238>/ \<088>} {  You have walked for what seems like endless days, and yet only seconds have  past since you entered this desolate land. Step after step never brings  anything new into sight, and the constant onslaught of snow and hail blocks  your vision of the road ahead. Traversing further and further down the  snaking trail, you stumble over a broken sign, lying in a frozen puddle. Examining it closer, your spirits rise. Maybe something exists out here that  can help you on your quest...or tear you from it. } {ygg} {} {mountain} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}
