R {24196} {0} {<108>} {Enshrouded in Darkness} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  You have fallen from the magnificent Rainbow bridge into a pool of solid  darkness... Nothing that was here before is here now, as ethereal shadows  dance about the room in a snaking mantra. Sunlight fails to pierce this  blackened hell, and no sounds of the outside life can be heard. You can move  about, almost floating in pools of darkened waters, and begin to wander  further into the void. You notice two small grey objects hovering in the air. The tide of black waves carry you closer and closer to the dull ovals. Moments pass, and you find yourself face to face with a large creature hiding within the darkness. Its form is mostly hidden from perception, and it emits  an awful hissing sound as you try to edge away from it. The form begins to  speak as you make your way further down into oblivion. } {ygg} {} {space1} {safe,shop} {1.000} {}
