R {24197} {0} {<278>} {Within the Halls of Judgement} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Here you stand among many others, all sinners accused of murder, thievery,  and crimes against humanity. Here you stand among your kin... Shadows dance  across the cracked walls, as each man, woman, and creature tells the story of their crimes and their pain. Only dim candlelight allows for visions of this  eternal damnation. Ruffians, murderers, rapists, politicians, lawyers, and  others sit at a long dining table that stretches the length of this dismal  place. You take a seat at the end, and listen intently as thoughts of escape  fill your mind. } {ygg} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
