R {24199} {0} {<278>} {Den of Iniquity} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A foul stench fills your nose as you walk into the room. The bodies of the  long dead lie against the wall, and pieces of other beings crowd the floor. Rotting flesh hangs from the walls, dripping a mix of excrement and bugs onto the stone floor. Small furry creatures run about on the floor, eating  whatever they can and avoiding what they can't. A large fireplace crowds the  back corner of the room. Flames burn high over charred bones, burned flesh  and other things that are better left unknown hiding beneath the rubbish. } {ygg} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
