R {24200} {0} {<138>} {The Shore of Corpses} {<138>%%<088>} {  Falling from the frozen plains, you find yourself upon the shore of a black  sea. The bodies of thousands of unknown souls float on the sea and litter the rocky beach. There are pieces of torn flesh and blood sifting through the  bubbling waves. Unholy screams float up through the waves, as each wave  crashes over another. No sun shines down upon this horrid place. A blood red  moon glows dimly overhead, luridly lighting this mass grave. Every way you  turn, more cadavers are borne onto the beach, as the spirits of the fallen  descend to this forsaken place. } {ygg} {} {quicksand} {pk} {1.000} {}
