R {24204} {0} {<268>} {The Lake of Fire} {<268>. .<088>} {  Your last step sends you hurtling into a large lake encased in flames. Fire  sears your flesh with your attempts to surface. Life slips away gradually, as you vainly try to reach the shore. Pain pierces every part of your body, and  unconsciousness begins to tighten its grasp upon you. } {ygg} {} {air} {maze} {1.000} {}

