R {24208} {0} {<278>} {A cavern beneath the lake} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Nearly passing out due to the intense heat, you are swept beneath the the  waves of magma. Taking one last breath, you prepare for the end. Instead, you find yourself in a large cavern. The walls gleam with precious and unique  stones that have been created by thousands of years of pressure from the  lake. Towards the center of the room is a shimmering pool of water. It is  unbelievably clear and waves brush against the shore of the cave, causing a  soft mist. } {ygg} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
