R {24209} {0} {<228>} {Aboard the Viking Longboat} {<228>, `<088>} {  With a loud crash, you fall against the polished deck. Looking up, you see  that the bridge has disappeared. Standing up, you begin to take a look  around. You seem to have landed on a long vessel of some sort. You see long  wooden deck with a large oak mast protruding from the center. The sail is  emblazoned with the symbol of Odin and flaps gallantly in the wind. Further  to the west, you can see the captain leaning against the rail, trying to  predict the weather conditions. You can hear men below, singing drunkenly,  and laughing hoarsely. Over the side, the long river snakes miles ahead,  where it empties into the ocean. } {ygg} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
