R {24210} {0} {<228>} {Main Deck} {<228>, `<088>} {  The odor of salt is strong. The fresh sea spray gently mists upon your face. Above you a dirty white sail flaps in the crisp ocean air. Sounds of grunting and drunken laughter can be heard beneath your feet. A lone gull perches upon the railing next to you and screech its sorrowful tune. You breathe deep and  take in the day's final hours as the sun starts to set. The water against the ship's hull throws frothy foam back into the sea as it cuts a path towards an unknown destination. } {ygg} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
