R {24211} {0} {<228>} {Longboat's Jutting Bow} {<228>, `<088>} {  Standing at the bow of the ship you feel lulled by the waves gently lapping  the side of the vessel. The sound seems to drown out the gulls' screech in  the distance. Towards the horizon you detect a slowly setting sun and a  blazing red and yellow sky. The clouds stretch forever over the choppy blue  waters. Standing at the wheel, a large unshaven man guides the boat over the  frigid sea. The boat seems to sail eagerly into the uncharted waters. } {ygg} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
