R {24212} {0} {<238>} {Atop the Mast} {<238>/ \<088>} {  Atop the wooden mast, you can see the vast ocean stretching in all  directions. Salty sea spray stings your eyes. Gulls surround you, many  taunting and challenging your patience. A brisk breeze from the north flaps  the sail next to you, and catching you off-guard, you nearly slip. The  blinding sun glistens off the water, the waves tossing the boat to and fro. A single cloud looms high in the sky, the azure sky seeminly swallowing it. } {ygg} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
