R {24218} {0} {<178>} {Upon the Tundras of Ice and Stone} {<178>~ ~<088>} {  Amongst the frozen wastelands you can make out only the glaring white snow  and sparkling ice. As the crisp wind blows against your face a million tiny  ice needles prick your skin. Many hearty warriors have fallen victim to this  harsh environment. The air is fresh and clean but you sense it is slowly  drawing your energy away. As you trudge along the frozen ground you feel your joints become stiff. The snow crunches under your feet and in the distance  you spot a serene patch of snow untrampled by human feet. In the south you  see a castle. } {ygg} {} {ice} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {24219} {0} {<178>} {Along the Banks of the Iving} {<178>~ ~<088>} {  Pure blue water flows from the mountains before you. This river, Iving, never freezes no matter how frigid the weather might be. Its tranquil bubbling  sound lulls you to a sense of security. It shimmers as the light reflects off its gentle ripples. The deep azure hue is like nothing you've ever seen  before. Jotunheimir is separated from Asgaard by this stream of stunning  beauty. The polar climates of this region are becoming more apparent as you  feel the temperature dropping well below zero. As the night approaches, all  life vanishes into shelters from fear the biting cold will steal their life  as they sleep. } {ygg} {} {ice} {maze} {1.000} {}

R {24220} {0} {<178>} {Before the Castle} {<178>~ ~<088>} {  A castle towers over you made entirely of crystalline ice, its smooth clear  surface cold to the touch. As you approach the gates you look straight up and notice that there is an intricate pattern carved into the solid ice. There  are towering walls and towers that seem to touch the clouds. The Iving River  flows through the moat protecting the castle from intruders while Thiazi's  guards protect the gates. Upon the translucent castle wall you see long,  clear icicles dangling from above, never melting. The castle stands there in  all its glory like a stronghold made of diamond. } {ygg} {} {ice} {} {1.000} {}
