R {24221} {0} {<278>} {Throne Room of the Eternal Frost} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are in awe as you approach the throne room of Thiazi. The room is more  magnificent than the rest of the castle. Statues of Teutonic gods decorate  the room. Giant blue pillars supporting the high ceiling and thirty foot tall windows seem to reach forever. A huge throne made from the waters of the  river Iving is where the god Thiazi sits. The castle is cold and drafty but  there is a certain sense of security in it. The hallways are filled with  doors to countless rooms and chambers. The light in here reflects off every  surface and glistens on every structure. } {ygg} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
