R {24222} {0} {<278>} {Upon the Ringhorn} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You land with a crash upon the bow of a long ship. The breeze coming off the  sea water swirls your cloak, as the sun cascades off the glinting waters. Seagulls flap by without a care, letting their calls harmoniously pierce the  heavens. The smell of burning flesh and smoke fills your nostrils, as you  turn to see the funeral pyre of Balder, the most beloved of all gods. His  body rests in a hero's fashion, and the mount he rests upon is surrounded by  treasures and flowers. } {ygg} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}
E {24187} {enter portal} {enter portal} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {24223} {0} {<228>} {Inside an elven village} {<228>( *<088>} {  Small thatched huts crowd the streets here as elven citizens and large carts  struggle past one another. Large groves of trees act as a barrier around the  outside of the village, preventing anyone from finding it. A large worn dirt  road passes through the village in its entirety, leading directly to a  temple. } {ygg} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {24224} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {24224} {0} {<228>} {On a path} {<228>( *<088>} {  The road shrinks into a trodden dirt path. In the distance a large golden  temple rises majestically into the sky. Awestruck, you watch as the sun's  reflection off the temple lights the scenery for miles around. } {ygg} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {24225} {u} {u} {16} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
