R {24225} {0} {<268>} {Upon the Sun's Highest Altar} {<268>. .<088>} {  The sun's undying rays shine upon your face and its warmth fills your body. Pure white walls inlaid with the finest gold from around the world reach to  the heavens. This sacred place is undefiled by evil's malicious grasp. Freyr's throne stands here in all its glory as he looks upon his holy kingdom judging the good from the wicked. An ambient hum bounces off the walls, as  softly an infinite cry of compassion and mercy drones along. } {ygg} {} {air} {} {1.000} {}
