R {24226} {0} {<278>} {A Darkened Cave} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Almost no light fills this dank cavern, as you awaken from a death-like  sleep. Stumbling slightly as you arise, the smells of sea water and unwashed  dwarves fills your nose. The jagged walls of the cave allow a handhold along  the slippery floors. A bright flash of light shatters the darkness as you  turn a corner, and you find yourself in the presence of four small dwarves,  huddled about a campfire. } {ygg} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}
E {24187} {enter portal} {enter portal} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {24227} {0} {<278>} {In front of Golden Gates} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Awe completely overwhelms you as you stand before the magnificent gates of  Asgaard. Glittering with encrusted jewels and knotted with silver, the  doorway shines brighter than the sun itself. Shielding your eyes, you move  onward, curious of what lies behind this amazing architecture. } {ygg} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
