R {24228} {0} {<278>} {Starlit Balcony} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You walk out onto a gigantic balcony overlooking the planes of Yggdrasil. Weaves of silver and gold create a decorative railing, and large marble  pillars sturdy a small overhang. A small woman stands here, humming to  herself. She sees you, and raising a bony finger, beckons you closer. } {ygg} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
