R {24229} {0} {<278>} {Trapped within Hel} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Obviously not liking your taste, Nidhogg spit you across the Sea of Corpses. Landing hard on your backside, you look up to find yourself in an icy domain. High mountains of solid ice prevent any form of escape, and the freezing  waters prevent any boats from landing. You are trapped, helpless, within this frigid hell. From behind you, a wolfen howl sounds, and female laughter  follows. } {ygg} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
