R {24230} {0} {<278>} {The Hall of Gladsheim} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Before you lies a wide hall, with torches and fireplaces lighting the stone  work quite well. A long oak table runs the length of the entire hall, filled  with exotic foods and mead for the gods. Servants rush incessantly about  trying to make sure everything is in order. Around the table are seated the  inhabitants of Asgaard, the Aesir. Each god with his or her own assortment of servants and counselors, they sit drinking, eating, and discussing battle  plans. } {ygg} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}
