R {24231} {0} {<268>} {The Raging Sea} {<268>. .<088>} {  A blast of salty sea spray shoots into the air trailing a prodigious serpent. His titanic scales shimmer as the water flows over his sleek body. A forked  tongue juts out of his mouth, slipping past venomous fangs and he makes a  fearsome hissing. Huge waves rip across the plane of the oceans forming giant rings around the beast. A rush of water drenches you and drags you further  into the sea. The ocean turns a pale shade of green as Jormungand spews toxic venom into the gaping black sky and dark waters. The toxic substance drains  your life away. } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {24232} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {24232} {0} {<268>} {Destruction of the Powers} {<268>. .<088>} {  The final days are upon us. Surt has risen from the southern lands of  Muspellheim. Freyr has come as a sole competitor to the power of the fire  giants. The twilight of the gods has arrived. Judgement will be swift, and  the vengeance swifter. The limits having been reached, a terminal blow shall  be dealt and the new world shall start. An idyllic start to a hopeless  prelude. The evil will be wiped out and the gods will live in harmony. A new  world rises from the sea like a phoenix from the ashes, but now is the time  for destruction. } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
