R {24233} {0} {<268>} {Shattered Earth} {<268>. .<088>} {  Utter silence\; nothing stirs\; nothing makes a sound. Then a single figure is  seen looming in the darkness. A terrible hulking mass of fur and claws. A  flaming red wolf screams from the shadows shattering the silence. The earth  from where he leapt is torn and ravaged. A gaping scar is made onto the  surface. The frail ground is ripped apart as Fenris claws at the soil. A howl so terrifying that it rattles your bones is unleashed and the earth shudders  in fear as the furies of Skoll and Hadi are released upon the broken world. Complete chaos has been set upon this fragile world. It's just too much  pressure to take. } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
