R {24234} {0} {<268>} {Plains of Vigrid} {<268>. .<088>} {  The harsh plains of Vigrid show no mercy to the weak. The scarred land has  seen many battles and the blood of many brave warriors has been spilled upon  this very ground. The hard packed earth shows sign of warhorses and soldiers  alike trudging across the barren fields. Foliage in this area is sparse and  all signs of life have been trampled and stained with deep red blood. From  all the corners of the world, gods, giants, dwarves, demons and elves will  ride towards the broken lands to fight in one last showdown. Mighty and weak  shall be equally slaughtered and a new victor will arise. } {ygg} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
