R {24235} {0} {<268>} {The Blackened Throne within the Clouds} {<268>. .<088>} {  It is the end of days and you have stumbled upon a final respite before the  destruction of the world you know. Troubled screams of pain and agony resound beneath this airborne throne room. The sky is pitch black and foreboding  shadows loom overhead heralding an uncertain fate. The wails of the fallen  pierce your ears and the stench of war is suspended in the cold night air. Before you is a throne, demonic in appearance. The cold marble structure is  darker than the midnight sky. There is only one twisted enough to sit upon  this throne and laugh at the doom that has fallen upon this corrupted nation. That being is Loki, and he is prepared to purge the land to exalt his evil  reign. } {ygg} {} {air} {} {1.000} {}
