R {25481} {0} {<248>} {Swirling Forces} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  Stepping over the shaft in the floor, you are immediately sucked down into a viciously narrow whirlpool.  Bumped from side to side and descending at a gut-wrenching speed, you emerge from the bottom end of the shaft with a loud 'POP' into a small room with a grate covering leading down.  Two smaller grates also lead off in opposite directions, but are far too tiny to traverse.  Another large room can be seen through the grate below you.   } {oradrin} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}

R {25482} {0} {<248>} {Before the Throne} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  You float at the top end of a steeply sloped underwater chamber.  Shattered columns line the walls leading down, some collapsed inwards and strewn across the floor.  Bubbles emerge from cracks and chasms and dissipate shortly afterwards.  At the bottom end of the chamber, a throne rests on a slant.  This place has been the sight of a great rage, but not recently.  Noting the grate on the slanted ceiling above, you realize that the pressures of the depths and the whirlpool distorted your senses of gravity and perception while in the small chamber above.   } {oradrin} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
