R {25483} {0} {<248>} {Throne of the Chosen} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  The destruction seems to fade somewhat as you near the throne.  It would seem that the last attempt at invasion of the throne room and the death of its lord ended further up the slope.  Its success seems questionable, but one can never be too sure.  The throne, while on a slant, is majestic and impressive.  Crafted of the finest sapphires and emeralds, the throne stands the height of a giant, and the base radiates an eight-pointed star made of diamond.   } {oradrin} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
