R {25551} {0} {<178>} {A Chilly Reception Area} {<178>[ ]<088>} {  As you come through the door, there is a sign which reads, "Wait here for  the next available receptionist".  There is some smaller writing underneath  it.  You see several cubicle like desks; the view beyond them is blocked by  the crystal frosted glass that divides the desks.  } {canyon} {} {insideice} {} {1.000} {}
