R {25552} {0} {<268>} {A Busy Hallway} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  The main entrance to the hospital is very luxurious.  Dark wooden timbers offer the main support to the ice framework of the hospital here.  Veins of gold and silver have been worked into the wood.  A set of large, glass doors lead out into the atrium.  The doors have been etched with signs of smiling doctors, nurses and happy looking patients.  The doors don't appear to have been sound proofed, as the sounds of children playing and happy birds float through the doors.  A large sign hangs from the ceiling.   } {canyon} {} {hallway} {} {1.000} {}
