R {25554} {0} {<178>} {Main Waiting Room} {<178>[ ]<088>} {  Snowy white walls surround this bright room.  There is a painting hanging on one wall and some scrolls scattered around a table against another wall.  Chairs are placed neatly in rows around the room and there is a box full of toys in one corner.   } {canyon} {} {insideice} {} {1.000} {}
