R {25555} {0} {<178>} {Surgical Waiting Room} {<178>[ ]<088>} {  This large icy room is filled with chairs.  It appears that this room has not been reorganized in some time.  A tiny group of chairs has been circled together in one corner.  Newsprint and magazines were placed in a seemingly random fashion amongst the chairs.  None seem to have been read, but rather just used to keep track of time.  A large clock stands against the wall and seems to show the current time.   } {canyon} {} {insideice} {} {1.000} {}
