R {25557} {0} {<268>} {A Turn in the First Floor Hallway} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  The icy hallway takes a turn here.  This corner is a bit odd as the walls appear to be melting.  Perhaps the sunlight coming through the small window has something to do with it.  A peculiar smell also seems to permeate this section of the hallway.  It seems to reek of ammonia and nitrates, almost a strong fertilizer smell.  Oddly it is coming from the pharmacy area.  There is a small sign hanging outside of the door in the hallway.   } {canyon} {} {hallway} {} {1.000} {}
