R {25558} {0} {<178>} {Exam Room Two} {<178>[ ]<088>} {  This space seems quite small to contain the smell which seems to permeate the  entire room.  Odd runes and symbols are scrawled upon the walls.  Groups of  half empty and completely empty bottles litter the room.  It looks like who  ever was working in here was in a hurry, attempting what ever they could to  take care of the patients in this room. } {canyon} {} {insideice} {} {1.000} {}
