R {25559} {0} {<268>} {A Freezing Hallway} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  It seems to have grown dim in this section.  The light from a huge window  here seems to have been muted somehow.  Oddly it is just as warm here as it  was in the last section.  An odd smell that is bitter yet sweet at the same  time pervades the hallway.  It seems to be coming from the lone doorway.  A  small sign hangs outside the doorway. } {canyon} {} {hallway} {} {1.000} {}
