R {25560} {0} {<178>} {Exam Room One} {<178>[ ]<088>} {  The smell of burning flesh lingers in this room.  A small table is placed in the center of the room and a small stool sits beside it.  The walls have signs and posters with medical propaganda hung from them.  There is a large, covered shelf hung from the wall behind the table.   } {canyon} {} {insideice} {} {1.000} {}
