R {25561} {0} {<178>} {Exam Room Three} {<178>[ ]<088>} {  This room seems smaller than all the other rooms.  There is an exorbitant amount of heat in here.  Tiny flora have sprung from the walls, ceiling, and floor.  Against the light icy blue of the walls, the color of this flora is stunning.  The heat has begun to quickly melt the ice in here.  Rivulets of water fall down the walls and pool into the center of this room.  The water and heat have made this room very humid; making it somewhat unpleasant when compared to the cold of the hospital.   } {canyon} {} {insideice} {} {1.000} {}
E {25562} {e} {open e;e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

