R {25767} {0} {<278>} {The Perfect Road} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are on the most beautifully kept and built road you've ever seen.  Each individual stone appears so clean it may have been scrubbed with a toothbrush, and is set so flawlessly you can barely tell where one stone ends and the next begins.  The road travels for what appears to be a fairly short distance towards the north, heading for the largest dome you've ever seen.  Could that be the infamous Gladiator's Arena?   } {arena} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
