R {25768} {0} {<278>} {Outside the Arena} {<278>. .<088>} {  The road you are on remains nearly perfect in every way, and cleaner than any you've seen before; yet now you can see signs of traffic on the cobbled stones, where decades of long hard use have begun to wear the stones a little TOO smooth.  In front of you is the single largest building you've ever seen; easily ten stories tall, and at least eight thousand feet in diameter, this perfect dome is reputed to have been built so well that a whisper spoken anywhere inside would carry to any other part of the building.  The walls are unbelievably smooth, and so clean that the sun practically reflects off of the dark grey granite.  An enormous archway to the north, fifty feet at its peak and twice as wide, provides access to the dome.   } {arena} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
