R {25771} {0} {<278>} {Entrance to the Fighting Arena} {<278>. .<088>} {  Spread out before you in a mind-boggling array are all of the various sub arenas, rings, and cages of the infamous Fighting Arena.  Here it is possible to engage in just about any form of combat imaginable; anything from hand to hand fighting to full sieges with body armor and chariots is available here, all in pre-made environments.  Contests and tournaments are held here often, sometimes for very large prizes, but most of the time this entire arena is open to all warriors, of any race or nationality, to practice or test their skills against each other for sport.  The entire arena is ringed with raised stands for spectators, but they are not visible from here.  A flight of stairs would seem to lead towards them, while the tunnel leading down from here is a relative mystery to you.   } {arena} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
