R {25773} {0} {<278>} {An Open Warfield} {<278>. .<088>} {  This entire portion of the arena is covered in dirt, rocks, and weeds.  Around 10,000 square feet in all, it provides the perfect setting for large battles involving many combatants in a warlike environment.  Strategically placed bunkers, buildings, and fences add to the setting.  The field itself is often reserved on request for up to two full days, allowing the opposing armies to spend the first day preparing the field with everything from barbed wire to hidden pits, before engaging in their "war" on the second.   } {arena} {} {city} {pk} {1.000} {}
