R {25774} {0} {<278>} {A Large Man-Made Lake} {<278>. .<088>} {  Excluding the Chariots' Arenas, this lake takes up the largest portion of the Fighting Arena.  Completely surrounded by beaches and large enough to hold a small naval battle, the once-blue waters of this lake are a murky red now, despite daily cleanings.  Surrounded on all sides by a very small beach (no more than 10 feet wide), this lake provides the perfect place to hold any type of naval- or water-based combat.   } {arena} {} {city} {pk} {1.000} {}
