R {25775} {0} {<278>} {The Medic's Cages} {<278>. .<088>} {  A series of cages buttressed against one another create a roughly rectangular formation starting in the northeast corner of this gigantic room, and expanding out to take up well over half of it.  Inside the cages you can hear the muffled screams of the wounded and dying Gladiators, and a few very loud snores occasionally escape through as well.  Outside of the cages are rows of padded benches, chairs, and some thickly cushioned cots, where the injured wait their turns for the free, but undeniably competent, medical attention that all Gladiators are granted after their fights.  Medics hustle to and fro - assessing the injuries of each Gladiator, deciding who will be helped when, and who cannot be helped at all - all the while studiously ducking their heads and displaying large green armbands, fastidiously trying to avoid fights with any who might mistake them for other than what they are...   } {arena} {} {city} {pk,healer} {1.000} {}
