R {25780} {0} {<278>} {The Animal Cages} {<278>. .<088>} {  Huge steel cages line the walls and fill most of the available floor space in this part of the arena.  The cages appear to come in all different shapes and sizes, but all are 10 feet tall, and made of steel at least one foot thick.  In each cage is a different animal, all vicious, and all trained to fight.  As with all else here, the cages are of the highest quality, but they've been bashed, battered, and beaten so often over the years by vicious animals, violent gladiators, and virtually every weapon known to man that scratches, dents, and gashes are abundant on every cage.   } {arena} {} {city} {pk} {1.000} {}
