R {25781} {0} {<278>} {Long Range Combat Arenas} {<278>. .<088>} {  4 massive brick walls, each easily 2,000 feet long and 40 feet high, spaced about 200 feet apart, are run crosswise against 2 other walls to create 3 monstrous adjacent arenas.  These arenas, much longer than they are wide, are used for long-range combat.  Bows and arrows, thrown weapons (spears, knives, swords, and so on), and even catapults are the most common weapons of choice here, but these arenas have seen combat using EVERY weapon ever made at one time or another.  Each of the 3 arenas, despite being the exact same size, sports a different layout.  The first is almost overrun with bales of hay, mounds of dirt, and other natural obstacles.  The second is filled with random wooden or steel barricades, while the third has a mazelike design with walls of only the sheerest cloth.  The holes in the cloth are, of course, repaired daily, but the blood stains remain...   } {arena} {} {city} {pk} {1.000} {}
