R {25782} {0} {<278>} {The Jousting Arenas} {<278>. .<088>} {  Four very large but somewhat generic jousting arenas are here.  Each is approximately 500 feet long, with a 3 foot tall wooden wall running the length of the center, and 4 foot high steel railings marking off the outer edges.  Tall towers set on the outskirts of each arenas allow scorekeepers to place flags depicting the crests of each Knight competing, the current scores of each match, and other pertinent information.  Each tower is held in place with 4 tall wooden posts, each post as thick as the trunk of a large tree; it appears that either through foresight or experience the builders realized how easily an errant horse could accidentally knock over a tower!   } {arena} {} {city} {pk} {1.000} {}
