R {25783} {0} {<278>} {The Refreshment Stands} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you enter this large room above the Fighting Arena, your senses are instantly assailed by some of the finest smells you've ever encountered.  Practically covering every inch of the walls to the north are open fires, on which you see meat roasting, stews bubbling, and soups boiling.  Ringing the rest of the room in a three-quarter circle are assorted carts, half-built shacks housing counters, ovens, and other cooking "musts," and seemingly enough chefs to cook for the entire world.  As with everything else offered here, you know that these will be amongst the finest of their respective specialties, and the wonderful aromas only serve to reinforce that fact.  It's known that the food here is extremely expensive, yet the general consensus has always been that it was worth every last copper.   } {arena} {} {inside} {shop} {1.000} {}
