R {25784} {0} {<278>} {The Weapons' Racks} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  One of the most popular areas in the Gladiator's Arena are the weapons' racks.  Here, the finest weapons' makers in all the land put their wares on display.  Each weapon seller stands in front of a gigantic rack; while the sizes of these racks vary, the smallest you can see is roughly 10 feet tall and 20 feet wide.  Every type of weapon you've ever heard of is offered here, most at extremely good prices, and customers throng around every rack bartering, examining, and sometimes testing the largest assortment of death-giving items you've ever dreamed of.   } {arena} {} {inside} {shop} {1.000} {}
