R {25787} {0} {<278>} {Peasants' Seating - Standing Room Only} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Splintered and shattered planks are stacked against the back walls, and piles of wood chips seem to be everywhere.  Apparently, this room used to offer quite a bit of seating for the peasants, but sometime recently the stands must have collapsed.  The clean up effort is overwhelmingly unimpressive on the whole, but nobody really seems to mind.  Small foot stools, probably brought in by peasants who knew about the collapse, allow some of the shorter races to see a little better from behind, and everyone seems to pack in as close to the railing as they can for a better view, leaving ample room near the rear walls for... well, anything.  You could practically fit a circus, complete with elephants, with all the excess room back there!   } {arena} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {25788} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
