R {25788} {0} {<278>} {East Entrance to the Peasants' Seating} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  While it's still possible to view the Fighting Arena from here, there are neither seats, nor any particularly good angles to view the action from.  The walls are barren, and the floor is made of solid granite, so worn over the years that in places it looks as if a misstep could cause you to fall right through it.  The door to the west appears to have jammed open many years ago, and there are no guards stationed near it.  Peasants mill around, discussing what they've seen, who they're rooting for, or what they think might be coming soon.   } {arena} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
