R {25790} {0} {<278>} {The Armor Racks} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Ringing this room are as many smiths, leatherworkers, and assorted other craftsman as you've ever heard of.  Each stands in front of a rack easily twice as big as the ones you saw the weapon sellers' wares on.  Before even looking at their wares, you already know that each will be reputed to be amongst the best in his or her field; the rules on that here are inflexible. Despite it's purpose, the Fighting Arena is known to discourage killing when avoidable, and to that end they offer an incredibly large, high quality assortment of armors here.  All prices are rigidly controlled, to make sure that each prospective Gladiator should be able to protect him- or herself as well as possible.   } {arena} {} {inside} {shop} {1.000} {}
E {25791} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
