R {25877} {0} {<278>} {Preparation Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have entered a long room, lined with storage lockers and racks of weapons and armor.  Men and women alike sit here, shedding their toga's and putting on the armor and bronze weapons of the Reman gladiators.  Many are clearly desperate, desperate for any chance to gain money and fame and rejoin the upper ranks of society from which they have plunged.  Others merely have the choice of starvation, or a risky try at a prize for surviving the arena's rigours.  The door to the south leads outward to your doom, tread it carefully.  You can be cautious and wise, and leave also the north.   } {remcon} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}
