R {25878} {0} {<278>} {The Ticket Booth} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Long lines of gates and booths allow access to the stands that sit around the arena floor like vultures, their wings spread across this field of carrion.  Tickettakers sit lazily on wooden stools, counting the denarii that they collect for small scraps of parchment, with a stamp set into the face.  To the south is the preparation room for those foolish enough to participate in this bloody ritual, while to the north you can escape this soulless place and return to the streets of Reme.   } {remcon} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}
