R {25887} {0} {<168>} {A Desolate Bog} {<168>[<278>?<168>]<088>} {  A dank chill permeates the air, cutting through clothing, piercing to the very bone.  Tendrils of dense mist curl about the sparse vegetation and the occasional gust of wind keeps the mist flowing constantly about the wilted trees and reeds.  The ground under foot is muddy and water-logged, making passage a wearisome task for any passing this way.  Occasionally a fleeting form may be glimpsed in the banks of fog, only to vanish from sight as quickly as it appeared.  A small wooden sign begs the attention of passers-by.   } {drageran} {} {areaexit} {maze} {1.000} {}

