R {25894} {0} {<268>} {Before Castle Levitus} {<268>. .<088>} {  To the north, the swirling clouds part somewhat to reveal a structure of immense proportions rising from a jagged island of solid rock which hangs suspended by some mystical force.  Imposing stone walls, jet black in hue, are topped by numerous crenellated towers.  One in particular overshadows the rest, its lofty height dwarfing its peers.  The pinnacle of the great tower is obscured by a mist which seems to pulse and coagulate as if with a life of its own.  Intermittent glimmers of light slip from within the dark fortress merely serving to cast the grim stonework into deeper shadow.   } {drageran} {} {air} {} {1.000} {}
