R {25895} {0} {<278>} {The Gatehouse} {<278>. .<088>} {  Looming ominously from the mists, the grim walls of Castle Levitus, hewn from giant blocks of jet-black stone, are pitted and marked with the passing of time.  The battlements tower high overhead, their mere presence brooding and oppressive.  To the north, an immense arch carved with intricate runes and symbols frames a formidable double gate of iron-bound oak.  To either side and above the gate stands the gatehouse from which the portcullis may be lowered in time of siege.   } {drageran} {Key on guard in this room} {city} {} {1.000} {}
