R {25897} {0} {<278>} {The Barracks} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Orderly rows of bunks line the south and west walls, each neatly made in regimental fashion.  At the foot of each bed a small, iron-bound trunk provides storage space for personal belongings.  Assorted personal items lie about the room; a mandolin leans in one corner of the room whilst set above it on the wall is a target from which throwing knives protrude.   } {drageran} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
