R {25898} {0} {<278>} {The Outer Courtyard} {<278>. .<088>} {  As imposing as the surrounding battlements are, so the courtyard is as beautiful by contrast.  Neatly tended gardens in each corner hold a dazzling array of flora.  Inlaid slabs of jet and mother-of-pearl are arrayed alternately in check fashion around an exquisitely carved fountain of green stone which gushes forth a relentless stream of the purest water.  To the north, a splendid arch leads within the castle whilst to the east stands a stout gate wide enough for mounted riders or horse-drawn carts to enter.  To the west, a smaller door is set into a recess in the wall.   } {drageran} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
