R {25899} {0} {<278>} {Entrance to the Stables} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The floor of the stable is immaculately clean, with only the faintest traces of scuffing evident where the mounts have passed through.  Around the walls, neatly arranged and each on its own peg is an assortment of riding tackle.  The leather of each has been spit-shined meticulously, the gold of the buckles and trims polished to a glowing luster.  A large door stands to the east, smaller doorways to the north and south.  The outer courtyard lies to the west.   } {drageran} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
