R {25904} {0} {<278>} {The Great Hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The great hall of Castle Levitus is every bit as impressive as the rest of  the titanic fortress. Numerous exquisite works of art adorn the walls. Paintings depict the ancestor of Morrowe, exquisite tapestries celebrate  historical triumphs, and scultures depict the family. In the center of the  hall a spacious area permits guests to dance and performers to entertain. Skirting this space, opulent furniture is interspersed with long tables,  filled with every conceivable delicacy. Curtains cover the west wall, while  to the north is a sturdy double door, inlaid with runes. To either side of  this door, ladders ascend to the gallery. } {drageran} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
