R {25905} {0} {<278>} {The Castle Library} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Myriad books and archives are neatly stacked on bookshelves which fill the  walls from floor to ceiling. A careful examination of their titles reveals  them to be sorted by their authors. Subject matter is diverse, ranging from  ancient history to zoology, pre-historic mysticism. The owner of this library is obviously affluent should the worth of such works be considered, and  singularly learned were they to have read but a fraction of the literature  present. A long table bedecked with books fills the centre of the room whilst to one side stands a smaller table with a half-full glass of wine resting  upon it. } {drageran} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
