R {26082} {0} {<248>} {Atlantean Test Ground} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  Standing at the bottom of the underground garden, you are suddenly aware that you have been transported to another realm.  From your extensive travels and studies you can assume you are in the legendary Lost City of Atlantis.  You are standing in the middle of an arena of some kind.  The bleachers surrounding the arena are filled with Atlanteans who watch you with judging eyes.  You can see several tall buildings jutting into the distant skyline.  It is obvious to you that these people are a very advanced civilization, and not happy in the least that you are here.  A bead of sweat runs down your face as you begin to wonder why you are here - is it merely to be put to death, or the beginning of some sort of test?   } {dread} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
