R {26087} {0} {<278>} {Sandy Racing Field} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Standing along the sandy shoreline as the surf rolls upon your feet, you look out on the ocean and see seemingly forever.  The sounds of yelling and screaming in the distance seem to be getting closer to you.  On the horizon you see two runners racing down the sandy beach.  From this distance one appears to be female and the other a man.  The woman appears to be stopping every once in a while, giving the man even more distance between the two.   } {dread} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
