R {26088} {0} {<278>} {Elysian Fields} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Here is a wondrous green field that seems to roll endlessly on, with brilliantly green tall trees that seem to tickle the heavens in the horizon. Many a hero is wandering around; some look puzzled, others look at home, but all share a common look in their eyes: one of a happy hunter, as happy as can be.  Oh, the stories you could tell your friends about these heroes, old heroes the bards sing about and the unsung heroes alike that you've met here! } {dread} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
