R {26324} {0} {<268>} {Petrified Forest of Glimmerdim} {<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>} {  The Petrified Forest of Glimmerdim is a sacred place for the drow. It is here that all their rites of passage will take place. They come here to give  birth, to marry and to die. Each Glimmerdimean knows their tree by nature. Their mother will have given birth under the tree, which will have been the  tree under which she was born. Those who marry stand each under their own  tree and call out their vows. Many drow will choose their mate based upon the proximity of their trees. } {glimmerdim} {} {temple} {} {1.000} {}
