R {26450} {0} {<278>} {Inside the Car} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As soon as you climb in, you hear a low growl just behind you.  You snap your head around to see what made the sound as your bowels turn to water.  The most hideous form you've ever seen is holding a car seat in one massive hand ...  And the car seat is crushed almost beyond recognition.  This car will not be your ticket out of this insanity after all ...  In fact, the door just slammed shut behind you as you came in - and you are closed in here with that thing!   } {longnight} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {26449} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {26451} {0} {<278>} {The Library} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  What a mess!  The book shelves are tipped over ...  The desk in on its side ...  And the floors are just covered with mounds and heaps of books.  You hear a low moan as you take in the disaster around you ...  And in the next flash, you see a woman sticking out from under the overturned desk.  You rush over to help her, barking your shin painfully on something as you do, but just as you get to her, the moaning stops, and you can almost see the life light drain from her eyes as she sighs her last breath.  A small trickle of blood runs down her cheek from the corner of her lips.   } {longnight} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
