R {26453} {0} {<278>} {Hammond Insurance} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As soon as you come into here, you know you shouldn't stay.  After the cold you were feeling outside, the heat in here is as oppressive and painful as it is shocking.  There's an angry red glow down the hall to the east ...  And you can smell smoke.  There must be a fire in here someplace, and from what you've seen elsewhere - you're not sure you'll have much warning before you get far too close to it.  Things just seem to burn out like coals ...  Without open flames.  You've never seen anything like it before.   } {longnight} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {26452} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {26454} {0} {<278>} {Portland Avenue Garage} {<278>. .<088>} {  Cars are pulled up to the pumps, and you feel certain that the owners of those cars will never drive them away again.  Howls and laughter and shouts mingle with the blasts of thunder ...  And there seems to be movement all around you.  You decided that this may not be the healthiest spot in the world for you to be in right about now ...   } {longnight} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
E {26452} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

