R {26456} {0} {<278>} {Old Folk's Home} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are standing in the atrium of an old folks home.  In the distance you can hear pitiful screams, quavering voices pleading for mercy ...  Voices that abruptly stop in the middle of a word.  With head bowed, listening, you pause.  You have seen so much horror - so much carnage ...  That you feel something inside of you has died for ever.  You know what you would find if you continued into the building, and you're not sure that you can deal with the sights that have to be waiting for you deeper in the building.  You whisper a silent prayer for the poor, helpless elderly who may still be alive in here.   } {longnight} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
