R {26459} {0} {<278>} {In a Large Colonial House} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The people who live, err, lived, in these houses had to have plenty of money.  They are very very large, and filled with expensive looking antiques.  Sad, very sad ...  The people who bought them and obviously spent so much time and money on them are now gone, or if they're not gone, they soon will go the way of all the others you've seen laying mangled and torn at nearly every step you've taken.  Nothing left to show for it all.  In one infamous night - all killed in gruesome fashion.  And you have to wonder if all of this clap-trap that money can buy is anything more than vanity ...   } {longnight} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
