R {26461} {0} {<278>} {In a Large Colonial Mansion} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The lightning flash is close enough to make you jump in fright, but you're not sure if it was the sudden deafening explosion of sound, or if it was what the flash revealed to you.  A woman in her mid 50's is laying on the floor in a pool of blood.  From what's been done to her, you feel certain that she's dead.  She's dressed in fancy clothes, and her face is covered under layers of makeup - or of something else that seems to be really glittery.  You guess that her hair was probably also well coifed before, well, before this ...   } {longnight} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
