R {26462} {0} {<278>} {A Large House on the Hill} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You thought this was another colonial house, but as you enter it you can tell it's from a later period.  But from what you could see in the fiery lightning, the grounds around the house more than make up for whatever is lacking in the house ...  Not that it's a shabby house.  You stand there in the dark doorway, listening for any sound you can pick up.  A very faint scratching sound is coming from just over your head someplace ...  At least it sounds that way when the thunder stops rumbling long enough for you to tell.  Suddenly a warm drop of - something - drops onto you head.  You reach up to touch the wet spot, and the next flash of lightning shows that the tip of your finger is black - with shiny red blood in the red light.   } {longnight} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
