R {26463} {0} {<278>} {The Monument} {<278>. .<088>} {  The road forks around a monument of some sort here.  In the lightning, it seems to be a statue of a soldier on a high pedestal, and there is also a cannon in the grass at the foot of the statue.  You can see an inscription, but in the uncertain red light, you can only make out a few words.  The wider road continues south, and a narrow one forks to the west.   } {longnight} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
