R {26466} {0} {<278>} {In the Lodge} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Your first impression of this place is that you have stepped into hell itself.  You seem somehow removed from the mundane mortal world - and placed in a furnace - which roars all around you.  Demons of all sizes and shapes scamper off in all directions.  You are standing before the gates of hell.   } {longnight} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
