R {26467} {0} {<278>} {Into the Demon's Clutches} {<278>. .<088>} {  You really should have followed your better judgment and just not come any further south.  Once the demons see you, you have no chance of escape.  They descend upon you, and your mind tries to go blank - to shut out what is happening to you ...  The pain is indescribable ...  You wonder how long it will take you to die ...   } {longnight} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}

R {26468} {0} {<278>} {Agamenticus Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  The street is very narrow here at the fork.  From the way the lightning looks to the west, there seems to less of a hill there than there was closer to the center of town.  You heart leaps as you wonder if perhaps you will finally find a way to leave town in this direction ...   } {longnight} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
