R {26469} {0} {<278>} {Agamenticus Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  Things seem fairly still out this way ...  There are none of the shrieks and screaming there were in town, and you don't see any movement in the bushes or down the road.  You wonder if you've finally found a place the demons haven't hit yet - perhaps even a place that's been spared for some reason.  You begin to breathe more slowly and evenly as you feel some of the sheer terror drain away from you.   } {longnight} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
E {26468} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
