R {26470} {0} {<278>} {Agamenticus Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  Your hopes are rising with every step that brings you further out into the country.  You have a fixed idea in your head that if you can just get out of this town, the sun will shine, the temperatures will go back to where they're supposed to be for this season ...  Normal living people will be going for casual strolls, or rocking themselves out on their porches.  Oh yes - and all the demons will vanish.  A thought keeps trying to force its way out from underneath that idea - that perhaps it's like this all over the world right now - but won't allow it to surface and be heard.  You - can NOT - allow it to be heard.   } {longnight} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
