R {26471} {0} {<278>} {Garland's House} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is a big old rambling farm house.  The lightning doesn't help light the place much, because the windows aren't large, and they seem to have a lot of stuff in front of them.  You can hear a racket from a room in the back - and you're amazed when you identify the sound as a big bird, like maybe a cockatoo.  You can hear quiet movement not far from you ...  And your heart is in your throat again.   } {longnight} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {26470} {e} {open e;e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {26472} {0} {<278>} {Agamenticus Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  You're not exactly hearing crickets ...  But you're more at peace on the inside than you have been since all of this started.  You're definitely out of town now - or at least, you're out of the busy part of town.  You have no clue where the road goes, but if you haven't lost your bearings, then you're going further southeast into Maine.  You think if you keep going in this general direction, that you'll have to hit the ocean before too long ...  Won't you?   } {longnight} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
