R {26495} {0} {<278>} {The Bancourt's} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The light in here, although subdued, is a real shock to your system.  There are at least 4 candles lit in here!  You haven't seen so much light, apart from the awful lightning, since this whole ordeal began.  A middle aged man and woman are sitting at the kitchen table, where two candles are lit.  In the shadows behind them, you see another candle, and in that dim light, you can just make out 3 sleeping children.  One seems a bit older than the other two.  Yet another candle is lit before a picture on a small table.  The feeling is one of peace and safety.   } {longnight} {} {inside} {safe,shop} {1.000} {}
