R {26503} {0} {<278>} {Berwick Academy} {<278>. .<088>} {  You're at a T intersection ...  But the road to the east has the bushy part of a tree laying across it, and it's smouldering with a cherry red glow.  North you can see a vast open space - as if you were on a hill overlooking a a valley.  Then you remember that the river is down there, and you guess that the hills the lightning is illuminating on the other side of the valley have to be in New Hampshire.  You heart falls when you realize it's just as dark over there - as it is over here!  It won't do you any good to get back over the bridge.   } {longnight} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
