R {26504} {0} {<278>} {Berwick Academy} {<278>. .<088>} {  The largest building you've seen on the campus is just south of you.  In your terror fogged mind, you remember seeing it just before crossing the bridge into Maine - just before the darkness descended on the world.  It looked like such an idyllic place.  Never did you dream you would see it up close - and under these strange circumstances.  The road continues to the west, but again you see trees down, blocking the way.  The lightning seems to have really taken its toll on this well exposed hill.  There's a sign in front of the building.   } {longnight} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
