R {26505} {0} {<278>} {The Lyceum} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  It's very dark when you enter the building.  You get the impression of long echoing hallways and high ceilings, but since the only way any light can get into where you are is through the door you just came in, you can't really be sure just what is inside of here.  You guess, from the name, that it must be a central building that serves the entire campus.  Perhaps there are classrooms - or meeting halls.  But whatever else there is in here - you know you're not alone.  You can hear strange sounds in the distance ...  And because of the echoes, you can't tell where they're really coming from.   } {longnight} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
