R {26637} {0} {<278>} {In a Dirt Cellar} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You can't see, but you can tell from the way the floor feels that you're in a dirt cellar. Feeling around in the complete darkness, you realize that there are clotheslines everyplace down here! You can't make out all of the pieces of clothes hanging from them ... there don't seem to be any regular pants, shirts ... but you can feel socks, and maybe underwear.   The walls of the room seem to be made out of field stone. The thought of what you could accidentally put your hands on down here in this tomb-like place gives you the creeps ... } {longnight} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
