R {26931} {0} {<278>} {Port Side of Airship} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is the left most part of the ship.  Once has to marvel at the construction of this fine ship.  The inner hull, is a masterpiece of construction.  Almost entirely smooth, it makes for a rare site nowadays.  This ship must be one of the best kept ships in any fleet of the empire.  One could only expect that though from the elite of the empire.  That as well is another thing it is obvious from how the crew is conducting themselves that they are real professionals.  Anyone would be lucky to serve upon this grand vessel.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
