R {26933} {0} {<278>} {Starboard Side of Airship} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The far right of the ship houses the machines which make this magnificent beast fly.  All sorts of gadgets and gizmos are running together here.  It is an amazing sight to see.  There must be ten thousand different pieces of equipment here.  As to be expected, a number of sailors maintain the machines: repairing them when they are broken, oiling them when they slow down, a rather boring job overall.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
