R {26934} {0} {<278>} {Port Side of Airship} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The sight of the airship is quite breathtaking.  The ship is an amazing feat of architecture.  The enormous size of the inner hulls is bigger than the largest seagoing vessel in the empire.  The technology to keep such a beast in the air must be quite advanced for its time.  One can not help but wonder just what keeps this thing in the air, other than wind that is.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
