R {26940} {0} {<278>} {In front of The Bowsprit} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The view from the bowsprit is breathtaking.  You can see the horizon in the far off distance.  Birds are flying and gliding all about the airship in curiosity.  This of course has led to a problem, as the airship always tends to attract birds, and well they do have bodily functions too.  The swabs are always scraping the dung off the deck.  This part of this ship is frequented by sailors for its excellent view of the surrounding area -- that is when they get one of their rare breaks.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
