R {26941} {0} {<278>} {Officer's Quarters} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  These quarters are lavishly decorated and furbished with the finest items.  They are arranged about the area in the uniform fashion typical of this airship.  This is, quite obviously, where the higher-ranking officers spend much of their personal time.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {healer} {1.000} {}
