R {26942} {0} {<278>} {Port Deck} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The deck of the ship is full of activity.  Crew members are running here and there, trying to keep everything running.  However some of the hired hands are not helping matters.  They are continuously getting in the way, and causing quite a bit of commotion.  The wind is rather brisk up here, the mere feel of it is quite exhilarating.  You can see the whole land, as far as the eye can see, from upon the deck.  Few people ever get a chance to experience this.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
