R {26943} {0} {<278>} {Starboard Deck} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The deck is full of life, as crew members prepare for takeoff.  Some are securing loose objects, others are tying down masts.  Most are trying to get the mercenaries down below so the others can do their jobs.  A few are off working on the farthest reaches of the boat.  They appear to be mending a few of the planks.  Looks like the ship is almost ready for takeoff.  You wonder where they are going?  Maybe they are heading for one of the capitals.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
