R {26945} {0} {<228>} {Grassy Field} {<228>, `<088>} {  The fields of Conadrain surround you.  Conadrain derives much of its wealth from the nutrient rich soil within its lands.  They are careful however to preserve these nutrients and have developed a system to maximize the use while not destroying the environment.  Many bandits have tried to steal from these fields, however they always seem to get caught.  It is rumored that there is a beautiful apple orchard around here somewhere.   } {talsa} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {26946} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
