R {26946} {0} {<228>} {Pasture} {<228>, `<088>} {  The fertile land around here has undergone special care to grow plant life suited to grazing.  Besides being known for their excellent crops, the Conadrains produce some of the best meat in the Empire.  The quality of their products has allowed them to create a virtual monopoly in the agricultural business.  This has lead to the annexation of a few smaller surrounding countries who could not afford to run themselves, since no one would buy their food.   } {talsa} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
