R {26947} {0} {<228>} {Grassy Field} {<228>, `<088>} {  The fields are dotted with various farmhouses.  These farmhouses are run by state-hired workers.  These people are trained in the general running of farmland, as well as breeding.  One of the things that has made the Conadrain economy shoot up is the excellent products which their highly advanced breeding program has produced.  Many of the farmers live out here, though the majority still live in some nearby town.  The rare opportunity of getting your own farmhouse is only given to the smartest and best farmers in the employment of the Empire.   } {talsa} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {26946} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {26948} {0} {<228>} {Field} {<228>, `<088>} {  The sheer immensity of the fields, has created hundreds upon hundreds of jobs for the peasants.  They don't earn a great deal, however the job is fairly popular for you get a small part of the harvest every year.  This concession was made when the only way they could get people to work the fields was to conscript the lowest of peasants.  Everyone knows that a hired hand works better than a person forced to work.   } {talsa} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {26946} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {26949} {0} {<228>} {Heading Towards the Palace} {<228>, `<088>} {  The large grassy fields part somewhat here.  The part of the field where the grass parts appears to be some sort of path.  It is unlikely anything could grow on this ground for it has the looks of ground which has been tread upon for hundreds of years.  Perhaps this path will take you to the imperial palace.  Unfortunately you are not sure, and you would not want to stray onto a path which did not lead to the palace.  Perhaps you should ask one of the locals about it?   } {talsa} {} {field} {healer} {1.000} {}
