R {26950} {0} {<278>} {Entrance to Palace} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The palace of the Conadrains lies before you.  It is renown for its beauty   across the entire empire, even past the empire into lands unknown.  The palace was constructed in the third year of the second emperor reign.  Back then the empire was small and only included the land just around Conadrain.  So the palace was not even a tenth of what is now.  It was constructed of pure gold and was entirely renovated a few years ago.  The greatness of this palace has proved itself through century after century of rebellions and war.  It was prophezied along time ago, so long as this palace stands, the empire will remain intact.  And it has withstanded from invasions for many, many centuries.  } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
