R {26951} {0} {<278>} {Palace Intersection} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The moment you walk into the palace you gawk at the sheer mass of wealth on display here.  Red silk carpets line the floors and huge chandeliers hang from the high ceiling.  The amazing thing is that the palace does not appear to be gaudy or ostentatious.  Most of the riches had been accumulated slowly over the years from the surplus of the Empire, or the Emperor's private funds.  Huge hallways extend to your right and left.  Glancing up you see that the palace extends to a second story.  Maybe there are some stairs to the north? } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
