R {26952} {0} {<278>} {Palace Hallway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hall is full of pleasantries.  Although it is a rather hot day, the palace seems to have some sort of cooling system installed.  The halls extend for great distances in every direction.  Occasionally you will see a door here or there, however most of it is just plain brick.  This probably indicates that the rooms which lay behind these walls are rather large, yet another wonder of the palace.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
