R {26953} {0} {<278>} {Palace Corner} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hallway abruptly turns to the north here.  A large torch hangs from the intersection of the two rooms, illuminating the room.  The joint between the is seamless and beautiful.  The construction of the palace revolutionizes the thinking of architects throughout the realm. } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
