R {26954} {0} {<278>} {West Hallway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Working in the Imperial Palace has always been a favorite assignment of the men in the army.  Only the most elite of the soldiers are selected to patrol these halls, watch over the Emperor while he is attending to matters of state, and escort guests to and from the places they need to be.  However the only reason one might not care to pull guard duty at the palace is the lack of adventure.  Many of the guards join because of the great stories their fathers and their grandfathers have told them about the ancient wars.  In a way though one could look at being behind the lines as favorable, for you are running almost no risk of being killed.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
