R {26955} {0} {<278>} {Northwest Palace Corner} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hall turns yet again here.  The mere perfection of this palace is a wondrous thing.  One has to wonder how the architects ever came up with a design like this.  And the masons must have been the best that there ever was.  Masonry like this exists nowhere in the world, except here.  Many people from around the world come here just to gape at the palace.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
