R {26956} {0} {<278>} {North Hallway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The northern part of the castle is rather blank.  Many of these rooms are unoccupied.  The masons constructed the palace big enough to hold several thousand people, however only one or two thousand actually live here.  Most of the doors are locked up, as their is still some stuff of value in each room.  The only time they are opened is when a guest shall be staying in one of the rooms.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
