R {26958} {0} {<278>} {North Hallway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hall is decorated with all manners of pleasantries around here.  Vases of excellent artistry stand upon grand tables.  Huge and luxurious pictures of famous aristocrats dot the wall here and there.  This castle is such a model of other castles in the kingdom.  It is almost as if after this castle was built, every single other one inside the Empire was built to resemble this one as closely as possible.  None however have reached grandness which this castle has achieved through excellent craftsmanship.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
