R {26959} {0} {<278>} {Northeast Palace Corner} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hall makes a sharp turn here.  The hall seems to drag on forever and ever.  This is one of the few places where it actually makes some sort of turn in its path.  The doors seem to have stopped a while ago.  Maybe they just decided they didn't need any more.  Or perhaps the rooms that you saw a while ago are just extraordinarily large.  The wall like in all the other places is made of precisely fit blocks of gold and silver, the sight is quite breathtaking.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
