R {26960} {0} {<278>} {East Hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The eastern most part of the hall is quite empty.  Only a smatter of people here and there even bother coming to this part of the palace.  The few rooms down here consist of little more than storage rooms.  However perhaps there is something of value within these rooms, or maybe not.  Might as well move along, not much to see.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
