R {26961} {0} {<278>} {Southeast Palace Corner} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The southeast section of the palace is dominated by guest rooms.  All along this section of the hall you can find all manners of various exotic and exorbitant rooms.  The Empire of Conadrain makes darn well sure that its guests are quite comfortable during their stay.  Well, at least the high ranking officials.  The normal peasantry is forced to just wait in the halls until the emperor will hear what they have to say.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
