R {26962} {0} {<278>} {Palace Hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The palace is quite repetitive in it's architecture.  The whole things is one giant pattern repeated over and over again.  About every ten or fifteen feet a giant arch, arches over the ceiling and onto the other side of the floor.  Even though its repetitive its still quite a beautiful sight.  How long the palace has been revered is a credit to this fact.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
