R {26964} {0} {<278>} {On top of the stairs} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The sight of the palace upon the second floor is quite breathtaking.  The things upon the first floor become so much more clear, and visible.  The upper floor is in somewhat of a disarray.  Papers are thrown about here and there.  Many people are trying to clean up the mess, but the extent of it is quite immense.  How could the palace become such a playground?  Everyone up here seems to either be cleaning or sitting around doing nothing -- kind of odd for an Emperor's palace.  One would think that they could find something to do. } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
