R {26965} {0} {<278>} {Beginning of the long hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hall seems to stretch on forever, as far as the eye can see.  Everywhere you look is hallway, amazingly decorated.  If the halls downstairs were extravagant, these are priceless -- beautiful vases and giant tapestries adorn the walls. The tapestries depict the history of the Empire and thus are valuable for both their subject and their artistry. } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
