R {26966} {0} {<278>} {Near the end of the hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hall actually seems to be coming to end.  The feint hint of a door of some sort can be seen to the north of here.  Surprisingly the decor of the wall has thinned out somewhat here.  This part of the hall is quite uncommon in this castle, for it is quite blank.  However you can see certain parts of the wall which have been marked out for new things to be placed.  By the size of the markings you would guess that they are probably going to add some new tapestries.  Maybe they have some new stories to tell.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
