R {26967} {0} {<278>} {Before the Council Chamber} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hall has come to an end here.  Before you lies a door of immense size. It stands some twelve feet tall and eight feet wide.  A giant could fit through this door, it is so incredibly large.  The doors are quite shut right now, because it appears that Talsa is having a council right now.  Only his closest advisors may enter the chamber during a council.  Many of the guards are trained to kill any man who might even be attempting to pass these doors during a council.  Many have tried before now, however none have survived their attempts.  Sometimes these councils can go on for several days without any breaks in between.  The longest went on for two and half weeks, when it was learned that the barbarians to the north of the Empire were planning a massive assault upon the Empire.  To violate these chambers, would be to violate the gods of this land and would result in almost immediate death. } {talsa} {} {inside} {healer} {1.000} {}
