R {26968} {0} {<278>} {Council chamber} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The council chamber is immensely large.  The room is at least fifty feet wide and fifty feet long, though the shape of it is rather odd.  The walls move around to form a more oblong shape than anything else.  A grand circular table sits in the middle of the room.  Several seats lie around it, however one in particular is rather large.  That is likely where Talsa generally sits.  The room is only lit by a single hole in the ceiling of the palace.  During the day sun comes in through this hole to illuminate the entire room in a fantastic way.  This however is somewhat limiting for at night they have to lug in giant lamps to keep the room properly lit.  This room keeps up with the rest of the splendor of this castle, it is truly an amazing sight to behold.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {26967} {s} {open s;s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {26969} {0} {<228>} {Field Outside The House of The Rising Sun} {<228>( *<088>} {  The land around here has been ravaged by many battles.  The rebellion is always in a constant state of warfare.  You stand outside the House of The Rising Sun, an inn notorious for being a rebellion hideout.  It is visited by the scum of the earth, and the lowest creatures of the land.  The building itself is quite a landmark in its own historical right.  Before the rebellion it was known throughout the land as one of the finest inns.  However the rebellion has overrun it and turned it into a base of operations against the Empire.   } {talsa} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
