R {26970} {0} {<278>} {Waiting Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The interior of the inn looks similar to most inns and tavern in the land.  The owner obviously modeled it after some of the inns in Conadrain.  However it appears to be lacking much of the maintenance that a place like this requires.  Empty beer bottles and dinner plates are spewed across the floor, many of them being entirely shattered or partially broken.  The floor is also dotted with spilled beer stains and stains of vomit from people who obviously had a tad too much to drink.  The particular part of the inn you are in is really more a foyer for the entire room.  Here if the inn was having an extremely busy day, guests could rest upon the couches on either side of the room.  However the inn does not receive many busy days anymore, nor is this room used for its original purpose, or so it appears.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {26971} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {26973} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {26969} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {26971} {0} {<278>} {Hallway in The House of The Rising Sun} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hallway is a complete mess.  Various patrons lay around the hall sleeping off their drunkenness.  A mirror which was hanging on the wall has been completely shattered.  It appears it was shattered by someone being thrown into it, though you can't really be sure of that.  The carpet of the floor has been torn and treaded upon for a long time.  It's amazing that any human could live in this sort of environment.  The filth in this room is just incredible.  The smell could knock out a giant rhinoceros, it's so potent.  The inn is in desperate need of about thirty or forty good maids.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {26972} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
