R {26972} {0} {<278>} {Turn in Hallway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hall seems to fork to the north and south here.  The room is completely dark.  There are a few lamps hanging upon the wall, however they seem to have been out for quite some time now.  The whole floor seems to creep every time you take a step in the hall.  The walls look as if they could cave in at any moment.  It's a wonder this place hasn't been abandoned and condemned for centuries now.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {26976} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
