R {26973} {0} {<278>} {Bar Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A large wooden table is right before you.  Behind this table you can see all manners of cups, glasses, shotglasses, and bottles of alcohol.  At one time this bar was quite respectable, however ever since the rebellion has overrun it, it has been run into the ground with the rest of the inn.  The once fine mahogany bar table is now full of holes and is stained horribly from uncleaned spilled drinks and vomit.  Should the rebels ever be ousted the entire inn, especially the bar would have to be entirely rebuilt.  Unfortunately this bar table which has stood for such an incredibly long time, ever since the inn was built many hundreds of years ago, would have to be thrown away.  Slopped about the room are a few drunks, most have passed out from the enormous amounts of alcohol which they consume.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
