R {26974} {0} {<278>} {Bedroom} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The first impression which you receive upon entering this bedroom is that the person or persons living in this room must be incredible slobs.  The sheets of the bed are lying in the far corner of the room, the bed has several holes in it, and the headboard of the bed has been entirely kicked in or something.  At the foot of the bed right by where someone might put his head is a large pot full of vomit.  Maybe this is the room where they stick all the people who pass out from their excessive drinking.   } {talsa} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
