R {28036} {0} {<148>} {Inside a Fox Den} {<148>. .<088>} {  As you enter this dank den, the vixen bares her teeth in a feral warning growl, while her cubs peep out warily from around her back legs.  The musty smell in here forces you to sneeze several times, causing the vixen to emit more vicious growls in your direction.  Perhaps you should leave now and leave them alone.   } {lidnesh} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {28035} {u} {u} {16} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {28037} {0} {<228>} {Standing Upon Some Stepping Stones} {<228>( *<088>} {  You are crossing the brook on some stepping stones.  Luckily, the stones rise far enough out of the water so they are not slimy from the dampness.  To the north, you see a large pile of deadfall.  From here, it looks as though you might be able to get over the deadfall if you move carefully.  Glancing back to the west, you see a streak of red dash from one bush to another.   } {lidnesh} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
