R {28039} {0} {<228>} {A Ring of Trees} {<228>( *<088>} {  The trees in this enclosed copse form a natural ring.  As you stand in the center gazing around, you hear a giggle from behind you.  As you spin around to determine its source, another giggle comes from your left.  Glancing in that direction, you see a slender arm disappear behind the tree. It dawns on you that this area is brighter than the rest of the forest.  It's as if the sun has chosen to smile upon this place more than any other.  } {lidnesh} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {28040} {u} {u} {16} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
