R {28040} {0} {<228>} {Amidst the Treetops} {<228>( *<088>} {  Having climbed up these trees, you stand on one of the thick branches and look around in wonder.  What had appeared to be badly-distorted branches are, in fact, rather small houses!  From within, you see small greenish and yellowish eyes peering back at you and the shock of it almost sends you falling to the ground.  Luckily, you catch yourself before you do.   } {lidnesh} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {28039} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {28041} {0} {<148>} {Neck-Deep in a Brook} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  You're at the end of the line.  Upon closer examination, the deadfall looks much too unsteady to climb.  The brook running beneath it doesn't improve the situation any, as you can hear the deadfall constantly shifting with the water current.  Lastly, the fact that you are treading water makes it hard to get a good handhold or foothold on the treacherous pile.  Nothing for it, but to swim back the way you came.   } {lidnesh} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
