R {28042} {0} {<228>} {Before a Cave Entrance} {<228>( *<088>} {  Trees and bushes are all but non-existent here.  A sheer rock face blocks all passage to the north.  Set into the rock face is a cave entrance.  The growls coming from within suggest it is a bear's den.  With bears, it's always better to steer clear so you decide to think twice before entering the cave. } {lidnesh} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
