R {28163} {0} {<278>} {The House of Egueran} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are in Egueran's House.  The owner is not here at this time, but you can see many decorations in his home.  He seems to be a veteran of the old Eddore War.  On the walls he has put many drawings of the final battle, and a poem about his heroic acts.   } {arisian} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
