R {28164} {0} {<278>} {In the Temple of Nature} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  How can silence be so present in a place?  You don't hear any sound coming from the street, and your breathing is the only noise that can be heard in this holy place.  A stone-and-wood altar dedicated to nature has been built in the middle of the temple, and many donations to the goddess of Nature have been made.  To the south you notice a small door.   } {arisian} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
