R {28165} {0} {<278>} {A Small Altar} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This room seems to be especially dedicated to the sea.  On the small altar, you can see a fish sculpted in the stone.  There is a painting on the wall, representing a fishing boat.  Fishermen come here to make offerings to their deity, to make their journey safer.   } {arisian} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
