R {28166} {0} {<278>} {House of the Storyteller} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  If you want to hear old tales, you have entered the right place!  Old legends are heard every week, and you just need to read the signs on the walls to know most of them.  The storyteller has dozens of books on racks, but most of them look really old and are covered with dust.   } {arisian} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
