R {28167} {0} {<278>} {Trisanar's House} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have entered the house of another Eddore War hero.  His name is Trisanar, as is written on an award on the wall.  He seems to be a mage, which is the only explanation for all the strange magical symbols everywhere.  Magical scrolls, wands, and other unknown items fill the room.  } {arisian} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {28156} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {28168} {0} {<278>} {The Armorer's storeroom} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Here are all the pieces of armor that have been ordered by the armorer and never been sold.  The work on this armor is incredibly beautiful, with finely carved symbols running all around them.  The dwarven smithing knowledge is at its best here, though many of these protective pieces are not completely finished.   } {arisian} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
