R {28169} {0} {<278>} {The Dwarven Armorer's Shop} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Shards of steel, wood, and leather cover the floor of this shop.  Various armors and shields are hanging on the walls and in the window.  Plate armors, leather gloves, every kind of protective gear seems to be made here, and there is nothing else to say about their quality other than: Dwarven quality!   } {arisian} {} {inside} {shop} {1.000} {}
