R {28170} {0} {<278>} {A ruined house} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are in the ruins of a small house.  It appears as if it has been burned for a long time, and demolished after that.  When you see all the beautiful buildings all around, you wonder why people have let the place go to ruins instead of building new houses.   } {arisian} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
