R {28171} {0} {<278>} {The Smiling Orc Tavern} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Dirty.  Noisy.  Very dirty and very noisy; only these words can describe the place where you are.  The head of an orc hangs on the wall behind the bar near other trophies.  A lot of mean-looking people are here drinking beer.  They throw their empty bottles at a wall, so the ground is full of broken glass.  You'd better not fall here!   } {arisian} {} {inside} {pk,shop} {1.000} {}
