R {28172} {0} {<278>} {The Bakery} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are in the bakery.  At least fifty people are waiting here to buy some bread, or a pie.  Some of them tap their foot impatiently...  The tension in this shop is incredible.  You wait five minutes, and then it is your turn.   } {arisian} {} {inside} {shop} {1.000} {}
E {28150} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

