R {28252} {128} {<278>} {On a Tribune} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are amidst a crowd standing upon a tribune. They are waiting for the play to begin, and are jostling for a better position. Given that the play hasn't  begun, you wonder why they are here. It could be hours before the actors are  ready to begin their performance. } {prosper} {} {inside} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {28253} {128} {<278>} {Standing in Line} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You stand in line, as many other people here, for an autograph of your favorite actor.  You can stand here forever though because the chair, where this favorite actor should sign, is empty...   } {prosper} {} {inside} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {28254} {0} {<278>} {Intruding upon 'Act I, Scene II'} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you step into the room, you notice people waving swords and wands of much  destruction. Two people in particular are shouting at one another. When they  see you, the battle stops and everyone turns to look at you. It seems that  you have sauntered in on a rehearsal of the battle scene in Act I of the  'Pirates of Lem-Dagor'. } {prosper} {} {inside} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {28255} {128} {<278>} {Behind the Stage} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The director is facing a point in a curtained room next to this one. A  stagehand is working on a lantern that seems to be out of oil. You hear  voices, similar to those you have heard recently. You try to remember where. Of course! They are in rehearsal for the stage rendition of the Pirates of  Lem-Dagor! } {prosper} {} {inside} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {28256} {128} {<278>} {Entering the Theater} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  After climbing the ladder and stepping in the room, you find yourself in a  completely different area. It is as if you just stepped out of reality and  right a play about it. You see the same things which you saw on the Tempest,  but now they are obviously fake. Fake uniforms, fake weapons of much  destruction, fake gangways and fake doors. } {prosper} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
