R {28259} {0} {<278>} {Behind the Stage} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you wander behind the stage, you inspect the wind turbines, which are a  reasonable facsimile of the real thing from a distance, but are clearly not  the real thing up close. } {prosper} {} {inside} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {28260} {128} {<278>} {On 'The Bridge'} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have entered the stage version of the bridge of The Tempest. To the north you see the huge window at the fore of the craft. Several figures are working at installing parts of the deck of the ship. To the west, you see two fake  doors being installed. The north most door appears to lead towards an  important room. The southern one could lead to an exit stage right. } {prosper} {} {inside} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

R {28261} {0} {<278>} {A Storage Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This appears to be a storage room for the play. There is a shelf here with  all sorts of wooden replicas. On the table lie several articles of costuming  in shades of red, brown and blue. } {prosper} {} {inside} {pk,maze} {1.000} {}

