R {28443} {0} {<278>} {A Field Hospital} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A crude field hospital has been erected here, no more than a tent secured to  the unyielding earth by hammered stakes. Within is a thick, oppressive heat,  and the stench of rot and death. Wounded demons lie clinging to life in  endless rows, attended to by medics who are barely able to keep their hearts  beating. The pile of bandages and medical supplies stacked neatly in a corner seems far too pitifully small to be enough for the great mass of wounded that have been piled up here. In the midst of the commotion, a massive demon runs  the hospital with blunt efficiency, triaging the patients closest to death  while shouting out a constant stream of instructions to his assistants. } {paradise} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {28444} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {28444} {0} {<228>} {End of the Trail} {<228>, `<088>} {  You have reached the end of the trail. The trees cluster too thickly to  proceed any further to the west and south. To the north is a small, sparse  clearing with a large tent filling up most of the space. You hear a sudden  shout and step quickly to the side as four demons rush past, bearing a fallen comrade upon a large shield. The demon they're carrying seems to be missing  an arm and an eye, and the lower part of their jaw has been blasted away by  some ruinous surge of magic. They seem to be feebly clinging to life as their comrades rush them urgently towards the tent to the north. Perhaps it is a  hospital of some kind that contains a healer powerful enough to save them. } {paradise} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {28445} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {28443} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {28445} {0} {<228>} {A Grassy Trail} {<228>, `<088>} {  You step onto a grassy trail, heading deep into the thick woods around the  battlefield. The trees are sparse and hostile, with barely a leaf in sight. Sharp, waving branches stab against your side as you make your way down the  winding path, cleared less by the intentional efforts of engineers and more  by the footsteps of hundreds of demons. The plant life here is mean and  prickly, with thorns and poisonous fruit in abundance. } {paradise} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {28446} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {28444} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {28446} {0} {<238>} {A Wooden Palisade} {<238>, `<088>} {  You are standing behind a sturdy wooden palisade, constructed from rows of  sharpened stakes. The occasional stray crossbow bolt skitters past the demon  army to ricochet off the palisade, causing those nearby to duck for cover  behind it. The palisade provides shelter and fortification for Lilith's  soldiers, and has drawn heavy fire from the rebel forces. These assaults have been to no avail, as the palisade stands tall and mighty, with the occasional scorched or cracked sections quickly repaired by imps or demon recruits. } {paradise} {} {plain} {} {1.000} {}
E {35559} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {28451} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
