R {28448} {0} {<228>} {A Rocky Road} {<228>, `<088>} {  A small road leads to the east, bustling with activity. Unlike the crude dirt trails that suffice for roads in most of the demon camp, effort seems to have been made to lay down stones to smoothen the road. The reason why quickly  becomes apparent, as the road is packed with imps that scuttle back and  forth, their arms overflowing with bundles of weapons and armor. The demons  must have built this road to allow them to ferry arms and armor to the  battlefield without slowing down or losing balance and dropping their  precious cargo. Despite the best efforts of the demons, however, the road is  still hastily laid, and you have to step carefully to avoid the sharp edges  of stones cutting into your feet. } {paradise} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
