R {28449} {0} {<228>} {Near the Forge} {<228>, `<088>} {  The road trails to an abrupt end here, signalled by two boulders arranged on  either side of the road. To the east is a squat metal hut, with furious  plumes of smoke rising from a hole drilled in the top. From time to time, its doors open and imps stagger out, carrying full loads of weapons so freshly  forged that you can still see the steam rising from the blades. The heat from within the makeshift forge is palpable, blistering your skin from where you  stand outside it. } {paradise} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
