R {28450} {0} {<238>} {A Makeshift Forge} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  As you enter the makeshift forge, the first thing you notice is the  overwhelming, oppressive heat. It seems to blanket your entire body,  practically withering you with its intensity. In the very center of the  forge, propping up the metal roof like a pillar, is a gigantic furnace,  white-hot and burning like a supernova. Standing within its fiery maw is a  demoness, tirelessly working to forge an endless number of weapons for the  demon army, while her apprentices encircle her, fetching materials and  flinching away from the fire. } {paradise} {} {hut} {} {1.000} {}
