R {28461} {0} {<238>} {Engineers' Tent} {<238>, `<088>} {  This large tent is secreted away behind a stony hill, protecting it from  demon assaults. Within is a mass of assorted engineer's tools, from wrenches  to spades, laid out neatly on the floor. The rebels are prepared to handle it all: from ballista repairs, to destabilizing fortifications, to building  barricades to shield the commanders' tent if need be. Sappers encircle the  tools, working busily on crystalline devices that hum with magical power. With flashes of light and thuds of a hammer, they attune the devices both  magically and mechanically. In the back of the tent are a row of simple cots, each occupied by an exhausted-looking engineer struggling to get some rest. They work twenty hour shifts and sleep for four, if they're lucky. It's no  wonder that all of them look immensely fatigued. } {paradise} {} {plain} {} {1.000} {}
