R {28515} {128} {<278>} {In the Cindery Village} {<278>. .<088>} {  Thick curls of bitter smoke waft past your nose, riding unseen currents of  hysteria and dread. Shards of bones crunch brittle cries beneath your feet  and ripped remnants of sweat-oiled clothes are ground into the debris. It is  a sad and sorrowful sight upon which you now gaze. The castle and its  feasting are far away now. Only broken huts and rotting bodies remain of this once proud village. } {times} {} {city} {maze} {1.000} {}

