R {28970} {0} {<238>} {Bright Pwyll} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  Here the sands of Pwyll's shores evolve into a higher, rockier terrain, where an impressive stone monument has stood guarding this shoreline for centuries. The monument takes the form of a gate made of basalt and consists of two pillars decorated with a sculptural relief that depicts two lords in the midst of a wild stag hunt. A set of stairs leads the way up out of the sand and between these two pillars, inviting the visitor to traverse this path in order to meander further into this mysterious land. } {annwn} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
