R {28971} {0} {<228>} {Bright Grasslands} {<228>, `<088>} {  The meadows here are plush and bright. Every so often, small stone cairns interrupt the rugged grassland, though whether piled there intentionally or through the entropic forces of nature, it is impossible to tell. To the south, mysteriously well-kept hedgerows evidently begin to line the edges of the faint dirt trail that begins here. } {annwn} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
