R {28972} {0} {<228>} {Bright Grasslands} {<228>, `<088>} {  The hedgerows completely cut-off the ability to move east or west at this  point, so heading forward or going back to the path most recently explored  are the only options. The dirt path continues through these hedges, no more  nor less defined than it was before. To the south there appears to be a  fountain, and to the north the grasslands draw ever-closer to the docking  area of this island. } {annwn} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
