R {28973} {0} {<178>} {Bright Grasslands} {<158>*<168>*<138>*<088>} {  Hedges still line the path here, but situated at this clearing's midpoint is  an impressive fountain that pours its waters into several large pools. These  pools were built with a stunning network of interlocking stones and are  surrounded by magnificently manicured gardens. The gardens have been created  to skillfully blend in with their more wild, natural surroundings, but it is  obvious that the various shrubs and trees are being pruned on a regular basis by an expert hand. Who is the caretaker of these gardens in this seemingly  unfrequented land? } {annwn} {} {flowers2} {} {1.000} {}
E {28972} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {28974} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {28974} {0} {<228>} {Twilight Pwyll} {<228>( *<088>} {  This portion of the island is filled with timeworn, looming apple trees. The apples on these trees have been bred to grow with sparkling golden skins, so that what sunlight does manage to shine through their ancient, all-encompassing branches, creates the illusion of an external twilight. } {annwn} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {28973} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {28975} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {28975} {0} {<228>} {Twilight Pwyll} {<228>( *<088>} {  This section of the island appears uncultivated, unlike the carefully manicured grove of apple trees that resides to the east. Trees also grow here, but they have been left to grow wildly, making traversing through this section of the barely-used dirt path a bit more of a chore. Every few steps a tree branch seems to have grown conveniently exactly at eye level. What is the deal with these trees, do they have a super secret vendetta against eyeballs? } {annwn} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {28974} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {28976} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {28976} {0} {<228>} {Twilight Pwyll} {<228>( *<088>} {  Oak trees are abundant in this section of the island, but for every healthy  tree, there seems to be a dead, leafless one to offset it. This could have  something to do with the swampland that begins to the north, which is most  likely creating a less than satisfactory environment for the trees. There  also appears to be the ruins of a building to the north. Strange that someone would attempt to build anything on such uncertain terrain. } {annwn} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {28977} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
