R {28977} {0} {<228>} {Dark Pwyll} {<228>; ;<088>} {  Oh joy, the swamps of Pwyll. This swamp is certainly not fun to trudge through, but hopefully further exploration will cause there to be a good reason for having smelly wet feet for the rest of the day. To the north a ruined building can be spied, and to the south a modest forest of oak trees flourishes. To the east and west, a thick wall of trees and foliage causes traversing in these directions to be undesirable. } {annwn} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
E {28978} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
