R {28978} {0} {<178>} {Dark Pwyll} {<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>} {  Here is more swamp water to plod through. Luckily there is a ruined building  situated in the center of this sector so a person can attempt to hop across  the collapsed slabs of stone in order to stay on dry land for a short while. To the south and the west, more marvelous marshland manifests itself. The  north and west are directions unsuitable for travel on account of the thick  swath of vegetation that borders them. } {annwn} {} {ruins} {} {1.000} {}
