R {28979} {0} {<228>} {Dark Pwyll} {<228>; ;<088>} {  This area of the swamp has many tall, proud trees rising up out of it. These  trees do seem brave to decide to grow in such a place and the fact that they  have chosen to do so makes them that much more exotic and beautiful when  compared with their land-dwelling counterparts. To the east and the west,  more marvelous marshland manifests itself. The north and south are directions unsuitable for travel because thick vegetation blocks the way. } {annwn} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
