R {28980} {0} {<228>} {Dark Pwyll} {<228>; ;<088>} {  This is the shallowest part of the swamp. To the east, the swamp disperses entirely, and the trees grow as a dense forest. To the west, the swamp continues onward and the water level becomes deeper. The northern and southern shores of the swamp in this area are impossible ways to travel, since the foliage there would be too dense to make exploration appropriate. } {annwn} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
