R {28981} {0} {<238>} {Even darker Pwyll} {<238>( *<088>} {  Upon close inspection, this entire forest appears to be dead. The trees grow in a tight-knit canopy, leaving no more than a small tunnel for a traveler to squeeze through hunched over, branches catching against clothing all the while. Maybe this was not the wisest route to utilize, but there did not seem to be any other logical path to take through the island. It even seems as if the route to take is forced upon the traveler. Is this some sort of labyrinth? } {annwn} {} {dead_forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {28982} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
