R {28982} {0} {<238>} {Even darker Pwyll} {<238>( *<088>} {  This is a forest that evidently died en masse at some point. There is not a single living plant or animal anywhere in its vicinity. This means that the forest is unnaturally quiet. It is also intensely dark. The branches of the dead trees grab mercilessly at clothing, hair, and skin. The air is still, but there is actually a refreshing breeze coming from the west. This is because there is in fact an opening in the trees. It even appears to be big enough to fit through. } {annwn} {} {dead_forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {28981} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
