R {28983} {0} {<228>} {Bright spot} {<228>, `<088>} {  The brightness in this section of the island is certainly a surprise, considering how dark it was but a moment ago. This bright clearing also contains evidence of someone occupying it. There is a modest wooden table with several items set carefully upon it. To the north is a forest devoid of living trees, and to the south, nothing more than a mysterious dark fog is discernible. It is as if a black void came along, sucked all the light up into it, and took up permanent residence there. Any possible exits to the east and west are blocked off by tall, thick, hedges. } {annwn} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {28982} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
