R {28984} {0} {<178>} {Even darker Pwyll} {<178>~ ~<088>} {  It is a strange fog that hangs in the air here. Black tendrils of mist slither in and out of the possibility of perception. The air is cold and moist and the scent of damp earth is strong. Every so often, the mind-numbing sound of howling pierces the silence. The mysterious darkness coupled with these intense howls is enough to bring on a state of panic. It is simply necessary to keep moving forward, there must be an end to this fog at some point. } {annwn} {} {mist} {} {1.000} {}
E {28983} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
