R {28994} {0} {<268>} {Pwyll docking area} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  What a weird little dock. It is nestled in at the bottom of a cliff, with nothing to see but the sea in any other direction. There is a ship waiting here, as if somebody uses this dock regularly. What sort of individual would live up in the mountains and voluntarily scale them in order to reach this dock? They would have to be the strange, tenacious type, that is for certain. Then again, maybe it would be worth it to leave all the cares of the modern world behind and live in harmony with nature. A romantic idea, though it would be a tough, lonely life to lead. } {annwn} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
