R {29035} {0} {<238>} {The Wizard's Laboratory} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  This is the Pwyll wizard's laboratory. The building that encompasses this lab is in itself an architectural work of wonder. It was built into the wall of the crater so that anyone who happens to be sightseeing in the area will completely miss it unless they stumble upon its cleverly camouflaged front door. Once inside the lab, there is a rustic cabin feel to the place, as it is built of natural wood that is heavily coated in a lacquer finish. The northern wall of the lab houses a gigantic window that shows a spectacular view of the sea, and allows the sun to pour merrily inside. The rest of lab is filled with many types of glass vials and containers, and all of the necessary implements involved in working through complex chemical experiments. } {annwn} {} {hut} {} {1.000} {}
