R {29082} {0} {<268>} {Harlech Docking Area} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  This docking area is nothing more than a beach. The water is clear and splashes rhythmically up against caramel colored sand. A jagged cliff face juts up a mere dozen feet back from the shoreline. Brave trees grow out from the side of the cliff, working relentlessly against gravity to reach toward the sun. Further out from the docking area the cliffs protrude directly out of the water and are completely carpeted with trees. } {annwn} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
