R {29083} {0} {<228>} {Clearing in the Forest} {<228>, .<088>} {  This clearing really is just a flat grassy piece of land. One lonely tree grows in the middle of it, apparently doing its best to make up for the more mundane scenery around it. There is a view down to the sea when looking to the north. To the east and west, the grass succumbs to a rockier terrain that ends abruptly as a steep cliff ledge. To the south stretches a vast expanse of forest. } {annwn} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
