R {29084} {0} {<268>} {Harlech Docking Area} {<268>~ ~<088>} {  A really lengthy dock was built here. There are spots available for at least twenty ships, but only one of them is occupied. It is so curious, this desolate dock. There is nothing to see ahead aside from water, and nothing behind but a steep cliff. Why would anyone take the time to build such an exquisite dock in such a secluded area? } {annwn} {} {shore} {} {1.000} {}
