R {29085} {0} {<238>} {Cliffside} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  Peering over the edge of this cliff reveals the great expanse of the sea below. Currently, a pod of dolphins is swimming through the vicinity and it is quite entertaining to watch them perform various acrobatic feats that involve much flipping and diving through the air. This does not look like a wise spot to climb down, it would be better to check for a way down at a different section of the cliff. To the east is a grassy clearing, and to the south of that a forest is flourishing. } {annwn} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
E {29083} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {29086} {0} {<238>} {Cliffside} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  Wow, it would be a really bad idea to slip and fall right here! The sea to the north that stretches out just below the cliff is so incredibly far down from here that it looks fake. Also, poking out from the water, there are a bunch of sharp-looking rocks that would make for a very uncomfortable landing. To the west of here there is a small grassy plateau, and to the south there grows a well-established forest of ash trees. } {annwn} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
