R {29088} {0} {<228>} {Dense Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The focal point here is an ash tree that was most likely struck by lightning, as it has a nasty burn mark midway along its trunk. Little sapling shoots are attempting to grow out of the burnt section that is still anchored to the ground, while the rest of the tree lies hopelessly askew upon the leafy earth. Moss has taken this part of the tree over completely. The trees around it still stand tall. To the north is a rocky cliff and to the west is more forest. Other directions are inhospitable for an explorer to travel due to the extreme density of the foliage and dead fall. } {annwn} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
