R {29089} {0} {<228>} {Denser Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  This is just another section of forest with an even denser stand of ash trees to attempt to maneuver through. The small space to step through between the trees here has been claimed by a fairy ring. This ring is made up of tiny mushrooms with little pointed caps. Some grow straight up, whereas others grow on a tilt, making it look as if they are swaying and dancing together. Perhaps they are statues that are like fungal memories of fairies who were dancing together here not long ago. } {annwn} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {29087} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
