R {29091} {0} {<228>} {Denser Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  There is a very curious looking tree right here. It actually has the appearance of a human man. It is not moving, and it certainly is not alive in the same sense that a human is alive. However, it literally looks like a man was somehow turned into a tree; or trapped in a tree. Maybe this is some sort of nature spirit in a state of dormancy at the current time. It's a bit creepy, as the tree-man's eyes are open and staring directly out at the bit of a path where a person can walk by. Perhaps this could even be a type of enchanted being set here as a lookout to protect the forest. } {annwn} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {29090} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
