R {29105} {0} {<178>} {Lighter Forest} {<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>} {  This section of land must have originally housed the castle keep. From what is left of the structure, it is evident that this tower was of a simple square design. One can imagine what the great hall would have been like here. The king would have thrown celebrations for the whole kingdom and together everyone would have enjoyed a wondrous feast. Then, once the festivities came to an end, the king would have retired to his royal sleeping quarters which also would have been located in this part of the castle. Hopefully with his beautiful queen, if he was lucky. } {annwn} {} {ruins} {} {1.000} {}
