R {29196} {0} {<148>} {Gates of Hades} {<148>. .<088>} {  You are standing before the great stone gates of Hades.  Large stone pillars reach up into the air from out of the ground and tower over you many feet in the air.  The gate doesn't look like any other gate you have seen before.  It is more like a square arch symbolizing the entrance to Hades domain.  At the top of the gate is deeply carved writing\; however you can't understand what it is saying.  Knowing where you are, though, it must say something about this being the gates of Hades.  Standing on the far side of the gate is a giant beast of a dog.  He appears to be chained directly to the gate as if to keep him from running off.  You sigh with relief as you realize he is probably there to scare you but do you no immediate harm.  The terrain is exactly like the plains before, and very little grows other then black grass and a few sparse flowers with no scent.   } {hades} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
