R {29211} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mPerceptual Mist[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you walk on, you come to the point where the path seems to suddenly end.  Yet, it also seems the path begins again.  You ponder this apparent contradiction for a moment, but then realize that it is not a contradiction but rather a point of balance.  There is a sudden flash in your mind as this realization strikes you.  The ground seems to sing, and worlds turn about your head.  All of your ideals, conceptions, and knowledge flow through your mind and to seem mean nothing at all.  Suddenly, all is still.  Your mind is suddenly a blank page with nothing written on it, and you sense the inherent beauty in this.  You pause for a moment and then resume your journey exploring Tao.   } {tao} {} {inside} {bank,safe} {1.000} {}
