R {29583} {0} {<228>} {[1;32mMound[0;37m} {<228>, `<088>} {  As you wend your way past hedges and trees to approach the bonfire, you find yourself atop a mound.  The mound is barren of trees but is rather encircled by stones of various sizes, shapes and positions.  You wonder about the relationship of the stones to sun and moons and stars of the realm throughout the seasons.  Some of the stones seem to be sculpted and others appear more natural in shape.  None seem to be naturally placed, however.  The ground is thinly covered in grass, apparently worn from much traffic.  The visible earth through the thinning grass nearly seems to glow.  As you look around you sense the immense power of this location as the stones seem to intensify and focus the earthâs energy as a magnifying glass might do to light.  The area would lend itself to a sense of vigor and well-being mingled perhaps with a tinge of fear of the power harnessed here.   } {druid} {} {field} {safe} {1.000} {}
