R {29604} {0} {<228>} {Entrance to the Jewelled Palace} {<228>, `<088>} {  Small but tasteful, this courtyard is on the small side.  Surrounded by a wall of black marble blocks, it holds a few stone benches and a withering tree here and there.  It tends to be quiet, as few stop here for very long on the way in or out of the Jewelled Palace.  Torches flicker in their sconces, but never die or need refreshing, and the dim light they cast reveals long narrow apertures in the surrounding wall.  Just the thing to shoot arrows through at anybody foolish enough to invade the castle.   } {paradise} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
