R {29608} {0} {<278>} {The Stone Palace} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Prince Moloch reigns here, almost invariably seated at the large table that serves as the nerve center of his domain.  Maps of the realm crowd each other, as the Prince of War consults with his minions, considering his next move in his neverending struggle to unite the princedoms under his own aegis.   } {paradise} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
