R {29611} {0} {<278>} {The Palace of Perfection} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Sweet perfume wafts with every movement here, enticing and tantalizing.  Tasteful artwork, in marble statuary and pastel paintings, are interspersed with soft couches and tables of pure crystal.  Beautiful beings- Succubi and Incubi, the children of Princess Lilith- lounge and relax, chatting in quiet voices.  The Damned that serve them are almost as lovely, and even they are decked out in silk and jewels.  It is here that the 'cubi are created, and here they train, hoping to someday earn the title 'Consort' from a demonic lord.   } {paradise} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
