R {29612} {0} {<278>} {The Cathedral} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Planed wooden floors.  Pews.  An altar.  Stained glass windows.  Everything a cathedral should be, even if this is an odd place to find one.  But the Church of Free Will is strong in the city, despite the strange fact that a Damned leads it.  There are those who whisper and mutter about it, but never where they can be overheard.   } {paradise} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
