R {29804} {0} {<278>} {Room of many candles} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You enter a room containing a haphazard array of altars, each one holding many burning candles.  The flames flicker and sputter wildly, casting shadows that dance in strange patterns on the mute walls.  The entire room is at once mesmerizing and disorienting, and it takes you a while to realize that some of the candles are not inert.  They are not candles at all, but dreaded wax demons that have destroyed many an unwary traveler.  With some relief, you spot another staircase leading out of this eerie enclosure.   } {entropy} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
