R {29805} {0} {<278>} {Jewel room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This room is full of crystal cases containing dazzling jewels; some are assembled in exquisite architectures.  Clearly, all the treasures of the Tlog have been gathered here.  Despite the shimmering opulence, you find yourself uninspired.  Is it anything more than a cacophony of rocks?  You then see an extremely well dressed noble seated at a sumptuous table off to the side.  A ladder of helium jewels floats above your head, leading further upward.   } {entropy} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
