R {29807} {0} {<138>} {The dump} {<138>%%<088>} {  You now stand in a garbage dump, although no seagulls feast upon the leavings.  Rather, this would seem to be a dump of discarded ideas and half-baked notions, unfinished paintings, rambling rejected poems, rancid and festering scripts for plays never to be performed.  As you wander through it your head spins with incoherent bombast unrequited by applause.  Through the piles of improbable posturing you spot a café to the north.  The dump also contains a smudged sign welcoming you to the island.   } {entropy} {} {quicksand} {} {1.000} {}
