R {29813} {0} {<278>} {A garish sunset} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You now stand on top of the tower gazing upon the most garish sunset you have ever witnessed.  Pink is piled upon red upon gold upon orange upon purple, and the sky seems like the stretch-marked skin of an obese and flatulent god.  You gape for a while and soon find yourself spouting perfervid odes to its excess.  Despite your enervation and sense of decay, peg-legged lyrics leap to mind as you spiral in a debauched poetic delirium away from any sense of decency, propriety, or self-restraint.  The only exit from this place would seem to be back down that rope of sand.  Your only companion is a young fellow staring at the sunset and writing feverishly.   } {entropy} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
