R {29962} {0} {<148>} {Payseth's Room} {<148>. .<088>} {  Upon entering the room, you feel that the necromancer that lives here is pretty distracted and untidy.  Spellbooks are lying around the room, elixers and staves are all over the bed and the shelves.  In fact, the wizard is so distracted, that he doesn't even notice your intervention.   } {necro} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
