R {29963} {0} {<148>} {Asardotlan's Room} {<148>. .<088>} {  Judging by the appearance of the room, its inhabitant is an old and experienced mage.  Everything looks so much in place and ordered.  Looking at the desk, you can see ancient books and tomes speaking about the aspects of advanced necromancy.  Touching one of them, you immediately feel a rush of evil force going through your whole body.  If only touching them produces such an effect, what could happen if you read out a few spells from them?!   } {necro} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
