R {29964} {0} {<148>} {Yerrahar's Room} {<148>. .<088>} {  The blackened walls and the smell of burning flesh tell you that this room has seen a lot of fire.  Even now, there is some ash smouldering in the corner.  A menacing necromancer stands in the middle of the chamber, sending flame arrows all around himself.  Poor zombie, that was not fast enough to dodge them, is trying to crawl out of the room.  Alas, he is just a punchbag for the wizard's spells.   } {necro} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {29960} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {29965} {0} {<148>} {Naynad's Room} {<148>. .<088>} {  The room of the professor of necromancy looks like absolutely contrary to what you could have expected to see.  There are no books or handwritings, no lecture notes or anything, just some zombie parts lying around the room.  The professor himself is lying on the bed, occasionally waving his wand, and then something on the floor explodes.  Now you realize the fun of being a necromancer - at least you can have a nice stress relief with just a wave of the hand!   } {necro} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {29960} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {29966} {0} {<148>} {A meeting chamber} {<148>. .<088>} {  You have arrived at a large round room, the ceiling looming over you in the form of a huge dome.  The meeting chamber is illuminated by a vast number of candles mounted all over the walls, high above your reach.  A massive round marble table sits in the middle of the room, surrounded from all sides by chairs.  The high council gathers in this meeting room to discuss matters of huge importance to the necromancers.   } {necro} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
