R {29967} {0} {<148>} {A bend in the hallway} {<148>. .<088>} {  Taking the west branch of the hallway, you force your way through the army of the zombie servants, flying and crawling here and there.  The hallway ends, bringing you to a room situated to the north.  There are no candles and whatnot, but somehow you can see everything clearly.  After examining the surroundings, you figure that the hallway is lit well by the light coming from that northern room.   } {necro} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
