R {29968} {0} {<148>} {The Room of the Pentagram} {<148>. .<088>} {  Immense magical powers fill this room, making the air nearly pulse with  energy. A huge pentagram has been painted in blood on the floor. From the way it gleams in the light, the blood appears very fresh. A goblet filled with  the blood also stands in each vertex of the pentagram. Magical candles  surround the pentagram, and magic rays of light shoot out at times from  candle to candle. In the center of the pentagram stands a mighty  necromancer, accumulating the energy produced by the magical sign. Perhaps  it is not a good idea to wait around and find out what this energy will be  used for! } {necro} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
