R {30035} {0} {<278>} {Inside the sheriff's office} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The iron door behind you slowly creaks shut, making a horrible grating sound as the metal scrapes the oak floor.  A pile of very important looking documents rests below a stone gargoyle-like paperweight.  A birchwood file cabinet lies in the northeast corner of the room, accumulating dust.  Evidently, it has not been used in a very long while.  You grimace as you realize how chaotic the scene is - like everyone else in the town, the sheriff doesn't seem to care about anyone except himself.  You advance carefully towards the sheriff's desk, making sure that there are no loose planks in the floor - if you were to fall through it would be a MASSIVE case of "I've fallen and I can't get up."  I don't think anyone wants to relive THAT nightmare again.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
