R {30036} {0} {<278>} {Inside a large tent} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Compared with the rest of Sargasso, this fairly large tent is organized and clean, although by no means would it ever win any awards for odor.  It smells like rotten meat inside, and a careful inspection reveals a dead rat carcass in one of the corners of the tent.  How utterly sick!  Perhaps this tent isn't so clean after all.  Shaking your head, you decide to leave the citizens of Sargasso to their own devices.  Let them wallow in their own filth.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {30034} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {30037} {0} {<278>} {Approaching a small mine shaft} {<278>. .<088>} {  After having spent some time in the dirty, run down settlement of Sargasso, you realize that the only thing the prospectors have is mining.  They left their families and decided to dedicate themselves to one single task.  The wind starts to pick up a little and the weird dirt-stuff flies around for a little bit, but the gusts are not nearly as horrible as when you were walking upon the mountain.  Still, the smell of charred flesh, which was absent to the north, lingers on here.  What could these miners be doing to paint such a horrid picture of the town?  You shrug off the question, thinking it could not possibly be on purpose.  To the west you see a beautifully colored hut and wonder why something so vibrant would be in a place of such death and misery.   } {dsr} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
