R {30045} {0} {<148>} {Exploring underground} {<148>. .<088>} {  The cavern takes many twists and turns here, and at times it is difficult to discern which way you are travelling.  There is very little to mark your path other than the sound of your footsteps reverberating like cymbals in a concert hall with bad acoustics.  Tiny indentations in the hard limestone cavern walls indicate to you that skirmishes take place rather frequently here - after all, the underground can be a very dangerous place for the weak and unready.  A little rat scurries across the floor, its claws scraping the rock like fingernails on a chalkboard.  No matter what anyone else thinks, you believe that this place is unsettling at best.  The cavern continues north and west.   } {dsr} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
