R {30046} {0} {<148>} {Exploring underground} {<148>. .<088>} {  The cavern suddenly stops here, but not by any natural phenomenon.  Dark burgundy rocks continue to crash down from the ceiling, pummeling the floor with their immense weight.  Eventually the assault stops, but you get the sense that someone doesn't want you to see what lies to the north.  Could it be treasure?  Could it be danger?  You have no way of knowing, but perhaps one day someone will clear away the rubble and reveal what lies beyond.  For the time being, however, you will need to be satisfied with a dead end.   } {dsr} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
