R {30049} {0} {<148>} {Exploring underground} {<148>. .<088>} {  Clank, clank, clank.  In the distance you hear iron weapons being sharpened on the granite walls of the cave, and you worry that you might be ambushed somewhere ...  But where?  You start thinking that the more you travel in these strange lands the more questions pop into your head - but you still have no answers.  The smell of fresh blood wafts in from the south, and you question the wisdom of travelling in that direction.  You wrinkle your nose at the prospect of seeing another dead body (even the most bloodthirsty of warriors has an occasional pang of guilt when seeing a rotting carcass).  You can also travel east or west to what you hope is a safer part of the tunnel.   } {dsr} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
