R {30050} {0} {<148>} {Exploring underground} {<148>. .<088>} {  You find yet another dead end in this very strange yet exciting cavern.  The granite walls are soft to the touch - they feel like a goose down pillow feels after weeks of hard travelling.  Some massive erosion must have taken place for the walls to get like this, but you can't help but wonder exactly HOW.  After all, this mine shaft was constructed fairly recently, so it would be silly to think that someone could actually be LIVING down here ...  } {dsr} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
