R {30051} {0} {<148>} {Exploring underground} {<148>. .<088>} {  The twists and turns of the cavern having completely aggravated you, you decide to take it easy for a while.  Sitting down on the cold granite floor, you doze off for a tiny bit, thinking that a little bit of rest is what you need to clear your mind in the hopes that you can find some way out of this truly irksome place ...  You wake up with a jolt as you feel a sharp pain in your left leg.  Your eyes pierce the darkness and you see two semi-humanoid creatures, each about 1 meter tall.  They unsheath what appears to be a wavy serrated sword and point it at your throat, demanding all your money.  You sit there, dumbfounded, and ponder your next move. } {dsr} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
