R {30055} {0} {<278>} {Outside the Aquamarine Cathedral} {<278>. .<088>} {  The brilliant building before you is made entirely of cyan colored crystal which you quickly recognize as being aquamarine.  A holy energy seems to radiate from the building, filling your soul with warmth and goodness.  The crystalline house of worship has a tear-jerking scene painted on it: a sargasso miner discovers this strange town and proceeds to forget all the evil in his heart.  How touching!  This place, unlike some of the more corrupt churches you've visited, fills you with such a sense of serenity that you know that all doubts will be removed when you enter its walls.   } {dsr} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
