R {30058} {0} {<268>} {Inside a nun's quarters} {<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>} {  You stand here inside the quarters of two of the aquamarine cathedral's nuns.  Glancing outside the window, you see a sparkling blue lake with fish jumping in and out of the water, passing the time by playing together.  You smile to yourself at how pleasant the scene is and resolve to spend more time just sitting by a lake and letting things be.  Inside the chamber you see two very neat beds, each with a small plaque on the headboard.  A communal dresser against the east wall houses the nuns' habits, and you notice that the outfits are impeccable.  The two inhabitants must truly set an example for the other nuns.   } {dsr} {} {temple} {} {1.000} {}
