R {30059} {0} {<268>} {Inside a nun's quarters} {<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>} {  What a pig sty!  Yuck!  Whomever lives here knows nothing about how to keep a room clean.  Habits are EVERYWHERE: on the bed, crumpled on the floor, in front of the window ...  Yuck.  A crinkled package on the floor says "bacon" on it - it appears as if one of the nuns here has a craving for meat, as the package is ripped open as if the nun's life depended on it.  You wrinkle your nose as you suddenly realize that there is a faint odor of something that you can't place your finger on.  Whatever it is, you first feel nauseous, as if you are about to pass out, but the feeling passes and you start feeling rather giddy and loosened up.  Yeah, man, you really dig these penguin chicks.   } {dsr} {} {temple} {} {1.000} {}
