R {30060} {0} {<278>} {Approaching Diamond Castle} {<278>. .<088>} {  As you walk along this talcum-covered path, you see what appears to be a large castle made entirely of glass in the distance.  Smiling to yourself, you are almost blinded by the sunlight reflecting into your eyes.  You shield your face with your hand, hoping that you can block out the radiance. The light is so pure that it hurts even a powerful adventurer such as you.  As you get a little bit closer, you see that the castle isn't made of ordinary glass: it is pure diamond.  You whistle at the exorbitant cost, but you realize it was worth it: the purity and beauty of the place is unmatched.   } {dsr} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
