R {30063} {0} {<278>} {Inside the Diamond Arboretum} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  After passing through the fence, you find yourself inside an arboretum.  The diamond walls melt away like hot metal, revealing all kinds of trees: spruce, oak, cherry, birch, and more - you don't have names for all the different kinds.  Various wildlife graze here, taken from all over the world and sent here to live.  The citizens of this strange kingdom love interacting with the animals, as is evident by the large number of visitors. What amazes you most of all is the fact that the animals seem strangely calm - you can interact with them without fear of getting hurt.  The arboretum continues north and west, while the main castle is south.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {30066} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
