R {30064} {0} {<278>} {Inside the Diamond Arboretum} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This part of the arboretum is a haven for sundry types of flowers and herbs.  The plants stretch upwards, drawing the light into their leaves in an almost magical process.  Its almost as if the light spirals downwards only for them.  Looking upwards, you can almost sense liquid light pouring from the sky into the plants.  You've GOT to get yourself one of those things.  Bending down to examine the flora, you can see many different types of herbs: marjoram, ginseng, cinnamon ...  Basically everything you would ever need for cooking or herbal remedies.  The arboretum continues north and east.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {30063} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
