R {30065} {0} {<278>} {Inside the Diamond Arboretum} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Patches of bright green grass grow here, as the noblest of all animals grazes in this corner of the arboretum: the yak.  "A YAK?!"  You ask yourself?  Yes, a yak.  After having visited the Amazon Nation, Queen Angelina was so impressed with the grace of the creatures that she decided to take some back here for breeding purposes.  While it's true that no one knew where this fine kingdom was until recently, Queen Melosa herself used to get visits from Queen Angelina, who was under the guise of a different name.  Yet whatever the reason the yaks are here, you can't help but marvel at the fact that their popularity would spread so quickly.  The arboretum continues east and south.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {30066} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
