R {30066} {0} {<278>} {Inside the Diamond Arboretum} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A huge wooden stand containing the arboretum workers' supplies dominates the area in this part of the arboretum.  The whole entire place has a noxious stench about it, almost like the smell of manure.  You reason that it must be manure, as there are many animals around and manure is a good way to fertilize the plants.  What this means for YOU is that you'd better be REALLY careful where you step, or you may find that your "boots of striding" turn into "boots of stinking."  You wouldn't really want that, would you?   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
