R {30067} {0} {<278>} {Inside the dining room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is everyone's favorite part of the castle: the dining room.  While it's true that it's not as fancy as the rest of the castle (how do you compare to diamonds anyway?)  It has a certain feel about it that makes you want to pig out on candied yam, roast beef, and chocolate eclairs.  Not even in the Amazon Nation is one tempted so much by delicious goodies.  The table extends so far to the south and east that you can barely make out the end!  You quickly slide over to the table and steal a fresh roll from the table and stuff it in your mouth like a veritable pig.  Thank goodness no one noticed that.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
