R {30069} {0} {<278>} {Inside the dining room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  In this section of the dining room you see the members of Diamond Castle's royal family.  Their food is even better than that of the other guests: herb roasted chicken, fresh pumpkin pie with whipped cream, and crisp lettuce with Caesar dressing, just to name some of the scrumptious edibles.  Steaming apple cider and rich hot cocoa are available for anyone to drink.  You pull up a silk-laden chair and sit amongst the monarchy, sharing with them your deeds of valor.  They listen intently, genuinely interested in all your triumphs and adventures.  When your conversation ends seemingly hours later, you realize that the inhabitants of this city aren't that different from you after all.  The dining room continues north and west.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
