R {30071} {0} {<278>} {Inside the kitchen} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The various cooks and maids gather together here, as it is their "home base," so to speak.  You smell so much stuff at once that your nose cannot register it all: beef stew, delectible fried shrimp, golden brown chicken ...  There is just so much to cook that the chefs have problems keeping up with it all.  The serving maids are running back and forth so much that there is a huge rut in the floor where their feet tread so hastily.  A huge cauldron hordes the space in the kitchen's center, and it is there where the cooks magically bake, fry, and marinate everything.  How they do it, you don't know.  The dining room is above you and a tiny door to the west functions as a service entrance to the kitchen.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
