R {30077} {0} {<278>} {Inside the jail} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Strangely enough, you thought that the jail would be the source of the negative energy vibes that you felt in the entranceway above you, but somehow you feel a little more at peace down here.  Maybe it's because the locks on the jail doors function as some literary symbol of your safety.  Whatever it is, the place still doesn't look very friendly.  Broken swords lie on the ground, tossed aside like dead bodies are after a battle.  The cell doors look incredibly stable, so you don't really doubt your safety.  A cell lies to your north, the jail continues east and west, and the entryway is above you.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
