R {30080} {0} {<278>} {Inside a dingy cell} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  After struggling to open the rusty iron door, you find yourself in a stereotypical cell: a disgusting aluminum bowl serves as a toilet, and the stench of fecal matter is almost intolerable.  You truly pity the person who has the burden of cleaning this place (not that jail cells get cleaned out all that often.)  The limestone walls are soaking wet and covered with more mildew than you cared to know about.  A constant dripping noise coming from the ceiling warns you that this cell is in desperate need of repair.  Then again, this is a PRISON.  It's not exactly high on the list of priorities, you reason.  Still, it's a shame that people are forced to live in horrible conditions such as this - this cell isn't fit for the lowest of all vermin.  The jail's hallway is to the south.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {30079} {s} {open s;s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {30081} {0} {<278>} {Inside the jail} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The jail veers sharply west here, almost as if the inhabitant of the cell to the north needs to be kept away from the other prisoners.  The tiny stones on the floor appear to have come from the huge hole in the wall, indicating to you that there was some kind of struggle to put the villian inside its cage.  Almost as if to confirm your fears that the prisoner inside is dangerous, you spy a spiked black high heeled shoe hiding in the shadows; some very dangerous woman must be contained inside, so you should be careful before entering the cell.  The main part of the jail is east from here.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
