R {30086} {0} {<278>} {Inside the Throne room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you enter Queen Angelina's throne room, you (rightfully) expect the room to be filled with diamonds, as the rest of the castle is.  Much to your surprise, there are no jewels of any kind to be found.  The throne room is filled with puffy white clouds that you could bounce on for days and days and the novelty would not wear off.  Indeed, the atmosphere is that of a bright blue sky, and you cannot tell where the room begins and ends, so seamless is the illusion.  A soft breeze blows throughout the chamber, gently tossing your hair about.  Only two objects are in this room: Queen Angelina's cherry wood throne and a magical decanter which produces a crisp, spring-like scent.  You sigh and close your eyes, letting the Queen's essence fill your soul.  It is warm and loving, and you now know why she is so adored by her people.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {30085} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {30087} {0} {<278>} {Talcum Way} {<278>. .<088>} {  Talcum Way (which is covered with Talcum powder, believe it or not) extends north here.  Your boots don't make the "crunch, crunch" sound that you expect, but rather you hear a pleasant swishing sound, similar to a broom of feathers brushing across a tile floor.  You close your eyes and let the peaceful sounds overcome you.  You feel lighter than air, almost as if you could float away into the clouds.  Two very decorative mansions lie to your east and west: one made of jade, the other of opal.  To your north is a very ancient library.   } {dsr} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
