R {30089} {0} {<278>} {Kelly's House} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Her house resembles somewhat of a kitchen/dining room setup, as you see a very large table set for about 100 guests in the middle of the main room.  You see a multitude of snapshots in this edifice as well, as the owner of the home considers herself to be a decent photographer.  Glancing at the southern wall, you see a very big, very scary looking dishwasher with a huge pile of dirty dishes right next to it.  Better stay away from that.  Other than the aforementioned, there is very little to describe about the house, so you might as well leave.   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {30087} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {30090} {0} {<238>} {Inside Pumice Library} {<238>"""<088>} {  Bookshelves spiral upwards towards the seemingly endless ceiling.  Normal citizens and scholars alike congregate here to do but one thing: learn.  To this end, sapphire tables are scattered about the library, and each is completely crammed with people reading, examining, and poring over the contents of some book or other.  Seeing how engrossed people are in their reading, you mosey over to one of the bookshelves.  Three particular works catch your eye: "Planets and You", "The Life and Times of Queen Angelina", and "Melosa's Wish".  How fascinating!   } {dsr} {} {bookshelves} {} {1.000} {}
