R {30091} {0} {<238>} {Inside Pumice Library} {<238>"""<088>} {  This section of the library contains some very rare books: consequently, there are some extremely knowledge-thirsty creatures studying here.  You tiptoe very cautiously, because just the slightest noise would bring their complete wrath upon you.  Sure, they may be just scholars, but enraged scholars can be a big pain in the butt.  A large bookshelf to your west contains quite a few interesting looking books, while one to the left looks quite boring.  Not all information is worth knowing, you suppose.   } {dsr} {} {bookshelves} {} {1.000} {}
