R {30096} {0} {<278>} {Talcum Way} {<278>. .<088>} {  As you continue south from the strange city's center, you find yourself on an unpaved street covered competely in snow white dirt.  Bending down, you gently take a pinch from the ground and rub it between your fingers.  The powder caresses your hands like the warm waters of the North Sea, and you realize that it is made from ground talc.  So THAT'S why they call the street "Talcum Way."  You sigh contentendly and replace the powder, wanting to leave its beauty there for someone else to enjoy.  You smell some freshly baked bread from the east and hear the sound of chemicals exploding to the west.   } {dsr} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
