R {30101} {0} {<278>} {Mystina's Baked Goods} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The aroma of fresh bread and pastries having attracted you here, you smile dreamily as you almost float to the counter.  All of Mystara's treats look so divine through the counter's glass that you can't help but drool just a little bit.  The danishes drip with cinnamon/sugar glaze, The chocolate chunk cookies explode with melted goodness, begging your wet lips to take a bite, just one little nibble ...   Shaking off the feeling of near sexual euphoria, you come back to your senses.  They're just baked goods after all ...  but darn good ones. } {dsr} {} {inside} {shop} {1.000} {}
