R {30102} {0} {<278>} {Talcum Way} {<278>. .<088>} {  Talcum way ends quite abruptly here, as the gorgeous talcum powder meets a large glass wall.  For some reason, your vision of the world beyond the wall is completely obscured by a dark black mist that is contained INSIDE the crystal.  How sinister!  Why someone would place an obstacle here, you don't know.  What could lie beyond?  You're dying to find out.  You try hurling your body against the glass, hoping that perhaps you can break through it, but not a single dent appears.  Sighing, you realize that you have no other way to turn except north towards the center of the city.   } {dsr} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
