R {30108} {0} {<278>} {the Challenge of Mercury} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  All around you is bitter, freezing ice.  Huge balls of hail plummet to the ground, denting the ice below you.  You slip and stumble as you try to make your way about this strange place.  As you step wearily down on a loose patch of ice, your foot falls through and is submerged in the biting water!  Brrrr.  As you try your best to free your foot from the liquid's grasp, a woman wearing a light blue dress comes up to you, ready to fight.  Prepare yourself!  } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}

R {30112} {0} {<278>} {The Challenge of Saturn} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A tense static fills the otherwise void space.  You feel the strange energy crushing your skull like a vice, blasting your mind into innumberable fragments.  As you float around in this void, the static coalesces into a tangible sea of energy which pierces your flesh like one thousand needles.  The indescribable force then separates into two distinct columns, one beneath your feet and the other directly next to you.  The liquid power solidifies into two platforms, with the energy below you lurking like a floor made of nothing but iron spikes.  A cloaked figured fades into existence on the pillar next to you and challenges you to a fight.  Prepare yourself!   } {dsr} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
