R {30114} {0} {<248>} {The Challenge of Neptune} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  You find yourself completely submerged in a bright blue liquid.  It certainly appears to be water, but it is so dense that trying to move around is quite an effort\; it is like swimming a sea of blue honey.  Strangely enough, you don't feel the need to go to the surface for air\; this is a good thing, because the ocean seems to continue for many leagues both above and below you.  After several hours of swimming without seeing any lifeforms, you come across a hole in the water - it appears as if someone ripped the very fabric of the liquid apart.  Entering this tear, you find yourself face to face with an apparition.   } {dsr} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
