R {30337} {0} {<228>} {Garden} {<228>( *<088>} {  This used to be a fine garden with well-tended bushes, white rock walkways, and a bronze fountain in the center.  Now the bushes have grown grotesque, the white gravel in the walkways has gone ash gray with some kind of mold, and the fountain is broken, choked with debris and stinking.  You wouldn't be surprised to see wild animals roaming around in here, lying in wait amidst the tangled vegetation.  You do make out tall walls of brick surrounding the ex-garden on three sides.  Apparently, the glass doors are the only way in or out.  Small wisps of cotton float through the air.  You're not sure where the cotton is coming from, but it's all over the place.  You can probably reach out and grab a piece, if you like. } {orlando} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
