R {30528} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mThe Cloak Room[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  At the center of this cloak room is a large, circular coat rack, which is filled with all manner of outerwear.  Fine fur coats and tailored jackets hang side by side with travel-stained cloaks and scuffed, crudely tanned leather overcoats.  Through a gap in the cloaks you see a light flickering. A closer look reveals a small fire surrounded by a pair of comfortable- looking benches.  At the foot of a velvet-topped bench is a small fountain, which bubbles forth fresh orange juice.  Along the walls of the room lie a multitude of packs, both bulging and empty, some of which lie in the way of the exits to the northward concession stand and the stairwell to the west.  However, there are no packs along the southern wall, which is hung with large, velvet drapes that discreetly cloak another exit to a small chamber. } {bard} {} {inside} {safe,healer} {1.000} {}
