R {30543} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mAscending the Tower[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The stair curves seemingly endlessly both up and down, broken only by the landing you stand on. The landing is easily wide enough for several people to pass each other comfortably, but the height and several bold apprentices hanging out over the sturdy railing cause some passersby to gulp in suppressed nasuea. The north and south walls are dominated by huge stained glass windows, depicting scenes from the history of the guild, whilst gothic archways lead east and west to small spires. } {bard} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
