R {30800} {0} {<238>} {Docks} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  Stone steps lead straight up out of the water to these docks, while the rare skiff can be tethered to poles set deep in the mud.  Visits to this side of the river are rare, for the valley beyond leads to the royal catacombs.  Still, there's always somebody here to assist visitors; the dockhands tend to be silent and deferential while keeping a sharp eye out for potential graverobbers.  Even the Nile itself seems quieter here, perhaps in deference to those rulers of Egypt who have passed over it into immortality.   } {dynasty} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
