R {30801} {0} {<238>} {Valley of the Kings} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  This?  This valley is where so many Pharaohs and queens have been interred in their magnificent tombs?  Why, it seems to be nothing but a vast and barren desert, surrounded by harsh, forbidding mountains.  Well, granted, there's that passage to the north, and that dark spot in the sand might be a hole leading into the ground, but neither seems very promising.  The wind whistles suddenly through the crevices in the crumbly mountains, echoing eerily and sending a shiver down the spine.  Surely even the greediest tombrobber would flee in terror.   } {dynasty} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
