R {30806} {0} {<238>} {The Tomb of Pharaoh Hatshepsut} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  Behind the wonderful temple, tunnelled deep into the stone of the mountain,  is this secret passageway. Torches line the walls, tossing flickering light  onto the painted hieroglyphs that detail the remarkable life of the only  female Pharaoh in Egypt's history, Hatshepsut. The hall leads to the tomb she is preparing for herself. Already her childhood memories are preserved in  toys long abandoned and now stored here. Everything she'll need in the  afterlife, from food to gold-threaded clothes, is here waiting for her. } {dynasty} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
