R {30810} {0} {<238>} {Grand Avenue} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  The avenue is plenty wide, and it's a good thing too.  Crowds throng the streets, people hurrying to and fro in the city.  Pushing through is almost a requirement, rather than being considered rude.  Of course, nobles have it rather good, being carried from place to place on litters, but everybody else has to get by on foot.  The avenue is surprisingly clean- horses aren't allowed here except for official business, and thousands of feet over the centuries have packed the dirt beneath into a hard surface.   } {dynasty} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
