R {30811} {0} {<238>} {The Theban Marketplace} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  Ah, the great marketplace of Thebes!  People come from miles around to buy and sell their goods here, and it's rare that even exotic items can't be easily located.  Linen in every imaginable color, food from rough dried meat for travelling to imported nightingale tongues, animals ranging from camels for rent to much more expensive kittens- if you want it, it can be found here.   } {dynasty} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
