R {30813} {0} {<238>} {The Unpleasant Peasant Quarter} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  A whiff of foul odor makes itself known as one enters the peasant quarter, growing stronger as the poor area is further penetrated.  Mud brick huts are the norm here, and rubbish is merely pushed to the side in the alleyways for stray dogs to feast.  There's little shade, and nothing grows here except poverty.  Still, the residents here don't complain much.  This is simply the way things are, the way they've always been, and the way they always will be.   } {dynasty} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
