R {30820} {0} {<138>} {The Lobby of the Palace} {<138>[ ]<088>} {  The lobby is a functional chamber, the cedar-beamed ceiling soaring high above.  Doors lead in various directions, and a quiet servant is available to direct visitors to their business.  The floor is patterned in checkered gold and crushed turquoise, inlaid in marble.   } {dynasty} {} {palace_room} {} {1.000} {}
