R {30847} {0} {<118>} {The Pharaoh's Harem} {<118>[ ]<088>} {  The harem is spacious.  It has to be- sometimes it holds hundreds of women.  Centered around a small courtyard, the concubines are housed two to a room, with little thought given to privacy.  The chambers do not have doors, and barely enough room for their inhabitants.  There are plenty of sensual linen sheaths to wear, though, and enough makeup to last a noblewoman a century.  Of course, these days the only inhabitants are the leftover women belonging to a ten-year-dead Pharaoh, and those that Prince Tuthmoses has started to collect.   } {dynasty} {} {bloodyroom} {} {1.000} {}
