R {30858} {0} {<278>} {Youngsters' training room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This room is the one in which younger giants are trained to face the outer world.  Wooden dummies are lined up against a wall.  Those must be fake targets for training the youngsters.   } {village} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
