R {30859} {0} {<228>} {A street in the giant village} {<228>( *<088>} {  Leaving the turmoils of the contest room, you look at the rest of the village.  Tall houses grow on both sides of the street and, as you look farther northwards, you notice the flank of the mountain drawing nearer.  Two houses are east and west.  They seem to be shops, according to the weapon and armour drawings on both houses' doors.   } {village} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
