R {30861} {0} {<278>} {Giant weapon shop} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You stand in the weapon shop of the giant village.  A weapon rack is on a wall with many weapons on it.  There are numerous axes, the giant's favorite weapon.  But there are also two-handed swords and normal swords.  As you enter, the shopkeeper greets you and shows you his weapons.   } {village} {} {inside} {shop} {1.000} {}
