R {31126} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mThe Depository[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have entered into a dimly lit chamber.  So dim in fact that your eyes take a moment to adjust.  The walls of this room are covered with small black tiles that glint icily in the inadequate lighting.  You notice ceiling and floor seems to be covered with some fibrous matting, perhaps weaved from straw.  The air about you is motionless, dry and cool with little ventilation making for a slightly musty atmosphere.  This is the chamber where the spoils of various campaigns are brought and stored.  You see weapons and armour of exotic design piled all around you Some of the items appear to have been here only a short time, others lie long forgotten, veiled in dust and cobwebs.  You wonder what evil fiends were the original owners of these artifacts and feel comforted that they have been vanquished by the crusaders.  Eagerly you pick your way about the room.  Perhaps there is an item here which you could use to aid you in the pursuit of righteousness.  } {crusaders} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}
