R {31130} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mThe Stables[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you step from the peace of the gardens, the chaos that hits you is  overwhelming. There is an air of urgency here. The results of preparation can be seen everywere. Stable hands run in all directions, trying to ready  mounts. Off to one side a procession of adventurers in garb of the Crusaders, prepares to go forth. Weapons and armor gleaming, they share a few last  smiles and laughs before they must face the trials ahead. Along one whole  section of wall are the stalls, filled with mounts of all kinds. Valiant  warhorses share space with sturdy pack animals, all bedded down and well  cared for. As you turn to take it all in, you catch the smells of dry straw  and horses being groomed mixing with those of steel and leather. Off to your  left stand a few venerable men and women, obviously older members of the  order, that have come to watch the younger members depart. They occasionaly  lean together to reminisce of times past and journeys taken. Straining to  hear over the loud din, you catch fragments of hastily spoken farewells and  wishes of good fortune mixing with the soft whisper of a few parting lovers  and children seeing their parents off. As this sinks in, you notice the  expanse of several gates leading off to several paths. Each meant to speed a  traveler on their way. All here will walk a path, which one will you choose  adventurer? } {crusaders} {} {inside} {safe,healer} {1.000} {}
