R {31131} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mThe Sunlit Hallway[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You enter a hall with a very high ceiling.  There is an oval opening in the middle of the ceiling that sends muted light cascading throughout.  Beams of sunlight bounce off the lovely white marble walls where beautiful paintings hang in weathered frames.  Life-size statues stand proudly along the length of this bright corridor.  As you walk, a feeling of peace flows through the room.  The whole atmosphere gives a sense of a holy presence  } {crusaders} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}
