R {31133} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mThe Temple Library[0;37m} {<278>. .<088>} {  Tall pillars stand guard about this room, watching over the vast information stored within the shelves of this grand library.  Oak shelves hold volume upon volume of countless different types of information.  Small golden plaques line each shelf, properly identifying what lies within, from the codes of chivalry to the most complex battle techniques.  Murals of epic battles line the few places the walls show through, and some skirmishes wage war eternally around the pillars that have become their world.    } {crusaders} {} {city} {safe} {1.000} {}
