R {31147} {0} {<228>} {[1;32mThe Tranquil Clearing[0;37m} {<228>( *<088>} {  You come upon a beautiful section of the gardens.  A ring of trees surround an open clearing, with several benches nearby  to relax the tired traveller's feet for a while.  The sun breaks through the clouds overhead and shines down on the soft grass, and in several of the surrounding trees you can hear birds chirping.  A squirrel before you stares at you a moment, then quickly climbs up one of the trees.  You feel strangely at peace here. } {crusaders} {} {forest} {safe} {1.000} {}
