R {31148} {0} {<228>} {[1;32mThe Leafy Portico[0;37m} {<228>( *<088>} {  A feeling of serenity surrounds this ambulatory. Great leafy vines hug the  hand carved supporting columns as they reach towards the ceiling. The nearby  trees sway in the afternoon breeze and cast dancing silhouettes upon the  temple walls. Tired adventurers relax out here where their banter will not  disturb those within the temple. Sitting in an old wooden chair is an aged  man telling tales of his adventures to the young acolytes. As you walk about  you hear the crunch of dead leaves beneath your feet, quickly one of the  acolytes hurries over to sweep them into the garden. The tranquil feeling of  this place makes you forget about the evil and corruption beyond the gardens  and walls of the temple. } {crusaders} {} {forest} {safe} {1.000} {}
