R {31149} {0} {<228>} {[1;32mBeneath a Swaying Arbor[0;37m} {<228>( *<088>} {  You continue along the path as a soft, warm breeze caresses you face.  There is something about the quiet undertones of the currents that awaken a sense of holiness deep in your soul.  Even though you are now outside, the temple behind you extends it's marble influence, and the golden light sifting through the arbor illuminates the path with an azure glow.  Your eyes travel towards your feet and you smile as you see your reflection in the polished granite flagstones that make the path.  Like the rest of the temple, the path here is immpeccably maintained.  Though many travel this way, it seems that the craftsmanship is skillful enough to keep its new appearance for many years to come.  Above your head, ivy climbs on a mahogany trellis.  The strong scents of summer, combined with the dappled sunlight above, make you feel quite comfortable.  You stop for another moment to enjoy the breeze on your face.   } {crusaders} {} {forest} {safe} {1.000} {}
