R {31158} {0} {<138>} {[1;32mThe Squires' Armoury[0;37m} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  Upon entering the room, you notice the friendly old knight look up from his  work and smile warmly. He holds in his hand a pair of sturdy leggings  embossed with the symbol of a young Crusader. He beckons you to come closer  and try on a few pieces of the equipment he has made. As you start to make  your way over to his table you take notice of the other squires trying out  their new equipment and bragging of their bravery. Somehow taking your first  steps into this room brings you a sense of peace, calm, and honor that you've never felt. As you pick up a piece of armour eagerly awaiting its first  owner, you feel that you are finally home. } {crusaders} {} {shop} {bank,safe,shop} {1.000} {}
