R {31403} {128} {<228>} {The white monolith} {<228>, `<088>} {  A huge, pure white monolith rises up here.  Serenity fills your heart, and you fall to your knees weeping as every thought of injustice and suffering floods your memories like a torrential rain.  Love fills your heart and you suddenly feel the pain of the animals and the woodlands, calling you to help in the fight against the animated household items.  The light grows brighter, and a beautiful woman steps out before you.  Gently wiping the tears from your eyes, she pulls you to your feet and wraps her wings about you in a comforting embrace of compassion.   } {wizards} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
