R {31596} {0} {<278>} {Before the Temple of Shal'indrael} {<278>. .<088>} {  Before you stands a temple out of antiquity. At first you feel a wave of  disorientation pass over you, but it quickly subsides. Memories flare to life in your mind as you remember the tales of Shal'indrael, the floating temple  of balance. Shal'indrael -- the temple which had to separate itself from the  corrupt world of mortals, heroes, and superheroes. Legend has it that a  powerful sorcerer, in his pursuit of perfect balance, created this temple for all adventurers who wished to develop their mind, soul, and body. You  hesitate for a moment as you realize that if the legend of the temple is  true, then the legend of the treasure of Shal'indrael may be true as well. } {temple} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
