R {31599} {0} {<278>} {Adept Mar-Nalan's Office} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have entered into the office of Mar-Nalan, Barrick's apprentice. Odd books line the room, stacked precariously in piles by colour. Many of them look as  if they are ready to tip over at any moment. However, held by forces unseen,  the books continue to balance themselves. A small lantern rests on the desk  in the center of the room, illuminating a pile of papers. It appears as  though no one has organized this place in over a thousand years. } {temple} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
