R {31600} {0} {<278>} {The Inner Sanctum Of Shal'indrael} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You have entered into the inner sanctum, the heart of the temple of  Shal'indrael. Light bounces off the immaculate marble floors as a small,  unassuming fountain gurgles in the center of the room. To the east lies a  brilliant corridor of light, while to the west lies a pitch black covered  walkway. You wonder if this is the type of balance of which the legends  spoke, a balance between good and evil. } {temple} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
