R {31748} {0} {<118>} {Governer's Retreat} {<118>. .<088>} {  An odd blend of purpose is palpable when one steps into this room. It could  be considered an opulent sitting room when the elaborate couches and  armchairs are taken into consideration, all stacked in a comfortable  half-circle about the hearth and centered with a polished teak coffee table,  housing a platter with a porcelain jug and several delicate cups or fluted  glasses. To the far eastern side, however, resting before large windows which overlook the sprawling valleys past the barony, is a desk with delicate  silver inlay, its amenities at this point a pressing plate for paper and a  stoppered inkwell with a goosefeather quill resting at its side. } {chantry} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
