R {31753} {0} {<238>} {A Docked Ship} {<238>\_/<088>} {  The crates being loaded and unloaded from this ship suggests its purpose to  be mercantile to some degree, and there is little doubt that it may have a  long and rich history. The deck's planks are a variety of colors, suggesting  dozens of replacements over the years (or perhaps decades). Up to the helm,  one can spy the ship's wheel having been broken and repaired several times  over as well. Above the door which leads down into the barge is an elegant  engraving upon a wooden panel, reading the ship's name: The Golden Coin. } {chantry} {} {ship} {} {1.000} {}
