R {31755} {0} {<248>} {Brimtoil Alley} {<248>. .<088>} {  Past the northern bustle one comes to the calmer, plainer and saner environment of Fellchantry's alleyways. There are still the odd buildings  with awkward doors upon surprisingly sturdy hinges from which men and women  conduct their many creative business ventures, though they are sparser, the  people here skinnier and rattier, their eyes sharper, and their weapons  always at hand. A sharp curve eventually leads across a small bridge to the  east, eventually plunging even deeper into the (known) underbelly of the  barony. } {chantry} {} {alley} {} {1.000} {}
