R {31756} {0} {<238>} {Bogboil Bridge} {<238>===<088>} {  Some may call it a bridge, others may call it a hack, but the fact that it  allows people to cross water is one set in stone. A multitude of planks run  from one end of the stone pavement across a narrow river from the western to  the eastern side. The tightly-packed buildings receive a bit of a gap here,  though one may spy that a few brave souls have taken it upon themselves to  construct ramshackle balconies in order to appreciate their 'ocean view'. Eastwards, the alleyways split at an intersection and vanish beyond sight. } {chantry} {} {bridge} {} {1.000} {}
