R {31757} {0} {<248>} {Treadway Alley} {<248># #<088>} {  A rather open space for an alley, a multitude of tables and chairs are  scattered around the area, serving as a quaint space for an outdoor drink or  smoke among the regulars in this area. Some of the doors against the eastern  buildings lead towards shops, some to homes, and others to homes with their  back rooms converted into shops, all selling a series of curious wares of  varying value. The cobblestones underfoot appear to be dark and glisten  always, as if moistened under the toil of recent rains despite the  ever-present overhead gloom.  The alleyway continues to the north and south, westwards lies Bogboil Bridge. } {chantry} {} {dungeon} {} {1.000} {}
