R {31758} {0} {<248>} {Treadway Alley} {<248># #<088>} {  The pleasantries seemingly associated with Treadway Alley continue here, some tables and chairs scattered about the alley. Frequenters would find  themselves here reading the new gossip prints of the week over a drink or  warm beverage and a warm pastry produced from an adjecent bakery. It is clear that if one were to look for folk with fewer scruples, a journey deeper into  the network of alleyways may be in order.  A bend in the path leads eastwards, one's northern and western flanks blocked off by buildings. } {chantry} {} {dungeon} {} {1.000} {}
