R {31759} {0} {<248>} {Murder Alley} {<248>. .<088>} {  A bit of a narrower path between buildings, this area does not seem to  receive a lot of traffic. The buildings which flank the road to the north and south are a bit more ramshackle, the air feels a bit colder, and the ground  is a bit grimier. Upon closer inspection of the northern building, one may  notice the trademark giving this passage its name. A splash of dark paint  (someone dropped a bucket, no doubt) smears across the wall, the impact  having left many spots, giving one the illusion that a throat was cut. } {chantry} {} {alley} {} {1.000} {}
