R {31760} {0} {<248>} {Bottlebreak Alley} {<248>. .<088>} {  The smells wafting through this alley are less charming than those elsewhere  within the Barony, but not bad enough for one to run for the hills. Folk who  traffic here tend to always have a bottle tucked beneath an arm, however, as  they move from one seedy tavern to another, eyeing anyone who they may not  recognize suspiciously. Words can be had about the general odour of unwashed  bodies, however. The state of the surrounding buildings does not suggest  dilapidation to the point where its denizens should look and smell the way  they do, though the feeling of complacency hangs thick in the air. } {chantry} {} {alley} {pk} {1.000} {}
