R {31764} {0} {<278>} {Chantry Commons} {<278>( )<088>} {  A small attempt at emulating Fellchantry Square, a less grandiose open space  among the alleys has been appropriated by locals and turned into a market. Stalls manned by peddlers are set about the area, shouts ringing through the  air guaranteeing quality and quantity for their patrons' hard earned coin. From buildings on all sides, cords hang from roof to roof for the sake of  dangling flags and other colorful decoration for this lively environment. A  set of alleyways split off to the south and to the east, leading deeper into  Fellchantry's underbelly network. } {chantry} {} {fountain} {} {1.000} {}
