R {31803} {0} {<148>} {Monuhi's Crypt!} {<148>. .<088>} {  Welcome to your grave. Monuhi is older than time itself, any mortal who  wishes to defeat him should have more power than they know what to do with,  and even then some more. Many have come to challenge the master of evil, to  this day, only one has succeeded. He was unable to kill Monuhi though, and  instead trapped his soul inside scrolls of the Black Master. Too late though, did this generation's warriors discover that it was he who was in the black  scrolls, for now he has been released. } {nenukon} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
