R {31838} {0} {<148>} {Stone roads around the fortress} {<148>. .<088>} {  Following the roads along the east side of the fortress, you notice the busy bustle and hustle of many goblins.  Some are just walking and talking, while others are moving loads of goods here and there.  Up ahead, you hear loud noises and a large commotion is going on.  A fight of some kind has broken out!   } {fortress} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {31839} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
