R {31839} {0} {<148>} {Stone roads around the Fortress} {<148>. .<088>} {  Pushing through the spectators, you draw closer to the fight along the road.  You still can't quite figure out what's going on, but, a little farther up, you can see goblins rushing around and yelling for more guards.  Glancing to the east side of the road up ahead, you notice a large round hole in the wall.  It looks like a cave of some sort; maybe some creature wandered out into the goblins' territory?   } {fortress} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {31840} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
