R {31840} {0} {<148>} {Stone roads around the Fortress} {<148>. .<088>} {  A huge fight is in progress here!  Several humongous goblins are wielding spears and charging into what appears to be some kind of earthworm, although it's not any kind of worm you've seen before.  This thing is huge, fully eight feet long and probably three feet around.  It's a good bet this is what caused that hole in the rock wall.  Obviously some underground, lost variety of worm, this creature has three six-inch-long spikes protruding from its snout.  Rearing up, it stabs forward with its head trying to impale the goblins, while the goblins try to hold it at bay with their spears...   } {fortress} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {31841} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
