R {31841} {0} {<148>} {Stone roads around the Fortress} {<148>. .<088>} {  The roads on this end of the cavern are packed with goblins trying to see the fight and deliver goods.  It's very crowded and you don't feel very safe being crowded into a small space with all of these creatures.  You're still pondering who they must think you are and why they aren't trying to kill you.  Maybe you can find some answers in the castle.   } {fortress} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {31840} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {31842} {0} {<148>} {Stone roads around the Fortress} {<148>. .<088>} {  Following the roads along the west side of the fortress, you notice the busy bustle and hustle of many goblins.  Some are just walking and talking, while others are moving loads of goods here and there.  Apparently the goblins are preparing for something, but what?  Maybe they plan to build up and launch a full scale assault on Aylor!?!   } {fortress} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
