R {31843} {0} {<148>} {Stone roads around the Fortress} {<148>. .<088>} {  This road carved out of the stone sides of the mountain continues on, twisting around the sides of the mountain as it travels ever onward to places only the goblins know.  You wonder who could be in charge of all of this.  Each goblin here seems to know what their purpose is here.   } {fortress} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {31844} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
