R {31844} {0} {<148>} {Stone roads around the Fortress} {<148>. .<088>} {  This end of the road seems to be less traveled and you notice that many goblins avoid going farther on it.  Up ahead you can see the road growing darker; apparently there are no slugs up ahead.  Of course, it doesn't look as though there are any travellers, either.   } {fortress} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
