R {31846} {128} {<148>} {Before the Queen} {<148>. .<088>} {  Squeezing thru the crack you fall into a tangle of webs and find yourself struggling to break free.  Unfortunately the webs are not your worst problem here.  Your worst problem is the spiders who made them....  Your screams echo on the walls of deafness as a huge hairy spider scuttles forward, fangs glistening in the dim light of your torch.  Brown hairs brush your face as you hold perfectly still....  waiting, waiting.  The spider moves back just enough.  You leap to your feet as it rushes back upon your movements!   } {fortress} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {31847} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
