R {31847} {128} {<148>} {Blood Silk} {<148>. .<088>} {  This room is the scene of a nightmare.  Webs line the walls and ceilings creating an almost tranquil setting of a snowfall in the winter time.  Lined about the room in various positions and places, however, are the dried-up husks of bodies.  They line the walls and ceilings, buried in webs of old with faces twisted up and gnarled in masks of horror and death.   Sitting in the middle of it all is an abomination of evil. A huge spider nearly the size of a large horse sits with its legs pulled up about itself. Sensing you, it opens its legs and you peer into the face of a beautiful woman. Expecting the face of a spider, you're stunned with surprise, until she opens her mouth and reveals her fangs. You prepare yourself for the onslaught. } {fortress} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {31846} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {31848} {128} {<278>} {Just inside the fortress} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Stepping through the doors into the fortress, you aren't bothered by the guards at all.  You release your grip on your weapon, having expected them to at least question you about your intentions here or who you might be.  Carved from the stone of the mountain itself, this place is built to last.  An army wouldn't have a chance of defeating the goblins here at this fortress, but maybe if you can find out what's going on around here you can upset them enough to cause problems internally.   } {fortress} {} {inside} {pk} {1.000} {}
