R {31849} {0} {<278>} {Hallway in the fortress} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you enter a hallway in the fortress, you're still amazed that such a fortress could remain hidden here in the mountain from the people of Aylor for so long.  Everyone always wondered how the mountain goblins of the Miden'nir seemed to be endless.  No matter how many were killed there were always more.  Guess this leaves no doubt as to where they all come from.   } {fortress} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {31850} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
