R {31966} {0} {<248>} {A Gorge} {<248>% %<088>} {  Instead of continuing to travel along horizontally, the tunnel here has  decided to become a vertical shaft. Since this is a high traffic area, there  are well-worn foot and handholds cut into the wall. In some sections where  the tunnel is not so steep, there have even been stairs carved into the  stone. As a result, traveling through this gorge is not at all difficult. There are some interesting geological formations along this path, it might be useful to investigate. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
