R {31967} {0} {<248>} {A Deep Gorge} {<248>% %<088>} {  This must be the deepest gorge in the area. The tunnel to the south continues onward at this deep level, and the tunnel to the west continues upward,  possibly the better way to travel if seeking the solace of the land of the  surface dwellers. The darkness here is so thick that it would be impossible  to continue on without a light source or night vision. This gorge is used as  a main route for travel, so the handholds and footholds along its walls are  carefully maintained, and worn down from centuries of regular use. Upon  noting some of the unusual geological formations in this area, an individual  may take great interest, and stop to investigate. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
