R {31968} {0} {<248>} {A Fossil Chamber} {<248>% %<088>} {  In this chamber, the remains of tens and thousands of fossil vertebrates have accumulated, settling here throughout the course of thousands of years. It is curious that they all ended up here, but somehow the location of this chamber must have caused it to become a hospitable environment for them. A traveler  can carry on south from here, or can head to the north, but both ways are  veiled in equal amounts of darkness, so it is tough to decide whether one way would be better than another. While trying to decide on the next course of  action, a traveler may wish to investigate this chamber. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
