R {31969} {0} {<248>} {A Swift Underground River} {<248>% %<088>} {  A river crashes through this cavern. An extensive bridge has been built so  that traveling over it by foot is possible. It is a simple wooden bridge,  built wide enough for only one individual to travel across at a time, and it  is quite rickety. The water rushing by underneath is inky black and smells  strongly of sulfur. The river makes this the noisiest part of this  subterranean world, where the creatures are so quiet, a traveler can lull  themselves into a false sense of security. But an individual must always be  on the alert, for the creatures here are long-practiced in the art of a  silent hunt. There are some interesting geological formations around this  river, it may be useful to investigate them. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
