R {31970} {0} {<248>} {Twist in the Tunnels} {<248>% %<088>} {  This is a short, twisting tunnel. Its floor is so smooth that it causes an  individual to wonder if a body of water rushed through here at some point. This thought comes to mind because the sound of a rushing river arises from  the north. The acrid scent of smoke comes from the west. It does not smell  like the smoke from a grass or a tree fire, this smell is heavier, and more  disturbing. The cold, damp air of the tunnel causes the smoke to begin to  etch its way into clothes, and also causes a headache to begin to form. Aside from the annoying scent of smoke, and the abnormally smooth floor, this tunnel is quite similar in appearance to any of the other tunnels. There are  a couple of interesting geological features in the tunnel that might prove  interesting, one would simply need to investigate them. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
