R {31972} {0} {<248>} {Nearing the City} {<248>% %<088>} {  The plain limestone walls of the tunnel have been replaced with polished  black stones. Evidently this tunnel is approaching the greatly acclaimed  underground city of the dark elves. The dark elves have a great love of  obsidian rock and will use it to build wherever possible. This tunnel was cut into a perfect arch shape, then had its stones added. The stones interlock  perfectly, like a jigsaw puzzle. The tunnel continues on in this fashion if  heading to the west, but ends abruptly if a traveler decides to carry on to  the north, away from the city. The scent of smoke is strong here, and the  desire head away from the city rather than toward it, begins to take over. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
