R {31974} {0} {<278>} {A Somber Walkway} {<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>} {  After ascending a stairway of clouds leading into the heavens, an individual  would probably expect to find something surreal at the top. Many an explorer  has been left disappointed, however, since this is nothing more than the  Ascension Bluff Nursing Home. The architect thought that a stairway of clouds would make the residents feel closer to the gods. Unfortunately, all this  served to do was make this location less suitable for visitors and employees  to frequent. Further to this, when one closely inspects the clouds, they will come to the realization that they are not real clouds at all, but rather  millions of tiny cotton balls affixed to a steel frame. Interestingly enough, it seems that a nursing home in the clouds acquires quite the eclectic bunch  of residents. Anyone who chances by a for a visit will find that this nursing home contains more than just your ordinary sampling of senior citizens. } {nursing} {} {smallroad} {} {1.000} {}
