R {31977} {0} {<278>} {Entrance to Ascension Bluff} {<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>} {  At the entrance to the Ascension Bluff Nursing home the pathway widens into a semi-circle of flagstones that are surrounded by several stout wooden  benches. A low-set stone wall hugs all of these particulars, and three wide,  curved steps lead up to the front entrance of the nursing home. This nursing  home has been made to look like a lodge in hopes that the residents will feel like they are simply here on vacation. The roof has a steep slope and the  exterior of the building has been carefully crafted from wooden logs. Patio  doors lead straight out to the front gardens and walkway from many locations  along the front of the building. Even more light is brought into the nursing  home via expansive, arched windows that take up much of the wall-space above the patio doors. } {nursing} {} {smallroad} {} {1.000} {}
