R {32112} {0} {<228>} {To the Weaponz!} {<228>, `<088>} {  As you walk along one of the many paths that leaves the orc tent, you can see other orcs walking, with rather large smiles on their faces.  Odd, considering most orcs are gaunt, hard, and enraged most of the time.  The answer to their bizarre behaviour becomes very evident: This is the way to the weaponsmith.  These orcs have been allowed to get weapons, which gives them a marked advantage if a fight breaks out.  Similar to organized military where soldiers get promotions to officers, these weapons raise the status of the orcs who hold them.   } {woodelves} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
