R {32140} {0} {<278>} {Advisors' Table} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The advisors' room is dominated by a twenty foot long red oak table.  Several elves walk around quickly here, bringing out maps and ancient battle strategies to figure out how to route the orc invaders that will be on their doorstep in a few short hours.  Bears, flaming arrows, and burning oil are all being contemplated by the one elf who isn't running back and forth: The King.  He slowly stands, his head bowed low in thought, and chooses to have the mages begin the incantations to summon the wild animals of the forest to their aid.  Perhaps nature, which broke this castle, can break a few orcs?   } {woodelves} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
