R {32150} {0} {<228>} {An Elven Home} {<228>( *<088>} {  This elven home must belong to a family, as there are several beds around the edges of the home, and a central table with 4 chairs.  Various elven items such as paintings and sculptures are used to decorate the home.  Most elven families have a family heirloom, usually a sword or bow.  These relics have been created by their families and used to fight many battles.  They serve as a constant reminder that despite their love of peace, sometimes an unavoidable war will come.   } {woodelves} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
