R {32151} {0} {<228>} {Galanoir's Residence} {<228>( *<088>} {  It is unusually cold in Galanoir's home.  Despite it being summer outside there is almost no light shining into his home.  As you look around the reason becomes quite evident: Galanoir is storing his produce here.  Watermelons, pumpkins, grapes, and oranges are all here, kept fresh and cold for sale later.  Off to the side you can see a bed, it is covered in thick animal hides to give warmth while sleeping in this room.   } {woodelves} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
