R {32170} {0} {<278>} {Archer's Tower} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The tower has been standing here for a long time.  Originally used as a lookout for the previous owners of the castle, the elves now use this as the first line of defense for their treetop village.  Arrows are piled high on the floor here, and special iron bars have been added for the elves to sit on while oil heats under a fire.  Looking down you see that if there was an attack, the elves have a perfect view of the trail running towards the castle.  As you are looking down several elves come up the ladder and start the fires under the oil.  Women and children hurriedly collect their things, as the attack will undoubtedly start soon.   } {woodelves} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
