R {32172} {0} {<228>} {Magic Shop} {<228>, `<088>} {  This small shop is littered with every sort of magic item you can think of.  Scrolls, wands, amulets, staves, and cloaks are all but a few of the items that the shop holds.  As you are looking around the shop owner comes out to see if he can help you.  To your surprise it's a halfling, and he hops up onto the counter to help you.   } {woodelves} {} {field} {shop} {1.000} {}
