R {32173} {0} {<228>} {Garro's Weapons and Armor} {<228>, `<088>} {  To dissipate the extreme heat required when working with mithril, the elves have removed the stone walling of the smithy, allowing a brisk breeze to run through.  At the fire is Garro, hammering a breastplate into the correct shape for an elven chest.  Away from the flames, elven artisans work at detailing the armor, adding inscriptions of magic as well as forest motifs.  Garro takes notice of you, and approaches, offering his wares.   } {woodelves} {} {field} {shop} {1.000} {}
