R {32454} {0} {<218>} {The Grand Plaza} {<118>(<178>~<118>)<088>} {  The northeast corner of the Grand Plaza is dominated by the Clerics' Guild--The Tower of Life--to the north and the smallest of the eight towers--The Helpers' Headquarters--to the east.  Vines budding with a variety of flowers wind their way up the Clerics' tower, each blossom alive with vibrant color.  The Helper building is the most understated of all those lining the Grand Plaza, and yet it completes the symmetry of the square perfectly.  The so-called Eighth Tower is overlooked by many, but all would miss it if it were gone.  Vendors here shout advertisements for a variety of exotic curatives, claiming to soothe every ill from a runny nose to Nanjiki jungle rot.  Guards flank the entrances to the Guilds, letting only the worthy pass.   } {aylor} {} {hellfountain} {} {1.000} {}
