R {32525} {0} {<278>} {GreyAsh Alley} {<278>. .<088>} {  This is GreyAsh Alley, between Darksoil and Faeriefog Roads.  To the west, an enormous house blocks the view outside of the city limits.  The house is covered in large tiles the size of shields.  On closer inspection, their earthy tones come to light and present a sort of steel/leather material.  You run your finger across a silver and black metallic tile that seems to coalesce and keep your eyes from completely focusing on it.  As you back up a step and take in the full image of what is before you, a chill runs down your spine as you realize finally what it is that sides this extravagant house. Dragon scales.  Hundreds of richly colored dragon scales. } {aylor} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
