R {32527} {0} {<278>} {GreyAsh Alley} {<278>. .<088>} {  GreyAsh Alley is given its name for its distinctly grey and powdery ground-covering.  You notice that, even though it's everywhere on the ground, nothing has stuck to your boots or your legs.  There are no dust clouds, and none is caked on the bottoms of your feet.  On closer inspection, you find that, while it is a light, powdery substance, it is attached firmly to the road.  GreyAsh Alley continues to the south and meets up with Faeriefog Lane to the north.   } {aylor} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
