R {32529} {0} {<278>} {GreyAsh Alley to Silvermist Road} {<278> +-<088>} {  This is a gloomy sort of intersection where the ground and the air both hold  a grey shade. There is little to see on the corner of GreyAsh Alley and  Silvermist Road other than a large manor covered by a large, white tent. Three massive cannons defend the front lawn, and a stable of warhorses sits  off to the side. Funny, you think, how, with the grey of ash and the silver  of mist, a war scene seems fitting. A massive chain dangles above you. } {aylor} {} {crossroad_se} {} {1.000} {}
