R {32551} {0} {<268>} {The Pews Beneath a Stained Glass Window} {<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>} {  You stand among the many rows of black marble pews that provide rest for weary pilgrims and those seeking atonement.  Standing here, one can really take in the glory of the amazing Aylorian temple.  Looking up, you see that the ceiling is painted in a deep midnight blue, where the 3 moons of Andolor are depicted, shining bright in the night sky.  Hundreds of stars twinkle overhead, and you wonder if what you are seeing is real or imagined.  With a start, you realize you are indoors and it is only a painting.  It's a very lifelike painting that seems to mesmerize you, but it is still just a painting.  The peaceful serenity in this one spot seems to draw you in.  Perhaps it would be better just to sit for a moment and rethink things a bit.   } {aylor} {} {temple} {} {1.000} {}
