R {32561} {0} {<268>} {Ivar's Throne Room} {<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>} {  The Legendary Ivar hails from lands unknown.  Many years ago he made his home in a city whose history has been long forgotten.  His ideas on government, trade and foreign policy rescued the city of long past and established it as the greatest city ever known.  When it became apparent that Ivar's following was much larger than even the great city, he left and created this, the Grand City of Aylor.  Mighty Lord Ivar drove back the wilderness and used his mastery of politics and finance as well as his vast fortune to create all that is around you.  What happened to that lost city?  Nobody knows.  When Ivar left, so did those who loved him, and the city fell to ruin, losing everything that once made it so great.   } {aylor} {} {temple} {safe} {1.000} {}
