R {32562} {0} {<268>} {Confessional} {<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>} {  This room is the standard wooden closet, with a small window for voicing your deepest secrets.  If you're here, that likely means you're working to gain forgiveness for the time you've spent killing, stealing and drinking, and will soon begin a new life where you can kill, steal and drink some more!  Whatever your purpose, a small set of old wooden stairs leads into sheer darkness.  If great change is in your future and you're at the pinnacle of your success, but you wish to take on even more power, maybe you should consider taking a trip downstairs.  Only those who have achieved excellence can travel to the dark depths below. } {aylor} {} {temple} {} {1.000} {}
