R {32566} {0} {<278>} {The Templar's Road of Andolor} {<278>. .<088>} {  The bustling road is loud and dusty.  People brush past one another from either direction, sometimes unsuccessfully.  A large orc making his way out of the city is allowed special clearance which gives him a vain smirk of self importance.  You find yourself suddenly pushed to the side as a wolfen thief and a psion begin to brawl in the middle of the street.  Instinctually, you look off in the distance for a guard to stop the fight.   } {aylor} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
