R {32568} {0} {<278>} {Northern Entrance - The Templar's Road of Andolor} {<278>. .<088>} {  At this point in the road, The Great Andolor Highway has begun to slim as the large paved stones slowly mix with, and turn into, a form of cobblestone path.  It's quite amazing the amount of work and detail that went into this simple shift in the road.  To the south, the cobblestone continues for a short distance behind you, where it forks to join the magnificent Aylorian Church whose spires reach like daggers into the heavens.  To the north, the large expanse of the great world lies before you, with limitless excitement and adventure.   } {aylor} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
