R {32569} {0} {<278>} {A Large Manor} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This manor has been gutted from the inside out, one large room.  The majority of the odd decor is still under construction, but you can see the beginnings of what is taking shape.  Large sections of logs run along the floor, creating one huge tree trunk under your feet.  The walls are already covered in tree bark with branches that look like they're growing out of them.  On one of the larger branches you see something strangely familiar... It's King Bird!  This is a larger than life-size replica of the Tree of Life. Neat-O!   } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
