R {32570} {0} {<278>} {The lower branches} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The large room continues here, where the construction is nearly finished. It's almost as if you've stepped into a portal to the REAL tree.  You have to knock on the floor just to make sure you're still in this house.  This seems to be where the majority of the birds are flocking; parakeets, parrots, hummingbirds, and even the mighty hawks can be seen on the branches.  The dense foliage that encompasses you makes it hard to find your way back.  It might be a good idea to turn back before you find that you can't.   } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
