R {32571} {0} {<278>} {N t qui e finis ed} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The scene here is in stark contrast to the parts of the room to the north.  Here it looks like a full-on construction site.  There are wooden supports along the walls where workers try to adhere large pieces of bark to them.  A chunk falls from above and hits the floor just a few yards away and startles you.  Might want to back out of here slowly before you get hurt!   } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
