R {32572} {0} {<278>} {A glorious expansive hut} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The floor here is covered with a large dot-frog skin rug, stitched together with reeds taken straight from the Dead Grove.  Cages line the walls, filled with giant insects taken from their natural habitats.  Each cage is neatly labeled with a golden, engraved plaque.  Hornets, spiders, and dragonflies buzz about within the cages.  A large, potted cottontop sits in the corner, the pods letting tufts of milkweed float throughout the air like a soft winter snow.  You jump as a swamp rat chitters at you from the floor. } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
