R {32573} {0} {<278>} {A Taste of Normality} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Finally, a normal dwelling.  After all the craziness that you've seen in this part of town, this is a welcome break.  Large pillars reach to the ceiling, a smooth marble floor reaches out in front of you, and the daylight casts wonderful shadows on the walls.  A plaque is mounted on the wall opposite you.  "Diatz", it reads...  Hmm.   } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {32530} {s} {open s;s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {32574} {0} {<278>} {Replicated Ruins} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you walk into this estate, you see that the room is divided perfectly into fourths.  The northwest corner is a make-shift grave site with shrunken monkey heads and hands posed as if reaching out from the ground at you.  The southwest quadrant is covered with a layer of fiery coals, on which several burning monkeys are dancing with fire lizards, throwing bones at each other. To your right, you see a large aquarium with several live...  Mer-monkeys?!  You boggle and notice that the floor to the northeast is completely missing! In its place is a fluffy cloud, circled by a stuffed winged monkey attached to its base by some thin wire.   } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
