R {32575} {0} {<278>} {A small closet} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You can barely squeeze yourself into this closet; there are stacks and stacks of monkey heads and body parts piled up from floor to ceiling.  This must be where all the spares are kept for the large display in the rest of the house.  How many trips to Nanjiki would it have taken to collect this many monkey parts?  Why would anyone go through the trouble of collecting them all?  In this case, the motives are obvious, though the purpose is still left to be seen.   } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
