R {32576} {0} {<278>} {Memories of a Warcamp} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is the home of someone who is, most likely, a veteran of a great war.  Longbows and arrows with long-dried blood on the tips are hung on the wall as trophies.  Swords with battered and rusted blades lean against the wainscot in a very careful arrangement.  This was probably a general who retired long ago.   } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
