R {32577} {0} {<278>} {An Homage to the Tiger} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This room is very impressive.  It has smooth, white walls, with the exception of one, which is a beautiful panoramic view of a warcamp.  Detailed depictions of Lady Takeda and the other warriors can be seen.  The center of the picture is dedicated to the legendary Tiger of Kai.  The sun almost glints off of the ivory painting.   } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
