R {32578} {0} {<278>} {The Tenth Hell} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is obviously the home of a fan of the Nine Hells.  There are eight full-sized statues placed in a circle around the room.  Four of them are here, facing the west.  Zapon, Baalzephon, Pearza, and Corin watch the others silently.  A stone cold look in their eyes as if they could come to life and attack at any moment.   } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
