R {32581} {0} {<228>} {Eastern Yvan Park} {<228>, `<088>} {  This park, while well groomed, is far from the pride of Aylor.  The nobles that live here care very little about what could be a great monument to the days of yore, when dragons were feared instead of slaughtered, and there was no place for one to be chained to the ground like a trophy.  Aylor is indeed a grand city.  This, unfortunately, is an example of the grand being grim.   } {aylor} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
