R {32582} {0} {<228>} {Western Yvan Park} {<228>, `<088>} {  The litter on the ground disturbs you.  This could be a wonderful shrine to the history that Yvan once held.  Maybe you could petition Ivar to get this place cleaned up.  Though he comes to spit on Yvan himself every once in a while, that probably wouldn't do much good.   } {aylor} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
