R {32583} {0} {<228>} {Yvan Park} {<228>, `<088>} {  You stand at the cobblestone ring that surrounds Yvan, the dragon.  He turns towards you, his eyes open wide with hope, the hope that you will free him.  This dragon comes directly from the depths of the Scarred Lands.  He once ruled his entire area, but that was centuries ago.  He was captured by Ivar and chained here as a trophy to the new city of Aylor.  The haughty residents in these parts treat him as such also, bragging not about the grandness of Yvan himself, but of the great Ivar for capturing him.   } {aylor} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
