R {32584} {0} {<278>} {The Trophy Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This room is furnished like a cozy den.  A large fireplace in the corner houses a roaring fire.  Above the oversized mantle, four large speckled eggs sit in small round holders.  There are 3 more eggs on the floor at the base of the fireplace.  Overhead a large leathery wing extends out in full flight position.  It must be a mounting, however, since there is no body attached to the wing.  The gaping maw of a dragon extends halfway across the room, leaving its bright, sharp teeth right at eye level.   } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
