R {32585} {0} {<278>} {A Shrine to the Black Lotus} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Wow, someone's obsessed. The walls are covered with various artifacts taken  from the Fractured Lands. Icy Manipulators, Fellwar Stones... Even a  Millstone set in the corner. There are pictures on the wall, two of which  seem to be the owner of this shrine slaying some of the more famous creatures within The Fractured Lands. } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
