R {32586} {0} {<168>} {Vankoliche Manor} {<168>[<278>?<168>]<088>} {  The walls of this large manor are covered with slime both inside and out. Even indoors, away from direct sunlight, the black ooze continues to randomly spark as though it were hiding some unknown magic.  Despite the instability of the walls, many bone monuments hang amidst the black ooze, some of which are still attached to now dried muscle and sinew.  A grand, off-white staircase spirals down to what appears to be a dank cellar.  The exit of this dark abode is to the north.   } {aylor} {} {areaexit} {} {1.000} {}
