R {32589} {0} {<178>} {In the Tower of Whispers} {<278>###<088>} {  Judging from the way most visiting guild members guard their purses while here, honor among thieves is a vastly overrated concept.  All manner of cutpurses, pickpockets, cutthroats, footpads, highwaymen, burglars, and conmen call the Tower of Whispers their home away from home.  Unsavory characters of all varieties trade everything from secrets on spotting likely marks to recipes for mixing poisons.  After all, knowledge wants to be free, and so does gold!  Guild guards prowl the room, some of them undercover, in an attempt to discourage members preying on one another.  The Tower of Whispers is alive with tidbits of forbidden knowledge, and that's just on the ground floor.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,trainer,guild} {1.000} {}
