R {32590} {0} {<178>} {In the Ironwood Tower} {<278>###<088>} {  The interior of the Rangers' Guild has the cozy, natural feel that one would expect.  The tower walls are dotted with windows carved ornately out of the ironwood.  At night, floating balls of light roam at random about the common room to provide illumination.  Veteran rangers relax in comfortable chairs to relieve the stress and exhaustion of their long journeys.  A low murmur of conversation usually buzzes throughout the common room as guild members talk of their travels and experiences to break the tiresome spell that lone travel can cast on an adventurer.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,shop,trainer,guild} {1.000} {}
