R {32595} {0} {<178>} {In the Tower of the Mind} {<278>###<088>} {  The most striking thing about the Tower of the Mind is the silence, broken here and there by laughs, coughs, or simple statements of affirmation and negation.  It is a point of pride for the Psionicists' Guild that even if spies could penetrate their walls they probably wouldn't learn much, as almost all conversation inside the walls happens directly between the minds of the participants.  Here and there, guild members sit to "talk" or practice their skills, some by meditation, others by bending spoons, and still more by levitating various objects with only their minds.  The mood in the Tower of the Mind is scholarly and fraternal\; indeed, many members dedicate their free time here to assisting in the training of novices.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,trainer,guild} {1.000} {}
