R {32613} {0} {<138>} {The Gno-Go Express} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  This is the highest platform in the market.  It carries a large copper catapult that seems to have been pieced together from various mismatched parts, cogs, and screws.  It must be automated in some way since it is making ghastly, loud noises and pouring out huge clouds of smoke.  The catapult itself is on a large dais that seems to pivot three hundred and sixty degrees.  The arm of the catapult extends over the platform's edge, dipping down so that its bucket is even with the floor.  Several gnomes with goggles wait nervously near the catapult.  There is a large green sign which reads: The Gno-go Express - if we can't deliver it, Gno-one can!    Below that, it says to type 'look sign' for more information. } {aylor} {} {shop} {safe} {1.000} {}
