R {32618} {0} {<178>} {Tinkers' Guild: Second Floor} {<278>###<088>} {  Though never exactly famed for their neatness, the second floor of the Tinker Tower is in disarray even by Gnomish standards.  It would seem that the transition from "second floor" to "main entrance"-- occasioned by the unfortunate safety concerns raised about the Guild's state of the art front door-- has thrown off the Unified Building Decoration Strategy.  A sign posted on the wall apologizes, reading: "Please Excuse Our Mess!!!  We Are Redecorating To Better Receive You!!!  -- Tinkers' Guild Hospitality Committee."  What appear to be work benches have been hastily converted to serve as displays for a variety of bizarre inventions.  Still, here and there tools and parts have been left behind.  A few members of the Guild mill about, too busy in most cases to stop for casual conversation.  In order to provide a little warmth the Hospitality Committee has set up a mechanical banner to greet visitors.  The machinery squeaks and sometimes smokes, but mostly it works.  Mostly.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {} {1.000} {}
