R {32620} {0} {<178>} {Tinkers' Guild: The Grand Exposition!!!} {<278>###<088>} {  A giant banner has been strategically placed to greet those coming up the steps from the second floor: "Welcome to the Grand Exposition of INDUSTRY and SCIENCE!!!  Ask About Our Adopt-an-Inventor Program!!!  --Tinkers' Guild Exposition Committee."  Proud inventors stand next to their displays to show them off and answer questions from the visitors.  The exhibits have been grouped according to category, and several sport ribbons denoting them as prize winners.  The subtle tilt of the building is more noticeable in the upper stories.  Walking here actually takes concentration not to lose balance or go sliding across the showroom floor (which the Gnomes have seen fit to wax to a high shine. Anything to impress the public!).  Each display stand has been engineered with a fantastically advanced gyroscopic counterweight to keep the exhibits from tipping over.  A ladder at the back of the room leads up through a trapdoor to the top level of the Guild. A sign posted by the ladder reads: "DANGER: Senior Guild Members Only!!!"  } {aylor} {} {castle} {} {1.000} {}
