R {32642} {0} {<178>} {Ironwood Tower: A Training Room} {<278>###<088>} {  Colorful diagrams hang about this room showing all manner of nuts, berries, and plants, separated into groups according to their edibility.  One whole side of the room is occupied with a series of shelters, some of them carefully pitched tents, others makeshift lean-tos of branches and layers of boughs.  This is the Survival Lab, where ranger wannabes learn the ropes of how to keep themselves alive in the wild.  All the necessary skills from foraging to the creation of traps and snares to shelter creation are taught here.  To survive in the wild, rangers must learn to use what nature gives them, and this is the beginning of that education.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
