R {32644} {0} {<178>} {Ironwood Tower: A Training Room} {<278>###<088>} {  Like the Survival Lab, the walls of this room are hung with diagrams.  Here, however, they are to show the different kinds of tracks and prints one might encounter in the wild.  The Tracking Lab is where rangers learn how to follow and trace all manner of quarry through a variety of terrains.  Rangers' Guild instructors are fond of claiming that they could teach a one-eyed man to track a rabbit through a briar patch on a moonless night, but that expertise has to begin somewhere, and "somewhere" is here.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
