R {32645} {0} {<178>} {Ironwood Tower: A Training Room} {<278>###<088>} {  Books labeled with words both familiar and unfamiliar are the prominent  feature of this training area-- the Rangers' Guild Linguistics Lab. Individual desks are lined up in neat rows for the classes to meet here  hourly during the day to study the dialects of the people of Andolor. Rangers are renowned for traveling far and wide to the farthest reaches of  the world, and being able to communicate with the people they find is  paramount. Guild trainees are not allowed to graduate to full "member" status until they speak at least three languages fluently, one of which the guild  must consider to be "uncommon". } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
