R {32646} {0} {<178>} {Ironwood Tower: The Hidden Glade} {<278>###<088>} {  On one of the uppermost levels of the Ironwood Tower, the rangers have stashed a little secret.  The Hidden Glade is a full-service tavern for full guild members only.  The tables here are spaced out to allow a bit more privacy, unlike the cozy first-floor common room.  A bar carved from the same ironwood as the tower itself runs the length of the tavern, its surface polished to a smooth shine.  Shelves behind the bar are stocked with a variety of liquors from across the known world.  Perhaps the most unusual feature of the Hidden Glade is that the guild always picks up the tab.  As a result the Glade is almost always full, and day or night there are always tall tales and gossip being told here.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
