R {32647} {0} {<178>} {Ironwood Tower: Keeper's Office} {<278>###<088>} {  The office of the Keeper of Forests, master of the Rangers' Guild, is at the highest level of the Ironwood Tower.  The Keeper claims for himself the most awe-inspiring of all guild furnishings, as even the furniture here is carved from seamless blocks of ironwood.  Here and there about the desks, filing cabinets, and other accoutrements, magically preserved blossoms still sprout from the wood.  The ornately carved windows that decorate the tower are larger here, so that the Keeper might have an unrestricted view of the city of Aylor.  Trained birds come and go, bearing messages for the guild master.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
