R {32648} {0} {<178>} {Tower of Whispers: Purse Liberation} {<278>###<088>} {  The first phase of training for thieves who want to go professional is Purse Liberation Training.  Seamstress dummies are spaced in even rows and are covered with bells, forcing a trainee to "liberate" a suspended purse without causing so much commotion that they disturb the bells.  Furthermore, all trainees must wear a coin pouch of their own while inside the tower, and in order to pass Purse Liberation Training a rogue must present the instructors with the purse of one of his comrades.  A variety of tools are available for use in the task, from subtle finger-blades to good old-fashioned daggers.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
