R {32649} {0} {<178>} {Tower of Whispers: Lock Compromising} {<278>###<088>} {  A point of pride in the Thieves' Guild is that the tower is filled with many locks, but no keys.  This room takes that principle to the extreme.  Each of the many desks here holds a series of locks, placed in order from simplest to most difficult.  Students are issued a "little black book" containing diagrams of the internal workings of various lock types, and a thief must be able to reproduce these diagrams from memory.  Lock picks for use in the training are available for free to guild trainees.  That is, if they can get into the lockbox that holds them.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
