R {32650} {0} {<178>} {Tower of Whispers: Presence Obfuscation} {<278>###<088>} {  The floor here is covered in alternating dry leaves, loose gravel, and broken glass.  Dim lights hung at angles throw shadows along the walls and across the ground in jagged lines.  For training, the guild janitor is brought in, and a student must walk from one end of the room to the other without being seen or heard.  To complicate matters the walls are bare, simple stone, so that any sound is reflected and magnified.  Only the best thieves have what it takes to pass this test on the way to full guild membership, but the guild wants only the best.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
E {32649} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {32651} {0} {<178>} {Tower of Whispers: Assisted Biological Manipulation} {<278>###<088>} {  Most guild members will tell you that the high point of their training was when they got out of the classrooms and into the lab assignments.  Poisons are the hallmark weapon of thieves, and in the ABM lab guild trainees learn their uses.  Jars line the shelves, filled with everything from carefully preserved kobold glands to vials of corrosive balor spittle.  A series of cages contain white lab mice for experimentation purposes, though none of them are ever actually harmed in the process.  (Some, however, may be "negatively impacted.")  } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
E {32648} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
