R {32652} {0} {<178>} {Tower of Whispers: Proactive Sentry Relations} {<278>###<088>} {  The focus of thief training is to do everything possible to avoid having to deal with guards and sentries, but sometimes, as the saying goes, the way out is through.  In this lab, trainees are taught the finer points of backstabbing, throat slitting, and general assassination.  In the first phase of training the student needs only to sneak up on a live instructor, and then they move to phase two: practicing the killing stroke on a combat dummy to ensure a perfect blow every time.  The training is usually harmless, though one student ("No Fear" Narlfryd, the famed wolfen daredevil) was severely reprimanded and nearly expelled for getting a little too excited and injuring one of his professors.  These days instructors typically wear a back plate and a neck guard, just in case.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
