R {32653} {0} {<278>} {Tower of Whispers: The Den of Iniquity} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The office of the Whisperer in Darkness, master of the Thieves' Guild, is traditionally kept empty.  As part of the Whisperer's duty he must keep his identity a secret, save from the most senior members of the Thieves' Guild.  The room is completely empty except for a strongbox, bolted to the floor and secured with an exotic lock of incredible complexity.  Not a single speck of dust is to be found here.  Apparently the cleaning staff is keeping the room spotless in anticipation that the Whisperer might one day reveal himself.  The office window gives an impressive view of the Grand Plaza, and the tops of the other guild towers.   } {aylor} {} {inside} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
