R {32665} {0} {<178>} {Tower of the Mind: Archpsion's Office} {<278>###<088>} {  The master of the Psionicists' Guild makes his office in a spacious chamber atop the Tower of the Mind.  Well known among the citizens of the city for his decadent taste in art, the Archpsion has decorated his office as befits his image.  Flamboyant paintings in vibrant colors line the walls, elegant sculptures decorate the corners, and delicate vases and statuettes ornament the room's several bookcases.  A fine mahogany desk sits at the center of the room, forcing all entrants to come face to face with the guild master.  When the Archpsion is seated, a large window on the back wall of the office frames him with the grandeur of the Grand City visible beyond.   } {aylor} {} {castle} {safe,guild} {1.000} {}
