R {32666} {0} {<138>} {IVAR'S -- The Red Room} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  The decor here explains why they call it the Red Room.  Plush crimson carpet so thick your feet sink in more than an inch covers every square inch of floor, and the red walls are swathed in scarlet draperies that glitter with golden thread.  Those serving drinks probably appreciate the footing-- they don't have footwear to go with their skimpy red outfits and ruby jewelry.  Even the felt that covers the blackjack table is a soft cherry red.  It's noisy and red hot in here too, bodies packed in rising the ambient temperature, and occasionally tempers fire up too, so it's probably best to keep one's weapon at hand.   } {aylor} {} {shop} {bank,safe} {1.000} {}
