R {32667} {0} {<138>} {IVAR'S -- The Exotica Room} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  Sweet-smelling smoke drifts through this bright hall, incense sticks replaced immediately when they burn down to ash.  The walls are the color of drifted desert sand, and in fact are textured with such as well.  Here and there a young lad or maiden, garbed in filmy sheer material, gently waves a large feathery fan to cool the casino's patrons.  Along the far wall is a large glass tank, the water inside occupied by tropical fish and wispy plants.  A mermaid imported from the Dragon Sea presides there, and tritons are welcome to take a refreshing dip.  Lapis lazuli, sandstone, and pearl have been pressed into mosaics on the walls, and lush Oriental rugs soften the sound of footsteps.   } {aylor} {} {shop} {bank,safe} {1.000} {}
