R {32669} {0} {<138>} {IVAR'S -- The Star Room} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  The walls are panelled in deep ebony oak, and the ceiling sparkles with bright points of light in neon green, pink, and cyan, like stars across the night sky.  It's dark in here as well, with odd purple fires burning in the torch sconces.  However, it is easy to see everything-- cards, the blackjack table, and decorations all glow in the light of those torches, even the tasteful potted plants resting here and there.  Sounds are oddly muted, and now and then the owl on a corner pedestal lets out a haunting hoot, its eyes glowing in the darkness.  The drinks being served by barely-clad servers might put a few customers off, the electric blue color a tad unnerving.   } {aylor} {} {shop} {bank,safe} {1.000} {}
