R {32670} {0} {<138>} {IVAR'S -- The Party Room} {<138>*<128>$<138>*<088>} {  This is the noisiest of all the casino rooms, and not just because of the band here putting out loud, raucous music.  The atmosphere is one of excitement, the crowd's babble rising and falling with the play of the cards.  Bright, colorful streamers are strung along the purple-painted walls and ceiling, and a rotating, faceted silver ball hangs in the center, reflected light spinning around the room.  There is even a small, polished portion of the floor set aside for those who would like to take a break from blackjack to get in a bit of dancing.  Party on!   } {aylor} {} {shop} {bank,safe} {1.000} {}
