R {32671} {128} {<278>} {Remort Chamber} {<278>. .<088>} {  Richly-hued, highly-polished walls glisten, giving off a warm radiance.  High-backed leather chairs sit in the room, each placed in a systematic pattern of order.  The floor is covered by a lush, multi-patterned hand-woven rug, silencing the footfalls of those crossing the floor to enter this Chamber.  The atmosphere is one of peace, strength, and solitude, as the journey from this Chamber is one made alone.  As you rest, awaiting the transformation into your next incarnation, you sense a pulsing in the room...  Quiet...  Yet strong...  Almost as though this Chamber possesses a life of its own through which you must pass.  Be well in your next life, Adventurer.   } {aylor} {} {city} {safe,trainer,questor} {1.000} {}
