R {32674} {0} {<208>} {A Meeting of the Villainous} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  Before you lay the charred ruins of a burned out warehouse, blackened with soot from what looks to be a recent fire.  You are unable to make out much in the blackened remains other than a few pieces of wood and garbage.  In the back corner, you spot what appears to be a black-silk coffin that has somehow survived the fire.  From past knowledge, you know this place was used by the Mafia for its meetings.  Carefully, watching your every step, you investigate, trying to figure out what has gone on here.   } {aylor} {} {dark} {safe} {1.000} {}
