R {32677} {0} {<138>} {Entrance to Aylor's Arena} {<138>[ ]<088>} {  As you make your way through the pub, you find yourself standing in an entryway leading to, as the sign says, Aylor's arena. While the city of Aylor itself may be grand, the arena most certainly is not. Even before you enter the actual arena, the smells of blood and sweat mix with the smells of black lotus and the other various magical concoctions that are commonly used by fighters. Trash litters the ground, and rats scurry around. You also hear the sounds of fighting. The sound of steel striking steel rings through the air, mixed with the battlecries of the fighters.  There is a tunnel leading to the stands, where one can 'watch the fights'.  There is a big GREEN SIGN here. } {aylor} {} {palace_room} {shop} {1.000} {}
