R {32683} {0} {<148>} {The Aylor Arena} {<148>. .<088>} {  This section of the arena reveals a ghastly sight.  Mixed in with the viscera and blood, you notice, are several fingers and toes.  It appears that some of the combatants not only relish the bloodshed, but also enjoy torturing their opponents.  The wall at this point is blood red, yet somewhere underneath you know it is stone.  The floor is completely filled with blood and viscera.  You can't even be sure what you're standing on, since it all squishes uncomfortably as you step around the worst of it.   } {aylor} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
