R {32684} {0} {<148>} {The Aylor Arena} {<148>. .<088>} {  As you enter this part of the arena, you notice right away that the smells of black lotus and the sulfur associated with certain magical spells are less pungent.  It seems that some mighty warrior has recently cleared this section and did not give his opponents time to use their magic.  The walls here are dripping with a green-red substance that might be some sort of beverage that someone has spilled, but it's probably just some nasty green blood mixed in with the rest of the blood.   } {aylor} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
