R {32687} {0} {<138>} {Ivar's Lounge} {<138>[ ]<088>} {  This section of the pub is made for more intimate conversations. There are about twenty round pub tables organized around several billiard tables. Each table has space enough for four stools to be placed around it. These tables are easily moved about, so a couple of them have been pushed together by the most enterprising of the patrons. On the west side of the lounge, the wall is adorned with dartboards, and on the east side, a number of slot machines have been set up. To the north is the main bar where the bartender can be found, and to the south is the entrance to Aylor's Arena, for those who wish to prove themselves in a fight. } {aylor} {} {palace_room} {shop} {1.000} {}
