R {32688} {0} {<138>} {Ivar's Pub} {<138>[ ]<088>} {  All of one hundred taps are ready to flow at Ivar's! Relax here and enjoy one of the best draft selections in Andolor. The bar itself is made from heart pine. The wall behind it features a triptych of stained glass windows depicting Ivar in the midst of a grand bloody battle scene. A shelf beneath this stained glass contains the most complete selection of hard alcohol a person could ever conceive. A line of bar stools, made to match the bar, stands invitingly in front of it. To the south of the bar, a dozen dartboards have been established upon the wall, and several red-cloth billiard tables wait patiently for pub patrons to begin a game. To the west of the bar, Ivar has set up a stage and dance floor for a different form of entertainment. } {aylor} {} {palace_room} {shop} {1.000} {}
