R {32691} {0} {<278>} {The Lone Treetop} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  In the large, thick branches of the lone tree of Aylor, you see a number of nests both large and small.  You notice from this vantage point that the leaves of the tree are covered in a thick, purple dust.  On closer inspection, you get a whiff of the dust in your nose, and, besides the tickle, you feel yourself overcome with a warm, fuzzy feeling.  You smile to yourself and glance around, making sure nobody is looking to harm the tree.  } {aylor} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
