R {32696} {0} {<278>} {BoXern's Boxes} {<278>. .<088>} {  This large tile lays flat on the ground and as such provides you easy access back to the main road.  It's a great location for this particular shop, as the other lifted shops provide a reliable wind barrier.  Hundreds of boxes are stacked up here, various towers of bright colors make up the walls of the room.  A tall, lanky giant, evidently named 'BoXern' runs the shop from a small register near the south.   } {aylor} {} {city} {shop} {1.000} {}
