R {32699} {0} {<238>} {A Twisted and Cracked Ancient Road} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  Lone and bare, the level sands stretch and twist to the edges of vision.  Like slow ocean breakers they crash against the rocky shores of this desert sea.  Ancient bleached bones sit like shipwrecks high upon the rocks that thrust through the sandy waves, beckoning like sirens of old those weary travellers to their thirsty doom.  A cracked and ancient road rides through the wastes like a bridge over a troubled sea, twisting on motionless waves of sand until it disappears into the haze of the east.   A small weather beaten and blasted marker sits half buried by the all encompassing sands.  Its barely legible words state '20 miles to Reme.' } {reme} {} {desert} {shop} {1.000} {}
