R {32701} {0} {<238>} {A Carefully Maintained Road} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  The road here is as well maintained as it is abandoned to your west.  The sands are held at bay with a cunning wall of stone, which gives the rock of the road the appearance of a great causeway rising above the harsh and merciless sands of the desert.  To your east you can barely make out through the blinding sun some sort of intersection defying the soft curves that the desert would seem to prefer.  } {reme} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
