R {32702} {0} {<238>} {A Carefully Maintained Road} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  The road is wider here as it approaches the intersection before you.  You can see more clearly now that what you took for mountains in the distance, seen hazily through the slow moving desert air, is in fact the spires and towers of a great city rising before you.  To your west the desert slowly drinks in the concrete river of the road you travel on.  To your east it meets another road in a great intersection.  } {reme} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
E {32703} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
