R {32703} {0} {<238>} {Well Travelled Crossroads} {<138>~ ~<088>} {  The road you have been following through the desert has arrived at a great intersection, carved from the rock and the sands that seem to make up most of this place.  A rusting iron cage hangs forlornly from a graying wooden pole, squeaking in the harsh acid wind that blows across the sandy wastes about you.  A few sullen vultures sit upon the pole, regarding you strangely as you peer into the rusting iron of the cage and notice bleached bones and rags that tell of past meals for these scavengers of the sky.  Sand blasted expanses of road lead off in all directions, and along the one to your east you can see the hazy spires of a mighty city thrusting upwards from its sandy base.  } {reme} {} {desert} {} {1.000} {}
