R {32778} {0} {<138>} {Palace Entrance} {<138>[ ]<088>} {  This entranceway is lined with sheets of the purest gold!  The glare from several powerful magical fires almost blinds you as you stand in awe of the might and splendor displayed around you, showing well the power that this ancient city still holds.  Gold snakes decorate the walls, almost obscuring on one particularly ancient wall the ancient picture of an eagle.  Clearly someone else once ruled here many aeons ago.  To your west you can see the verdant green of the palace gardens, and to your east lies the white marbled splendor of the Palace road.  } {reme} {} {palace_room} {} {1.000} {}
