R {32779} {0} {<278>} {Harbourmaster's Office} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This small office is liberally cluttered with tablets listing cargos, ship registries, and destinations of such.  You also see customs slips, warehouse inventories, and much more.  The tablets tower over the single small desk that occupies the centre of the room, making the single occupant of that desk look even smaller than he is.   } {reme} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
