R {32780} {0} {<278>} {End of Merchants Dock} {<278>. .<088>} {  Strange reflections in the waves lapping at the dock before you seem to be to your confused eyes windows into other worlds, glimpsed and then lost.  Perhaps the legends are true then, that this sea is at a place where the walls of the world grow steadily thinner, allowing these foolhardy sailors of Reme to quest out into an ocean of worlds, with a strange wind in their sails.  You grasp the rough wooden railing, ignoring sharp splinters, as you grow dizzy and feverish with the possibilities before you.   } {reme} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
