R {32781} {0} {<278>} {Octavian Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  The houses around you have steadily grown taller and more elegant in the last few blocks.  One giant in particular stands to the west, a massive construction of mortar and marble towering into the sky, with servants running in and out of it carrying every imaginable load.  To your north and south Octavian road continues.   } {reme} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
