R {32782} {0} {<278>} {Octavian Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  This is the rich part of town here in Reme. Tall columns line the street and  marble drinking troughs sit by the side of the road for the horses that pull  the gilded chariots. Even the servants in this section wear clothes that  would cost you a year's looting to be able to afford. Octavian road continues to your north and to the south you can see the South gate of Reme. } {reme} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
