R {32783} {0} {<278>} {Inside the South Gate of Reme} {<278>. .<088>} {  This gate seems to have been recently closed.  It is heavily chained and barred, with a small sign hung upon the central link.  The sign says 'Closed due to sandstorms'.  You turn your attentions elsewhere and notice that Octavian road is to the north.   } {reme} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
