R {32785} {0} {<278>} {Guildmaster's Office} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This wide and open room is hung with green tapestries that display various scenes of nature and legend.  Curious items are hung from small rods set into the walls, things relating to various legends that the Bards still sing of in their annals.  A dagger belonging to the hero Razor before his ascent into the realms of the immortal.  A broken sword, cruelly jagged and sharp, that once was carried by Valkur the mighty himself.  The only personal items of the Guildmaster appear to be a battered wooden desk and a similarly battered wooden cello that both sit far to the back of this spacious room. } {reme} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
