R {32896} {0} {<228>} {A Wheat Field} {<228>, `<088>} {  Even more wheat!  Ye gods, why would a people need this much food when there hasn't been a war in decades.  Even with exporting most of it, you'd still have enough to feed all of Aylor and plenty left over.   } {firebird} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
