R {33188} {0} {<108>} {Path Space} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  Sitting here between two strands of the Walk of the Stars Umbra makes one contemplate the nature of paths.  Every path is made for convenience in that it is easier to go along the path than not.  This means that they usually are as compact as possible, especially when they go through open space.  But one more property comes to mind: that any path you may wish to follow will require that you move from this place, betwixt the shadows.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
