R {33194} {0} {<108>} {Walk of the Stars - Umbra} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  This shadowy path, no doubt created by some dark force, seems even darker than the cold emptiness of space.  The shadows form a loop, almost like a leash around the stars, encircling Jabbah entirely while stretching out east to Novus Ordo, back west around Polaris, and south, just shy of Xathanc, before completing the loop.  Novus Ordo is just east of here, while Okda can be seen across the Antipodal Celestial Meridian, and Enif and Errai can be seen across the Fundamental Celestial Plane.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
