R {33208} {0} {<108>} {White Sealing Ward} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  A magical fire glows white and seals the black hole east from here so that passing adventurers will not fall into it.  The ward seems to have been devised such that it doesn't merely contain the black hole, but rather draws energy out of the black hole and redirects it.  It is believed that this energy is then transferred to the obsidian sphere at the Major Equatorial Locus, which in turn powers all the other loci to enable them to tie themselves together with the antipodes and make this space finite yet unbounded.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
