R {33228} {0} {<108>} {The EverDark} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  The EverDark, from which this entire place got its name, is unlike any ordinary darkness.  Even when stars are nearby, it obscures the light so that one must stare directly at a star and concentrate in order to see it at all.  This living darkness was conjured in ages past by the drow, who came here to extinguish Scheat, the Wishing Star.  While it has dimmed Scheat considerably, the EverDark itself is contained by Vespera, and Scheat still refuses to be destroyed.  You feel an unnatural chill wandering through this blackness.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
