R {33257} {0} {<108>} {Walk of the Stars - Vespera} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  Crimson light, like the ruddy hue of an unseen sunset, winds around these stars.  And yet, unlike the Zenith trail, it does not seem malevolent, but restful.  The path it takes runs from Kitalpha, past the moongate, then north, parallel to Moonwalk until it reaches Kursa, and goes around Sham and Tseen Kee on its way to Okda, and finally south to complete the loop.  Kitalpha is directly south of here and Scheat is to the northeast, while Novus Ordo is in the northeast, across the Antipodal Celestial Meridian.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
