R {33273} {0} {<278>} {Xathanc} {<278>*  <088>} {  Xathanc, also known as the "lucky star" of gamblers, is one of the brightest stars on the northern side of the sky.  Standing in its light is thought to make one more intelligent, although it may exert a corrupting influence on those who remain near it for too long.  It is by this star's light that the first antipodal map was made, because it took a lot of luck to manage the nontrivial deck transformation required.  There are several casinos nearby, although they're invite-only.   } {vidblain} {} {space2} {} {1.000} {}
