R {33283} {0} {<108>} {The Hat Trickster's Lair} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  This hat-shaped region of space is said to be the lair of a magical top hat.  Rarely seen, it teleports from place to place, sometimes covering unsuspecting adventurers and making them disappear.  Some speculate that it is therefore a variant of the cloaker and that it therefore eats its unwitting prey.  Others claim that it could have been the work of some magical prankster and that it merely teleports those it covers, perhaps even interdimensionally.  Sadly, none it has covered have ever been seen again, and so it is quite impossible to find the truth of the matter.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
