R {33313} {0} {<278>} {Bunda} {<278>  .<088>} {  Known as the Sea Star, this star is thought to bring good fortune to sailors and those who travel the sea.  Legend tells of a vicious pirate who once stole a gem that shone as brightly as a star and of the other pirates who lay waste to the Alagh coastline, all fighting over the gem.  Eventually, the citizens of Alagh begged an intelligent sea monster to put an end to the chaos.  The sea monster then destroyed the ship of the Dread Pirate Roberts, who then held the gem, and flung it into the heavens so that it would trouble men no more.   } {vidblain} {} {space3} {} {1.000} {}
