R {33339} {0} {<108>} {Walk of the Stars - Requiem} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  This path through the stars seems to have been formed by magic from the music of an imperial dirge. The terrifying power of this song, played whenever  those who control the metallic moon go into battle, resonates not with  sadness for those lost, but with the reminder of the doom which awaits any  who oppose them. This terrifying path winds a circle past Bunda, down to  Deneb and Gianfar, west between Chort and Spica, turning north near Corona  Aerianni, then east, meandering between Nasil and Zacuto to complete its  circuit. Zacuto is a bit due south from here, while Nasl is off to the  southwest. } {vidblain} {} {space4} {} {1.000} {}
