R {33468} {0} {<108>} {Reliquary Asteroid Field} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  This place was formed during the martyrdom of St. Vesper when he faced down a great demon to save his parish.  He managed to lure the demon away from the people and over to a small shrine in the countryside where he invoked its power to destroy the demon.  Unfortunately, the demon had at that same moment unleashed an abyssal force to murder the priest.  St.  Vesper thus became a martyr, the demon was sent back to hell, and various remains of the shrine were thrown so violently into the sky that they wound up here, not far from Absolvo Te, the Mercy Star, which they were surely drawn to.  A small silver chalice floats among these ruins.   } {vidblain} {} {space4} {} {1.000} {}
