R {33482} {0} {<108>} {A Far Corner of Imperial Space} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  Claimed by those who live on the metallic moon nearby, none are permitted here except by their permission.  It is curious, though, that they should forbid any to come here, because there is nothing here.  Most likely, they've laid their claim on this place merely to keep spies away, for they are terribly secretive as to exactly what they might be doing here.  It is doubtful that they ever patrol this remote corner of their claim, however.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
