R {33490} {0} {<278>} {Zaniah} {<278>  .<088>} {  A syzygy of stars so close they appear to be one star, the three stars that make up Zaniah give off a soft, bluish-white light.  Sometimes called the Virgin Star (or, more properly, the Virgin Stars), it is thus a symbol of purity and hope.  Legend tells of three close sisters who, in their youth, volunteered themselves as sacrifices to be eaten by a terrible monster so that they might save their village.  The story goes that one of the villagers they saved later grew to be the hero who eventually slew that monster and that he turned the souls of the three sisters into stars with his powerful magic to honor their sacrifice.   } {vidblain} {} {space3} {} {1.000} {}
