R {33492} {0} {<278>} {Deneb} {<278>*  <088>} {  This bright bluish-white star is also known as the Alchemy Star for its connection to magical potions and related witchcraft.  The story goes that a greedy witch from Onexia Prime once swindled gold from many rich people with a promise of an elixir of immortality, only to run off with the money.  After she had swindled many of them, they banded together and hired a holy man who cursed her with the Pulsa diNura, or lashes of fire.  Little did they know that she really had created that elixir of immortality with the money, although she had made only enough for herself.  However, this backfired, because the curse was eternal, leaving her as if she were being burned forever at the stake.  Her essence is said to remain and to grant power to any who promise to avenge her.   } {vidblain} {} {space2} {} {1.000} {}
