R {33502} {0} {<108>} {Near the Crystalline Creature} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  As you step away from the remains of the crystalline creature, you find yourself better able to appreciate its beauty.  From the ruby red crystals along its trunk, to the jade green ones with amethyst purple fringes at the edges, it is a sight to behold.  Its smallest appendage has very fine crystals that look like sapphires.  It has three horns on top that connect to a central trunk, while two legs and a small appendage connect to the bottom side of the trunk.  The small appendage is just north of here, while the left leg runs around the east side of here and then to the south.   } {vidblain} {} {space4} {} {1.000} {}
