R {33543} {0} {<108>} {Walk of the Stars - Requiem} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  This path through the stars seems to have been formed by magic from the music of an imperial dirge.  The terrifying power of this song, played whenever those who control the metallic moon go into battle, resonates not with sadness for those lost, but with the reminder of the doom which awaits any who oppose them.  This terrifying path winds a circle past Bunda, down to Deneb and Gianfar, west between Chort and Spica, turning north near Corona Aerianni, then east, meandering between Nasil and Zacuto to complete its circuit.  Corona Aerianni is just northwest of here, while Spica is off to the northeast and Chort is off to the southeast.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
