R {33554} {0} {<278>} {Gianfar} {<278>  .<088>} {  This is the Dragon Star, which shines a malevolent red.  It is said to be the home of an ancient race of dragons that, thankfully, have not been seen for ages, save perhaps by those brave enough to seek them out.  This is quite fortunate, for even the least of them is said to rival Aldanon's power.  Some say that the star is not truly a star, but rather a dark world forever lit by bright dragonfire--a rumor that none have yet confirmed.  None who lived to tell of it, anyhow.   } {vidblain} {} {space3} {} {1.000} {}
