R {33675} {0} {<108>} {Kuiper Asteroids} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  The Kuiper Asteroids are so named for the man who caused their creation.  Kuiper was once a man who had a belt which gave him the strength of an ettin.  With it, he flaunted his power until he made one of the ettin chiefs very jealous.  One night, the ettins got together when Kuiper was asleep at home, hefted the entire mountain his house was on, and threw it into the heavens.  The belt is now lost, but pieces of that mountain can still be seen here.  The remains of an old boot can be found in this rubble.   } {vidblain} {} {space4} {} {1.000} {}
