R {33743} {0} {<108>} {Walk of the Stars - Lux Aeturna} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  An eternal light makes a curious jaunt through the stars in this area, making it the sort of thing that passes for a road in this vast void.  It begins near the west side of Onexia Prime, runs past Alya and Reshal, west from Maia and around Mira to Vagra to the north.  From there, it wanders west a ways, then southward, going around Kajam to make a stop at Lupus Majoris and Minoris, then back south and later east, passing Kuma Q'Faile to complete the circuit.  Vagra lies directly north of here, and Mira to the northeast.  Maia is far to the west, and Reshal is visible in the south, though its mate Alya is not.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
