R {33746} {0} {<278>} {Maia} {<278>  .<088>} {  Also called the Archivist's Star, it is thought that an ancient library from ages past was relocated here during the Cataclysm.  Though now safe from the Demonlord's rampage, it is unknown whether it will ever be reopened.  Because of the danger, the spells protecting the archive make it so that it can only be opened from the inside.  Given that the Cataclysm is long over, many fear that all inside it have simply perished, and that it will be lost forever.  And yet, others hope that they are merely being overly cautious, pointing out that some could have survived, as it were, by becoming undead.   } {vidblain} {} {space3} {} {1.000} {}
