R {33790} {0} {<278>} {Phact} {<278>  .<088>} {  Once thought to be fictional, this small bluish-white star reminds some of the color of a dove's wing.  Some speculate that it was never truly considered fictional, but that scholars have misinterpreted the statements concerning it.  Because the dove represents peace, they claim that those saying it was fictional were using it as a metaphor to say that peace itself is an illusion, especially when it is paired up with Altais in the sky.  Even today, this star is seen to represent the hope of peace, however distant it may seem at times.   } {vidblain} {} {space3} {} {1.000} {}
