R {33812} {0} {<108>} {Stone Space} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  This place was once an ordinary asteroid field until the day a merchant with a huge cargo of gems came through here.  When he was ambushed by bandits and saw that he was about to die, he deliberately set off all the explosive wards protecting his cargo, destroying it, himself, and the bandits.  While any gems large enough to have value that did survive were long ago gathered up, there are still many beautiful gemstone fragments floating around.  The bits of onyx in this place are almost impossible to see in this darkness.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
