R {33830} {0} {<278>} {Kajam} {<278>*  <088>} {  The legend goes that this star was once the flaming club of an ogre chief.  In ages past, there was once a tribe of ogres who were being driven away by a horde of frost giants.  Being weaker than the giants, they turned to their ogre magi for help and the magi created a set of flaming clubs as well as a club with the power to control the others, Firesmash, for their chief.  With these new weapons, the ogres began to prevail until their chief faced down the chief of the frost giants.  Foolishly, this chief summoned all the power of every other flaming club, killing himself as well as the frost giant chief.  This power being far too great to control any longer, the ogre magi were forced to fling Firesmash into the heavens where it now shines as a star.   } {vidblain} {} {space2} {} {1.000} {}
