R {33835} {0} {<108>} {Walk of the Stars - Lux Aeturna} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  An eternal light makes a curious jaunt through the stars in this area, making it the sort of thing that passes for a road in this vast void.  It begins near the west side of Onexia Prime, runs past Alya and Reshal, west from Maia and around Mira to Vagra to the north.  From there, it wanders west a ways, then southward, going around Kajam to make a stop at Lupus Majoris and Minoris, then back south and later east, passing Kuma Q'Faile to complete the circuit.  Reshal lies just west of here, beside its mate, Alya. Maia can be seen far to the northeast, while Onexia Prime is off to the southeast.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
