R {33917} {0} {<108>} {Rune Space} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  Giant runes are burned upon the sky in this place.  Some think it was one of Futhark the Elder's earliest experiments, but, if so, he must surely have realized that he would fill the sky long before he wrote even a page of his library here in magical fire.  Although the runes are no longer as bright as they once were, such that they cannot be seen from the ground, those who can see magical auras would have no trouble making sense of them.  This rune looks somewhat like a modern letter E, or perhaps more like a snake.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
