R {33934} {0} {<108>} {Walk of the Stars - Segin Way} {<208>[ ]<088>} {  This slipstream path is a slick way to segue through the stars.  Just be sure to watch your step; careless people have been known to fall off.  The path itself runs a long circuit starting down at Azah and Tyl, running north to Vindemiatrix, then east to Algol, and south, around Altais and Phact, until it runs alongside the Fundamental Celestial Plane, heading west now, and completes the loop.  Azah and Tyl can be seen south of here.   } {vidblain} {} {space1} {} {1.000} {}
