R {34346} {0} {<248>} {Floating Cloud Sanctuary} {<248>% %<088>} {  What looked like cloud from the street feels even more like a cloud from inside.  The soft, billowy floor absorbs all your footfalls, and the walls shimmer with moisture.  Somehow the air is still not humid, yet you can clearly see the floor and ceiling of this place swirl much like clouds do.  An empty podium sits in the middle of the room, and a soft light radiates from it.  The quietness of the place has a near holy quality.   } {gnomalin} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
