R {34347} {0} {<278>} {Vacant Cloud House} {<278>. .<088>} {  What looked like a cloud from the street feels even more like one from inside.  This place has a floor which billows and absorbs the sound of your footfalls.  A thin layer of dust seems to coat everything, but it doesn't stir at your movements.  There is a definite smell of storms in this house.  The gnomes have somehow managed to make rooms inside this cloud.   } {gnomalin} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
