R {34348} {0} {<278>} {Large Cloud House} {<278>. .<088>} {  This structure is enormous.  It appears as if several Gnomes live in this home.  The cloud billows as you walk and there is very little noise inside the swirling walls of the house.  You can see a hallway with several doors which must lead into the private rooms of the Gnomish inhabitants, and opposite the hall is a large kitchen.  A fire burns on a hearth made of stone, which against all physical laws, rest comfortably atop a fluffy piece of the floor.  A set of stairs lead down into the cloud, though a complex alarm system guarantees that no visitors such as yourself will climb down to find out what is there.  There are faint sounds of hammering and ringing bells coming from below, however, and you guess that it must be a Gnome's workshop.   } {gnomalin} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
