R {34354} {0} {<278>} {The governor's room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you ascend the stairs, you come to a pair of double doors.  Throwing open the doors, you enter the private chambers of the governor.  A large bed occupies the majority of the room, and appears to be spinning.  Mirrors hang on the ceiling above the bed.  The nightstand next to the bed holds a strange device.  As you examine the device, you touch one of the buttons and soothing melodies begin to play.  A fireplace dominates the western wall.  The fireplace is lit and provides a romantic setting.  A balcony overlooking the city is to the south.   } {gnomalin} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
