R {34355} {0} {<278>} {Stratus Street} {<278>. .<088>} {  The street comes to an end here.  A large billowing mansion rises to the north, its spires and towers looking like fanciful creatures as they swirl.  It is difficult to understand how all these cloudy places can exist, but then, the jarring effect of the multicolored stones might be playing more tricks with your mind than you first thought.  A small house sits to the west, and an official building sits to the east.  The building is out of place since this seems to be a housing district, but perhaps the gnomes like to have plenty of places to gather for business.   } {gnomalin} {key on 'Ancient Leader'} {city} {} {1.000} {}
