R {34356} {0} {<278>} {Meeting Hall} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Somehow the walls of this cloud have been pressed back.  They are a smooth white, and lines and swirls of dark grey and black seem more like paint than cloud material.  A large table sits on the springy floor.  There is a lecturn at one end of the room.  A long list of rules is held to the front of the lecturn with what appears to be wires and hoses which disappear through one of the cloud-walls.  The writing is crammed together and extremely small, and reading it would probably give most people a headache anyways.  You guess this must be where the community comes to discuss ordinances for the neighborhood.   } {gnomalin} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
