R {34357} {0} {<278>} {Small Cloud House} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Much like the other houses you have seen, this one is made up of a cloud, or maybe it is many clouds all pressed together.  You have no idea what holds this place together, or how it keeps from shrinking or growing, but at least it doesn't rain or snow itself out of existance.  The furniture here is sprawling, seeming to have many curves and is almost as billowy as the structure itself.  Silver streaks run across the ceiling and walls, and here and there an occasional one runs across the fluffy floor as well.    } {gnomalin} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
