R {34358} {0} {<278>} {A small garden} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is one of the strangest gardens that could ever exist.  Flowers of all kinds bloom in soil which should not be floating so easily atop whispy clouds.  The saplings and small bushes seem to spring up out of the billowing clouds underfoot.  There is a slight breeze, but you cannot tell where it might be coming from.  The bushes and flowers seem to sway gently as the clouds which nurture them undulate and swirl.  The glittering street lies back to the east.   } {gnomalin} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
