R {34359} {0} {<278>} {A large balcony} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Standing on the balcony, you overlook Stratus Street.  The purpose of the precious stones on the street becomes clear, and it is apparent that the stones form a complex magical formula.  The winds whip about you as you stand on the balcony and you reach for the rail.  You notice then that tendrils of clouds form the railing which is as solid as the floor you stand upon.  A gnomish flag attached to the wall of the mansion flaps in the wind. } {gnomalin} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
