R {34360} {0} {<278>} {Entrance to the Dagas Cathedral} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you stand at the entrance to the cathedral, you see amazing architecture and masonry craftsmanship that emit a sense of primordial power.  However the gnomes appear to have mixed in technology with magic to create this cathedral.  The bell hovers in midair, supported by a contraption.  The exterior of the chapel is made of stone.  Gears and gadgets are carved into the walls of the cathedral as well as images of their god.  The feeling of cold that you would normally expect from stone does not exist, but a strange feeling of warmth radiates from the floors and walls.  Spires rise towards the heavens and disappear in the clouds.  You feel a cool breeze blow across your face and angelic singing echoes in your ears as you open the doors.   } {gnomalin} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
