R {34393} {0} {<278>} {Hallway to Reception} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The gnomes patiently shuffle along, moving slowly towards the reception area to the north.  This hallway looks like most of the government facilities you've ever seen, and is less elegant than the entrance.  Dingy walls are adorned with only official announcements and warnings.  The ceiling is lower here, but the cloud floor muffles most of the sound.  The queue has become quieter here as most individuals appear to have decided on which question to ask the receptionist.   } {gnomalin} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
