R {34618} {128} {<248>} {Breeding Cave} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  Female Sahuagin wander in and out of this rustic cave.  Some lay waiting on seaweed mats waiting for their master and prince to come impregnate them. Others are here to deposit their eggs or care for their hatchlings.  You shudder as you notice a pile of dead hatchlings in the corner of the room.  The Sahuagin are not ones to tolerate weakness.  Guards enter the cave to inspect the new hatchlings, pluck any with noticeable imperfections and slam them against the walls of the cave before tossing their tiny bodies into the pile that will later be used as shark food.   } {sahuagin} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
