R {34633} {128} {<248>} {Lair of Prince Azhirlur} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  You are surprised when you enter the lair and see a colorful tapestry hanging on the dreary stone wall.  Even more peculiar are the figurines of gold and the bowls of fine china that sit on the primitive table in the center of the room.  It is an obvious contrast to the other dark and gloomy rooms you have come across in this stronghold.  The tenant of this lair is undeniably one who is unusually fascinated by the items that have been seized from his victims.   } {sahuagin} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
