R {34635} {128} {<248>} {Imperial Defender Post} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  You slip unnoticed into the scant quarters of the guards you noticed stalking the corridor.  Seaweed mats lie on the floor for off-duty defenders.  Racks of barbarous weapons are hung on the walls for easy access if there should be any intrusion.   } {sahuagin} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
