R {34636} {128} {<248>} {Sahuagin Service Chamber} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  This dismal, cramped cave houses the domestic staff of the palace.  Workers scurry in and out, performing various duties for the king and his nobles.  You glance around the meager cave and find only some food scraps and seaweed mats.  Bloodstains in the corner and the walls are a reminder to the laborers that the king is not a patient creature and will not tolerate being displeased.  A spot next to the bloodstains seems to be a tunnel. } {sahuagin} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
