R {34637} {0} {<248>} {Imposing Corridor} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  The pitch-dark corridor continues with nothing but rough, featureless stone walls looming over you on all sides.  In spite of the lackluster surroundings, the butterflies in your stomach intensify as you move forward into the sinister blackness ahead.   } {sahuagin} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
