R {35100} {0} {<238>} {Along a Hidden Path} {<238>/ \<088>} {  A small trail, barely wide enough to walk down, works its way down from the jagged southern mountains that rise to rip the sky.  Bits of rock litter the way, eroded off the mountainside.  A short, weedy grass clings to life in the insufficient soil.  Above you, the sky is murky.  The clouds rumble and shift in a sea of everchanging grey, a hint of rain against the dusty and bone-dry landscape. } {ketu} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
