R {35102} {0} {<238>} {At the Edge of a Cliff} {<238>( *<088>} {  The forest around you is dying.  High up on the cliff, hundreds of feet above the eastern gorge, the trees seem caught in a state of autumn, their leaves red and orange and gold.  Many other trees have long since died, the ground around you littered with the trunks and carcasses of ancient trees, some a hundred feet or more tall.  With the death of the great canopy, a number of other plants have moved in, mostly vines and brambles. } {ketu} {} {dead_forest} {} {1.000} {}
