R {35103} {0} {<238>} {Deep in the Dead Forest} {<238>* *<088>} {  All about are the remains of what was once a forest.  Trees stand in careful rows, once deliberately planted, now dead.  What few trees live retain just a handful of leaves each.  The foliage hangs precariously from the branches, as if the next strong wind would strip them bare.  In the forest's wake, brambles and thorns have taken over.  An impregnable fortress, the ugly vines stretch far to the south and west, blocking the way. } {ketu} {} {dead_jungle} {} {1.000} {}
