R {35104} {0} {<228>} {A Forest of Ash and Poplar} {<228>( *<088>} {  The trees are thick and deep.  The forest is overgrown - were it ever tended, it would have been long ago.  There is no path to speak of.  The only way is where the trees run thin, their growth slowed by rocky soil and the sheer west cliffs.  By the cliffs, some rocks have been piled loosely.  A great silence permeates the woods. } {ketu} {} {forest} {pk} {1.000} {}
