R {35106} {0} {<228>} {Deep in the Cliff Lands} {<228>. ^<088>} {  The jagged cliffs that hang over the gorge turn to a series of hills and valleys.  The land is vivid and green, covered in wild grains that reach several feet in height.  A creek cuts the hills like a dagger before it drains to the west.  Sage and wild mint grow among the grains, and the air is thick with their scent.  From the sky, the sun's rays pound the earth with the force of a copper hammer. } {ketu} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
