R {35107} {0} {<238>} {In the Cliff Lands} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  All around you, small cliffs rise in the rocky landscape.  There is little life.  Grass grows where it can, sprouting in patches between rocks.  A strong wind kicks up dust and pebbles.  The wind-swept debris creates tiny funnel clouds, spiralling a few feet at a time before the wind shifts imperceptibly and the rocks fall back to earth.  The weather has suddenly become cold.  In the barren clifflands, the wind is wicked and constant, an unrelenting force that chills everything in its way. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
