R {35108} {0} {<238>} {High in the Cliff Lands} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  The strange landscape of cliffs and rocks continues, perhaps the result of tectonic shifts many eons ago.  The earth has an eerie, barren quality. Little grows here.  That which does, nestles in cracks and crevices, anywhere there's soil.  A spindly, barren tree stands beneath a massive northern cliff, offering a way up to the ledges that form a natural path.  The branches shake and rattle with the wind. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
