R {35110} {0} {<228>} {Verdant Grasslands} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grassland here once served as some sort of border.  A stone wall, perhaps five feet in height, spans across much of it.  Incredibly ancient, the wall has fallen to ruin.  There are gaps in many places, the stones gone, those that remain weather-worn and battered.  The grass itself is a deep, rich green.  Tall and thick, it bows and sways in the wind. } {ketu} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
