R {35113} {0} {<228>} {The Great Plains} {<228>, `<088>} {  This field is planted with clover.  No other plants grow here, though in the distance, the plains continue untended.  A few wild horses stand here and feed on the abundant clover.  As you approach, their heads jerk up quickly, and they turn to flee to another field.  By your feet, a fox darts by, a quick shot of crimson that quickly wriggles and disappears into a burrow in the clover. } {ketu} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
