R {35115} {0} {<228>} {The Great Plains} {<228>, `<088>} {  Storm clouds gather, the vast, open sky is in turmoil. A massive crack from  the clouds shatters the landscape, and rain pours from the heavens. With the  weather, the green of the prairie is made more vivid by the new smells the  rain brings. A long line of trees split the prairie to the east, tall maples  planted as a defense against the wind that comes to rip the topsoil and send  it high into the air. Beyond the trees lies a small field planted with what  appears to be sunflowers. } {ketu} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
