R {35116} {0} {<228>} {At Forest's Edge} {<228>( *<088>} {  The trees are thinner here. Away from the heart of the forest, you can see  sunlight breaking through the alders. Birdsong resonates from the canopy,  carrying down in an outpouring of melody and counterpoint. Branches sway  gently. The wind carries through the woods, warm and gentle, rustling the  leaves around you in an almost percussive effect. A few trees lie fallen  nearby, their trunks split open, acting as homes to ants and termites. } {ketu} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
