R {35117} {0} {<228>} {In the Forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Short spruce trees surround you.  This section of the forest is filled with conifers, and sharing space with the spruce are pines and yews.  Between the trees, a thin, yellow grass has taken over the forest floor.  Atop the thin stalks of the grass are fluffy seed pods.   Somewhere in the distance, you can hear the sound of water from a creek or stream.  The air is cold here.  A freezing wind cuts in from the south, twisting through the trees and whipping around you.  It catches you in its cold fingers before it leaves as suddenly as it came, the weather suddenly temperate again. } {ketu} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
