R {35118} {0} {<278>} {The Cusp of Darkness} {<228>,<278>|<228>`<088>} {  It is getting darker here, the air humid and cold.  In the dim light, you see a rocky trail descending into the deep darkness below.  Above you, you can hear the cackling greeting of crows, a shrill laughter that resonates through the crags around you.  To the east and west are massive cliffs, too sheer to scale.  Further in the northern darkness you can make out flickering lights.  A light rain begins to fall. } {ketu} {} {smallroad} {} {1.000} {}
