R {35119} {0} {<238>} {Kreyagin's Gorge} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  Here the darkness is cold and palpable, inky blank tendrils that move with the wind to wrap themselves around you.  The western cliffs are high and rocky, towering hundreds of feet above the basin of the gorge.  The massive ravine sprawls north and east, and a small path to the south leads out of this cursed place, toward a distant crossroad.  In the darkness, you can hear a strange, skittering sound from deep in the canyon. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
