R {35120} {0} {<238>} {Descent into Darkness} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  The ground slants and slopes, taking you on a downward descent through the  gorge. With the wind at your back, pressing, the way is precarious, and you  have little time to find your footing. Ahead of you, the wind howls through a thin passage. The weather is suddenly cold. A bitter chill settles in the  ravine, casting a frigid pall over the canyon floor. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
