R {35121} {0} {<238>} {A Tight Corner} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  The gorge narrows into a rocky corner, the east and south walls slowly coming together into a sharp point.  Something has dug a small tunnel into the south cliff, perhaps two feet high.  Too small to walk through, it looks as if crawling might work.  From within the rock, you can hear a dull, scratching sound. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {pk} {1.000} {}
