R {35122} {0} {<238>} {Deep in the Gorge} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  Stable as a house of cards, the ground buckles and crumbles beneath your feet.  In the blackness, it is difficult to watch your step, and the unfaithful earth provides many reasons.  Hundreds of fissures pock-mark the earth.  Some span but inches in size, while others you can see range dozens of metres across, and offer certain death to the careless.   As the wind picks up, it makes a range of sibilant sounds as it carries across the crevasses, ranging from a low whine to a hideous shriek.  Taken together, the sounds form a music of dissonance. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
