R {35123} {0} {<228>} {Vale of Flowers} {<228>, `<088>} {  A small, fertile vale has taken root in the gorge.  Thick, black soil holds the roots of wild flowers and rose bushes.  The air is heavy with the flowers' fragrance, and the rich smells linger tantalizingly.  A flowering vine has begun to climb up the side of the canyon, rising several dozen feet in height, having latched on to a tiny tree that has grown out of the rock face.  Between the flowers grows silvergrass, which glints and glimmers in the waning light. } {ketu} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
