R {35124} {0} {<148>} {In a Dark Tunnel} {<148>. .<088>} {  This is some kind of rough burrow, carved out of the face of the cliff.  The walls and ceiling feel loose, and crumble under your touch, the earth formed from fine sandstone.  Sounds reverberate and echo.  You hear some sort of scratching or scraping from up ahead.  The air is damp and warm, and smells of death. } {ketu} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
