R {35125} {0} {<148>} {A Cavernous Lair} {<148>. .<088>} {  The northern tunnel has widened into a larger room.  But unlike the tunnel, which looks to have been carved, this room appears natural, caused by the natural erosion of the sandstone by water over millennia.  Stalagmites and stalactites jut from the cavern's floor and ceiling, large at their bases, narrowing to razor-sharp tips.  Water drips from the ceiling, and runs off into a tiny underground stream. } {ketu} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
