R {35126} {0} {<238>} {A Narrow Passage} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  Here the rocky walls of the gorge have narrowed down to but a few feet in width, a crack in the earth that could easily be leaped from high above.  This sudden contraction almost cuts off the way, but the width permits entrance into the larger expanses north and south.  The walls are quite jagged and rough.  The rocks look to be recently split, sharp as swords, and undulled by years of erosion. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
