R {35129} {0} {<238>} {An Awkward Slope} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  A small path between the towering cliffs takes you on a further descent downward.  Small, spiny insects skitter between the many rocks, disturbed when your feet upend their resting places.  A sudden blast of hot air erupts from the north, carrying a sick smell of sulfur, rot, and death. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
