R {35130} {0} {<238>} {The Path Turns} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  The path twists suddenly, snaking east down a steep slope. At its base, you  can see bursts of fire and ice, and every so often, a great roaring sound  pierces the darkness. The smell of death is heavy here. A sickness that  festers, it works its way into your nostrils and lungs. The air is very warm  here. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
