R {35131} {0} {<278>} {The Pit of Bones} {<278>, `<088>} {  The western path opens to a wide-open pit, its floor littered with bones. Some look old, bleached white by age and the biting wind, while others look far more recent, bits of rotten flesh hanging off, left uncleaned by whatever brought this upon them.  The air here is rotten, foul, and disgusting.  Laden with death, its sulfurous taint lingers all around you, the smells overwhelming and impossible to ignore. } {ketu} {} {ashen_field} {} {1.000} {}
