R {35132} {0} {<238>} {In a Large Tent} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  Of all the tents that ring the perimeter of the camp, this is the largest. Unlike the others, which look to be bell tents set up around a single wooden pole, this tent has been set up around a centre pole, and four at the corners.  The centre pole is larger, slanting the roof and allowing the rain to quickly run off.   Inside, you can see animal furs laid out over a bed of fresh straw.  In the southeastern corner there is a large chest, kept shut with an iron lock. The air is sweet here, filled with the scent of some kind of spicy incense. } {ketu} {} {hut} {} {1.000} {}
