R {35133} {0} {<238>} {The Canyon Ring} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  There is a little more greenery here.  A few squat bushes eke out their existence in the rocky and insufficient soil.  Around them grows silvergrass and crabgrass, the colours alternating between silver and deep green.  A light rain begins to fall.  It creates a rocky mud, which follows the slope of the path to flow to the grass and bushes - perhaps this is what allowed them to grow in the first place. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
