R {35135} {0} {<238>} {The Canyon Ring} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  The massive central rock looms high to the east.  It is uneven, and its peak slopes slightly to the west, casting a shadow over the ground on which you walk.  Every so often, at the periphery of your vision, you can see something scurry out of a rock, into the shadow, and then past you, impossible to make out in this dark and rocky land. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
