R {35136} {0} {<238>} {The Canyon Ring} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  The ground slopes down to the north, carrying the bad weather on its descent, the rain here coming down harder.  The precipitation is impossible to avoid, there being no cover here save for the odd bush.  Above you, the eastern cliff lacks any kind of overhang that could be used for shelter.  A bit of moss covering the great central rock soaks up some of the rain. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
