R {35137} {0} {<238>} {The Canyon Ring} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  Flat and less rocky, the earth here has levelled out from the slope to the south.  Towering to the south-west is the central rock which forms the canyon ring.  Westward, you can see some sort of opening in the northern wall of the gorge.  The wind continues its endless spiral around the rock, clutching you in its cold fingers as it flies past. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
