R {35139} {0} {<238>} {The Canyon Ring} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  You stand in the northern part of the canyon ring.  A great opening has been carved out of the northern cliffs, great boulders still lying around the entranceway.  An inky blackness boils out of its depths, broken up only by wisps of light that cut like blades through the dark. } {ketu} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
