R {35140} {0} {<148>} {The Cavernous Maw} {<148>. .<088>} {  This opening looks to have been violently cut out of the rock.  Rough and misshapen, the tunnel can nonetheless be described as enormous.  The ceiling towers almost a hundred feet above you, and it is at least that distance from wall to wall.  There is a thick, permanent darkness here that the light cannot fully penetrate.  Bits of light dance and flit through the air as if by magic, never able to fully illuminate the way. } {ketu} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {35142} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
