R {35141} {0} {<278>} {The Pit of Skulls} {<278>, `<088>} {  The earth here has been piled with skulls, and fragments thereof.  A sick ash lingers like dust over the bones, and the constant wind creates small clouds of death that move and resettle into new piles and layers.  There is an awful, sulfurous smell from somewhere to the north.  In this place, you can see a hideous order.  The skulls are piled roughly by size, with the smallest to the north, and the gargantuan to the south. } {ketu} {} {ashen_field} {} {1.000} {}
