R {35268} {0} {<238>} {The Basement Furnace Room} {<238>. .<088>} {  The granite and ebony floor in this corner of the furnace room is covered  with black coal and dust. Stepping through the dust stirs up black clouds  which obscure the vision and clog the lungs. Large piles of coal dot the  floor here, and fire elementals dart through the maze of fuel, gathering coal to bring to the furnace to the northwest. The walls are pitch black, except  where deep claw marks have scraped through the coal dust coating the granite. If you're very unlucky, you might meet the creature who made those marks. } {academy} {} {city_underground} {} {1.000} {}
