R {35271} {0} {<238>} {Behind the Basement Furnace} {<238>. .<088>} {  The back side of the Academy furnace is covered with arcane symbols and  age-old graffiti. The symbols were obviously drawn by a trained and steady  hand, while the graffiti has been left by generations of students with little to do and too much time on their hands. The incredible heat from the furnace  serves to preserve the graffiti rather than remove it, which provides an  interesting collage of witticisms from the past. } {academy} {} {city_underground} {} {1.000} {}
