R {35380} {0} {<278>} {Below the Basement Staircase} {<278>.@.<088>} {  A long staircase ends in this small alcove. To the west, a practice area  stretches out, filled with students dueling practice dummies. A large torch  flickers on the wall, casting shadows that dance across the floor and up the  staircase leading back into the academy proper. } {academy} {} {stairs} {} {1.000} {}
