R {35381} {0} {<278>} {Office of the Arch Mage} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The office of the Arch Wizard Maerchyng is an astounding place. Bare of  anything except one chair, one desk, and one slightly wilting plant in the  corner, it nevertheless gleams with majesty and power. Mage lights gleam from the crystal chandelier set in the ceiling, and the floor sparkles with power  and magic. The walls are bare, except for a painting of the Academy gardens  set behind the desk. Windows peer out from the office in three directions,  giving you a gorgeous view of Aylor and the Academy gardens. } {academy} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {35228} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {35382} {0} {<278>} {Hallway in the Academy} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Tall cabinets line the walls here, filled with fascinating tools and weapons. The tops of the cabinets are clear glass, offering you a view into the  contents. Touching them probably would not be advisable, however, as you can  see the sparkle of security magic covering the entire cabinet. Above the  cabinets, the walls are lined with posters and paintings advertising school  spirit and team work. } {academy} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
