R {35383} {0} {<278>} {Hallway in the Academy} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The hallway you've stepped into contains fantastic statues, smiling distantly at the passing students. Each of these statues represents one of the Gods of  Andolor. Some of them are of surpassing beauty, drawing the eye and  quickening the spirit. Others are twisted and dark, and you see students  scuttle around those statues, unwilling to touch them. East and west are  classrooms, and north and south the hallway continues. } {academy} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
