R {35397} {0} {<278>} {The Minion War School} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This rather large tepee serves as a place for all the minions to prepare  themselves for battle. Classes take place every day, throughout the day,  rotating students in and out. They do most of their studies through lectures  in the beginning, however, later it turns into brutal fights between minions. They must work hard to be fully prepared to overcome Fort Terramire. } {terramire} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
