R {35398} {128} {<118>} {Bottom of a dark pit} {<118>. .<088>} {  You have no idea where you are. Nothing can be seen, except a ladder in the  center of the room. Feeling around, you find a couple torches unlit hanging  on the walls. After feeling around a bit more, you give up. } {yurgach} {} {redcarpet} {pk} {1.000} {}
