R {35440} {0} {<148>} {Deep in a Root Hair} {<148>. .<088>} {  Deep within the root hair, a small, putrid pool has gathered. The reddish  liquid festers within the roots like a tumor, and sends out clouds of noxious fumes which burn your eyes and creates hallucinogenic visions of the  destruction of civilization. } {tol} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
