R {35595} {0} {<148>} {A Dead End} {<148>. .<088>} {  The tunnel comes to an end here with a series of branching private burrows to the east, south and west. The sound of a kit crying intermingles with  laughter from another direction and maternal scolding in all directions. You  notice a note posted to the door of the burrow on the west side of the  tunnel. } {terramire} {key on 'security guard' 1n} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
