R {35609} {0} {<148>} {The End Of The Hallway} {<148>. .<088>} {  The hallway continues to the south, however, it is apparent no one is allowed past this point since there are signs hanging everywhere warning trespassers. There are two large doors on each side of the hallway. The one on the east  has a peekhole, while the one of the west does not. A single torch hangs on  the wall next to the door on the west causing shadows to cast upon the walls  in an eerie fashion. } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {35611} {e} {open e;e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
