R {35623} {0} {<148>} {Campgrounds} {<148>. .<088>} {  Tepees constructed of some kind of animal hide are placed randomly around  the center court of the undead village. They are decorated with random  drawings, some quite artistic, depicting scenes from the owners' lives. Some  of the stories told upon the tepees are quite disturbing to see. A dirt road leads around the minion camp, and the inhabitants go about their business of  readying for an attack on Fort Terramire. } {terramire} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
