R {35624} {0} {<148>} {The Weapon Shed} {<148>. .<088>} {  This hut is used as a storage shed for the weapons that are going to be used  for the attack on Fort Terramire. Many different weapons hang upon the wall. It seems these savages are going to show no mercy on the citizens and  soldiers of Fort Terramire. Axes, rapiers, bow and arrows, daggers, spears,  any type of weapon imaginable is right here in this large hut. The enemies  never allow anyone other than the guards whom rotate shifts into this hut. The weapons have all been tested for sturdiness and are to remain in that  condition until the enemies attack. } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {35622} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {35625} {0} {<148>} {An Underground Village Comes Alive} {<148>. .<088>} {  The underground village is rather large and is busy with the undead minions  of Dorisaine going about their business. It is very common to see the minions armed, and it would not be a good idea to cause trouble here. It would  probably be best to fit in here as much as possible. If they suspect someone  out of place, they will probably attack without question. Tread lightly,  adventurer, and try not to stick out too much. } {terramire} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
