R {35626} {0} {<148>} {Campgrounds} {<148>. .<088>} {  The tepee housing is constructed in no apparent order. Families gather around nearby, going about their daily business, while others are preparing for war  in body, mind and spirit. Even the women will be expected to fight. Only a  few chosen will be left behind to tend to the children too young to go to  battle. Children playing are heard from several directions, and the eerie  cackle of their giggles and laughs linger about the air. The children are  usually found playing tag or making up games to keep themselves occupied  around the tepees, but also tend to run around the village as well. } {terramire} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {35625} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
