R {35629} {0} {<148>} {Campgrounds} {<148>. .<088>} {  The dirt path ends here, and leads back to the southern and eastern sections  of the village. To the west and north are the entrances to a few more tepees. In the distance to the east, a lone hut can be seen. It is larger than the  others, and more elaborate. As you wander past the tepees, you can hear  digging and grunting noises. It appears that the village of undead minions is expanding! } {terramire} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {35628} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
