R {35630} {0} {<218>} {The Voodoo Witch Doctor's Hut} {<218>[ ]<088>} {  This is the hut of the village witch doctor. Although evil vibes radiate  throughout, the minions who live nearby appear to be quite at ease with the  presence of the witch. Magical symbols are etched into the stone floor and  the baked mud-brick walls. A Book of Shadows lies open to an evil  incantation, which is written in a language unfamiliar to most honest people. A huge cauldron hangs over a fire, which is bubbling a noxious substance. } {terramire} {} {hellinside} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {35628} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {35631} {0} {<178>} {The Hiding Place Of The Mastermind} { } {  The Mastermind behind the attacks on Fort Terramire stays in hiding. Very few of her minions even see her. She only communicates with a select few, who  make sure her orders are carried out with exact precision. The underground  hiding spot is huge. Maps of Fort Terramire have been hung upon the walls,  each marked with the exact locations of the attacks. The room is pretty much  bare, except for the maps on the wall, a desk, a chair, and a bed. A dresser  holds her clothing, and possibly something else. } {terramire} {} {} {} {1.000} {}
E {35625} {u} {u} {16} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

