R {35732} {128} {<238>} {A hostage hut} {<238># #<088>} {  After finally making your way through the iron doors that barricade the  entrance to this hut, it becomes obvious what this hut is used for: to keep  hostages and prisoners locked up. If only there was a way to help these poor  people. You see shackles nailed to the eastern and northern walls, and  buckets placed beneath them. The stench coming from these buckets is nearly  unbearable! } {peninsula} {} {cabin} {pk} {1.000} {}
