R {35733} {0} {<238>} {A large wooden shack} {<238># #<088>} {  The hut appears to be even larger from the inside. A golden throne stands in  the center of the room, presumably for the highest ranking member of the  Tairayden tribe. Torches, as seen in the other huts, hang from various walls  throughout the dwelling. One difference though, they are a bit larger and  appear to last longer than those you've seen before. It becomes more apparent a very important individual resides in this home. The only exit is to the  north, which leads back to the center of the village. } {peninsula} {} {cabin} {} {1.000} {}
