R {36467} {0} {<218>} {Inside a Dark, Steel Cage} {<218>[ ]<088>} {  You open the cage door and step inside, wisely apprehensive. The walls are  solid steel, but no sound can be heard scraping the cold, metal floor. You  brave another step inside and the temperature grows hotter, you trip and fall face-first into the darkness. Scared and jittery, you start to turn when two  flames lite in the obscuring black, casting their pulsating, unremitting  revelation of the cage's contents. } {gathering} {} {hellinside} {pk} {1.000} {}
