R {36469} {0} {<238>} {Inside the Gnoll Tents} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  The furnishing in this tent could be termed plush, but you reconsider: that  smooth, pale leather is not from an animal. Shivers go down your spine and  you try and focus on something else, hoping that wax in the candles isn't  from the same source. The beasts inhabiting the tent don't sit much better on your stomach\; you hope they don't get hungry. } {gathering} {} {hut} {pk} {1.000} {}
