R {36470} {0} {<238>} {The Gnoll Captain's Throne} {<238>\_/<088>} {  A macabre throne built from bleached bones, the supports each over seven feet long, sits gruesomely on a dais of piled rugs. Piled around the grotesque  throne are countless skulls, presumably of conquered foes, forming a  mountainous mound as testament to the gnoll leader's wicked ways. A bubbling  fountain of blood curdles yours, was it worth coming here? } {gathering} {} {ship} {} {1.000} {}
