R {36492} {0} {<268>} {Walking Through the Horde Encampment} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  The hard-trodden path wends its way through the tents and buildings in the  camp. Even though it is wide enough to allow several wagons to pass  side-by-side it feels crowded and cramped for all the troops moving about. It could be dangerous to try and stay here long if it didn't look like you  fit in. As soon as you think this you see a mob of goblins beating a heavily  outnumbered ogre. } {gathering} {} {hallway} {} {1.000} {}
