R {36506} {0} {<268>} {Another Intersection from the Main Road} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  Another offshoot from the main road leads south across a field, empty except  for a good-sized tent. Tents line the path as it carries you still further  west in a seemingly endless journey through this military nightmare. You know that this is only one detachment of Sarcoph's army, and yet this mighty arm  could face a kingdom alone. Can there be hope in the face of such power? } {gathering} {} {hallway} {} {1.000} {}
