R {36507} {0} {<228>} {On the green prairie} {<228>, `<088>} {  The prairie stretches out before you, its grasses tall and green. Sounds of  the prairie's inhabitants are everywhere, and you can see evidence of their  passing. Small tracks and flattened grass where herds of animals have passed. The sounds of prairie dogs and birds echo across the grassland, and you catch yourself just in time to avoid stepping onto one of the mounds which serve as entrances to the burrows of the prairie dogs. Far to the north, you can make  out a line of trees that serve as the northern boundary, and several birds  fly to and from their far off branches. To the south and west, you can see an ancient looking grove of trees standing alone in this flat plain. The scents  of wild flowers and smoke drift over the grasslands carried by the same  breezes which make the grass sway to their gentle song. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
