R {36508} {0} {<228>} {Well cropped grassland} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grass in this part of the prairie is quite short, and you can clearly make out evidence of grazing.  This appears to be one of the favorite places for the herds of wild cattle and deer to come for a quick snack or meal.  The soft breezes that constantly blow across the grassland carry the scents of clover and smoke from a cook fire.  The soft white clouds overhead dance and swirl with the ever changing breezes, and the birds which play among the clouds seem to rejoice in the currents of air.  All around the wild plains are alive and thriving, small animals play among the grass, insects buzz here and there, feeding on the plant or animal life, and the nomads which roam the plains keep a watchful vigilance over it all.  Far to the north, the eaves of a large forest mark a physical boundary to the plains, and far to the west, a low range of foothills serves as another physical boundary.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
