R {36509} {0} {<228>} {In soft grass} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grass here is very soft, and small clusters of clover and other herbs are sprinkled through the carpet of soft greenery.  The grass is neither tall nor short, but seems just the right height to allow for its softness.  The vast plains stretch out in all directions, though the grove of trees does break up the emptiness, and you can see both the northern and western boundaries of the prairie from here.  The sounds of wild life surround you, and you can see a herd of cattle grazing in the distance.  Figures on horseback ride through the grass and now and again, you see others riding toward the grove of trees with large animals dragging behind their horses.  The breeze blowing across the prairie is cool and the peacefulness of this place is soothing.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
