R {36519} {128} {<278>} {Entrance to the Gnomish Siege Factory} {<278>---<088>} {  If the resonating din outside the tent didn't prepare you for the sheer chaos inside, that's not surprising. Smoke and steam cloud the air, piercing  whistles shred your mind with their wails, unidentifiable objects fly through the air, and fires erupt from the strangest places. The magnitude of this  tent is absurd, and though you don't know who could have set it up, you know  you don't want to be under it if it falls. } {gathering} {} {smallroad_ew} {} {1.000} {}
