R {36545} {0} {<248>} {A Convergence} {<248>% %<088>} {  The tunnel deadends into a good-sized room that seems to form a hub at the  center of many convergent tunnels. The open space is filled with the  cacophonous sound of giant, two-headed brutes and the pungent smell of wood  smoke mixed with burnt flesh. Undoubtedly one of Sarcoph's recruits from the  Outlands, the monstrous humanoids appear to be fighting amongst themselves. The only calm one of the whole lot is a rotund specimen looking pleased to be sitting in a pool of blood and fingering the gold chain draped around his  necks. } {gathering} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
