R {36546} {0} {<218>} {The Torturer's Tent} {<218>[ ]<088>} {  One step through the tent's entrance and the only thing on your mind is  leaving. A torture victim's screams stab into your ears and the stench of  death hangs oppressive in the air. The tent must be under some enchantment  for the incessant screaming to be inaudible even directly outside the tent. Shelves and tables lined with innumerable devices of tortuous nature distract from the water tank, iron maiden, and white hot fire. } {gathering} {} {hellinside} {} {1.000} {}
