R {36602} {0} {<278>} {The Northern Part of the Castle Courtyard} {<278> * <088>} {  You stand inside the courtyard of the large castle. It would seem that the  castle is not empty after all. Various creatures run about the courtyard. You wonder how it is that you could sense no living things what so ever when  approaching the castle. You close your eyes and breathe deeply. Yes, there is a sense of strong magic in the air. You can't sense if it is good or evil... Just very, very powerful. That must've been what shielded the castle's  whereabouts and all its inhabitants. You open your eyes and take a look about you. It would seem that the walls of the castle are crumbling a bit. Vines  and moss and other plant life grow wildly all over the place, as the  creatures scurry about on their creature errands. Looking to the south, you  see that the courtyards continue. To the south, you spot a door into a  separate part of the castle. You choose your course and decide to investigate further. } {umari} {} {pillar} {} {1.000} {}
