R {36605} {0} {<178>} {The Southern Part of the Castle Courtyard } {<278>###<088>} {  You are standing in the southern part of the large courtyard of the castle.  More vines and ivy grow here, and more magical creatures romp about here.  Their movements cast eerie shadows that dance and play in the castle courtyard.  To your east, a small archway leads to what you think was once the castle gardens.  Given the extreme growth of the wild plant life around here, it is somewhat difficult to tell.  A patch of light plays over there, making you think there are even more inhabitants in this castle than you had originally thought.  To your south, there stands a wooden door that leads into the main keep of the castle.  You take a deep breath, and continue your exploration.   } {umari} {} {castle} {} {1.000} {}
