R {36606} {0} {<228>} {A Path to the Gardens} {<228>, `<088>} {  You are walking on a small stone path through an archway in the east wall of  the courtyard. In spite of the ruined condition of the castle and all the  grounds, there is an abundance of life and movement here. Creatures hop  about, and even the plants themselves seem to be busy at various plant  errands. You are slightly amused at the bustle of all that is around you. How in the world could you have thought this place to be empty? You chuckle  to yourself and decide to press onward along the path to what was undoubtly  once a splendid garden. Looking up, you also notice a path heading north back into the mountains. } {umari} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
