R {36607} {0} {<228>} {The Western Part of the Gardens} {<228>, .<088>} {  You are standing in the western end of the gardens.  Amidst the dead plant life, there is quite a bit still growing here.  You see that much of growing space here has gone to timothy, but upon closer inspection, you note that plants are growing, moving about, and even speaking in low voices!  You shake your a head a bit to ensure that is clear and listen again.  Yes, there is indeed a small murmur of voices in these gardens, and they are coming from the plants.  Whatever seed was sowed in these gardens has sprung quite fruitfully, and the magic is now being reaped.   } {umari} {} {field3} {} {1.000} {}
