R {36608} {0} {<228>} {The Eastern Part of the Gardens} {<228>, `<088>} {  You are standing in the eastern part of the ruins of the castle gardens.  There is even more active undergrowth here.  The abundance of plant life is simply overwhelming, and a damp feeling lingers in the air.  The moving plants almost make you feel slightly nauseous - you're not sure if you'd ever eat anything that came out of this garden.  It might taste sweet, but surely anything this full of enchantment might bring about poison or worse...  To the east, you notice a small wooden pen.  You wonder if the keeper of this castle once raised sheep.   } {umari} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
