R {36611} {0} {<118>} {A Dark Parlor} {<118>. .<088>} {  You stand in a large antechamber in the castle.  There are tables and chairs here.  You suspect that the owner of the castle used them for entertaining guests.  You pause and close your eyes.  Yes, you can almost hear the echoes of times long gone, of laughter and chatter.  You can see a richly dressed noble serving lavish snacks in this parlor while the market price of grain is discussed.  You open your eyes, and this vision is replaced by the stark decay of what you see around you.  You shrug.  Time moves on.  The hallways continue to the south, and you spy a small door to the east.   } {umari} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
