R {36612} {0} {<278>} {A Coat Closet} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You are standing in an old closet.  As you step inside the closet, there is rustling of fabric about you.  It would seem you've woken up whatever was sleeping in here!  Holding up your light, you look to see if it is mouse or rat or...  Something else.  A smell of mothballs hangs in the air, making you feel slightly dizzy.  It is also quite cold in this small closet.  You give an involuntary shiver at this cramped little place.   } {umari} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {36611} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {36613} {0} {<118>} {In the Halls of the Castle} {<118>. .<088>} {  You are wandering the halls of the castle. Upon further examination and  meditation you decide that this castle must belong to someone highly skilled  in the magic arts. You surmise this based on the number of magical creatures  wandering around and also the unusual number of magic objects you notice  bouncing around. You wonder if whoever created these wonders still resides in these halls. You pause and try to sense any sort of human presence. Indeed,  there is some, but not in the nearby halls. You throw your shoulders back and move onward into the dark halls. } {umari} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
