R {36614} {0} {<118>} {A Turn in the Hallway} {<118>. .<088>} {  You have come to the end of the main hallway of this wing of the castle. There is a little more light here. Gazing at the portraits on the walls, you  note that they seem to be eyeing you. You gaze about yourself nervously and  resolve to quickly get out of this part of the castle. It is quite eerie. The dim light that's here seems somehow darker than the utter blackness  that's behind you. Shuddering, you notice that the hallway continues to the  west and that a large staircase looms before you to the south. Do you  continue exploring these lower halls or climb the stairs into the darkness  above? You seem to be nowhere nearer to finding this castle's owner. } {umari} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
