R {36615} {0} {<278>} {At a Grand Wooden Staircase} {<278>.@.<088>} {  You are standing at the foot of a large wooden staircase.  Examining it closely, you find that the staircase does not seem to be rotting at all.  Indeed, it seems to be highly polished and shining.  Placing one foot tentatively on the first step, you find that it holds your weight easily.  As you begin your ascent up into the upper hall, you pause and wonder if it will hold for the entire length of your climb.  You must decide quickly.  Do you risk climbing the staircase further or do you wander back down into the stone passageways of the lower halls?   } {umari} {} {stairs} {} {1.000} {}
