R {36616} {0} {<118>} {The Hallways Turn Again} {<118>. .<088>} {  You have come to another twist of the dark stone passageways of the castle. This one is quite large. There is enough for perhaps ten humans to easily walk abreast through it, and a troll or giant walking through here certainly would not have to duck to avoid scraping his head on the ceiling. There is a small wooden door on the north wall of the passageway. This door is painted green and has some strange writing on it that you don't understand. Look southward, you see an entrance to a large and spacious ballroom. Care to dance? } {umari} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
