R {36617} {0} {<278>} {Inside a Small Bedroom in the Castle} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You find yourself instead a small bedroom in the castle. Unlike the rest of  the castle, this room appears to be quite tidy. Everything seems in order and in place, and the thick layers of dust that coat everything else in the  castle seem to be absent here. There is a sense of strict order about this  room. The bed is neatly made, and the items on the shelves seem to have an  organization all their own. All the order here makes you feel more ill than  any staleness and decay in the other parts of the castle. } {umari} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {36616} {s} {open s;s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {36618} {0} {<278>} {The Court of the Dustmite King} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You find yourself in the back of the closet. The space here seems to be much larger. Indeed, it's completely opened up. You find youself in what looks to be throneroom. However, layers of dust seem to cover everything. As before, some of the bits of dust seem to be moving about! You wonder if it's really safe to stay here. In the center of the room, sits a large dustime on a stone throne. He notices you and seems to glare down at you. } {umari} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
