R {36619} {0} {<278>} {The Northeast Part of the Ballroom} {<278> * <088>} {  You find yourself in a tremendous ballroom. Although the carpet is decaying from age, you can see that it once a brilliant blue color. The walls boast large stained glass windows. You see these stained glasses have pictures of all sorts of different magical creatures - griffons, dragons, and azeldovs to name but a few. You notice that the griffon seems to be featured more than any of the  others. } {umari} {} {pillar} {} {1.000} {}
