R {36620} {0} {<278>} {The Northwest Part of the Ballroom} {<278> * <088>} {  You are standing in the northwest corner of the castle's ballroom.  Here, you see a large piano that no doubt once churned out tunes while party-goers merrily danced away the evening.  Closing your eyes, you can almost hear the soft tune of a waltz, as couples move about the dance room floor.  Holding up your arms, you twirl about with your invisible partner.  Then you chuckle at yourself for being so silly and childish.  Nevertheless, there is still a great potential for a ball to be held here.  All that's needed are music and several hundred guests.   } {umari} {} {pillar} {} {1.000} {}
