R {36621} {0} {<278>} {The Southeast Part of the Ballroom} {<278> * <088>} {  Standing in the southeast corner of the ballroom, you find yourself gazing out of the large windows and into the mountains. Looking a bit closer, as the windows are somewhat dirty, you notice that, should one fall out of these windows, they are in for a very long fall downward. You back away. You are most certainly not afraid of heights, but you also don't much entertain the idea of tumbling deep into a black ravine. } {umari} {} {pillar} {} {1.000} {}
