R {36622} {0} {<278>} {The Southwest Part of the Ballroom} {<278> * <088>} {  You are standing in the southwest of the castle ballroom.  There is a large table here.  You suppose that there were once refreshments served here for party-goers to munch on in between their dancing and laughter.  Well, the table seems completely devoid of food now.  There are only a few odds and ends on it, save for a large and dusty crystal fountain.  Aside from that, there is nothing really of interest on the table.  Glancing about you, you notice two exits out of the ballroom from here.  Which one might lead you deeper in the castle, towards what you might seek?   } {umari} {} {pillar} {} {1.000} {}
