R {36623} {0} {<278>} {A Smaller Stone Hallway} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You find yourself back in a cold stone hallway. You shiver, as there is a slight draft coming through this passage. Looking about, you notice that the draft seems to be coming from the room to south of you. You ponder this for a moment and then shrug to yourself. You suppose that all old castles are drafty. It really wouldn't make sense for them to be otherwise. At any rate, there is a small door to the south in the passage. If you so wish, the passage also continues to the west. } {umari} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
