R {36823} {128} {<268>} {Away from the circus} {<268>. .<088>} {  The dream seems to be taking a very strange turn now. Perhaps Imagi is  watching down upon you, thinking the skimpy circus dream is not enough to  scare the fear out of you. To the south is the circus, filled with ugly  clowns and other performers, while what lies to the north is unknown. Do you  really want to find out what lies ahead? } {imagi} {} {air} {} {1.000} {}
