R {36863} {128} {<118>} {Room B2} {<118>[ ]<088>} {  Room 'B2' must be the loudest one yet. You instantly get a headache as the  drilling continues. Just when you thought you'd had enough, you hear the  patient's tooth crack, shortly followed by a horrifying scream of pain. The  patient reaches for your shirt sleeve, but you jerk back, avoiding the red  stain that would probably never come out. The only exit is through the  doorway to the north, leading to the hallway which connects all the offices  in the building. } {imagi} {} {bloodyroom} {} {1.000} {}
E {36859} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {36864} {128} {<278>} {The administration room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This room is obviously where the owners of the office stay and work. At first you wonder why a business would have multiple owners, but then remember  you're in a dream. Anything can happen. There's a musky smell in the air, as  if dust has been piling up. A desk stands in the center of the room, holding  a lamp and two stacks of paper. } {imagi} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {36856} {e} {open e;e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {36865} {128} {<268>} {Aquaphobia} {<268>. .<088>} {  As you may already know, aquaphobia, the fear of water, is no laughing matter for those affected by it. Though most people think this only involves larger  issues such as not going near the ocean or swimming pool, it can be much  worse. Even taking a shower, bath, or even doing the dishes can be a task  they dread to do!  "This is going to be a tough dream for you, young one. I considered  putting you near a swimming pool, but decided against it. In order to  tackle your fear head on, you need to be completely immersed in the  fear! So, you're headed straight to the middle of the ocean. Try  to relax and enjoy yourself, once the fear has subsided. It really is  a lovely place."  The only exit is down, which will drop you in the middle of the Uncharted Oceans! In this dream you can, luckily, breathe under water. } {imagi} {} {air} {} {1.000} {}
E {36866} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {36814} {leave dream} {leave dream} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {36866} {128} {<148>} {Diving in the Uncharted Oceans} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  You think of a few words to describe the scene around you: dark, quiet and  mysterious. You can see a bunch of aquatic life swimming by, all of which  seem harmless, but the thought sticks in the back of your mind as to what  dangers could be lurking in the darkness. An occasional fish carcass floats  by; you assume it was picked clean by a shark, or some other predatory fish. } {imagi} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
