R {36867} {128} {<148>} {Diving in the Uncharted Oceans} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  You are swimming around aimlessly in the Uncharted Oceans. It is very hard to keep track of which way is up, down, north, etc. Everything just seems to be  spinning in circles! Which you just might be, since an occasional whirlpool  jets by. You can see very little sunlight above, meaning you are definitely  very deep in the ocean. You do see movement above, though, which could be a  good or bad thing. } {imagi} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
