R {36868} {128} {<148>} {Diving in the Uncharted Oceans} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  There seems to be a bit of a current here, pulling you to the east, very  gradually. You are able to easily fight the current, though. Every direction  you look, you see darkness with a shade of dark blue. You can hear the  occasional screech or click of aquatic life communicating with each other. The fish swimming around are very colorful, and full of energy. } {imagi} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
