R {36870} {128} {<148>} {Diving in the Uncharted Oceans} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  You can't get over just how beautiful it is down here, who knows how many  miles below the surface. Imagi has assured you that any attempt of  resurfacing will result in failure. You wonder, does that mean you will wake  up? It's a thought worth considering, since the dangers here are countless. While pondering the dilemma, a large bull shark passes overhead. } {imagi} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
