R {36871} {128} {<148>} {Diving in the Uncharted Oceans} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  As you float perfectly still, you take a moment to listen to the sounds being made around you. There's a clicking noise, which you assume could be some  dolphins in the distance, communicating using radar. But there's another  sound; one you just can't quite figure out. It sounds like a mixture between  a 'swoosh' and the sound of a horse's hoof when running. Your thoughts are  interrupted when you see some large fish swim below you, creating a small  wake which drags you slightly to the south. } {imagi} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
