R {36873} {128} {<148>} {Diving in the Uncharted Oceans} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  This whole ordeal is actually turning out to be not so bad. The fear of the  water slowly seeps out of you as you continue to explore the ocean. The water is lukewarm, and just teeming with life. Some fish are as small as a gold  coin, and others you've seen seem to be as large as Aylor! Regardless,  nothing here seems to be aggressive, which makes you let out a huge sigh of  relief. } {imagi} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
