R {37017} {0} {<238>} {The village shaman's hut} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  Though tales of ogre shamans and their strange form of brutal, natural  magicks had reached your ears before, the gruesome nature of this one's shop  takes you aback. Shrunken heads from various races and animals hang in one  corner, while the walls are covered in hundreds of small cubbies filled with  countless anatomical pieces. Bags of assorted bone types and boxes stuffed to the brim with other oddities cover most of the floor space, making it so that you can barely even move through the hut's single room. A magical darkness  leaves everything dim and no lights are burning; all you can make out are the whites of the shaman's bulging eyes. } {livingmine} {} {hut} {} {1.000} {}
