R {37023} {0} {<148>} {Original Level: Northwest Quadrant} {<148>. .<088>} {  The walls glitter with myriads of fine stones, cascades of color twinkle and  catch your eye. No wonder the ogres were so prosperous, no wonder Sarcoph  wanted this mine. An entire nation could be funded with the abundance of  wealth in these caves, winding and numerous. From all around you comes the  flood of sound, the grating noises, the dings, the pings: there are miners  here. } {livingmine} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
