R {37024} {0} {<268>} {Waaaay, way-hay-hee up} {<268>. .<088>} {  You are so far up in the air that you are nearly level with the Great  Mountains to the north. Spread out below you is the entire ogre plain and  rolling foothills. Immediately below you is the village of Dak'tai, its  quarry to the east and the newly expanded mines in the mountain to the north. To the west the plain is plagued with a black disease, spreading out in even  rows and throwing smoke and a cacophony of noises: the encampment of the  occupying detachment of Sarcoph's Dark Horde. You can almost make out the  black tents and banners whipping in the strong wind. } {livingmine} {} {air} {} {1.000} {}
E {37008} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37025} {0} {<228>} {To the mountains} {<228>. ^<088>} {  These foothills are treacherous for travel, with thousands of trees towering  and tearing at the now tattered threads you once called clothes. This would  be avoidable were the road not swarming with imperial drones, running to and  fro from the mines to their encampment. As it is then, you resign to travel  through these devilish evergreens, aggressive and sharply thorned. } {livingmine} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
