R {37026} {0} {<238>} {Entrance to the mines} {<238>/ \<088>} {  Traveling through the mountains to the mine entrance made the hills seem  easy, but there's the mine entrance at the bottom of a massive ravine. The  end in sight, you pessimistically decide that it's not much to look at, just  a gaping hole there in the granite. Around the entrance, a set of massive  pulleys have been rigged to allow a team of pack moles to operate a lift,  affording the only safe way to ride down. Next to that the Horde has erected  a makeshift base of operations to be avoided. } {livingmine} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
