R {37027} {0} {<148>} {Descending the wooden stairs} {<148>. .<088>} {  You are quite grateful for the quality of this reliable stair, but whatever  warm feelings it might have given you are freezing with fear as you near the  bottom. The humongous, chewed shaft around you shakes along with the rest of  your underground world, pulsating to a terrible, subsonic rhythm. Whatever it is, you're getting nearer to it. } {livingmine} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
