R {37028} {0} {<148>} {At a junction in the expanded mine} {<148>. .<088>} {  Sarcoph's expansion of the mine would have you standing amazed at its size if the source of that terrible sound didn't feel right around the next turn. The rocks on the ground are bouncing and a high pierced screech has been  added to the mix. There are exits to the east and south, and a pool of water  that is disturbingly still catches your eye. } {livingmine} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
