R {37029} {0} {<248>} {In an underground river} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  Nothing is visible and the water has gotten much colder. From feeling around  you can deduce that the walls are only about two arm spans apart in any  direction and very smooth. The current is pushing you quite firmly, and the  walls will afford you no grip. } {livingmine} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
E {37030} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37030} {0} {<248>} {Out of control in the current!} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  You've lost all control now, and the water is taking you where it wills,  smashing you into the sides of the chute, rushing you on towards and  undecided fate. If you can work quickly, perhaps you can concentrate enough  to cast a spell and portal away from this frozen underwater slide that  otherwise will shortly take you to meet death. Or maybe you can muster one  last effort to swim out. } {livingmine} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
