R {37033} {0} {<148>} {North from the junction} {<148>. .<088>} {  For the first time since you entered this dark place, you finally see another being, running towards you through the rock and rubble. Something is wrong,  from the north is coming pained shrieking and the dull thuds of something  very large moving very quickly. } {livingmine} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {37034} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
