R {37034} {0} {<148>} {The dead end} {<148>. .<088>} {  Arriving at the end of the tunnel your breath leaves you: literally. Wrapped  around your chest is an exceedingly powerful tentacle of some sort. You feel  your ribs breaking as it slams you against the wall. A few of the previously  screaming miners use your misfortune to attempt an escape. The hidden  assailant responds by dropping you and revealing itself, or partly anyway. } {livingmine} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {37033} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37035} {0} {<148>} {A tunnel} {<148>. .<088>} {  The deafening roar is coming from under you now, and you see the way to it:  the tunnel drops off sharply and goes down. Just over the lip of that  mouth-like, monstrosity of an opening is the genesis of your terror. You  check your armor and decide it'd be better to get this over with quick. } {livingmine} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
