R {37036} {0} {<148>} {The bit revealed} {<148>. .<088>} {  You peek up over the rocks at the edge, teeth chattering not just from the  sonic vibrations, and see the secret to Sarcoph's tunneling: a humongous bit? The bit is attached to a long crank shaft that is being rotated by a team of  assorted humanoids orchestrated by a group of gnomes. The sight would be  almost humorous if this gargantuan drill wasn't tearing through rock and  earth at such an alarming rate. } {livingmine} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
