R {37037} {0} {<148>} {Before a natural cavern} {<148>. .<088>} {  After walking for a long time down the chewed tunnel you finally reach the  place where it ends. All the din and tremor from before is gone and below you there opens up a natural cavern. It is large enough that you can't see the  far wall, but you can make out big rock formations jutting up from the cave's floor. } {livingmine} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
