R {37130} {0} {<238>} {The Base of the Cliff} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The smell of desiccant earth fills your nostrils as you crunch the rock beneath you. Your head feels a bit fuzzy.  That was quite a climb!   Your  desire to seek the Inferno out and master its power has only increased. To the east lies a mammoth bridge\; it seems to be the only way to proceed. } {inferno} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
