R {37211} {0} {<228>} {Before the Archway} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The rough hewn stone road that you travel on slopes down through an enormous stone Archway.  Extending out from the sides of the archway as far as the eye can see are walls of fire, so hot you can feel your armor heating up from 100 paces, and so bright the reflection off of the road shines like the midday sun.  The flames prevent you from going anywhere but through the archway, or back the way you came.  } {inferno} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
