R {37212} {0} {<228>} {A Dark Wood} {<228>; ;<088>} {  The woods groan as the wind passes through the trunks of ancient, towering trees.  To your east a mixture of light and shadows dance with each other in an intricate pattern.  An overwhelming urge to get closer is slightly quelled as you pass an ancient tree, easily three thousand years old, lying across the ground in a smoldering heap.   } {inferno} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
E {37211} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
