R {37213} {0} {<228>} {Entering Elysium} {<228>; ;<088>} {  A dirt path, worn by the feet of laborers, leads west towards a small farmhouse. You can just make out a curl of smoke rising from a stove  oven in the back yard. People mill about as you pass, although most appear totally oblivious to their surroundings.  Although the land is illuminated so brightly it could be midday the sky is pitch black - not a single star shines from above.  To the east, a dark wood rises, and to the north and south you see nothing but endless miles of horizon.  A large, bright red sign protrudes from ground just in front of you. } {inferno} {} {swamp} {} {1.000} {}
E {37212} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
