R {37234} {0} {<218>} {Descending into the Inferno} {<218>/ \<088>} {  You are descending a steep, uneven flight of steps chiseled out of the mountain rock.  The stairs, which meander haphazardly around the mountain, require you to keep one hand along the face of the bluff to your left while the ground trembles and shudders beneath your feet.  Your brain is screaming, "TURN BACK," while your heart is pounding in your chest.  Your eyes cannot penetrate the gloom ahead and the unknown continues to play upon your deepest fears.  The only thing you know for certain: this is a VERY dangerous place.   } {inferno} {} {volcano} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {37235} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
