R {37235} {0} {<218>} {A Scorched Landing} {<218>/ \<088>} {  The stairway terminates at a large natural landing.  The ground is smooth to the touch with no indication of wildlife or vegetation.  The soil is a chalky black, giving you the impression that the entire world has been charred.  The landing tilts away from the face of the mountain at a precarious angle\; leaning towards the edge of it provides you a view of an inky darkness, obscuring unfathomable depths.  A thin, crumbling ledge slopes down around the mountain to the east.   } {inferno} {} {volcano} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {37236} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
