R {37236} {0} {<218>} {An Eviscerated Ledge} {<218>/ \<088>} {  Scarcely a foot wide, this ledge has you clinging for dear life to the face of the mountain.  When you make the mistake of looking down you see distant lights, several thousand feet below, indicating that the inferno still battles the pitch darkness of the chasm.  The ledge is covered in loose black soil, dangerously concealing large holes in the rock which appear to have been burned away.  The ledge continues around the mountain to the south and out of sight.   } {inferno} {} {volcano} {} {1.000} {}
E {37237} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
