R {37237} {0} {<218>} {A Smoking Cavern} {<218>/ \<088>} {  After the ledge you were on cut sharply into the heart of the mountain you find yourself in a large cavern.  Perhaps 20 feet in each direction, the walls glow with an inner heat and show no signs of any growth - not even moss.  The air is hazy with the heat, which singes the hair on the back of your neck, and the rumbling of the mountain echoes loudly here.  Impassible corridors, filled with toxic fumes and white-hot flames, branch out of the cavern in every direction.  Only one, leaving the cavern to the west, appears navigable.   } {inferno} {} {volcano} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {37236} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
