R {37238} {0} {<218>} {A Boiling Passage} {<218>/ \<088>} {  The passage slopes down to the very end of your vision.  It's filled with a heavy black smoke making it nearly impossible to breath.  The stone is hot enough to burn the soles of a Giant's feet through thick leather boots and the passage appears to be narrowing as you move, it's sharply pointed walls presenting a danger all of their own.  Pockets of water, some as little as an inch deep, others the size of small ponds, hiss and sizzle as you pass by.  Far off in the distance you can just make out a steep brick stairway leading further down into the mountain.   } {inferno} {} {volcano} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {37239} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
