R {37239} {0} {<218>} {A Brick Stairwell} {<218>/ \<088>} {  Claustrophobia begins to set in as you descend towards the flames.  The steep stairwell was cut right into the stone of the mountain, leaving no more than 6 inches of clearance on either side or above you.  The heat cascades in waves up the stairwell, so thick it feels like molasses and the light emanating from the flames is blinding.  Fear chokes you as you descend into the unknown, unable to see what is coming... } {inferno} {} {volcano} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {37240} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
