R {37908} {0} {<228>} {Beside a wide river} {<228>, `<088>} {  The plains come to an end here, next to a wide, swift flowing river. The  waters look cool and inviting, and far out in the water, large fish leap to  snatch unfortunate insects from the air. The ground is rich with green  vegetation, reeds and short grasses stirring in the breezes which are cooler  here by the water's edge. Thick vegetation blocks the way eastward, and the  ground becomes dangerously marshy in that direction also. To the west the  river continues, winding lazily along the southern edge of the plains, its  waters providing nourishment for this wide open expanse of grassland. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
