R {37909} {0} {<228>} {Muddy spot on the river bank} {<228>, `<088>} {  The ground here is very muddy. The dark brown ooze clings to everything it  touches. The swiftly flowing river has cut into the bank here, probably from a flood sometime in the distant past, and here and there small pools of water  reflect the sky's light. The sound of insects and frogs is very prominent  here, and far out on the river you see fish leaping and jumping. The breezes  coming off the water are cool and refreshing, and they seem to sigh as they  weave through the tall grass on the plains. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
