R {37910} {0} {<228>} {Thick vegetation on the river bank} {<228>, `<088>} {  The vegetation here is very thick. Reeds, grass, even a few bushes with  bright flowers grow here. There is evidence that something on the prairie  feeds off of the vegetation here; some of the leaves look like they have been nibbled. The ground is still wet but the vegetation has woven a fine mat of  roots to keep the mud from being a nuisance. To the south, the swiftly  flowing river rushes by while, to the west, the vegetation seems to give way  to a sort of beach. The sounds of insects and birds surround you and the sky  overhead is open, with clouds racing and dancing in fanciful shapes. Far to  the north the grasslands continue in a wide expanse. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
