E {37917} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37917} {0} {<228>} {A rocky path in the foothills} {<228>. ^<088>} {    The foothills are not as thickly covered with vegetation here. A few  scrubby plants thrive in the stony ground but this section of the  foothills seems barren compared to the prairies to the east.  The mountains to the west loom large and there is a definite sense of danger in the air.  Small crevices in the rocky ground could be very good places for an ambush.  The foothills continue to the north and south, while back to the east is  the lush grassland. } {nulan} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
E {37916} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37924} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
