R {37918} {0} {<228>} {On the green prairie} {<228>, `<088>} {  The rolling grasslands stretch out before you.  Gentle breezes blow through the grass, causing a small ripple over the surrounding land.  The open sky seems full of birds racing and playing among the fluffy clouds, and the sounds of small wildlife are everywhere.  In the distance, a herd of animals seems to be grazing, and the scent of wild flowers and herbs is strong on the air.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37925} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37900} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
