R {37919} {0} {<228>} {Path through the prairie} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grasslands stretch out in all directions.  Far to the northwest, you can just make out what appears to be a cluster of trees, while to the far west high snowcapped mountains are visible.  The sound of hooves drifts to you from the gently blowing breeze which perpetually blows across the prairie.  The subtle fragrance of wild flowers reaches your nose on the cool breezes, and now and then it is mixed with the scent of smoke.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37918} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
