R {37920} {0} {<228>} {Out on the plains} {<228>, `<088>} {  The plains stretch out in all directions.  The openness of this place is becoming a bit disturbing and the cluster of trees far to the north is beginning to look more and more inviting.  Clouds race across the sky, seeming to have no particular direction as the soft breezes blow, first one way, then another, over the open prairie.  The chirping of birds, occasionally mixed with the cry of a bird of prey is mixed with the buzzing and whirring of insects.  In the distance, you can just make out a herd of animals; from this distance, they appear to be grazing.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37919} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37927} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
