E {37921} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37921} {0} {<228>} {Near a stream} {<228>, `<088>} {  Finally, a break in the scenery!  Here the grass grows very tall and stirs  in the gentle breeze.  A stream seems to be running from the foothills to  the west and cuts a path off to the north.  Small, tender plants grow along  the stream's edge and the water looks cool and clear.  The whirring of  insects fills your ears and a small frog leaps from the bank of the stream,  where it was hidden, to snatch something from the air.  The cluster of trees  is far to the north and, just to the east and west, the foothills appear to  be a boundary for this vast open stretch of grassland.  } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37920} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37928} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
