E {37922} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37922} {0} {<148>} {The stream in the grasslands} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The water in the stream is clear and cool.  Small fish and frogs are visible  in the water which is not very deep.  Low, thick vegetation grows along the  banks of this small stream and the buzzing and whirring of insects is very  loud around the water's edge.  To the west, the ground appears to rise into  the foothills which lead up into the snowcapped mountains much farther to the  west.   } {nulan} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
E {37921} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
