R {37923} {0} {<228>} {A path in the low foothills} {<228>. ^<088>} {    The foothills extend farther out here than across the visible range just to the west.  You notice the beginnings of a stream, someplace around here, but the grass is quite tall and hides most of the ground from view, making  it difficult to pinpoint the exact location of the stream's trek through  the plains.  The ground is very uneven here but someone has been very  accommodating by beating some of the tall grass into a path.  The path  continues farther westward while, to the south, the ground slopes down  toward more prairie.  To the north, another rise in the ground slopes back  into the grasslands.  The mountains loom large to the west, now, their  enormity seeming to press down on you as you travel through the foothills.  } {nulan} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
E {37922} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37930} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
