E {37924} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37924} {0} {<228>} {A path in the foothills} {<228>. ^<088>} {  The path in the foothills winds its way slowly to the west, while the range of hills extends to the north and south.  Here and there, clumps of low, scrubby bushes grow, and an occasional spindly sapling reaches toward the open sky.  The ground is becoming more uneven, and many of the small valleys and ravines look to be excellent places for an ambush.  The mountains to the west are beginning to look quite ominous, now, and they dominate the view.  To the east, the grasslands stretch out before you, though you would have a small trek through the low foothills to get back onto the prairie.   } {nulan} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
E {37923} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37931} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37917} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37925} {0} {<228>} {Out on the plains} {<228>, `<088>} {  The plains stretch out before you, wide and flat.  The grass grows tall in this part of the prairie, around four feet in height.  Sounds of prairie dogs drift to your ears, and you can just see a few of the small animals frolicking in the tall grasses.  Perhaps it would be a good idea to watch your footing; their holes have been known to twist many an unweary ankle.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37932} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37934} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
