R {37926} {0} {<228>} {Out on the plains} {<228>, `<088>} {  The plains stretch out in all directions.  The wild prairie seems to sigh as softly blowing breezes dance among the tall blades of grass.  Flocks of small birds play among the white clouds as they slowly drift across the open sky.  To the north and west, you can just make out a herd of animals, and a plume of smoke.  The sounds of running hooves carry to you on an errant breeze, and you catch a hint of water on the air.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37925} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37935} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
