R {37928} {0} {<148>} {A cool stream in the plains} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The stream runs gently through the grasslands, its waters cool and clear. Small fish swim past, and the buzz of insects is louder near the water.  A small, green frog leaps from its place of concealment, snatching one of the unlucky insects from the air.  The stream continues to the north and west at this point, and the grass here is shorter than you would have guessed for such a wild grassland.   } {nulan} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
E {37927} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
