R {37929} {0} {<148>} {A crystal clear stream in the plains} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The water of the stream is crystal clear and you can easily see the stream  bed.  Small rocks and sand have settled on the bottom of the slowly flowing  stream and you see small fish darting around in the water.  The sounds of  insects and frogs fill your ears.  The stream continues to the northeast,  toward the cluster of trees.  To the west, the land begins to rise toward a  low range of foothills and, farther to the west, you can see a range of  snowcapped mountains. } {nulan} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
E {37928} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
