R {37931} {0} {<228>} {Steep foothills} {<228>. ^<088>} {    The foothills are very steep here and the ground has become very  treacherous.  Hidden holes and loose rocks make climbing any further, toward the stark mountains, very dangerous and the sense of foreboding from them is much stronger.  The grass and low, scrubby brush effectively hide much of  the ground from view but you think you can just make out something moving in  the tall vegetation.  The openness of the plains, back to the south, looks  much safer and more inviting than this inhospitable climb.  The foothills  continue both north and south and the plains stretch back out to the east.  } {nulan} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
E {37930} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37940} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
