R {37932} {0} {<228>} {On the prairie} {<228>, `<088>} {  The ground is soft here, the grass mixed with clover and other small flowers. Several small holes dot the landscape and the sounds of yipping alert you to the presence of some of the local wildlife. Far overhead, birds glide on the  soft breezes which perpetually blow across this wide open expanse of grass,  and, in the distance, you hear the shrill scream of a hunting eagle. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37933} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37925} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37933} {0} {<228>} {On the rolling grasslands} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grass is tall here, and hides the ground quite well.  The sounds of wildlife fill your ears, and cool breezes caress your face as you scan your surroundings.  Far to the west and a bit north you can just make out a cluster of trees, and a plume of smoke.  The distant sounds of running hooves are carried on the breeze, and you can smell a hint of the smoke in the air.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37941} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37932} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37934} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37934} {0} {<228>} {Well cropped grass} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grass has been cut quite low here, and you can make out obvious hoof  prints over the ground. Obviously this is where the herds of wandering  animals come to graze. As you survey your surroundings, you can see one such  herd off in the distance to the west, and now the cluster of trees is much  closer. You can definitely see and smell the smoke from a fire someplace  among the trees. They seem out of place in the middle of this rolling  prairie, but who can account for how nature works? The sky over head seems  filled with fanciful shaped clouds, which seem to play and dance to the music of the breeze. The sounds of the wild surround you, birds chirping, prairie  dogs yipping, and occasionally a mournful howl echoes across the grassland. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37933} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37942} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37925} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37935} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37935} {0} {<228>} {In well cropped grass} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grass is very short here, and evidence of grazing is everywhere.  Wild flowers and clover are scattered among the short grass, and small insects are visible as they scuttle through the greenery.  The scent of smoke is stronger here, mingled with the scents from the wild flowers.  There is a shady spot to the west, and the grove of trees is just to the northwest.  The smoke is coming from the center of the trees, and you see evidence of horses all around.  Over head the shrill sounds of a hunting bird of prey disturb the tranquil surroundings.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37934} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37943} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37926} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37936} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37936} {0} {<228>} {A shady spot in the plains} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grove of trees to the north provides some shade for the grass here.  You can smell roasted meat on a fire, and guess that it is coming from the north, as well.  Horse tracks are all around this area, as well as those of cattle.  The sounds of children playing reach your ears, and you can hear the bawling of cattle and thudding of hooves.  To the west, a small stream winds its way through the grasslands, and to the north, thick grey-brown trunks block your view.  In all other directions stretch the open plains.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37935} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37944} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
