E {37937} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37937} {0} {<148>} {A cool stream in the plains} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The vegetation is thick around the stream here. Tender shoots of grass and  small yellow mushrooms cluster thickly, providing numerous hiding places for  small animals and insects. Looking to the north, you can see the stream  running under the branches of the large grove of trees. Small fish swim  toward the shade and a few frogs dance on the water, lazily snatching insects from the air. Several birds glide lazily overhead, and several more appear to be winging their way to the trees. A low range of foothills can be seen off  to the west, as well as more open grassland. } {nulan} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
E {37936} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37945} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37928} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37938} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37938} {0} {<228>} {Muddy ground on the plains} {<228>, `<088>} {  The ground is very muddy here, evidence of the small stream overflowing its  banks recently. The grass has been stamped flat and a few flowers are just  beginning to peek out toward the sky. The stream lies to the south and east  and the sound of its gently flowing waters are very soothing. Insects are  thick here and it looks to be a fair breeding ground for mosquitoes.  To the south and east, you can see a large grove of trees and the smell of a cookfire  drifts on the breezes which perpetually blow over the plains.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
