R {37942} {0} {<228>} {Well cropped grass} {<228>, `<088>} {  This appears to be a place where the wild cattle and deer come to graze.  The grass is short here and a patch of clover has recently been nibbled at as well.  Small wild flowers nod lazily in the soft breezes which perpetually blow over the prairie, and the scent of smoke is strong on the air. To the west, the branches of the grove of trees provide a cool shade and, to the north and south, the grasslands continue. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37941} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
