R {37944} {0} {<228>} {Near a grove of ancient trees} {<228>, `<088>} {  You find yourself on the outer edge of a large grove of trees. They seem  ancient, their thick, grey-brown trunks big around enough to build a house  within and reaching toward the open sky. The branches are heavy with  greenery, and the sounds of chirping and squabbling birds drift down from the treetops. Other sounds come to you from within the ancient grove. The sounds  of children playing, a trickle of water, and the occasional call of an adult. A small stream runs in from the west, disappearing into the grove of trees,  and its crystal clear waters reveal darting fish and small insects. The soft  carpet of grass and clover is cool and damp to the touch, and this looks like a nice spot to rest before continuing the trek across the plains. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
