R {37946} {0} {<228>} {In tall grass} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grass here is very tall, well over three feet in height.  It seems to wave gently as the gentle breezes that perpetually blow over this prairie caress it.  Overhead, fanciful shaped clouds dance to the music of the breeze and flocks of birds dot the skies, seeming to play among the clouds.  The  yipping of prairie dogs surrounds you and you think you spot one of the  playful creatures bouncing into the shade to the east.  To the west, the low range of foothills marches onward, from north to south, a physical sign that  the plains end in that direction.  In all the other directions, the plains  stretch before you.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37945} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
