R {37955} {0} {<228>} {In tall grass on the plains} {<228>, `<088>} {  The grass here is tall and thick. It appears that the herds of cattle and  deer haven't fed in this spot in quite some time. Perhaps they do not graze  this close to the low range of foothills to the west. As you look around, you can see the eaves of a dark forest to the far north and, to the southeast,  the large lone grove of ancient trees rises to greet the fluffy clouds. To  the west, the foothills march toward a high range of imposing mountains. A  large eagle suddenly appears from the crest of one of the distant mountains,  winging its way over the grasslands in search of a meal. Insects buzz and hop through the tall grass and rustling from deep within the shelter of the tall  blades speaks of small animals going about their daily lives out on this flat plain. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37954} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37964} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
