R {37957} {0} {<228>} {In the low foothills} {<228>. ^<088>} {   The foothills rise toward the mountains to the west.  From here, you can continue west, deeper into the foothills, or north, and follow the range toward the large forest.  South and east will lead you back onto the flat plains of the Nulan'Boar tribe.  The ground is littered with small stones and a few stunted trees reach toward the sky.  A carpet of short green grass and clover covers most of the slope and the ground is damp, as if a small amount of ground water were finding a way to the surface to escape its confines.  High overhead, the clouds seem to drift and dance to the music of the soft breezes which perpetually blow across the grasslands and small flocks of birds play among the clouds, flying to and from the grove of trees to the southeast and the eaves of the large forest to the north.  } {nulan} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
E {37956} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37966} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
