R {37961} {0} {<228>} {In soft grass} {<228>, `<088>} {  Off to the west the grass seems better cropped than here. Wild and  uncontrolled the grass sighs in the breeze and would make a rather  comfortable place to lie down in. Nature is truly free here, there are many  creatures around but little to no people. The land off to the south looks  just as lush and soft while to the north and east the land stretches off into plains. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
