R {37962} {0} {<228>} {In well cropped grass} {<228>, `<088>} {  Although the plains are vast, the presence of cropped grass denotes the  nearness of more domesticated animals or, at the very least, wild cattle or  horses. Looking over the grass, you notice some hoof prints, thus confirming  your thoughts about the existence of ungulate mammals. To the north, the  grass grows much taller than it does here while, to the east, the grass looks soft and lush, almost good enough to sleep on. Although off to the west tall  grass can be seen, looming farther in the distance you see mountains. To the  south, you see a shady area and another good place to rest. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37961} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
