R {37963} {0} {<228>} {In tall grass on the plains} {<228>, `<088>} {    Walking through the long grass, you can see foothills emerging to the west. Somewhere close by to the north, a babbling brook can be heard.  Hopefully,  it will provide clear water to drink.  Although the grass to the east looks  cropped, the grass to the south looks more trampled.  Errant breezes whisper  through the grass and some sort of wild birds fly overhead.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
