R {37964} {0} {<228>} {Near the winding foothills} {<228>, `<088>} {    Moving closer to the foothills, the flat grassy areas become sparser as  the winding foothills, to the west, come more clearly into view. Past the  foothills, much further to the west, the mountains loom silently, giving  you a sense of unease. To the north, the sound of running water can be heard,  perhaps some sort of brook can be found. The vast plains can be seen  stretching off to the east and north. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37963} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
