R {37965} {0} {<228>} {Along the winding foothills} {<228>. ^<088>} {    The foothills take another bend here.  To the north, you can travel onward into the foothills for a ways while, to the east, you can travel back into  the plains.  North from here, the foothills begin to march along the western  boundary of the grasslands and, south of here, the plains intrude into a low  range of hilly terrain.  The ground here is very uneven and thickly covered  with vegetation.  Small clusters of herbs and flowers dot the grasses and a  few stunted trees offer their roots as snags to an unwary foot.   } {nulan} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
E {37964} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
