R {37966} {0} {<228>} {A bend in the foothills} {<228>. ^<088>} {  Directly to the west, a large hill blocks your view to what may be behind it. However, if you crane your neck skyward, the dark looming mountains can be  seen. Maybe there is a way through to the mountains but, as of yet, you can't seem to find it. To the south, the foothills become lower and less of an  obstacle to pass while, to the east, the foothills can be seen winding off  into the distance. } {nulan} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
E {37965} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37957} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {37967} {0} {<228>} {In tall grass} {<228>, `<088>} {  Making a gentle swishing noise, the long grass plays in the wind. The plains  seem to stretch out forever, especially to the south and the west. Although  the grassy plains dominate the landscape, far off to the west mountains can  be seen and, directly to the north, a large forest offers some shade from the sun and, perhaps, even from some of the wilder side of weather. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {37973} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {37960} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
