R {37968} {0} {<228>} {Out on the plains} {<228>, `<088>} {  As you continue to wander through the plains, you feel a sense of loneliness; not that of a lack of companionship, but that of a vast open space in which  you are the only intelligent life form for miles. Wildlife appears to be  everywhere. Herds of large animals roam the lands, the sounds of their  thudding hooves vibrating through the ground. Occasionally you spot what  appear to be half domesticated cattle, and thinking on this, you begin to  wonder if you truly are alone. To the north you can see a field of brightly  colored flowers decorating the edge of the forest. Looking to the west, east  and south, you see only tall grass, seeming to stretch on forever. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
