R {37969} {0} {<228>} {In tall grass} {<228>, `<088>} {  Just when you begin to wonder whether or not the grass ever ends, you see a  change to the north. Although the tall grass of the plains still remains,  large trees offer shade and some protection from the elements. To the west,  the promise of fresh water catches your ear but, because this is a grassland, looking east reminds you of where you are. The plains stretch before you in  that direction. To the south, you see cropped grass, something not naturally  occurring out here in the plains. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
