R {37972} {0} {<228>} {Muddy ground in the foothills} {<228>. ^<088>} {    From the looks of things, a flood or maybe heavy rain has caused the ground to be very muddy here.  Unlike most of the plains, the grass is soaked with mud and most of it is drooping.  It seems a little harder to maneuver here.  This is definitely not a great place to spend the night.   To the south, the foothills wind through the landscape and a small brook  offers a refreshing change from the plains. } {nulan} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
