R {37973} {0} {<228>} {Shaded grassland near a large forest} {<228>, `<088>} {  Just outside the edge of the forest, this part of the grasslands is more shaded than most.  Ahead to the north, the forest looks dark and cool at any time of the day.  Grass stretches out to the south, swaying in the breezes that almost constantly caress the plains.  To the west, a more colorful sight, wild flowers blanket the grass at the edge of a large forest.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
