R {37974} {0} {<228>} {In a field of flowers on the edge of a large forest} {<228>, `<088>} {  Dotting the grass throughout this part of the plains are beautiful and delicate yellow flowers, though looking around you notice soft, almost teardrop size white flowers as well.  On a drifting breeze you catch the slight scent of perfume.  Although most of the plains are a steady rolling grassland of greens and browns, here life seems a little brighter.  To the north a large forest offers shade and some shelter from the weather if needed.  A shaded stretch of grass close to the forest also beckons to the east, while to the south, the grasslands spread out before you.  To the west the eaves of the tall trees in the forest offer cool shade and some rest, perhaps.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
