R {37975} {0} {<228>} {In tall grass near the eaves of a large forest} {<228>, `<088>} {    High above, tall eaves offer shade from all elements, though how much is a little hard to tell.  Mushrooms grow easily in the cool shade of the trees  and might offer a meal of sorts.  To the east, bright colors catch your eye  as beautiful flowers dot the grass.  Further north, the trees part a little,  perhaps a path of some kind can be found there.  The sound of water running  over rocks catches your attention to the west.  To the south, the grass  seems to be growing exceptionally taller than in most places on the plains. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
