R {37976} {0} {<228>} {A sparkling brook in the plains} {<228>, `<088>} {    A break from what seems to be the steady flow of grass, this sparkling  brook offers a cool drink and a place to sit that won't cover you in grass.  However, if you prefer, a shadier spot of grass, to the east, would at least  give protection from most of what nature could throw at you. To the south  and north, the brook continues through the plains.  Just to the west, a  large cliff looms before you and travel in that direction is all but  impossible. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
