R {37977} {0} {<228>} {Foothills ending at a steep cliff} {<228>. ^<088>} {    Rolling hills and flat plains can be seen from the top of this hill.  A large cliff blocks your path to the north and west.  There may be another way around this cliff but not from here.  You can continue to the east or south, however, and, in either direction, the sweet song of a babbling brook hints at a possible drink or refreshing dip in cool waters.  } {nulan} {} {hills} {} {1.000} {}
