R {37978} {0} {<228>} {Just into the dark forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The coolness and protection from the elements in the forest offers a large  contrast from the vast openness of the plains. Although the forest looks  wild, there are small signs that at least someone comes in here to make use  of the forest. Footprints can be seen around the branches as if someone has  been gathering something. High above, the branches of this large forest's  eaves stretch out to the south offering shade, of sorts, over the grasslands. To the west, the edge of the forest can be seen. } {nulan} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
