R {37979} {0} {<228>} {On the edges of the large forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Just on the edge of the large forest, it seems quiet, almost too quiet. Nothing seems to be moving or living within the shadows of the giant trees. Although there are beautiful flowers here, the silence of the forest to the  south doesn't do anything to help improve any misgivings you might have. To  the west, a path seems to be leading deeper into the forest while to the east  leads a little further under the trees. } {nulan} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
