R {37980} {0} {<228>} {Near a path in the dark forest} {<228>( *<088>} {    Nearing a path in the forest, the silence of the great trees surrounds you,  almost isolating you from the world outside. Although there may be something  or someone in this forest, the dead leaves carpeting the ground make it hard  to hear anything at all.  Above you, the branches of the ancient trees have  made a dark-green, almost black, canopy that blocks out the sky.  About the  only noise that can be heard nearby, besides the wind, is the sound of water  coming from the west. Perhaps there is a brook or spring of some kind off  that way. Tall grass swishes softly just under the shadow of the eaves of  the forest to the south, while travelling east leads out to the edges of the  forest. } {nulan} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
