R {37981} {0} {<228>} {Along the sparkling brook} {<228>( *<088>} {    Fresh water flows swiftly from somewhere to the north or northwest, providing all kinds of wildlife much needed nourishment.  The cool life-giving waters continue to flow off to the south.  Looking into the water, you see that life flourishes there, as it does on the rest of  the plains.  To the east, the silent forest offers shelter from the  elements.  On a vagrant breeze, you smell smoke from nearby but all you  can see is some underbrush and the nearby trees.  } {nulan} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
