R {37982} {0} {<148>} {A dark cave} {<148>. .<088>} {  You have stumbled on a well hidden cave. The cave is fed by the small brook,  and hidden by the undergrowth from the dark forest. There are signs that  whoever uses this cave is still connected with the plains. Small bits of bone litter the floor, and two pallets made of cow and deer skin are arranged on  the floor. A small fire pit is near the entrance of the cave, and the walls  have paintings of the open grasslands adorning them. } {nulan} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
