R {37983} {0} {<228>} {Inside a hidden clearing} {<228>, `<088>} {    The clearing looks even larger now that you are inside the grove of  ancient trees.  A sparkling lake is a few feet to one side and the stream  empties into its still waters. You can see many people moving around here,  some going to and from the lake, either swimming or bringing back pails of  water to the tents which dot the clearing. The source of the smoke is  evident, now, as you make note of a large bonfire with several spits of meat  roasting over it. You can, also, make out a paddock, of sorts, where several  horses are hobbled.  At the far end of the clearing, a large bull hide tent stands, as if to watch over the dark-skinned inhabitants as they go about  their daily lives. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
