R {37984} {0} {<148>} {A small sparkling lake} {<148>~ ~<088>} {    The waters of the lake are cool and clear.  Small fish swim lazily over the small multi-colored rocks which litter the bottom of the lake.  Thick vegetation lines the western edge of the lake, making the thick trunks of the trees, in that direction, impassible.  On the edges of the water, small flowers and reeds grow thickly alongside sharp bladed grasses and, to the north, you can see a few wild cattle mingling among the horses of the nomads.  To the east, you see more water and, farther to the east, the main camp of the Nulan'Boar tribe.   } {nulan} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
