R {37985} {0} {<148>} {A small sparkling lake} {<148>~ ~<088>} {    The waters of the lake are cool and clear.  There is barely a ripple from the small stream emptying itself into the lake and the bottom is quite visible.  Small fish dart around near the bottom, occasionally blending in with the multi-colored rocks which litter the lake floor.  The land surrounding the lake looks fertile and well kept.  Many cattle and horses feed on the tender shoots of plant life which grow densely alongside the lake.  Several small children and a few adult women, all dressed in leather clothing, with tanned skin and dark hair, come to dip reed basketsful of  water from the lake.  As you continue to move across the lake, you can make out children swimming and diving in the cool waters and a few seem to be  fishing from the fertile shores. } {nulan} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
