R {37986} {0} {<228>} {A path alongside the lake} {<228>, `<088>} {  Many small plants and reeds grow among the grass here.  The lake to the north looks clean and pure, and the sounds of frogs and small insects surround you.  Underfoot, the vegetation is soft and damp.  You can see several of the Nulan'Boar people going about their business between the tents to the east, and the smell of roast meat is heavy in the air.  The clearing looks much like the rest of the grasslands, except for the gathering of tents, and you are puzzled by this single grove of trees in the middle of a flat prairie.   } {nulan} {} {field} {shop} {1.000} {}
