R {37987} {0} {<228>} {Path through the scattered tents} {<228>, `<088>} {  Tents are set up haphazardly through this stretch of grassland.  There is no clear or visible path through the tents.  It is as if the inhabitants of the clearing do not care much about structure, at least in terms of where things are placed.  There are a lot of people moving around here, some armed with bows and spears, others carry baskets, or blankets and babies.  The low murmur of their voices is tinged with an exotic accent and you can see a peacefulness about them.  The tents all seem to be made of bull or deer skin, and look quite roomy.  While large, the tents are still smaller than the one to the north and east, which seems to dominate the view within the camp.  The smells of roasting meat begin to take their toll on you, and you realize that you are becoming very ravenous.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
