R {37988} {0} {<228>} {A small pasture by the lake} {<228>, `<088>} {  This pasture borders the edge of the small lake within the clearing.  Thick patches of clover and small green plants of unknown origin grow along the shores of the lake, and many cattle and wild horses graze here.  The grass is soft and short, as if having been cut short by the teeth of the animals which inhabit the clearing.  It appears that the Nulan'Boar people take very good care of their animals, even those who are wild, and not under their control.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
