R {37989} {0} {<228>} {A small pasture by the lake} {<228>, `<088>} {  The pasture is shaded on two sides by the branches from the grove of trees, but most of the grass is open to the bright sky.  A few cattle stamp and graze here, and the sounds of swishing tails and nickering keep you constantly aware of the wild-looking horses who seem to be glaring in your direction.  The grass is short, but soft underfoot, and closer to the lake the ground becomes muddy.  There are many tracks all covering each other, but this is no real surprise, since the lake appears to be the sole source of water for the clearing.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
