R {37990} {0} {<278>} {A paddock on the lake shore} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The ground here is nearly bare of growing things, with the exception of the trees which block any northern passage out of the clearing.  There is a lot of dried grass piled up around here.  It appears that this is more of a protected area for the cattle or possibly the horses during the night when predators stalk the grasslands.   } {nulan} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
