R {37992} {0} {<228>} {A path through the tents of the Nulan'Boar} {<228>, `<088>} {    You find yourself walking among a scattering of bull hide tents. There  seems to be no particular path through the structures and you have to wind  your way through them. The Nulan'Boar seem to prefer randomness to straight lines.  Most of the Nulan'Boar are away from the tents, at the moment, but  there are a few mothers watching their young at play here. The tents are  all unadorned and look to be large enough for small families. To the south, is a cleared spot in the camp and you can just see a carving of what looks  to be a charging boar atop a slender pole. To the west, you can see pasture or, at least, someplace where animals are kept and cared for. } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
