R {37994} {0} {<228>} {Middle of the Nulan'Boar camp} {<228>, `<088>} {    In this part of the camp, the ground is cleared of all obstructions.  The only feature is a slender pole with a carving of a charging boar adorning its very top.  The pole is placed in the exact center of the cleared space. This must be a ceremonial place for the Nulan'Boar, possibly the gathering place for meals, as well.  It seems as if they take great pains to keep this place very clear of all things, grass, rocks and animals.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
