R {37995} {0} {<228>} {Before the large tent} {<228>, `<088>} {  While not exactly set apart from all the others, this tent does have space around it.  It is much larger and more ornate than the plain tents you have seen in the Nulan'Boar camp.  Out here the ground is flat, but there is grass growing, unlike in the center of the camp.  There appears to be smoke drifting from a hole in the roof of the tent, and a sense of power seems to surround the dwelling.  As you look over the view from here, you see a few people, both men and women, enter and exit the tent.  Many of the women who enter the tent are dressed in what appear to be robes of soft white calf's hide, and all have a peaceful look about them.  All of the men who visit are armed, and most have a gait that suggests they are more comfortable on horseback.  Wherever this is, it must be a place of importance.   } {nulan} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
