R {37996} {0} {<278>} {Inside the tent of the Nulan'Boar chieftain} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The inside of the tent is cool and dim.  The scent of leather is heavy in the air, and there is an undercurrent of incense and smoke as well.  The floor of the tent is covered with thick layers of deerskin, and small torches rest in stands around the tent, giving off a dim light.  A wooden rack on the northern wall holds a few trophies: antlers, long horns from bulls, a few rusted weapons, and a large horn bow.  On the eastern side of the tent is an ornate, beaded curtain, and the western side of the tent is dominated by a raised bed of branches covered with layers of skins.  It appears that the central area of the tent is where meetings can take place, as a carved chair sits just in front of the trophy rack, facing the opening of the tent.   } {nulan} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
