R {37997} {0} {<278>} {Chamber of the Nulan'Boar high priestess} {<278>[ ]<088>} {    Filled with a slightly sweet smell of incense, this room is warm and inviting.  Soft layers of deerskin lay thickly on the floor, providing a comfortable place to sit.  Feathers and beads, made into intricate decorations, adorn the walls.  This place is more holy than any other in the Nulan'Boar camp.  It is the chamber of the high priestess.  At  different times of the day, there can be a myriad of visitors seeking  advice or help on a multitude of things.   } {nulan} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {37996} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {38000} {0} {<278>} {The hut of the Nulan'Boar hunter} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This hut has been decorated with various pelts of the animals he has tracked  down and caught. The tent is very clean and organized. Several chairs are  sitting in a semi-circle around a larger, comfortable chair. That chair is  used by the master hunter to tell the tales of the hunt. } {nulan} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {37992} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

