R {38218} {0} {<278>} {The Mages' Bunkhouse} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Tall bunk beds fill the mages bunkhouse from floor to ceiling.  Each bunk contains ten beds, and the frames are sanded oak.  The beds are all made and kept clean.  Standing at the foot of each bunk is a tall closet with doors, and in each closet are a single hanger rod and a top shelf.  Wash basins hang off of the eastern wall in a marble countertop.  Piles of neatly folded towels sit next to each sink basin.  Oil lamps hang down from the ceiling at shoulder height and provide the room with much needed light.  A grandfather clock stands between the entrances of the room and quietly ticks the time away. } {afterglow} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
