R {38238} {0} {<238>} {The western ledge} {<238>/ \<088>} {  It seems relatively calmer out here on the western ledge. The air is still and tranquil, and you can hear the soothing splashing of waves against rocks from far below. A cool breeze carries the smell of the sea, and for  a moment one might forget that they are surrounded by huge, rather unfriendly creatures. } {titan} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
