R {38239} {0} {<238>} {A fractured ledge} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The ledge here has a huge crack running through it. It looks at least a meter deep, with the occasional secondary fracture spidering out perpendicularly. While the ledge still seems solid at the moment, and doesn't move at all due to the high rigidity, you never know when it might suddenly break. } {titan} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
