R {38240} {0} {<238>} {A treacherous corner} {<238>/ \<088>} {  You find yourself at a sharp corner of the plateau, where the ground ends suddenly to the south and west. Deep scratches mar the ground, as possible evidence of an intense fight recently. A series of marks trail right up to the edge, conjuring the image of something scrabbling  desperately for purchase on the smooth, hard crystal as they were forced inexorably off the edge. } {titan} {} {mountain} {pk} {1.000} {}
