R {38244} {0} {<238>} {Rocky terrain} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The ground is littered with large blocks of crystal, almost as if it were the dumping ground of a major mining operation. The sizes of the crystal  pieces vary from tiny bits of gravel to huge blocks that tower above any average man. Given how tough the material is, it seems inconceivable to have been the result of weathering or other natural causes. Meeting the ones with the strength to execute such a feat may be rather dangerous though... } {titan} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
