R {38245} {0} {<238>} {Approaching the Keep} {<238>/ \<088>} {  To the north, a gargantuan Keep hewn from the Mountain towers above you. The silhouette of figures can be made out moving along the battlements, indicating that not only is the Keep inhabited, it seems to be in top condition. It looks like the rumours were true insofar that an army was massing on the peak of the Mountain. } {titan} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
