R {38250} {0} {<148>} {A watering hole} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Rainwater has gathered here in a shallow pool, which looks deceptively deep thanks to the clear crystal bottom. Huge creatures of all sorts gather here to drink water, and some sort of lichen and resilient creepers have begun to grow at the edges. The sight reflects how truly resilient life is. } {titan} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
