R {38252} {0} {<238>} {The eastern edge} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The eastern edge of the plateau is much like the others\; the very edge is avoided by most creatures, and there is a sharp drop to the ocean. The  consistency and flatness of the plateau, considered from a larger macro  viewpoint, suggest that it is not entirely natural, and someone must have carved out the entire platform from the side of the mountain. } {titan} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
