R {38253} {0} {<238>} {A great view} {<238>/ \<088>} {  The edge of the plateau presents a great view at sunrise. To the north one can see Oasis island. In the mornings, the Uncharted oceans are bathed in the bloody red glow of sunrise, perhaps an omen of what is yet to come. Small shrubs and creepers cover the eastern cliff, with leaves turned to face the sun. } {titan} {} {mountain} {} {1.000} {}
