R {38258} {0} {<178>} {The southwestern tower} {<278>###<088>} {  At this corner of the Keep, one can see the Titan's line forming up to the north, where they look to be collecting their weapons and armor. A strong heat billows from the north, and there is also an intense light coming from the north. It reflects in the crystal walls, casting pretty rainbows across the ground in a mesmerising display. } {titan} {} {castle} {} {1.000} {}
E {38257} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
