R {39603} {0} {<268>} {Street Performers} {<268>. .<088>} {  There are four stations of performers that generally reside here. The  jugglers, the puppeteers, the fire eaters, and the sword swallowers. Every  once in a while one of the street performers will put on a spontaneous show  to draw a crowd, but usually they will wait for someone to pay them a token  before beginning a performance. Blue cobblestones have been added in  different shades here, and each different shade forms a circular pattern  around where the performers stand, encouraging an audience to circle about  them. In the middle of a warm summer day, these performers can expect up to a hundred folks watching their shows at a time. They certainly work hard to put on a good performance! } {oceanpark} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
