R {39604} {0} {<278>} {Play-All-Day Land} {<278> * <088>} {  Play-All-Day Land is a favorite place for parents to bring their children on  a hot summer day. The best part about Play-All-Day Land is the amount of  space set aside for the children to run around in. There is a playground  structure at the center of the area, and it is surrounded on every side by a  thriving field which is rife with wild flowers. The playground structure  itself has been made to look like a castle, and all around this structure is  a paddling pool that is supposed to look like a moat. It even has lily pads  growing inside of it, but the water is kept clean so that it is safe for  swimming in. A magnificent dragon slide swirls all around the exterior of the castle structure. The interior of the castle contains a number of nets for  climbing and trampolines for bouncing on. Parents can rest assured that their children will be totally tuckered out after spending several hours at  Play-All-Day Land. } {oceanpark} {} {pillar} {} {1.000} {}
