R {39605} {0} {<218>} {The Pirate Ship and Parrot} {<218>` <118>,<088>} {  This pub wasn't actually built out of a real pirate ship, but it was built to look like one! It was modeled after a schooner, complete with two masts. The  deck of the ship is of course where the patrons enjoy their beverages, and  heading downstairs would lead to the kitchen area, though only staff members  are actually allowed to go down there. The pub has been decorated with  artifacts that supposedly all relate to pirates in some fashion. They include swords that have been hung on the wall, stuffed parrots, and pirate skulls  and jewelery. There is also a stage for live entertainment, which usually  consists of a band or hypnotist. } {oceanpark} {} {hell1} {} {1.000} {}
