R {39607} {0} {<228>} {Ivory Tower of Butterflies} {<228>( *<088>} {  Here is a fantastical tower that has been created entirely from ivory. In the sun, it gleams as brightly as glass. The tower is not entirely enclosed;  instead, it begins at four wide base pieces of ivory that have been braided  into each other so that they rise up to a peak at the tower's apex. Butterflies weave in and out of the gaps in the tower walls as they fly, but  they have been enchanted so that they will never leave the tower. The  colorful butterflies are matched in beauty by the flowers that have been  planted all around the base of the tower. This assortment of tropical flowers holds an array of colors that is every bit as dazzling as those displayed by  the butterflies. } {oceanpark} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
