R {39609} {0} {<168>} {Jellyfish Jungle} {<168>~ ~<088>} {  The Jellyfish Jungle consists of dozens of spiraling glass tubes of varying  colors, fondly referred to by park staff as the jellyfish tree sculptures. These sculptures are spread apart enough so that an individual can walk  between them. The top of each of the tubes is capped with a metallic, green  sculpting of what has been fashioned to look like palm tree fronds. The  ground is covered with soft, black sand, and the jellyfish dance up and down  within the glass tubes. The jellyfish tree sculptures are about ten feet tall each, and their overall effect is quite bizarre. } {oceanpark} {} {wind1} {} {1.000} {}
