R {39620} {0} {<278>} {Sea Lion Symphony} {<278> * <088>} {  The sea lion enclosure consists mainly of a large pool of bright, clear  water. Where light hits the water, it sparkles brightly, and really looks  like a comfortable spot to take a swim. There is a section of land set aside  for the sea lions to rest upon as well, with a wooden lean-to built on one  side to provide shade on hot days. Wooden beds have also been constructed in  this section so that the sea lions may snooze happily. The ground is covered  with soft-looking beige sand, and a few large tree trunks have been scattered about for the sea lions to climb around on. } {oceanpark} {} {pillar} {} {1.000} {}
