R {39621} {0} {<278>} {Turtles in a Sun Bath} {<278>*  <088>} {  This is the habitat for turtles. Large, smooth stones cover one section of  the area. The stones chosen for this space are dark in color so that they  will soak up a maximum amount of heat, and they are also flat, in order for  the turtles to be able to crawl up onto them. The rest of the habitat's space is filled with a neatly designed pond that actually forms the symbol of a  crescent moon, in homage to the Crescent Moon Islands. Small shrubberies and  round rocks line the edges of the pond, accenting the shape of its border. In the air, enchanted balls of light hover, creating a measure of heat for  the turtles to bathe in when the natural sunlight is unavailable. } {oceanpark} {} {space2} {} {1.000} {}
