R {39653} {0} {<148>} {The Deep Ocean} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  There is very little light this deep in the ocean. Everything is slightly  hazy, and the darkest shade of blue. Trails of bubbles emit from undefinable  sources, and every so often, bits of dead organic matter float down from  above. The water is a bit salty and far too cold for comfort. Only creatures  who have never known the warmth and joy of sunlight could possibly enjoy a  life way down here. } {oceanpark} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
