R {39660} {0} {<148>} {Riding the Current} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Where does this powerful current come from? It is impossible to know for  sure, but it seems almost like some otherworldly power is in control here. It pushes everything up and out of the deep sea trench; a trench that could  have been so interesting to explore! Riding the current is fun, at any rate,  and maybe the ocean is simply trying to save a hapless adventurer from a deep sea terror. } {oceanpark} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
