R {39661} {0} {<248>} {A Peaceful Ocean Ridge} {<248>~ ~<088>} {  The ocean's powerful current leads an adventurer to this peaceful ridge. The  edge of the ridge sits to the south, and is barren of life. Its edge leads  off sharply into the great abyss, where water is continuously pushing up and  out as if it can't get free from there fast enough. To the east, the corals  begin to take up residence once again, and the topography of the ocean floor  starts to resemble rolling hills. } {oceanpark} {} {underwater} {} {1.000} {}
