R {40155} {0} {<228>} {Under the Trees} {<228>, `<088>} {  Standing at the top of the long crumbling stairs to the hidden mausoleum, you almost step in a pile of crunchy millet seed shells. The solid walnut  door before you has a small drilled-out hole next to the lock which a small  animal could probably pass through. The path starting at the bottom of the  stairs cuts through the dense underbrush of a dark forest and disappears  among the trees. Piles of orange and yellow leaves have been blown against  the monstrous walnut trees by relentless swirling winds. Several overhanging  branches block out most of the sunlight and echoes of bloodthirsty bats ring  in your ears. } {shadowsend} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
