R {40302} {0} {<238>} {An Old Work Shed} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  A cold, fine mist in the air blows straight in through the door and out  through the spaces between the boarded walls. The floor is nothing more than  a few old boards that have been thrown down on top of dirt and rock. Gardening and lawn care tools hang on rusty hooks all over the walls. Worktables with massive vices are scattered around the large shop. The dirty, dingy smell is partially covered up by the fruity aromas coming from a large  press on a long table along the back of the shed. Hanging on the wall behind  the press is a list of recipes. An old groundskeeper wearing dark blue  overalls and a blue plaid shirt stands at the press and peeks over his  shoulder at you. } {shadowsend} {} {hut} {} {1.000} {}
