R {40400} {0} {<278>} {The Foyer of the Argento Bank} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The entrance of the Argento Bank is opulently furnished, though it carefully  avoids being too ostentatious. Green marble and polished white granite form a checkered pattern on the floor. The sound of footsteps ringing out on the  stone is muffled somewhat by wall hangings whose mosaic-like patterns seem  quite exotic. Foot traffic winds gracefully around a statue of fortune,  placed prominently in the center of the room, and several plush chairs by the walls promise a comfortable place should one be required while waiting for  assistance. The display of luxury tacitly reassures its well-to-do patrons  that they are dealing with a venerable and prestigious institution. From the  adjoining rooms comes the sound of a lively babble of voices discussing  prices to the north, and the soothing sound of many pens scratching on paper  to the east. } {stuff} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
