R {40404} {0} {<278>} {The Stone Vault} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Barely sufficient to cut through the profound darkness, a feeble light cast  by three ensconced candles illuminates the vault. Conspicuously absent from  this peculiar room is any amount of gold bullion or stacks of coins and  currency, though a modest amount of silver is on hand. Sheaves of manifolds,  charters, and promissory notes from kingdoms, principalities, and duchies are tied together with ribbons and peek out of several drawers built along one  wall. Chilly air leaks into the vault, though the slight draft couldn't  possibly come through the solid stone walls. The room vibrates with an  inexplicable deep throbbing noise that is felt more than heard. An eeriness  and creeping sense of claustrophobia makes the vault seem entirely at odds  with the genially polite atmosphere of the rest of the bank. } {stuff} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
