R {40406} {0} {<278>} {The Chambers of the Shadow Seekers} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The high-strung, nervous tension permeating the central chamber of the shadow seekers is taunt enough to pluck like a string.  At any unexpected sound, glances flick warily upwards toward the chamber entrance in the east.  The activity of most of the seekers is united around an elaborate enchantment, the incantations of which are constantly being mumbled, and whose symbols have covered most of the floor in a delicate array of looping characters and prickly, spiked shapes.  Sizzling waves of buzzing, electrical charges undulate through the air of the room, raising goose-bumps on everyone's neck in a steady progression.  As much as possible, preparations have been made to conceal the activity at a moments notice: large rolled-up rugs lie ready to be unfurled to cover the chalk marks.  The two other rooms of the chambers may be found to the north and west.   } {stuff} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
