R {40416} {0} {<278>} {The Entrance to the Shadow Forge} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A near-deafening clanging sound and powerful wafts of smoke drift into this room from the forge to the south, while the way north heads to the top of the central spiral staircase.  The close confines and poor lighting of this narrow, dimly lit passage seem to be designed so that it can be easily defended against any intruder.  Drawn on the floor, a large circular sigil embossed with lead and glowing faintly violet suggests magical wards also protect this place.  It certainly does not make for a welcoming impression.  } {stuff} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
