R {40443} {128} {<278>} {The Top of a Steep Tunnel} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A dank, musty smell permeates the stale air of this confined, narrow space. The walls of the tunnel are roughly hewn, dark, abrasive rock that juts  irregularly into the passageway and threatens to viscously scrape elbows. Wildly distorted shadows of lurking figures play across the walls in a  macabre dance. Spiraling counter-clockwise, the tunnel continues its steep  descent to the south. There seems to be no other way to go but head back down the steep tunnel. } {stuff} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
