R {41990} {0} {<268>} {A well-crafted hallway} {<268>[ ]<088>} {  The hallway here is unique because the ceiling has been painted with a  magnificent fresco. It portrays cerejellums in a massive fight. The  cerejellums are floating within a sky that is riddled with a mixture of  clouds and winged demons. The cerejellums are shooting beams of magic out at  the demons, and considering the pained expressions upon the demons' faces,  the cerejellums must be doing a pretty good job of things. This must be an  important piece of cerejellum history for it to have been depicted in such an impressive fresco. The most interesting part is that the cerejellums are  actually battling on the surface of Andolor. They seem like the type of  creatures that would never leave the safety of the underground, and yet there it is, a sort of proof that at one point they did have a reason to reside  above ground. } {uprising} {} {hallway} {} {1.000} {}
