R {42137} {0} {<278>} {A Narrow Ledge} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The floor of this section of cavern is nearly nonexistent. There is a bit of  a ledge for an individual to carefully inch across, as long as they place  their back to the wall and throw out their arms in order to maintain balance. Anyone who does not take great care with their movements at this point, will  find themselves careening down into the inky black pit that yawns before  them. Little motes of enchanted light dance about in the air here, daring a  traveler to lose their concentration, and fall to their doom. The narrow  ledge makes its way to a more generous state of footing, either to the south, or to the east. } {uprising} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
