R {42139} {0} {<278>} {Approaching the Lip} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The floor of this section of the cavern drops away to the north and suddenly, there is nothing more than a skinny, slip of a ledge to creep across. To the  east, the cavern sports a firm plot of land for an individual to plod across, so that would definitely be the safer route of travel. There is nothing  particularly special about this section of cavern. It is lit through some  form of enchantment, causing an even, steady flood of light from floor to  ceiling. The cavern's walls are curved in shape, due to the way that the  cyclopses carve away at the cave by using the power of disintegration that is inherent in their eye. } {uprising} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
