R {42140} {0} {<278>} {Nearing a Corridor} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This cavern opens up to the south into a unique corridor. The corridor to the south is quite different from the current cavern, because rather than being  simply carved out into a rounded shape, the floor to it was worked on until  flat, then grey stones were added, making a perfect walking surface. The  current bit of cavern also leads to similar sections of cavern, both to the  east and to the west. The cavern to the north is eaten up by a large pit, so  heading in that direction is out of the question. } {uprising} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
