R {42141} {0} {<278>} {A Cleaned Corridor} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Bricks of stone have been used to create a level floor for this corridor. The stonework has been done with expert precision, so it must have either  been performed through some manner of enchantment, or more likely through the tireless work of slaves. The ceiling arches into the walls and these are also lined with smooth grey stones. The corridor is kept so clean that if the  stones could sparkle, they most certainly would. The air smells damp and  earthy, and the cavern is lit by torches that hang upon its walls. The  torches are obviously kept lit through enchantments that are monitored by the cyclopses. The light the torches cast is white, with a slight tinge of blue. The temperature in here is cool; the light that the torches produce does not  contain any hint of warmth. } {uprising} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
