R {42142} {0} {<278>} {An Opening in the Corridor} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Here the corridor opens up into rooms to the east and the west, then carries  on to the north or south. To the west is a room that looks like it holds a  forge, and to the east is a chamber containing many cluttered shelves. This  section of the corridor is much like the last. Enchanted torches light it up  from the walls, illuminating the smooth, grey stones that line the ceiling,  walls, and floor. To the south the corridor ends at a massive doorway,  whereas to the north, the corridor carries on until it surrenders to  darkness. What an eery place to inhabit, so far underground. } {uprising} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
