R {42143} {0} {<278>} {Before a Large Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The corridor ends here at a large entryway. It is lit with enchanted torches  that hang from the walls. The walls, floor, and ceiling have all been lined  with smooth grey stones. The entrance to the south looks like it spends much  of its time tightly closed and locked up. The torches illuminate the massive  door, as well as its lock, which looks excessively intricate. Beyond this  door must be the residence of the cyclopses' slaves. The slaves need to be  placed somewhere secure, but they also need to have suitable accommodations  so that they can maintain their health and strength. It is a well known fact  that cyclopses are skilled at taking good care of their slaves. To the north, the corridor heads straight until what can be seen of it melts into darkness. } {uprising} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
