R {42144} {128} {<278>} {A Sleeping Dormitory} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  In this corner of the room, the southern wall contains a small hearth. The  hearth has logs burning inside and the smoke is not staying in the room, so  it must be rising out through some sort of indiscernible exit. The flames in  the hearth dance about invitingly, and a plain wooden chair sits in front of  the hearth to rest in. Aside from the dressers, this is the only unique piece of furniture in the room that is not a bed. A pair of wet, smelly boots sit  in front of the fire, drying off. The atmosphere is quite homely, if an  individual manages to forget for a moment that they are trapped in a  cyclops lair.  } {uprising} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
