R {42147} {128} {<278>} {A Sleeping Dormitory} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Yes, this is definitely a sleeping dormitory. There is a bed in every spot  that one will fit, and there isn't space for much else. The beds have wooden  frames and are covered with animal pelts. There are several enchanted torches sitting upon dressers against the western wall, and to the east a small  hearth has been a built into the wall. The lighting in the room is soft and  low, just bright enough to wander around to get into a bed if you are a  creature that does not possess night vision. } {uprising} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
