R {42152} {0} {<278>} {Southern Temple Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  The dark elf city streets are built up of shiny black cobblestones. Dark  elves are both artistic and detail orientated creatures, so you had better  bet that they did not cut any corners on the creation of the city's roads or  its surrounding buildings. These streets must have been a spectacular sight  before the recent battle began to wage its destruction upon this city. On  either side of the street are buildings that once would have been  breathtaking, but are now collapsed and empty of life. This road continues  further into the city if a traveler heads to the west or to the east. Anyone who proceeds to the south, will find themselves at what is left of the city gates. } {uprising} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
