R {42153} {0} {<278>} {Southwestern Temple Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  The buildings that have managed to accrue the least amount of damage in this  city, are the ones that were built out of tower-sized stalagmites. Their  steadfastness may be due to the fact that they are so naturally melded to the cave's very structure. Stalagmites like these have survived here, growing  steadily over the course of hundreds of years, before the dark elves were  even around to consider making a city in this area. Several of these  stalagmite towers stand in every direction from here. The black cobblestone  road continues to the north or to the east from here. } {uprising} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
