R {42154} {0} {<278>} {Northwestern Temple Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  This is the western edge of where the dark elves once kept their marketplace. The remains of the market continue to the east, and a the road continues on  to the west to a section of the city where many upper-class dark elves have  built their homes. To the south, the road will take an individual on their  way back to the city gates. Carts where traders would have displayed their  wares, have been rendered into piles of junk that block the roadway. There is a fountain here that once would have been a beautiful focal point to the  area, but now sits dry, with bits of its stone structure crumbled inside of  it and irreparable cracks zigzagging along its surface. } {uprising} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
