R {42155} {0} {<278>} {Northeastern Temple Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  This is the section of the city where the trading market once stood. The dark elves haven't done much yet, with respect to cleaning up the mess here, so  the marketplace is still a complete disaster. Carts lie tipped-over, and many have been smashed or burnt beyond recognition. To the east is where the main  fire still burns, and the heat of it is even evident from over here, although the distance from it feels generously safe. It looks like the disaster here  has already been picked through and anything of interest has been taken. This is not surprising, considering the number of slaves that must have  broken free during the battle that waged here. Any dead bodies have also been carted off, and the rubble has been sort of pushed off to the side in places  to create a narrow walking path. } {uprising} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
