R {42157} {0} {<278>} {Southeastern Temple Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  The cave system that the dark elves chose to make their city in seems to be a series of caverns containing what could almost be referred to as a forest of  stalagmites. It is surreal, how large these stalagmites have grown. Each of  these gigantic stalagmites has been made into a building that is tall enough  to hold five to ten stories within its structure. This is evident because  each story of each building contains a balcony for the dark elves to walk out onto. Since dark elves are fond of using the power of levitation to get to  where they need to be, these balconies aid them either in accessing the city  streets or in returning them to the room they desire to occupy, in the least  amount of time necessary. } {uprising} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
