R {42158} {0} {<278>} {A Burned-out Road} {<278>. .<088>} {  This is a section of the road where a lot of lower-class dark elves had their homes built. The fires that were started in the area certainly had their way  with this section of the city. There are no dead bodies, the dark elves must  have been quite efficient at clearing those away, but there are burnt-out  husks of houses. The foundations left behind reveal that these were small  homes, and any objects lying around look like they would have belonged to  elves who had enough money for sensible items they would use everyday as  opposed to objects of pure beauty. Mainly the notable objects include  cookware, clothes, and storage trunks. There are a couple of children's toys  scattered into the mess that cause an individual to feel a whole lot less  dispassionate about the whole situation. In other parts of the city the fire  still burns, but here it managed to complete its job, leaving nothing but a  charred wreckage for thieves to pick through. } {uprising} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
