R {42371} {0} {<278>} {Master Bedroom} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The master bedroom is huge. The bed alone is big enough for eight adult  rabbits to romp on. It is neatly made and decorated with a hand sewn quilt  and giant throw pillows. There are nightstands beside the bed, and on each is an oil lamp and a vase of fresh flowers. The walls are almond in color and  the carpet is a plush emerald green. } {terramire} {} {inside} {shop} {1.000} {}
