R {42372} {0} {<278>} {A Kit's Bedroom} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Nothing is out of place in the kit's bedroom. The bed is neatly made. The  toys are all put away and it appears as if the kit is never home. But the  slaves will tell you otherwise. According to them, the kid is a spoiled brat  who gets anything he wants, and then some. Along the northern wall are several  shelves with trophies and awards upon them, all in different categories,  ranging from spelling bees to sporting events. The kit must be either very  smart and athletic, or his parents are well enough off, that they pay his way through everything. The latter is the best guess. } {terramire} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
