R {43194} {0} {<278>} {A stretch of echoing corridor} {<278>[ ]<088>} {   The corridor is really long, and even your quiet footsteps cause distant  echoes to return to you. The echoes tempt you to put on your lederhosen and  belt out a gut wrenching yodel to test the acoustics.  } {ascent} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
