R {43195} {0} {<278>} {An intersection} {<278>[ ]<088>} {   Just as you suspected, this is an intersection. The path branches to the  North, South, and West. From the West you hear the sounds of cheering, taunt, and, eerie screeching like a cat being skinned alive. The inquiring mind might want to investigate such interesting sounds.  } {ascent} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
