R {43196} {0} {<278>} {A room beside the elevator room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {   To the North the corridor continues past the Elevator, and to the South you see more of the corridor.  There is the buzzing of conversation coming from the South, while nothing catches your attention to the North until you hear the melodic chime of the elevator arriving.  Interestingly, the entire prison seems to be built around the elevator with equidistant focal points North and South of it.   } {ascent} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {43197} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {43195} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {43197} {0} {<278>} {The elevator room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {   You can't help but notice the ornate elevator doors here. Encrusted with  precious gems and gilded with purest gold, nothing could be more out of place in a prison. A glowing magenta button winks steadily beside the doors. The  Captain of the Guard divides his time between staring at the elevator doors,  passing prisoners, and you. Obviously what ever is beyond those doors is  important enough to keep an important official posted here as a precaution.  } {ascent} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
