R {43199} {0} {<278>} {Gateway to the cell blocks} {<278>[ ]<088>} {   You are at an intersection of the main corridor which continues North and  South, and branching to the West is the Gateway to the Cell Blocks. The  sulfurous odor seems to largely originate from the cells. The moaning and  screams also are concentrated in that direction. You overhear a spirited  debate about the location of "The Princess".  } {ascent} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
