R {43265} {0} {<228>} {A bright path} {<228>( *<088>} {  Directly after the animal trail, the forest opens up to a lightly wooded  path. To the east, castle walls dominate the view. Towers ascend to the sky  at each of the four corners of the castle. It appears the walls have been  recently damaged. However, the sounds that fill the air are those of a  warcamp: blacksmiths' hammers on anvils, orders yelled to grunts, weapons and shields clashing violently. The path leading east seems well worn, despite  the western path hardly being able to be seen. } {siege} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
