R {43267} {0} {<238>} {Entrance to the Warcamp} {<238>. .<088>} {  The gates to the warcamp have been left open, and the guardposts have been  deserted. There is virtually no traffic on the west side of the camp. Even  the fortifications are in disrepair. The sounds of weapons being forged and  recruits being yelled at break up the sounds of the forest to the west. The  castle looms high above the camp, yet the camp is still safely protected by  distance. It is not just the damage to the walls, there is something  other-worldly about the castle to the east. } {siege} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
