R {43344} {0} {<248>} {Spy headquarters} {<248>% %<088>} {  The walls of this make-shift basement are lined with giant boulders. There's  no telling how the boulders were brought in below the paddock beneath the  camp, but the stench may have aided the eldar spies. The boulders are covered with maps, notices, and hand-drawn portraits of kobolds. A massive  table stands in the center of the headquarters, littered with various pieces  of parchment. Despite there being a desk, there's not a chair in sight. The eldar must be entering and leaving with rapidity. } {siege} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
E {43319} {u} {u} {16} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {43345} {128} {<278>} {Castle Ramparts} {<278>---<088>} {  After crash landing onto the cold stone ramparts of the castle, regaining any sense of direction proves difficult. There are walls on either side of a wide path, leading to a tower on each side. There are no doors leading into the  towers, and no stairs that would lead down to the ground below. Sounds from  the battle rage below, perhaps jumping down off of the ramparts is the only way to escape! } {siege} {} {smallroad_ew} {} {1.000} {}
E {43336} {jump down} {jump down} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {43346} {0} {<268>} {Flying high above the forest} {<268>. .<088>} {  You're sailing through the air! Why are you looking around?! Your death is  imminent!! You have the sudden urge to cry out "HEY! I CAN SEE MY MANOR FROM  UP HERE!"  } {siege} {} {air} {} {1.000} {}
E {43345} {crash land} {crash land} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {43349} {0} {<238>} {Field Commander's Tent} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  This tent was once a color that was not mud. However, it has been splattered  with mud for so long that the original color has long since been lost. Armor  and weapon racks line the walls, each scantily clad with the tools of war. Small tables are scattered around the tent, each covered in various scraps of paper, pieces of armor, and damaged weapons. There is no calm here. } {siege} {} {hut} {} {1.000} {}
E {43332} {leave tent} {leave tent} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {43350} {0} {<238>} {A rarely used path} {<238>. .<088>} {  Being off of the main path in the camp, this path is clearly barely used. Cages hang from giant trees of the forest to the north and the west, each  containing eldar prisoners. The white walls of the tent to the south flap in  the forest breeze, as they have not been reinforced like the other tents. A  strange totem in the center of the path feels like it is drawing magical  energy from the surrounding area. } {siege} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
