R {43807} {128} {<248>} {Bloodied Halls} {<248>[ ]<088>} {  This hall is filled with a horrifying stench\; it is the stench of death. Stone faces line the walls, each of them twisted into a horrific expression  of anger, each face crying tears of blood. The ceiling is not visible  anymore, and more bloody hymns can be heard echoing from the south. } {crynn} {} {chessblack} {} {1.000} {}
