R {43808} {128} {<278>} {A Wicked Staircase} {<278>.@.<088>} {  A few candles allow you to see what lies before you: a staircase leading into pitch darkness below. Its wooden planks seem old and frail. Lyrical music  draws you downwards, but the feeling of dread continues to haunt you. The  walls are bare and plain, with only some figures carved into them that you  cannot quite make out. To the north is a hallway that reeks heavily of death  and decay. The Chambers of Anger aren't visible at all, meaning that even the shadows in this church are unnatural and of a darker nature than those in the world outside. } {crynn} {} {stairs} {} {1.000} {}
