R {43823} {128} {<118>} {Lowering Fear} {<118>[ ]<088>} {  This room is silent. No screams, chants, hymns or even your breath can be  heard. The only light source is that of crystals lowered from the ceiling  giving off a faint glow so you can vaguely see your surroundings. Stone  stairs are here, leading down into seemingly-unknowable darkness. } {crynn} {} {bloodyroom} {} {1.000} {}
