R {43824} {128} {<268>} {The Demon's Flight} {<268>. .<088>} {  You find that stepping from the cavern has caused you to fall through the air with time to wonder what lies below. You attempt to ascend back to the cavern but alas, to no avail. The only way to go is straight down to what appears to be a raging battlefield below. You feel the temptation to pray for a safe  return... } {crynn} {} {air} {} {1.000} {}
E {43825} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {43825} {128} {<268>} {The Demon's Flight} {<268>. .<088>} {  You start to see your destination. Red, the color of blood, stains the ground below. You are surrounded by a thick black smog, and voices of angry demons  whisper to you in an unclear tongue. Seeing the grey light blanketing the sky high above, confirms that you are far beyond the confines of the church. } {crynn} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {43826} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {43824} {u} {u} {16} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {43826} {128} {<268>} {The Demon's Flight} {<268>. .<088>} {  The stained ground suddenly begins to approach at an amazing speed though  'till now, the descent hadn't seemed to be fast at all. Icy wind now stings  your face, but you dare not turn from the ground lest you fall out of balance and experience a nightmarish death. Cold, brittle voices, those of swarming  demons, whisper to you. Something invisible moves quickly in the distance... } {crynn} {} {air} {} {1.000} {}
E {43827} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {43825} {u} {u} {16} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {43827} {128} {<268>} {The Demon's Flight} {<268>. .<088>} {  As the cold continues to encapsulate you, you find that your descent is  turning into a freezing hell of a fall. Whispering voices tell you that the  winds will continue to rage as long as your determination to live stands  strong. As the intensity of the bloodstains below start to sear into your  memory, you cannot help but feel your heart turn to stone as your resolve  begins to drop away. } {crynn} {} {air} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {43828} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {43826} {u} {u} {16} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {43828} {128} {<228>} {Temptation of War} {<228>, .<088>} {  Despite the blood on the battlefield all around you, you somehow stand upon a hill that isn't covered in blood at all. Around it is a wide open field,  where battles are waged between demons of many kinds and other creatures of  the underworld who survived the trip down here. A gasp can be heard next to  you. Turning, you see a warrior who might be able to assist you. } {crynn} {} {field3} {pk} {1.000} {}

