R {44525} {0} {<248>} {Approaching the City} {<248>% %<088>} {  This tunnel has been cut into the shape of an arch, and black stones line the walls, ceiling, and floor. What must have once been the city gates are  situated to the west. From this vantage point, all that is evident is that  the gate seems to have been compromised, and obsidian stones litter the  ground. The tunnel is still inky black night, aside from whatever light  source a traveler brings with them. The dark elves prefer the lack of light,  since their eyes have adapted to the darkness of the underground over the  thousands of years that they have lived and bred down here. The scent of  smoke is strong here and starts to cause dehydration as it eats away at the  moisture in the air. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
