R {44526} {0} {<248>} {Before the Gates} {<248>% %<088>} {  The gates to the dark elf city were recently razed and now bits of them lie  scattered throughout this area. Splinters of fine eldar wood have been  sprayed every which way, wrought iron lies bent and twisted, and obsidian  stones are scattered about. As a result, walking through here is difficult. Smoke rises from the rubble through the gates and lingers, making the air  throughout the caves heavy. Patrols of dark elves wander back and forth  through the deserted city streets, ensuring they will not lose the city  proper, or what is left of it. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
