R {44527} {0} {<248>} {Approaching the City} {<248>% %<088>} {  The tunnel here has been cut into the shape of an arch. The walls, ceiling,  and floor, have been lined with flat black stones that glimmer when a  traveler's dim light source chances upon them. The view to the east makes it  obvious that the dark elf city has been hit with disaster. The gates no  longer stand tall, but have been blown apart, and their remnants have become  strewn haphazardly around the area. Every so often, a shadowy form darts out  into the rubble, and then retreats back into the city. The scent of smoke is  so strong here that breathing becomes harsh and difficult. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
