R {44528} {0} {<248>} {Approaching the City} {<248>% %<088>} {  This tunnel has been cut into the shape of an arch. The tunnel has been lined with rows of shiny obsidian rocks. Each rock is roughly the same size, and  glitters when a light source happens upon it. The center of the tunnel  features three tall obsidian pillars, each of which has been carved with the  face of a powerful-looking dark elf priestess. Perhaps these dark elves are  important figures in the history of the dark elf city. Whatever the case may  be, it becomes obvious to a traveler at this point that they are nearing the  great city of the dark elves. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
