R {44530} {0} {<248>} {A Sharp Corner} {<248>% %<088>} {  The tunnel here takes a sharp, right angle turn. Its corner has been  completely overtaken by an curiously large assemblage of cobwebs. Since the  ceiling of the tunnel is about ten feet high, and the spiderwebs extend all  the way up, this is a concerning phenomenon indeed. What sort of gigantic  spider could have created such an extensive sequence of webs? On the surface  of Andolor, it would take a fool to believe the tales of a colossal beastly  spider. Unfortunately, the presence of these cobwebs indicates that these  stories could actually be the opposite of mythical! There are also a few  interesting geological formations in this tunnel, it might be interesting to  investigate them.  } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
