R {44567} {0} {<248>} {A Well-Carved Tunnel} {<248>% %<088>} {  This tunnel has been well-carved. Its ceiling arcs in a perfect half-circle  that continues all the way to its floor, and its walls appear surreal, since  they have been lined with crystals that were mined in the caves, then cut  into brick-like shapes. It also seems that this tunnel has become especially  well-suited to the growth of mushrooms, since its entire floor is completely  carpeted with them. Whether this was a scenario that was contrived, or  whether mushrooms simply naturally occur in this particular sector, remains a mystery. There are several other interesting geological formations in this  tunnel, and it might be worth it to investigate them. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
