R {44569} {0} {<248>} {Approaching a Bend} {<248>% %<088>} {  Whether heading to the north, or traveling to the south, this tunnel takes a  bend to the east. What could possibly be lurking around these blind corners? So many strange beasts roam through the underground; anything could be hiding just around the corner. Guaranteed, that which lurks would be an evil, ugly,  nasty thing. It really is survival of the fittest when it comes to living in  the underground realms of Andolor, and the creatures that are here have been  surviving in this fashion for thousands of years. In short, the beasts here  are all powerhouses of strength and stamina. Considering how well they know  the area that they reside in, and their naturally keen sight within absolute  darkness, any traveler is at a severe disadvantage in comparison to them. If  an underground creature could chuckle when it saw a surface dweller stumbling around down here, they probably would. There are several interesting-looking  geological formations in this tunnel, it might be helpful to investigate  them. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
