R {44570} {0} {<248>} {A Widening Tunnel} {<248>% %<088>} {  The tunnel widens here, and becomes quite a grand space to roam through. Unfortunately, any traveler knows that along with this sudden ease in  exploration, they are experiencing a severe increase in danger. Trudging  through this space is like wandering through an underground battlefield, and  the chances of becoming the target of an ambush are high. The air is very  still and reeks of wet earth. There is a pounding silence, which is disturbed at random intervals by the sound of a water drip. Footsteps sound as loud as  firecrackers, and great pains must be taken to dampen their clamber. There  are several interesting geological formations in this tunnel, and it could  prove useful to investigate them. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
E {44571} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {44569} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {44571} {0} {<248>} {A Sharp Corner} {<248>% %<088>} {  In order to enter this passage, a traveler needs to stoop-walk. Close-set  walls create a bit of a tight squeeze to wiggle through, but directly after  this, the ceiling and walls expand away from each other, and walking space  once again becomes abundant. The eastern wall of the cave has initials  inscribed upon it, in what appears to be candle-soot. The letters seem to be  QYV, but it is tough to tell for certain. The western wall seems to be made  up of rock that is far lighter in hue than that of the eastern wall. Since  the rocks here seem slightly different, it might be prudent to  investigate. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
