R {44574} {0} {<248>} {A Cramped Corner} {<248>% %<088>} {  The tunnel starts widening and opens up into a slight downwards path, heading closer to the city. There are slight movements in the shadows all around as  your light doesn't catch all corners in the jagged cave structure. The  stalactites and stalagmites seem to taper off and form a more rounded off  floor and ceiling, as if there is high traffic through these caves. The  rocks here seem slightly different, so it might be prudent to  investigate.  } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
