R {45668} {0} {<178>} {Where in the World is This?!?!?} { } {  From out of nowhere, you find yourself in front of a large gateway. The iron  bars bear signs of being neglected and caked in rust. Whatever was used to  keep them closed has long rotted away. One side of the gate hangs from only  the bottom hinge, leaving the bottom right corner dug into the scarred worn  cobble that lies beneath your feet. The other gate is completely gone with no trace of where it has gone. There is a wooden sign hanging above the archway  of the once finely crafted metal gate. The sign begins to read Charm City,  but the word Charm has been scratched out. Written beneath it in bright red  paint is the word...FURY. } {fury} {} {redgateway} {} {1.000} {}
