R {45669} {0} {<278>} {Beyond the Gates} {<278>-+-<088>} {  Once beyond the gate, your eyes cannot help but focus on the large tower  ascending into the heavens that seems to be made up of demolished building  parts. It rises up beyond where the eyes can see and tickles the overly  threatening grey skies. Every few moments or so, the surroundings flash an  eerie red as red lightning tears through the sky, delivering a booming  percussion that breaks the silence. The ruins of a gate house are to the  east. Venturing west looks like it would take you farther from the city. North... You get closer to that monstrosity reaching for the skies. } {fury} {} {crossroad_ews} {} {1.000} {}
