R {45670} {0} {<238>} {What Was Once a Gatehouse} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  After entering through what might "have" been a door at one time, you find  yourself inside what was once the gatehouse. The walls are still intact, but  the window facing the gate is just a pile of shards. There used to be a desk  in front of the window for someone to sit and watch the gate. Several animals seem to have made this their new home as a slight shelter from the seemingly  endless storm that plagues the city. The north wall is in relatively good  condition, which brings about surprise when you notice a fully functioning  locked door. Someone...or something must be using it for something. Curiosity killed the cat, good thing you're not a cat. } {fury} {} {hut} {} {1.000} {}
