R {45671} {0} {<238>} {An Oddly Still Intact Room} {<238>[ ]<088>} {  Beyond the closed door is a small room that looks like it has been lived in,  not just recently, but like right now. There is a small cot set up in the far northeast corner and a pile of various newspapers to the left of that. The  one window, surprisingly intact, has been blocked out with pieces of  newspaper no doubt from the stack on the floor. There is a small spot for a  pipe stove, some wood scraps and even a canteen with water. There is no doubt that someone is living here. } {fury} {} {office} {} {1.000} {}
E {45670} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {45672} {0} {<238>} {A Path to What Used to be a Park} {<238>. .<088>} {  Along each side of the path are patches of bare dirt and weeds. Different  types of rodents scurry to and fro as you walk along. You can imagine how  this path might have been quite beautiful at one time. Now is not that time. Now small divots are in the ground where bushes used to be, perfect to trip  in. Splinters and twisted steel are all that is left of the benches that used to be here. Trees are now rotted and semi-hollow, showing signs of burn marks thanks to numerous lightning strikes. } {fury} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
