R {45675} {0} {<278>} {Before the Red Tower of Fury} {<278>-+-<088>} {  You have finally made it to the only building that seems to still be  standing. Although it is also in a state of decay, it stands taller than any  other building as far as your eyes can see. You stretch your neck up and try  to see the top of the tower, but all you can see is floor after floor. At  some point midway up, the building changes from solidly built to almost  homemade. Pieces, parts, and just about anything have been taken from the  surrounding city and built on top of this tower to make it reach farther into the sky. It also seems like the red lightning emanates from the top, perhaps  it does. As for down here, the street you are standing on looks to have once  been bricked. Now it's hard to tell if they were even bricks, as there are  not too many intact. East and West, Sir Robert Avenue continues. } {fury} {} {crossroad_ews} {} {1.000} {}
