R {45676} {0} {<278>} {Sir Robert Avenue - East} {<278>- -<088>} {  The street beneath you is so badly damaged that you have to be careful not to end up tripping over a missing set of bricks, or slipping on loose brick  chips. There is a light post here, but it doesn't shine at all, instead the  glass bulb is broken and the pole itself is rusted almost red. You get the  sense that something very wrong is going on in this city but you can't quite  figure it all out yet. To the south, you can see that creepy gatehouse with  the newspapered window. North of you is what's left of a small two-story  home. East, the avenue continues. } {fury} {} {road_eastwest} {} {1.000} {}
