R {45677} {0} {<278>} {Sir Robert Avenue - East Continues} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  You come across what looks like it was once an intersection that went four  ways. Instead of being able to continue east, there is a pile of broken  bricks, trees and branches ripped from the ground, and other odds and ends  making it impossible to pass by. You do notice that to the north, there is a  small way to squeeze between a building and the pile to make your way to  another street. Off to the south, there is nothing. It's flat, it's boring,  and it goes on and on. The one thing that does stick out is in the middle of  the street, there is a rusty manhole cover. As you ponder how bad the sewers  must be in this place, you hear some kind of loud noise coming from below  you. } {fury} {} {road} {} {1.000} {}
