R {45678} {0} {<238>} {Running Beneath the Streets} {<238>. .<088>} {  The first thing to hit you is the smell. The pungent yet sweet smell of  death. Someone or something has died in here. As a matter of fact, a lot of  someones or somethings might have died in here. As you settle your feet down, you see that the raging storm above is beginning to seep down here, leaving a small trickle of red rain flowing towards the west. The walls in here are  made up of the same brick that once made up the streets, but down here, out  of the elements, they have survived almost completely intact. Just a few  bricks look as if they might be a little loose. It looks like the tunnels  here might have run underneath Lotus Street at one time. Now, both south and  west have been crammed full of junk appliances, carriages, and other stuff. Why is this even here? That is a mystery that might solve itself. } {fury} {} {city_underground} {} {1.000} {}
