R {45679} {0} {<278>} {Sir Robert Avenue - West} {<278>- -<088>} {  Heading west begins to show more of the dire condition of the city. Almost  every building is picked clean, half falling apart, or just flat out rubble. The ones that do stand have all sorts of glowing eyes and eerie sounds coming from within. As you continue along the worn stone road, you can't help but  feel like this whole place is not what it seems and the "people" here, well,  something is wrong with them. The road continues to the west and east. } {fury} {} {road_eastwest} {} {1.000} {}
