R {45680} {0} {<278>} {Sir Robert Avenue - West Continues} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The Avenue comes to an end here where another road begins. To the south, you  can make out what used to be some kind of gathering place as you can see some of the old hitching posts and an area that might have been used as a market. Almost none of that remains in any kind of working order. To the west there  are more run-down concrete and brick buildings. A new street begins to the  north. East takes you back towards that horrific tower. } {fury} {} {road} {} {1.000} {}
