R {45684} {0} {<248>} {Dub Alley} {<248>. .<088>} {  As you push your way past a narrow passage to the east, you come out in what  is still a semi-intact alleyway. Some of the more complete buildings seem to  be here off of this alley. An almost dampness accompanies each and every worn cobblestone as you venture forward. Suddenly, another flash of red lightning  lights up the whole alley and you see some rather unsettling sights. There is a building with an intact door to the north. The alley continues east. } {fury} {} {alley} {} {1.000} {}
