R {45685} {0} {<248>} {The End of Dub Alley} {<248>. .<088>} {  The alleyway comes to a spectacular end as the building to the far east has  been leveled into a small pile of crushed bricks. Nothing is even left to  repurpose for the tower or anything. You can even see the vast wastelands  beyond. Yet, somehow to the south, another building remains semi-intact,  explorable, maybe even lived in. There doesn't seem to be any pattern to  which buildings were completely destroyed and which were spared... somewhat. } {fury} {} {alley} {} {1.000} {}
