R {46056} {0} {<218>} {The Symbol of the Forgotten Night} {<218>[ ]<088>} {  The floor in this section of the temple is made from obsidian and it shines  like a mirror. Obsidian was also used to build the walls of the hot spring  that sits in the center of this chamber and the stairs that lead into it. Images that look like jaguars have been carved into the cave walls along with carvings of minotaurs. } {dungeon} {} {hellinside} {} {1.000} {}
