R {46057} {0} {<218>} {The Symbol of the Forgotten Night} {<218>[ ]<088>} {  This part of the temple feels very calm and the only sound is the gentle  gurgling of water in the small hot spring. The torches light the area dimly  and their orange light reflects perfectly off the mirror-like obsidian floor. Four obsidian statues stand at key points around this chamber. The statues  are of naked minotaurs that have their hands over their ears and their mouths open as if they are screaming. } {dungeon} {} {hellinside} {} {1.000} {}
E {46055} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46058} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46058} {0} {<218>} {The Symbol of the Forgotten Night} {<218>[ ]<088>} {  This temple chamber contains a small altar that was built from obsidian. It  follows the curve of the back wall and is covered in dozens of black candles  that are all lit up. Their hot wax drips down the sides of the altar. Behind  the altar hangs a giant oval mirror with an ornate border. It is speckled  with blood. } {dungeon} {} {hellinside} {} {1.000} {}
E {46057} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46056} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46059} {0} {<148>} {The Symbol of the Black Sun} {<148>. .<088>} {  Tall arched stained-glass windows have been built into the walls on either  side of this portion of the temple. Since there is no real sunlight, the  windows have been backlit by torches in a secret passageway that goes behind  the windows. Bar tracery has been inlaid in the interiors of the windows to  support their glass in a lancet-and-oculus pattern. } {dungeon} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
