R {46060} {0} {<148>} {The Symbol of the Black Sun} {<148>. .<088>} {  Gargoyles sit above faux walkways that have been built into these walls. Their stone hands cover their mouths as they stare down at the tiled floor in the center of the room. The floor has been inlaid with the mosaic pattern of  three black suns. The tiles shine as the torchlight reflects off of them. } {dungeon} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
