R {46061} {0} {<148>} {The Symbol of the Forgotten} {<148>. .<088>} {  Stone tiles have been used to create a giant mosaic on the floor in this  section of the temple. Several colors of stone have been chosen for the  design: mahogany, midnight blue and light grey. The mahogany and midnight  blue tiles have been used to create geometric shapes and lines whereas the  light grey tiles have been used to fill in the gaps in the design. Directly  in the center of this mosaic is the image of a giant eye that is crying tears of blood. } {dungeon} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
