R {46062} {0} {<148>} {The Symbol of the Forgotten} {<148>. .<088>} {  There are many intricate artistic details that have been added to this room. Relief sculptures fill up the vertical wallspace created between the  rectangular pillars and the point at which they join up with the room's  balcony. Each sculpture depicts a giant wide-open eye. Continuing to look up  higher in the room and into the space above the balcony reveals even more  eyes. The walls behind the pillars up there have had thousands of small eyes  carved into any available space. } {dungeon} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
