R {46063} {0} {<148>} {The Symbol of the Black Sun} {<148>. .<088>} {  There are column-statues here to help support the ceiling of the temple along with flying buttresses. The statues look like battle-hardened minotaurs and  they stare down at the center of this room with their arms crossed and faces  stoic. The overall design of this temple is intricate and beautiful. } {dungeon} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
