R {46064} {0} {<148>} {The Symbol of the Black Sun} {<148>. .<088>} {  An altar to the three suns has been erected here. The altar is covered in a  nest of opalescent bird feathers. Also, black, red and white candles burn  steadily from within this nest. There is a small silver dish in the very  middle that looks like it is covered with tongues, but that could just be a  trick of the light. } {dungeon} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
