R {46065} {0} {<148>} {The Symbol of the Forgotten} {<148>. .<088>} {  This section of the temple has chosen its golden altar as the focal point. Slender rectangular columns line the northern and southern sides of the room. They have been assembled in a tightly repeating pattern in order to draw the  eye directly to the altar. Between each pair of columns, a pointed arch has  been constructed. } {dungeon} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
