R {46066} {0} {<148>} {The Symbol of the Forgotten} {<148>. .<088>} {  A whole series of pointed arches leads the line of sight all the way to the  grand golden altar at the head of the room. Just above these pointed arches,  a balcony with golden rails has been built to follow the perimeter of the  room. Upon this balcony, slender ionic columns reach all the way to the  room's vaulted ceiling. } {dungeon} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
