R {46067} {0} {<148>} {The Symbol of the Forgotten} {<148>. .<088>} {  Faux windows formed through sculptural relief line the northern and southern  walls of the room. They match the rest of the temple's design, as they have  been fashioned to look like tall windows with pointed arches. The interiors  of these false windows have been divided into tiny squares in order to mimic  the look of real windows with bar tracery designs. } {dungeon} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
