E {46180} {jump up} {jump up} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46180} {0} {<178>} {Atop a Magical Tower} {<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>} {  You are standing in a large room at the top of the tower. This room appears  undamaged by time or intrusion. Long tables stand along the walls, and it  appears they were cleared quickly. Beakers and tubes still cover the table,  knocked over and left where they are. Book shelves sit empty, but scattered  pages still lie on the floor. Perhaps one holds a clue to what happened here. } {stormhaven} {} {ruins} {} {1.000} {}
E {46179} {jump down} {jump down} {0} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46595} {0} {<178>} {The Library} {<278>###<088>} {  You are standing in the Necromancer's library. Books of magic line the  shelves, many of which touch upon forbidden topics. The air is crisp and dry, constantly maintained so as not to damage the books. A book sits on a  pedestal in the center of the room, covered by a magical glass case. It must  be very important. } {stormhaven} {} {castle} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {20685} {e} {open e;e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46596} {0} {<178>} {Cold Storage} {<278>###<088>} {  This room is filled with bodies in various states. Several stacks are labeled "Spare parts", others are labeled "Dinner", and some are labeled "Reanimation Material". The room is freezing cold, perfect for keeping a body fresh. Don't stay in here too long or you may be added to a pile! } {stormhaven} {} {castle} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {20691} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46843} {0} {<178>} {Hallway in the Castle} {<278>###<088>} {  You stand at the end of a long hallway.  To you north you can see the heavy golden doors leading to the king's audience chamber.  One might hesitate before daring to venture further\; no doubt anybody entering such a central part of the castle will garner attention.  } {ahner} {} {castle} {} {1.000} {}
