R {46912} {0} {<228>} {A clearing in the forest} {<228>, `<088>} {  Having walked deep into Silverwind Forest, you quite unexpectedly find  yourself in an unusual clearing. The trees seemed to have gotten up and  walked away, their roots leaving the dirt all churned up upon their exit from the soil. Silver leaves litter the ground, their spark of life lingering on  long after they have fallen from their branches. Off to the east is the  beginning of a path through the trees, a path that is lined with spears upon  which small round objects rest. } {tanra} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {46913} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {13282} {w} {w} {8} {1} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46913} {0} {<228>} {The beginnings of a path} {<228>( *<088>} {  A sandy path leads from the clearing into the trees. On the northern side  of the path is a row of spears, upon which rest shrunken and shrivelled  heads. The heads look like they belong to people from different races, but  they all bear the similar expression of horror, frozen for eternity. As you  approach them, they begin to shriek with a high pitched keening, momentarily  deafening you with the intensity of it. Whoever, or whatever, is at the other  end of the path, knows there is someone lurking down here. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46914} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46912} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46914} {0} {<228>} {A sandy path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The path is covered with a soft silver silt, very fine indeed. It leaves  clear footprints from all those who pass along it, but all it takes is a  light wind to blow the prints away again. To that end, the prints that you  can see are mostly obscured and hard to read. The trees of the forest are  beginning to change, from the silver bark trees of elven woods, to a  rougher, redwood variety. To the north is a small clearing beside the  path, but the path itself continues on to the west and east. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46916} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46915} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46913} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46915} {0} {<228>} {A small clearing beside the path} {<228>, `<088>} {  At first glance this clearing appears to be quite idyllic, with soft,  sweet grasses and succulent ferns growing in abundance. However, on a  much closer look, you can see that the foliage is hiding some old  skeletons, half buried in the ground. There are some long spears  sticking out of the nearby trees, and one of the spears has some old  cloth pinned between it and the tree.  } {tanra} {} {field} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {46914} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46916} {0} {<228>} {A twisting path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The path underfoot is firm and the silver silt is blending and merging  with the dark brown soil of the surrounding forest. While the path is  still clearly laid out as it twists and turns through the trees, the  prints in the ground are harder to read and soon all but disappear.  The redwood trees stand tall and proud all around, with silver ferns  growing up around them like a sea of green. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46917} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
