R {46919} {0} {<228>} {A village hidden in the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  There is a hut right up against the forest wall, nestled under one of  the great trees. The dwelling itself looks a little worse for the wear  and it appears to be one of the older ones. Peering out a window is  the face of an old female, an elder of the village. Hanging from posts  outside the hut are plants drying in the sun. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46922} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
