R {46920} {0} {<228>} {A village hidden in the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  On the western side of the village is a group of smaller redwoods.  Between these younger trees a crude wall has been erected to form an  open air corral. Inside are creatures of various races and species, all  looking tired and dejected. They appear to be drugged and disinterested  in what is going on around them; probably the only way the villagers  can control them. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
