R {46921} {0} {<228>} {Village Centre} {<228>, `<088>} {  In the centre of the village is a large fire pit, ringed with stones and  dug into the ground. The pit has hot coals glowing within, keeping the fire  alive and waiting to be stoked into flames against the onset of night and  the cold it brings.  Bound and gagged beside the pit is an elf, stripped of  clothing and tied to a strong branch that is long enough to span the fire  pit. Off to one side is what appears to be the chieftain's house and a long  table is being prepared for a feast. } {tanra} {} {field} {pk} {1.000} {}
