R {46922} {0} {<228>} {A village hidden in the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Over on the eastern side of the village is an odd little man playing with  white sticks of all different sizes. He seems to be quite intent on his work  and does not look up as you approach. There is quite a collection of bone  weapons and utensils on some crude racks and small tables.  Some skulls  with burnt, dried flesh hanging off them, are gathered in a tumbled pile  under one of the tables, waiting to be scraped clean and made into food  containers. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
