R {46924} {0} {<228>} {A village hidden in the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Towards the southern edge of the village is a long building that is about  three times the size of the other huts and made in the same style. This is  the common area, where the women and children make jewellery from bones,  hair and teeth, amongst other things. They also go through the clothing and  other belongings of the unfortunate prisoners to convert them to goods that  can be used by the villagers. Items have been sorted into piles and the  smaller items have been placed in inverted skulls, which are being used as bowls. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46925} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
