R {46926} {0} {<228>} {A twisting path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The path you are following twists and turns, as it winds its way through  the towering redwoods. The path has been cleared of debris, allowing you to  walk along in complete silence if that is your will. Some of the trees have  strange markings on them and bits of bone stick out from the trunks of a few  redwoods. Deep into the trees you can see a shadowy figure flit along, almost  out of sight, it seems to be mirroring your winding path through the forest. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46927} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46925} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46927} {0} {<228>} {A shaded path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The path dips into a small gully, following the course of a creek. As you  descend into the gully the trees seem to tower above you, blocking out a lot  of the light from the sky above. The merry tinkling of the creek as it flows  along is very musical and the air smells very earthy and fresh. As you ascend  on the other side, over the rocks and tree roots, the trees allow the light  to filter through again. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46928} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46926} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46928} {0} {<228>} {A trampled path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  There are many animal tracks along the trail at this point and they are  very hard to read. Even a skilled ranger would have trouble understanding  the confusion here. Some of the ferns have been flattened nearby and a  couple of saplings have been snapped in half, it would seem there was a  ruckus of some kind here not too long ago. You hear a cry in the  wilderness, strangled into silence even as it is given voice. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46927} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46929} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46984} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46929} {0} {<228>} {A fork in the forest path} {<228>( *<088>} {  The path splits into three distinct trails, north, east and south. At the  meeting of the three paths is a large open space that looks like it was once  a paved road. The remains of an old civilisation, its legacy perhaps, now  cracked and covered with a layer of forest debris. The remains of the road  head east but seem to go no further in any other direction, perhaps the  passage of time has destroyed the rest completely. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46933} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46928} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
