R {46930} {0} {<228>} {A trampled path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  It would appear that there was a battle here in the recent past, which  tore up the ground good and proper. The tip of a broken sword lies in the  dirt, while its haft is underneath a tree. There is a patch of interesting  looking mushrooms on the edge of the path that avoided destruction in the  fight. Tied to a high and sturdy branch is a cage made from the supple  branches. Inside the cage is a skeleton so decrepit and broken that it is  impossible to know what race it was from. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46929} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46931} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46931} {0} {<228>} {A damp path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Water has pooled on the ground and the path is a little muddy. The air  smells quite ripe as the decomposing debris of the forest emits a pungent  odour. There are many small ferns sprouting on the ground, thoroughly  enjoying the damp conditions. Earthworms inch their way along in the  drier parts, before disappearing beneath the surface once more. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46930} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
E {46932} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46932} {0} {<228>} {A glade beside a pool} {<228>, `<088>} {  The sound of rushing water drones away in the distance and a rustle in  the grass suggests a small animal foraging for food. There is a flurry of  wings in the nearby trees and the squawking of birds as they declare their  territory. There are large boulders with many small niches and they are  draped with lustrous cedar moss that has tiny white and yellow flowers  all through it. } {tanra} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
E {46931} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
