R {46933} {0} {<228>} {Ancient ruins} {<228>( *<088>} {  Blades of grass peak through a cracked and partially covered paved road  which runs east-west through the forest. To the east you can see the ruins  of very old buildings, so ancient that large trees have grown from the very  roofs themselves, their roots draping over the sides of the buildings in  search of deeper earth. To explore the ruins and discover their secrets,  you need to enter them, if you can find the way in. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
