R {46934} {0} {<178>} {Ancient ruins} {<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>} {  A long stone building, with large windows all down the length of it, is quite cracked and worn. The roof is pretty much intact but is covered with grasses, moss and small plants, as well as one very large tree. The roots of the tree  drape down the front of the building, and along the stone steps, which are  quite broken up from the roots as their ageless strength has sought for a  foot hold and a way into the earth beneath. } {tanra} {} {ruins} {} {1.000} {}
