R {46935} {0} {<178>} {Ancient ruins} {<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>} {  One of the buildings has been cut in two by a fallen tree. Grey stone blocks  are scattered on the ground and roof tiles lie shattered beside them. A crack has opened up revealing a hidden room below. There appear to be shadows  flickering to an unseen light through one of the doors of an adjacent  building and a cold shiver runs down your spine as you look at them. } {tanra} {} {ruins} {} {1.000} {}
