R {46936} {0} {<178>} {Ancient ruins} {<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>} {  The trees of the forest crowd in very close, their roots running just  below the surface of the topsoil. The stone foot path has lots of cracks  and the footing is very uneven as the tree roots have played havoc with  them over the decades. Jasmine has grown up and over some of the walls  and the air is filled with the fragrance of the little white flowers. } {tanra} {} {ruins} {} {1.000} {}
