R {46937} {0} {<178>} {Ancient ruins} {<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>} {  This building looks like it used to house a library and many shelves still  line the walls, which are mostly intact. Some books have escaped the ravages  of time, but their pages are so yellowed with age it is practically impossible  to read them now. Stone steps spiral up and down to other levels, but the top  level here has collapsed. The way below is still clear of debris, almost as  if it has been magically protected from the buildings collapse. } {tanra} {} {ruins} {} {1.000} {}
