R {46938} {0} {<178>} {An ancient room} {<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>} {  Pillars carved with intricate designs line the room, which has saved the  ceiling from collapsing in and destroying it. Tree roots have broken through  the ceiling though and hang downwards in an attempt to reach the floor. Large tablets with ancient writing have cracked and now lie discarded near a  work table. Candles burning with a magical golden flame are placed around the base of the pillars, creating a constant train of shadows which writhe on the walls and floors. } {tanra} {} {ruins} {} {1.000} {}
