R {46939} {0} {<178>} {An ancient room} {<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>} {  A long table flanked by low stone benches runs the length of the room.  A fire pit occupies most of the space along one wall, the burning embers  long since extinguished. A fine layer of dust covers everything and foot  prints can be clearly seen on the ground leading in all directions. There  are doorways in each of the four walls, the doors themselves lying in ruin  on the floor, hinges all askew. } {tanra} {} {ruins} {pk} {1.000} {}
