R {46940} {0} {<178>} {An ancient room} {<178>{<148>*<178>}<088>} {  Many stone statues in various poses of regal victory and stately salutes  are now chipped and discoloured. The plaques under each statue crumbled long  ago and are no longer legible. The carpet runner that is laid out in front  of them is also discoloured and frayed by the passage of time, which has not  been kind to this room. Skeletons are piled up in one corner, like they were  tossed there unthinkingly by a creature with no compassion left in its soul. } {tanra} {} {ruins} {} {1.000} {}
