R {46941} {0} {<148>} {A dark tunnel} {<148>. .<088>} {  All light has been extinguished, the gutted torches sitting uselessly in  their rusted brackets, which are bolted to the walls. Spider webs stick to  your hair and clothing as you brush past them in the gloom. A cold breath  of wind whispers in your ear, sending shivers down your spine and causes  goose bumps to form on your scalp. A low moaning sound echoes quietly  around you, bouncing off the walls until you have no idea if it came from  in front or behind you. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
