R {46943} {0} {<148>} {Cave in!} {<148>. .<088>} {  A short and violent rumble shakes the earth and the northern archway  collapses in a cloud of dust and rubble, followed closely by the collapse  of the western tunnel. There is now no way through to the north or west  and the ancient city that lies above. The other passages are still  relatively clear of debris and the passages to the east and south are  the only hope you have of getting out of here with your skin intact. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
