R {46944} {0} {<148>} {Buried alive} {<148>. .<088>} {  As you walk in to the room the earth shakes yet again, sending loose  stones all over you, nearly burying you alive! The room is quite small  and there are piles of rocks everywhere, totally demolishing whatever  was left over from ancient times. You can hear the tinkle of stones as  they settle, but you can also hear scratching and faint grunts, like  someone is trying to dig themselves out of the rubble. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
