R {46945} {0} {<148>} {Suffocating} {<148>. .<088>} {  The tunnel begins to collapse around you and large stones fall to the  floor, barring the way to the west and the south. The dust in the tunnels  is really becoming quite bothersome and leaves everything with a grainy  feel to it. The floor is very uneven, with many stones and rocks ready to  trip up the unwary. Bugs scuttle across the rocks as their homes are  redecorated yet again. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
