R {46946} {0} {<148>} {Rubble and loose stones} {<148>. .<088>} {  The network of underground tunnels meets in a four way intersection amidst  the rubble. There is a large stone pillar in the centre that has crumbled and  decayed over time. It was covered in runes and hieroglyphics but the sands of  time have worn them away, making them impossible to read. Dark and dangerous  shadows follow you around, ready to pounce on you when the light goes out.  } {tanra} {} {underground} {pk} {1.000} {}
