R {46947} {0} {<148>} {A half buried room} {<148>. .<088>} {  This was once a prison but now the iron bars have completely rusted through.  Just a light touch upon them caused them to turn to a rusty dust, which emits  a very metallic odour that stays with you for a while. There are chains bolted  to the walls at intervals around the room, both inside and outside the would-be cells. In one of the chains a skeletal arm is still locked in, but the skeleton itself is long gone. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
