R {46948} {0} {<148>} {A dark tunnel} {<148>. .<088>} {  The air is stale with the smell of age, and the dampness of the stones is  creating a heavy atmosphere. The ceiling of the tunnel is quite uneven; the  changing heights become a challenge at times as you have to keep a careful  eye above. Rats scurry along the floor of the tunnel, their screeches echoing  around you, tails trailing behind them. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
