R {46949} {0} {<148>} {Bottom of a shaft} {<148>. .<088>} {  A very long shaft runs straight up from here, and the climb looks  treacherous. Every now and then some small stones skitter down the  shaft as something up higher dislodges them from the wall. There is  strange lichen on the ceiling near the exit of the tunnel that emits  a soft radiant light. Some boulders are piled up near the shaft, so  getting into and out of it is quite easy. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
