R {46950} {0} {<148>} {Vertical shaft} {<148>. .<088>} {  Climbing is a little difficult, but the rough stone provides lots of foot  and hand holds. Occasionally some small stones break away as you grab for  support and they bounce down to the bottom of the shaft creating little  pinging noises as it goes. A bug scuttles over your exposed skin, taking  a little nip as it passes by, giving you a slight stinging sensation as  the poison goes to work. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
