R {46951} {0} {<148>} {A precarious ledge} {<148>. .<088>} {  An opening in the vertical shaft gives you some time to rest. This ledge  is actually the start of a tunnel, which continues to the east. There is a  lot of soft silt on the floor, which is quite silky to touch. It would appear  you are the first person to be here is a very long time as the only signs of  passage are the ones you are creating. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
