R {46952} {0} {<148>} {A dead end} {<148>. .<088>} {  Venturing further down the tunnel to the east, you find it turns a corner  to the south, which is promptly a dead end. Whatever created this tunnel did  not complete it. Sitting up against one wall is a skeleton, still wearing  clothing, and a very old backpack, which has almost rotted through, lies  beside it. This looks to be an explorer who was unable to move out of the  tunnels, perhaps because of a broken leg, as indicated by a splint tied to  the exposed leg bone. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {46951} {w} {w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46953} {0} {<148>} {Blocked!} {<148>. .<088>} {  There seems to have been a cave in and the way out is blocked. It doesn't  look like digging your way out is going to help, just make matters worse, as  the pile of rubble is also holding up what is left of the ceiling, keeping it from collapsing even further. Sticking out of the rubble is a boot, with a  foot still inside. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
