R {46954} {0} {<148>} {A precarious ledge} {<148>. .<088>} {  There is an opening in the vertical shaft and it is a good time to take a  break from the climb, or perhaps not.  This ledge is a little unstable and  bits of rubble falls from the ceiling, hitting you on your head, or bouncing  off your helmet, mores to the point. Peering around you can make out a tunnel  heading off to the west. Maybe it is another way out of these caves, better  have a look and see. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {46955} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
