R {46955} {0} {<148>} {Vertical shaft} {<148>. .<088>} {  Don't look down. Um, hey, I told you not to do that! Anyways, now that you  have looked you can see that it is a long way to the bottom, it is so far  away that you cannot see it, only hear the distant, echoing rattle of stones  as they skitter their way to the bottom. There is a bit of a draft coming  from below and the air is cool and stale, but not a refreshing cool,  unfortunately. } {tanra} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
