R {46956} {0} {<228>} {A twisting path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The path through the forest wends and winds its way between the tall  redwood trees. Occasionally there are fallen trees covering the path,  but they are relatively easy to move around. There is a very soft carpet  of brown cypress leaves on the forest floor, muffling all footsteps and  covering all tracks. Ferns crowd the side of the path and gently brush  against you as you walk past. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
