R {46957} {0} {<228>} {A shaded path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The trees crowd a little closer, their branches intertwining overhead,  forming a natural roof high in the sky. The ferns blanket the ground,  creating a sea of green fronds that rustle in the light breeze. Moss  covers the trees that have fallen from their sentinel positions. This  is a most restful and idyllic section of the forest. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
