R {46958} {0} {<228>} {Edge of a cliff} {<228>( *<088>} {  The trees begin to thin, allowing the sunlight to filter through, turning  the air around you green, as the light causes the ferns to glow. The trees  part before you and the ground dips sharply. You now find yourself on the  edge of a cliff with a wonderful view of a ravine below. There is a path  down the side of the cliff, but it will be slow going. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
