R {46960} {0} {<238>} {Tumbling down a cliff face} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  Tumbling down the side of the cliff with a shower of pebbles and debris,  you finally manage to get your footing. Turning your rapid descent into a  controlled slide you guide yourself to the bottom of the cliff in relative  safety. Small stones skitter around you as they come to rest within a small  cloud of dust. Unable to go back the way you came, moving east into the  ravine seems the best course of action. } {tanra} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
