R {46961} {0} {<238>} {At the bottom of a ravine} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  The land here is quite rocky and the trees are not as stately as the ones  at the top of the cliff. Large boulders are scattered about the bottom of  the ravine in a very haphazard fashion.  The ground here is covered with  small, loose stones, which makes footing a little unstable. Over to the far  east of the ravine it looks like there might be a river. } {tanra} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
