R {46962} {0} {<238>} {A deep ravine} {<238>^ ^<088>} {  In the middle of the ravine you find that there is more depth to it than  first realised. A large crack has opened up in the earth and from the surface  it looks to be bottomless. Someone has been here before you though, as you  can see by a very basic rope bridge that has been erected, using the trees  on either side of the crack to anchor it. It is treacherous, but with care  can be crossed rather easily. } {tanra} {} {rocks} {} {1.000} {}
