R {46972} {0} {<248>} {An underground lake} {<248>% %<088>} {  A soft glowing blue light shimmers over a lake, which fills most of this  large cavern. The water is crystal clear in the light, with a sandy floor,  the result of centuries of sediment from the slowly eroding rocky walls.  Stalactites hang from the roof of the cavern, water slowly dribbling down  and dripping from the tips and into the water. Small ripples mar the surface  of the lake, but only for a short while. } {tanra} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
