R {46973} {0} {<248>} {A crystalline cavern} {<248>% %<088>} {  Near the western edge of the cavern is a small pool of water. At the  bottom of the pool are clusters of emerald crystals, which turn the water  a deep green in colour when the light shines on them. Underneath a stone  archway is a beautiful ruby cluster of the deepest red you have ever seen  and high up on one wall are some sapphires, winking in the torch light. } {tanra} {} {cave} {pk} {1.000} {}
