R {46977} {0} {<178>} {Fire caves} { } {  The heat from the fires is getting more intense the further into the cave  networks you travel. Pillars of flame burst out of the floor at irregular  intervals, shooting up to the roof of the fire caves with sudden displays  of heat and light. To the south you can see a lake of fire, the main source  of the heat.  } {tanra} {} {fiery_cave} {} {1.000} {}
