R {46982} {0} {<228>} {A cool path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Large wide leafed ferns overhang the path, bathing it in shade. Moisture  has gathered on their leaves in little beads of water. The trees are younger  than and not as tall as the ancient trees nearby, and blackened, rotten logs  are all that remain of the ones that used to stand here. The ground is covered  in bits of bark and tiny leaves, a soft carpet of lush vegetation that is  teeming with life. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
