R {46983} {0} {<228>} {A dark forest path} {<228>( *<088>} {  The trees crowd so close to each other that their upper limbs intertwine  and block out the sky overhead, completely restricting the natural light.  The ferns are taller and scragglier, growing so close to the path that it  is almost lost to sight. Large spider webs hang tautly between some of the  trees off to the side of the path, their strands look quite think and strong. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
