R {46984} {0} {<228>} {A dark forest path} {<228>( *<088>} {  Sunlight barely penetrates through the leaves of the trees above the path  and shadows dominate the area below. Bark hangs from the trees in tatters,  like something has been climbing them, their sharp claws raking at the trunks  of the trees. Broken branches litter the ground around the base of the trees  and have flattened some of the nearby ferns. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
