R {46985} {0} {<228>} {A dark place in the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The forest is unnaturally dark and the sounds of the animals and birds  are hushed here. The colours of the foliage are muted and faded as the  sun doesn't shine through. Glancing upwards you can see large grey  objects attached to the trunks of the trees. They appear to be large  cocoons made from a silken web and you can see that every tree in the  area has a handful on each trunk, draining the life out of them. } {tanra} {} {forest} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {46984} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
