R {46986} {0} {<228>} {A dark place in the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  Dark and dank, the trees in the area are pale and sickly, and their life  is being sucked away slowly by the parasitical cocoons attached to the upper  part of their trunks. The sickness is slowly spreading through the forest,  but for now, at least, it is contained in this relatively small area. Large  grey webs, of the same hue as the cocoons, have been woven between the  trees, a sticky situation to be sure. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46985} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
