R {46987} {0} {<228>} {A glade beside the river} {<228>( *<088>} {  Lush ferns with wide leaves surround the glade you stand in, beside which  a wide river flows. The trees around the edge of the glade offer shelter and  shade and the long grass is soft and green. Small white flowers grow and  flourish like stars and it is quite peaceful here with the birds chirping  and singing merrily. The river is cool and inviting, an ideal place to  refresh oneself and to quench a thirst. There are many animal tracks in  the soft ground, so it may not be wise to camp here. In the distance is  the dull roar of a waterfall. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
