R {46988} {0} {<148>} {An enormous waterfall} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The wide, slow moving river begins to quicken as its journey takes it to  the edge of a cliff. In a sudden rush, the water tumbles over the rim and  into a graceful swan dive, taking you along with it. For a few seconds it  feels like you are frozen in time as you plummet downwards, falling into  the water at the bottom, the roar of the water filling all your senses,  temporarily blinding you. In the next heartbeat you are swept away by the  currents of the river, this is definitely a one way trip! } {tanra} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
E {46989} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46989} {0} {<148>} {Turbulent waters} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The waters are swift and strong, driving you ever onward down the river.  There are many boulders and lots of deadwood in the water, making it quite  difficult to safely navigate the currents. The waters foam and froth around  you, splashing you thoroughly until you are completely drenched. There is  no possible way to reach the river banks as they are quite steep and the  waters have their own idea on what direction you should go. } {tanra} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
E {46990} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46990} {0} {<148>} {A bend in the river} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The waters pick up more speed as it reaches a bend in the river. The  trees on the banks flash by in a blur of greens and browns and every  time you open your mouth for breath, water finds its way in and it is  all you can do to keep from drowning. The rocks are very slippery,  preventing you from halting your very fast passage towards the upcoming  rapids. A shimmer of red can be glimpsed now and then as a fish jumps  out of the water close by. } {tanra} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
E {46991} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46991} {0} {<148>} {River rapids} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The rocks have become quite numerous and the water is driven through them at  a high velocity, causing you to crash into the rocks as you pass by. Moving  so fast, you are unable to grab a safe hold as they are quite slippery. The  waters seem to pull you back in, holding you tightly in their watery grip,  refusing to let you go just yet. } {tanra} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
E {46992} {s} {s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {46992} {0} {<148>} {A still pool} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  The turbulent waters that flow in from the river to the north find peace  here at the end of its journey. The waters are crystal clear and the bottom  of the pool is easily seen in the shallows and becomes lost to sight as it  deepens in the middle. Far to the northwest is an enormous waterfall, but  you'll have to safely navigate your way through the forest to reach it. At  the bottom of the water a silver shimmer catches your eye, if you dive down  deep enough you might be able to catch it. } {tanra} {} {waterswim} {pk} {1.000} {}
E {46993} {d} {d} {32} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
