R {46993} {0} {<148>} {Trapped underwater!} {<148>~ ~<088>} {  Following the silver shimmer into the depth of the pool was indeed risky  business. The water has turned quite murky and you have lost your sense  of direction. A school of silver fish flash pass you in a wonderful  display of synchronised swimming. The school circles you once, then as  one they move to envelope you within a blinding flash of silver scales.  It would seem that the only escape is to swim up to the surface as fast  as you can. } {tanra} {} {waterswim} {} {1.000} {}
