R {46994} {0} {<228>} {A path through the forest} {<228>( *<088>} {  The forest floor is littered with bark, leaves and twigs, creating a carpet  of reddish brown for you to follow. The ever present silver and green ferns  flourish and thrive at the base of the trees, they even grow on the trunks of some of the trees that have fallen over. A deep green moss creeps over the  stones and up the sides of the trees, which teems with a life of its own. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {46981} {e} {e} {2} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
