R {46995} {0} {<228>} {Blasted trees} {<228>( *<088>} {  Something disastrous happened here not so long ago that has left a large  portion of the forest devastated.  The once proud trees stand blackened  and rotten, twisted in a most unnatural state. Fungi and moss grow in the  devastation and the ferns have certainly flourished in the decay. Saplings  sprout up, quite young by the standards of the forest, all fresh and new,  ready to repopulate the area. Off in the distance you can see what appears  to be a large crater, though there doesn't seem to be an easy path to it.  It is certainly worth investigating, however, if only because the trees are  completely different from the redwoods that surround you. A mist has settled  over the crater, giving the area an eerie feeling. } {tanra} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
