R {46996} {0} {<228>} {The rim of a crater} {<228>* *<088>} {  Below you lies a large crater, created by a meteorite crashing to the  earth centuries ago. The vegetation inside the crater is quite varied  and almost alien in appearance, as though the spores of life from distant  galaxies were unwittingly deposited here at the time of the impact. The  giant redwoods that lie beyond the crater are not present here and there  is a hum of magic in the air as the forest around you comes to life. } {tanra} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
