R {47001} {0} {<228>} {The rim of a crater} {<228>* *<088>} {  Trees with white, flaky bark and small pointy leaves dominate the south  eastern edge of the crater. The bark of the trees shed like paper in various  sizes and the ground is littered with it. The grass grows very patchily under  these trees as they create a constant, solid shadow. A little black bird with  a white underbelly chirps away at you, constantly fluttering around you until  you leave its territory. } {tanra} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
