R {47002} {0} {<228>} {The rim of a crater} {<228>* *<088>} {  Exceptionally strong and sturdy trees occupy the land, and upon looking  up, small well camouflaged huts can be just seen in the top boughs of some  of the trees. It is impossible to climb the tree as the trunks are smooth  and glossy, offering no foot or hand holds. Small creatures buzz around  these huts and some of them come down to stare at you with curiosity. } {tanra} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
