R {47003} {0} {<228>} {The rim of a crater} {<228>* *<088>} {  The ground shakes and rumbles, and rocks tumble down the crater wall, as  the ground beneath your feet hiccups. Leaves are shaken from the trees and  birds take flight in fright. It is mere moments before stability is restored.  Lots of fruit bearing trees lose their fruit, which break open upon their  unexpected journey to the earth, rolling around before coming to a rest,  ready for the birds and insects to dine upon. } {tanra} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
