R {47009} {0} {<228>} {Bottom of a deep crater} {<228>* *<088>} {  Finally you have reached the bottom of the crater! It is quite muddy as  the lake that was resting at the bottom has partially dried out. Large flat  bugs wallow in the mud and tulip oaks, with their ribbon like roots, line  what was once the shore of the lake. Orchids of many colours grow among  the debris of the forest floor, delicate and yet sturdy, drawing their  nourishment from that which once lived. } {tanra} {} {jungle} {} {1.000} {}
