R {47012} {0} {<138>} {A sink hole} {<138>%%<088>} {  Well, venturing into the mud really wasn't a good idea, was it? You are well  and truly stuck with no way out and the mud is oozing into every crevice, every pore of your being. Actually, come to think of it, you better take a deep  breath and close your eyes and pray to Ayla, or whatever goddess you worship,  to grant you safe passage home before the mud claims you for its own. } {tanra} {} {quicksand} {pk} {1.000} {}

R {47013} {0} {<228>} {Approaching some ruins} {<228>( *<088>} {  Beneath the Forest of Everwood, this is a dark, mossy green enclosure,  surrounded by the roots of the massive trees towering above. Ahead, down a  passage bordered by roots and moss, sunlight filters down from above upon  what appear to be some stony structures in a large opening. The air in here  seems more still than in the forest above...even as birds fly above you,  their songs seem somewhat muffled. Above, a grassy fissure leads back to the  ground surface of the Forest of Everwood. } {songpalace} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
