R {47014} {0} {<228>} {Nearing the ruins} {<228>( *<088>} {  The path gains more light to the north as it approaches the ruins in the  distance. To the south, the path is darker and more covered with roots of  trees, mossy coverings, and leaves. Above, the Forest of Everwood bustles as  animals and unknowing travellers run by, oblivious to the existence of this  place. } {songpalace} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
