R {47015} {0} {<228>} {Under a crumbled archway} {<228>( *<088>} {  A crumbled archway stands here separating the grassy forest to the south from the cracked stone floors of the ruins to the north. The arch of the archway  is nearly entirely gone, leaving behind a partial pillar 7 feet high on the  west and a partial pillar 3 feet high on the east. Based on the structure of  the pillars, the archway would likely have stood over 15 feet high when this  structure was in its prime. } {songpalace} {} {forest} {} {1.000} {}
E {47016} {n} {n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}
