R {47016} {0} {<278>} {[0;37mAmong the ruins} {<278>. .<088>} {  Crumbled pillars and walls surround this area on all sides. Faded marble  tiles pepper the grass and weeds which have grown up to envelop this  structure. The shape of the ruins and amount of ground they cover indicate  that a great structure once stood here. Located far north from path covered  by the trees of Everwood Forest, the light has direct access here and  illuminates the ruins and the dust unearthed by the occasional passing  traveller, coating the atmosphere in a surreal cloud. When all is still, one  can make out the faint sound of resonating melodic tones which emanate from  the ruins themselves. } {songpalace} {} {city} {} {1.000} {}
