R {47017} {0} {<278>} {[0;37mA stone platform} {<278> * <088>} {  The faint reverberations and resonances heard elsewhere in the ruins seem to  emanate from this place and swell in magnitude. Where the rest of the ruins  are in pieces and dust, this platform is nearly entirely whole and uncracked. The platform is circular in shape and is etched with numerous musical  notations in a circular pattern, surrounding the silhouette of a crowned  female figure with her palms supinated outwards. Upon the platform, a pair of massive doors covered in moss and ivy stands freely. } {songpalace} {} {pillar} {} {1.000} {}
