R {47021} {0} {<278>} {Nearing the palace} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This northern part of the garden, dedicated to the Royal Children, is more  grandiose in nature than the southern section which was dedicated to the  Nobles. The marble is a little brighter here, and the gardens on either side  of the path exude a colourful vibrance not seen in the green gardens to the  south. The grandeur and opulence of the palace to the north is nearly  overwhelming. To the west is the Garden of Princess Amepsmamptra, and to the  east is the Garden of Prince Amepsmamptrer. } {songpalace} {} {road} {} {1.000} {}
