R {47025} {0} {<228>} {Garden of Lady Maltesa} {<228>. ^<088>} {  The Lady Maltesa earned her title and this garden when, in the late winter of the Season of the Storm in the Year of Shadow, she sold all of her chocolates and placed her children in indentured servitude in order to fund the  expansion of the Palace's Mezzanine by one seat. The Queen was so touched  that she would sacrifice her children and chocolates that she bestowed this  grassy garden as a symbolic fiefdom to the Lady Maltesa, ousting previous  favourite Lord Aiyeroh. The statue of Lady Maltesa shows a thin woman  squatting to flog a frog. } {songpalace} {} {field2} {} {1.000} {}
