R {47218} {0} {<278>} {Every Vote Counts} {<278>. .<088>} {  Here people come to vote. Even in the army, the most undemoctratic thing in the world, people vote. Not  all votes here are binding, but there is a time and a place for everything.  Plastered on the walls are some reminders of what boot  camp stands for:  Theme: Boot Camp is, in essence, a clan made up of new players. Based on the idea of helping the Helpershelper, this clan will take in new players and let them learn until they decide to become teachers or are ready to move on to bigger and better things.  Clan Decisions: All decisions in the clan are made through voting by  the Clan Leaders and rank 5 or 6 players. Although the  clan will be primarily democratic, Clan Leaders or the  Helpershelper have final say and can overrule any votes  if they feel they go against the Clan's Petition, Theme, Safety, or Harmony.  While the original clan petition and modified form  remains on the Website under the watchful eye of the Clan's Web handler, these two things remain unchanged, at least until another vote is cast... } {bootcamp} {} {city} {bank,safe} {1.000} {}
