R {47529} {0} {<118>} {Grand hall} {<118>. .<088>} {  A long hall stretches out before you, with access to the east and west wings  of the manor. The solid marble floor is covered with a deep, rich red carpet  runner, which muffles your footsteps. Archways to the east and west are  framed by velvet drapes that match the ones on the windows. Portraits of the  Earl's family, going back many generations, line the walls of the grand hall. Beneath each picture are some words about the subject above. Between each  picture are pillars of candles, elegantly displayed in wrought iron  candelabras. As you walk through the hall, you get the feeling you are being  watched, though the household staff are not paying you any special attention. } {aardington} {} {redcarpet} {} {1.000} {}
