R {47539} {0} {<278>} {Grand staircase} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A solid marble stair framed by a polished wooden balustrade opens up to the  top floor of the manor. Opposite the top of the staircase is an antique  wooden table with a vase of the biggest and brightest red and yellow tulips  in the lands. There are two hallways that make up the east and west wings of  the manor and many doors open up off them. Hanging above the centre of the  staircase is a chandelier that is made up of five layers of rings containing  magic crystals that twinkle gently with a pale blue light. } {aardington} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
