R {47540} {0} {<278>} {East wing} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This is the family wing of the manor. The master bedroom is at the far end of the wing and all the other bedrooms line the hall, some of them disused while others are occupied by the current members of the family. Tables with family  portraits dot the hallway and some of them go back many generations. Fresh  flowers from the temple gardens adorn the tables, lending a fresh scent to  the hallway. Polished floorboards echo the footsteps of all who walk on them. } {aardington} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
