R {47541} {0} {<278>} {Bedroom} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A large feather bed nestles between a dresser and a study desk. A peach and  white hand sewn quilt covers the bed and plump duck down pillows rest at the  head of the bed. A tall mirror stands next to the wardrobe, which has been  left open to reveal many dresses of various styles and colours. A plush white wolf pelt lays on the floor next to the bed, its silky fur a delight for bare feet. The window looks over a dark forest to the north and the estate's  temple to the east. A flock of white birds flies by the window, their sudden, noisy appearance a startling event. } {aardington} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {47540} {s} {open s;s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {47542} {0} {<278>} {Master bedroom} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  A large four-posted bed is the first thing that you see as you enter the  room. There is a gossamer thin curtain draped back and tied at each post,  which is made from a dark mahogany wood. A full length mirror, framed in the  same wood as the bed, stands near a window. Two large wooden wardrobes stand  side by side near the door. Lace curtains cover the window and are framed by  thick, dark green velvet curtains. A dresser with many drawers holds makeup,  perfume and hair combs for the lady of the house, and a matching dresser on  the opposite wall holds aftershave and products for the man of the house. Beside the bed on a small table is a gold necklace with a diamond pendant. Rugs made from high quality animal skins are laid out in front of the fire  place, which is freshly set. } {aardington} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {47540} {w} {open w;w} {8} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {47543} {0} {<278>} {Bedroom} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This bedroom is very neat and clean. There are no wrinkles on the plain  forest green quilt and the pillows are placed just so perfectly at the head  of the bed. The dresser against the wall is made from a light maple and is  quite modern when compared to the rest of the manor. A wardrobe made in the  same style as the dresser has a mirrored door and a large potted palm stands  beside it. The windows are closed and a white candle flickers on the desk  beside the bed. Books are neatly stacked together on the desk, ready for  study and a wooden chair is pushed up to rest against the lip of the desk. } {aardington} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {47540} {n} {open n;n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {47544} {0} {<278>} {Nursery} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  An old cot, which has seen many generations of the Earl's family come and go, is nestled up against one wall. Thick, silky fur rugs line the floor, giving  the room a cosy feel. A single bed is sitting against one wall so the wet  nurse or nanny can sleep close to her charges when needed. A wooden play pen  has seen many years of use, bearing the teeth marks of all its miniature  occupants. A couple of wardrobes and dressers hold infant clothes and cloth  nappies that get recycled over the years. } {aardington} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {47539} {n} {open n;n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {47545} {0} {<278>} {Play room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  This room is a child's delight! The toys that line the shelves and fill the  toy boxes are made of the highest quality and come from all over Andolor. The higher up on the shelves the toys rest, the older and more fragile they  are. There is a play pen with some simple toys for the younger children and  tables and chairs for the older ones. The walls are painted with colourful  scenes straight out of your imagination, designed to inspire the young minds. A bookshelf holds many storybooks for children of all ages. } {aardington} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
E {47546} {n} {open n;n} {1} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {47546} {0} {<278>} {West wing} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  There are a few doors along the length of the west wing, some stand open but  have little of interest within. Some small statuettes sit on marble and  wooden pedestals, created by famous artists long since dead. Tapestries, made by the women of the house, adorn the walls and candelabra, fashioned from  wrought iron, light the hallway against the night. Polished wooden  floorboards shine in the light and echo the footsteps of all who walk upon  them. } {aardington} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
