R {47547} {0} {<278>} {Store room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Deep shelves line the walls in the store room, which are filled with fresh  linen for the bedrooms and fluffy white towels for the bathroom. Spare  pillows, blankets and quilts are kept in closed cupboards to be brought out  when guests arrive. Everything is stacked up neatly and the whole room is  well ordered. A small writing desk near the door contains a ledger which  holds the inventory for the room. A set of wooden stairs leads upwards,  presumably to the attic. } {aardington} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
