R {47551} {0} {<278>} {Attic} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Deep in the attic the air is heavier and the temperature is cooler. This part of the attic is barely used anymore and has become home to various creatures  of the night. There are old trunks and chests and many boxes stored here that have remained untouched through the decades. A cold breeze springs up from  nowhere, rustling your hair for a moment and sending dust mites flying  through the air. At the far end of the attic the roof rises up and a stairway leads up to a dark landing. } {aardington} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
