R {47555} {0} {<148>} {Wine cellar} {<148>. .<088>} {  In this hidden room is the Earl's private collection and the wine is only  brought out on special occasions. The staff rarely come so deep into the  cellars so it makes a perfect hiding place. There are some extremely rare  vintages of wine that would be worth a small fortune if sold to the right  person. There are thick cobwebs in the room and small carcasses of rats are  caught in the larger webs. The skittering of many clawed feet echo off the  cold stone walls leaving you uncertain as to which direction it is coming  from. A gust of wind through the open door blows a cobweb onto you, which  adheres to your clothing. } {aardington} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
E {47554} {s} {open s;s} {4} {0} {} {1.000} {} {0.00}

R {47556} {0} {<238>} {A path through the estate} {<238>. .<088>} {  A winding path through the estate takes you through a sea of green. Your  footsteps crunch on the white stones and they shift slightly under the weight of your passage. To the south you can see the manor, its steepled peak rising into the sky like a lonely soldier. To the north, the path leads you through  a wrought iron archway, painted white, and covered with pastel pink climbing  roses. } {aardington} {} {trail_ew} {pk} {1.000} {}
