R {47557} {0} {<228>} {Green lawns} {<228>, `<088>} {  The path comes to an end at a small cul-de-sac. Old wooden benches, lovingly  carved by hand, have been placed in a semi-circle on the pool of white stones. A gap in the hedges at the end allows for easy passage to the wide green  lawns and the large white gazebo in the distance. To the west an iron gate  allows access to the kitchen gardens, while the lawns spread out to the east. } {aardington} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
