R {47558} {0} {<228>} {Green lawns} {<228>, `<088>} {  There is a large white gazebo, covered in pretty wisteria vines, that has  seen many weddings and summer cocktail parties over the decades. Blood red  roses have been planted at either side of the entrances to the gazebo, their  thorny stems a warning not to get too close. A flock of white birds flies by  overhead in a cacophony of sound, travelling away from the forest to the  northeast. To the east you can see a still lake and hear the quacking of  ducks on the water. } {aardington} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
