R {47560} {0} {<228>} {Approaching a dark wood} {<228>, `<088>} {  To the north the trees are looming dark and foreboding. There is an ominous  feeling to them, like something of evil intent is looking back out at you  from the shadows. The white stone path has petered out and you are walking on the soft, spongy grass. The closer to the woods you get the sparser the grass becomes. To the west is a large lake and you can hear the sound of ducks  quacking. } {aardington} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
