R {47561} {0} {<238>} {A path through the estate} {<238>. .<088>} {  The white stone path, shadowed by the ever present dark green hedges,  meanders through the estate. To the south the path joins up with the main  path around the manor and a flock of white birds send their dappled shadow to the ground beneath them. Pink wildflowers are scattered over the green lawn,  and yellow and black bees hover over them, their wings creating a barely  audible buzz. } {aardington} {} {trail_ew} {} {1.000} {}
