R {47568} {0} {<278>} {Axa's Trap Room} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  As you come to, you see yourself in a small room at the bottom of a pit. Above, about 30 feet up, you can see an opening where you must have fallen  from. You see the outline of a figure, which you assume is Axa, and hear her  laughing at you. You wonder what other cruel tricks there may be.      As you look around and try to find a way out, a few things catch your eye.  There is a rope hanging from the grate, however this rope is at least 20 feet off the ground and there is no way you could get to it. Over in the corner  you see a pile of bones, probably from an adventurer like yourself that  failed to please Axa. Behind you, you spot a wooden ladder - could this aid  in your escape? } {anthrox} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}

