R {47577} {0} {<238>} {The stables} {<238># #<088>} {  A cacophony of animal sounds is coming from a large wooden building, whose  doors are flung wide open. This is quite obviously the Earl's stables, which  houses a wondrous variety of creatures, some of which he uses as steeds and  others which he keeps as work animals or living trophies. The Earl's staff  are busy looking after the animals, feeding them and mucking out the stalls. } {aardington} {} {cabin} {} {1.000} {}
