R {47580} {0} {<228>} {A corral} {<228>, `<088>} {  A white painted wooden fence forms a very large corral where animals of both  the mundane and magical varieties have their own space to run free. The short green grass has been well trodden by the animals as they enjoy their limited  freedom. All the animals are well looked after and show no sign of abuse or  ill-treatment. Bales of hay, bought from a nearby farm, are stacked near the  fences, within easy reach of those tending to the animals. A well-used trail  leads from the corral to the nearby stables. } {aardington} {} {field} {} {1.000} {}
