R {47581} {0} {<238>} {A path through the estate} {<238>. .<088>} {  The path of white stones flows to the east and the west as smoothly as a  white river. To the east there is a temple with a steeple and to the west is  the manor itself. Around the temple is a beautiful garden full of life. Insects and birds flitter and flutter around the flowers, being both predator and prey to each other. You can also see the guards patrolling the grounds,  keeping a watchful eye on all the visitors to the estate. } {aardington} {} {trail_ew} {pk} {1.000} {}
