R {47583} {0} {<178>} {A beautiful garden} {<168>*<158>*<138>*<088>} {  Low hedges line the path of white stones which runs through a beautiful  garden. There are many pretty blossoms flowering in the sun, their petals a  colourful attraction to the local insects. A trail of tiny black ants cuts a  dark line across the white stones and the buzz of many busy bees comes from  the garden as they travel from flower to flower. The delightful floral  perfume wafts delicately on the gentle breeze, tickling the hairs of your  nose. } {aardington} {} {flowers1} {} {1.000} {}
