R {47590} {0} {<268>} {A confessional} {<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>} {  To the north of the main temple is a confessional of sorts. It is used mainly for the purpose of talking to the resident sister in confidentiality and  peace within the confines of the temple. There are two comfortable chairs  facing each other over a small table. A vase of flowers decorates the table  and a pitcher of water with clean glasses is available. A wooden screen can  be pulled across the space for greater privacy, though it is currently not  needed. A large window to the north offers light to the room within, and a  view of the gardens without. } {aardington} {} {temple} {healer} {1.000} {}
