R {47591} {0} {<268>} {The dais} {<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>} {  The dais is a simple affair, with a simple wooden pedestal holding a large  book. There is an altar to Ayla, covered with offerings of flowers and fruit, and plates of jewellery and gold. The altar is magically protected by the  benevolent goddess to prevent any looting. There is a large tapestry on the  back wall, depicting a beautiful blonde haired woman with bright blue eyes. She smiles down the length of the temple, both benevolently and  compassionately, where those who enter the temple can take comfort in her  presence. } {aardington} {} {temple} {healer} {1.000} {}
