R {47592} {0} {<268>} {A memorial alcove} {<268>{<178>+<268>}<088>} {  This alcove is dedicated to the memory of those who have passed from the  living realms. Many small candles have been placed on long shelves along one  of the walls. The wax from these candles has pooled and dried on the shelves, creating a stable environment for the multitude of candles that have been  placed here. A large box with a small slit at the top stands against the  southern wall. Inside this box are letters to the goddess Ayla asking for  help, blessings and offering of prayers. } {aardington} {} {temple} {healer} {1.000} {}
