R {47593} {0} {<148>} {Entrance to the catacombs} {<148>. .<088>} {  The air is stale and dusty down in the catacombs. A draft of fresh air,  flowing down the stairwell to the east, stirs the once still cobwebs, causing their inhabitants to scuttle in false anticipation of fresh food. Torches in  iron sconces line the walls, flickering and dancing, sending their magically  generated light into the room. To the south is a dark tunnel; the source of a low moaning sound. A grating sound of bone scraping on stone is almost  inaudible. } {aardington} {} {underground} {} {1.000} {}
