R {47594} {0} {<248>} {Catacombs} {<248>. <178>+<088>} {  The walls of the catacombs are made of a soft sandstone, which crumbles  slightly under your touch. The tiled floor has weathered the passage of time  quite well, though one of them looks to have cracked. The air is dry and  dusty, having been sealed up from the outside world for some time. A low moan drifts to you from deeper into the tunnels that branch off to the east and  west. To the north is the way out and back up to the temple. } {aardington} {} {crypt} {pk} {1.000} {}
