R {47595} {0} {<248>} {Catacombs} {<248>. <178>+<088>} {  A large, empty cobweb hangs limply from the corner, moving only under the  gentle coaxing from the draft of air which preceded you into these tunnels. The scraping of bone on stone sounds from within the dark, grating on your  senses, alerting you to the presence of something nearby. An evil presence  sends a paralysing chill through you, coaxing goose bumps to arise over your  entire body. You still have time to leave these confining catacombs, the way  out is to the west. } {aardington} {} {crypt} {} {1.000} {}
