R {49266} {0} {<278>} {[1;32mTemplo Mayor[0;37m} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  The absence of blood in this chamber in unnerving. The golden walls intensify the sunlight streaming through apertures around the room. Ornate shelves,  littered with codices of art, literature, and science, decorate the round  walls. A large circular pool lies in the center of the room, surrounded by a  growth of lush jungle plants. Floating in the water are several virgins,  bathing before a richly ornamented fountain. Sculpted from gold, the spring  emits fresh water, showering the virgins with an opaque mist. In the  distance, a fire crackles merrily filling the room with the scent of incense. White stone pillars surround the pool adorned in a thick tangle of vines,  they tower to the festively painted ceiling. Nearby, several virgins lie on a bed of leaves, beckoning you to rest with them. } {xunti} {} {inside} {bank,safe,questor} {1.000} {}
