R {49320} {0} {<278>} {The Bell Tower} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  After climbing what seems like endless stairs, you enter an open-air room high  above Aylor. The bell (for which this room is named, of course) hangs high  above you, the rope to ring it hangs down from the clapper. You seriously  don't want to be here when someone starts pulling that rope!   The bell tolls for all the dead leaders... as far as the eye can see there are  white withering bones...   some bones lay next to a calculator...   you know  that leader died while calculating the AP's.  the other one has a giant  quill...   that one died writing the descriptions...   yet another has no skull and a large pistol...   that one died answering all the questions from newbies....'  The list goes on. We mourn their passing, but rejoice in the blessings bestowed here by righteous Crusaders. Should you be in need of a spellup and no Crusader is in residence, please send a tell and someone will be with you shortly. } {crusaders} {} {inside} {safe} {1.000} {}
