R {49982} {0} {<278>} {You have company...} {<278>[ ]<088>} {  Outside, the night is pitch black and rain is thrown at you from all  directions by the wind. You can make out a figure of a large man as the small skiff nears the railing of your boat. He asks to come aboard and you agree,  inviting the man below into the cabin of the fishing vessel. He is large with a wiry brown beard that goes all the way up to his cheek bones. A shaggy  unkempt mane of hair falls in wet clumps over his face, but you can see his  eyes; big and black as the night itself. He says his boat has run aground  near the mouth of the cove and needs help pushing it off of the rocks before  the storm crushes it against the shore. Part of you wants him off your boat  as soon as possible, but looking into those black eyes you feel strangely  compelled to help the stranger. } {cove} {} {inside} {} {1.000} {}
