R {50534} {0} {<248>} {A Snaky Corner} {<248>% %<088>} {  The tunnel here takes a luxuriously curvy detour. Clearly it does not  understand that whoever is traveling along, might be interested in heading  straight to their destination. The dim light here extends itself just far  enough to reveal that the walls, floor, and ceiling of the tunnel, are  rounded-off in a neat, symmetrical fashion. This tunnel must have been formed naturally to have such a smooth surface; possibly through the process of  erosion, or maybe even by a gigantic burrowing creature. This type of  creature is the sort that an individual enjoys listening to tales of when  sitting with friends around a cozy fire, but hates to have nag at their mind  when traveling at these great depths of the underworld. There are some  interesting geological formations in this tunnel, it might prove useful to  stop for a moment and investigate them. } {uprising} {} {cave} {} {1.000} {}
